window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3701,"title":"Chapter 3701 - Secret Patterns","paragraphs":["“At first, my master only had the battle strength of a primary Ruler, but after mastering this Heaven Suppression Tablet, he was able to reach the level of a superior Ruler in one leap. Such a precious treasure is naturally extraordinary, but I don’t know what’s so special about this Heaven Suppression Tablet.”","With a trace of expectation, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness immediately covered the nearly 30,000-meter-tall gray stone tablet in front of him.","When his consciousness entered the Heaven Suppression Tablet, Jian Wushuang instantly sensed the extremely mysterious secret patterns hidden in the tablet.","Jian Wushuang could only sense these secret patterns, but he could not sense anything else.","“These secret patterns are so mysterious.”","Jian Wushuang knew that his strength was not weak, and he was definitely at the top of the Divine Beginning Realm. However, when he saw the secret patterns in the Heaven Suppression Tablet, he did not know what they were, so he could not see through them.","However, Jian Wushuang knew that these secret inscriptions were probably the key to controlling the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","As Jian Wushuang carefully examined them, he began to display them. The secret inscriptions hidden in the Heaven Suppression Tablet were roughly divided into three layers.","Each of the three layers of secret inscriptions had a lot to do with the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","“If I’m not mistaken, these three layers of secret inscriptions should be the method to control the Heaven Suppression Tablet. I only need to comprehend the first layer of the three layers of secret inscriptions to be able to use the Heaven Suppression Tablet normally,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","He had already understood the way to control the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","However, although he understood the way, the process was not that easy.","After all, the secret patterns hidden in the Heaven Suppression Tablet were indeed too profound and unfathomable. Jian Wushuang observed for a long time, but he did not have any clue.","“Master is a genius, but after I got the Heaven Suppression Tablet, it took me a long time to slowly master the Heaven Suppression Tablet. In other words, master also spent a long time to comprehend the first secret pattern on the Heaven Suppression Tablet.”","“It takes me a long time to master the first level of the secret inscription.”","“No rush, I’ll take my time.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and sat down in front of the Heaven Suppression Tablet with his legs crossed. He closed his eyes and began to fully comprehend the secret inscription on the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","Ten days passed in the blink of an eye.","During these ten days, Jian Wushuang was in a confused state because he could not see through the secret patterns. It was not until ten days later that he could barely see through the secret patterns.","“Universal principles!”","“There are universal principles in the secret patterns!”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes with a hint of surprise.","Under normal circumstances, only the legendary supreme experts were qualified to comprehend the supreme universal principles.","However, it was still very difficult to comprehend them.","Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master now. Logically, he should have been able to come into contact with the universe principles. However, when he had completely refined the Eternal Chaotic World, the universe principles had come to him personally, at that time, the universe principles covered his body, giving him a chance to feel the universe principles up close.","For a cultivator, that chance was simply a stroke of luck.","Although he did not get any substantial benefits from the close contact with the principles of the universe, there were too many intangible benefits.","For example, under normal circumstances, he would not be able to feel the existence of the principles of the universe from these secret patterns. However, because he had been in close contact with the principles of the universe before, he was able to feel them after 10 days of comprehension, that was why he could sense them.","“No wonder these secret engravings are so difficult to comprehend. It turns out that these secret engravings are derived from the universe principles.” Jian Wushuang sighed softly.","The universe principles were too extraordinary. It was not something that he could comprehend right now.","Even though what Jian Wushuang encountered was not purely the universe principles, but the secret engravings that were derived from the universe principles, the difficulty of comprehending them was much lower than comprehending the universe principles directly, however, it was still too difficult for a Principles Master like Jian Wushuang.","“Fortunately, I have experienced it up close and come into contact with the universe principles. This at least gives me the possibility of comprehending it. Without that encounter, even if the Heaven Suppression Tablet was placed in front of me, I wouldn’t be able to do anything about it,” Jian Wushuang said.","He knew that in order to comprehend the secret pattern in the Heaven Suppression Tablet, he had to first be able to sense the existence of the universe principles inside.","Jian Wushuang could sense it because of the opportunity he had last time, so he had the possibility to comprehend it. Without that opportunity, he could only watch helplessly.","“Strange. When master got the Heaven Suppression Tablet, he was only a Principles Master. Logically speaking, he was also not qualified to touch the universe principles. However, he still mastered the Heaven Suppression Tablet in the end. How did he comprehend the secret inscriptions derived from the universe principles in the Heaven Suppression Tablet?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","After all, his master did not have the same opportunity as him, but he did not receive any universe principles from his master.","However, Xuan Yi still managed to master the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","In that case, Xuan Yi must have had other opportunities, and he must have come into close contact with the universe principles by chance.","“Now that I know the whole story, I only need to spend time to slowly comprehend it.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","He knew that it would be extremely difficult to fully comprehend the first level of the secret patterns of the Heaven Suppression Tablet. However, he had no choice. In order to master the Heaven Suppression Tablet, he had to spend a lot of time to slowly comprehend it.","Even if the process would be very long.","The good news was that these secret patterns were derived from the universe principles. Jian Wushuang could gain a lot of benefits during the process of comprehending them. It was definitely unrealistic to comprehend a trace of the universe principles, however, during the process of comprehending, it would be helpful to improve his understanding of sword principle and the comprehension and application of various principles.","This kind of help was certainly much better than using some special resources to cultivate.","Jian Wushuang was completely immersed in comprehending the secret patterns in front of the Heaven Suppression Tablet under the ancient battlefield.","Time passed quickly.","In the blink of an eye, 30 years had passed.","During these 30 years, Jian Wushuang had been immersed in comprehending the secret pattern and did not stop for a moment.","Even so, his comprehension of the first level of the secret pattern was still very low. It could even be said that he did not comprehend it at all. At most, he had a little understanding and familiarity with this level of the secret pattern.","He knew that he still had a long way to go before he could completely grasp the first level of the secret inscription.","However, the thirty-year deadline had already arrived. He had to stop first and complete the agreement made by Di Shisan."]},{"number":3702,"title":"Chapter 3702 - Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan","paragraphs":["The headquarters of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was once the headquarters of the Three Saint Realms.","Although the territory had been destroyed due to the previous war, the aura of the war had gradually dissipated after 30 years of reconstruction. The place had returned to its former glory and glory.","The Seven Star Mysterious Sect was once recognized as the number one Ruler of the Divine Beginning Realm. Even the Three Saint Realms could only catch up to it.","With the battle strength of three Masters and the Seven Star who stood at the top of the Principles Master...there were countless experts and how glorious it was.","Even though a large number of experts had died, there were still many top experts who stayed behind.","With these experts as the foundation, the headquarters in the Divine Beginning Realm was in the best cultivation condition of the territory, and with the full support of Star Palace and Jian Wushuang, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect would regain its former glory, it was not impossible.","For example, although only 30 years had passed, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had gained a new status in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Today, everyone in the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was watching!","Many top experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had gathered here. In the past 30 years, most of them had recovered and were now full of battle strength.","In addition to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, his three Palace Masters, Temporal Temple Master, Deputy Temple Master Bai Xing, Ba Cang, and many experts from the Heaven Ancestor’s bloodline had also arrived.","They had come because of the sword principle battle between Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan.","Di Shisan used to be a legend of sword principle in the Divine Beginning Realm. His sword principle was so powerful that even Rulers were amazed.","Jian Wushuang was a legend in the Divine Beginning Realm today. His sword principle was also extremely powerful. The sword principle showdown between the two of them was naturally very attractive to cultivators from various forces.","On a calm lake, Di Shisan carried the magic sword on his back and stood there calmly. He was clearly stepping on the lake surface, but there were no ripples under his feet.","It was clear that he was extremely calm now. He did not have any strange emotions because of the upcoming battle.","As for Jian Wushuang, he had also slowly walked over.","His steps were deep and step by step, stepping through the void. Ripples spread out along with his steps.","After a long while, he appeared in front of Di Shisan.","“You’re here.” Di Shisan raised his head and looked straight at Jian Wushuang.","“I’m sorry to have kept you waiting.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The two exchanged a simple greeting as if they were old friends.","In fact, they had a certain friendship. It was not an exaggeration to say that they were old friends.","“Have you fully recovered to your peak condition?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“More or less. Even if there are some differences, it won’t affect the battle.” Di Shisan’s voice was still as cold as ever. “Shall we begin?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “This fight is purely a competition of sword principle and swordsmanship. So, you and I will only use the power of an ordinary Principles Master. What do you think?”","“No problem,” Di Shisan said.","In terms of divine power, even ten of them were no match for Jian Wushuang.","Now that both of them controlled and only used the power of the ordinary Principles Masters, this undoubtedly made the fight fair.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. With a flip of his hand, a blood-red divine sword appeared in his hand.","“This sword is called the Blood Mountain Divine Sword. My Master Xuan Yi personally refined it for me. Although it’s not a universe supreme treasure, its power is very impressive. Moreover, it’s extremely sharp and has the ability to suppress,” Jian Wushuang said as he looked at the divine sword in his hand, he said slowly.","For the sake of fairness, Jian Wushuang would not take out the Netherworld Divine Sword, which was the strongest supreme treasure. He did not even plan to use a universe supreme treasure to fight with the Blood Mountain Sword.","After all, the Blood Mountain Sword had been with him for the longest time, and he was the most familiar with it. With the Blood Mountain Sword, Jian Wushuang could perfectly display his sword principle and swordsmanship.","Di Shisan knew Jian Wushuang’s intention and immediately took out a cyan divine sword. “This sword is called moon-cutting. It used to be with me for a long time. It’s also not a universe supreme treasure, but its power is not weaker than the Blood Mountain Sword in your hand.”","“Very good.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and the two looked at each other.","The next moment, whoosh! Whoosh!","The two figures moved at the same time.","“It’s starting!”","“The battle has finally begun!”","“One is a legend of sword principle, and the other is a new legend of the invincible Divine Beginning Realm. Who is stronger and who is weaker in the battle of sword principle?”","“It’s hard to say who is stronger and who is weaker. After all, their understanding of sword principle has exceeded the scope of the Divine Beginning Realm and reached a new level. But I’m sure that this battle will be extremely exciting.”","The surrounding experts watched the battle with anticipation.","They also focused their eyes on the void in front of them, afraid of missing out on the details of the battle.","Under the gaze of countless experts, Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan finally fought head-on.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Countless sword lights burst out at the first moment.","The place where the two men exchanged blows turned into a sea of sword principle in an instant.","In this sea of sword principle, Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan’s figures flashed one after another like two ghosts, making it difficult to see clearly.","Each flash was accompanied by a large number of sword lights.","These sword lights were displayed by the two men at the moment their figures flashed. In this flash, the two men had exchanged dozens of sword skills.","That was why every time they flashed, a large number of sword lights would appear.","“So fast!”","“They actually unleashed so many sword lights in that instant?”","“It’s too fast. These two’s sword techniques are too fast.”","The surrounding spectators exclaimed in surprise at the first moment.","Even the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Xuan Yan, these three Rulers, could not help but exclaim in admiration when they saw the scene before them.","“Both of them didn’t use their absolute arts or any sword techniques at the first moment. They were purely using their swords. They were just competing in speed,” the Temporal Temple Master said.","“It’s not that simple.” The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance shook his head. “It might seem like a simple speed competition, but in reality, the sword techniques that the two of them casually used contained the universe origin of the Sword Dao. That universe origin of the Sword Dao greatly increased their sword techniques’ speed. Therefore, in this speed competition, they were actually competing to see who had the highest comprehension of the universe origin of the Sword Dao.”","..."]},{"number":3703,"title":"Chapter 3703 - Probing","paragraphs":["“You’re right. If they hadn’t fused the universe essence of Sword Dao into it, they wouldn’t have been able to instantly unleash such terrifying speed with the power of an ordinary Principles Master.” Xuan Yan nodded as well.","“The two of them are only at the beginning. Right now, they are just testing the waters, but even so, this scene is still quite shocking.” The Temporal Temple Master laughed.","These Rulers were powerful and had high standards, so they were able to see many things.","They knew that Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan were just testing the waters and had not really done anything yet.","Even so, the flashing figures and the sword shadows that burst out in an instant still shocked the surrounding spectators.","Both of them only used the power of ordinary Principles Masters, but after activating the universe origin of sword principle, their terrifying swordsmanship was still beyond the power of ordinary Principles Masters.","Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang!","Dozens of clashing sounds rang out, and Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan finally separated.","“Jian Wushuang, it seems that I have underestimated you. I thought that you had just reached the fourth level of sword principle, so you should not have a deep understanding of the universe origin of sword principle. You should only have a little understanding. I didn’t expect that your understanding of the universe origin of Sword Principle has reached a certain level. You are not inferior to me at all.”","Di Shisan stood there with a rare look of excitement on his cold face, this kind of excitement was only possible when one met a real opponent.","“The same goes for you. You are indeed the first person in the Divine Beginning Realm to step into the fourth level and master the origin of the universe of sword principle. Your understanding of the origin of the universe of sword principle was already so amazing when the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed. If it weren’t for the fact that you were in a deep sleep later on, with your talent in sword principle, your comprehension of the origin of the universe of sword principle would have already reached a new level that I can only look up to.” Jian Wushuang also praised.","Both of them had tested each other’s comprehension level of the universe origin of sword principle.","Obviously, their comprehension level of the universe origin of sword principle was about the same.","Because of this, the two of them were evenly matched in the test fight, and there was no difference in the speed of their swordsmanship.","In fact, only Jian Wushuang knew that the reason why he could be evenly matched with Di Shisan was mainly because he had been comprehending the secret inscriptions in the Heaven Suppression Tablet for the past 30 years, it was extremely helpful to his sword principle, which deepened his comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle.","However, if he had not made progress in the past 30 years and fought with Di Shisan at his peak 30 years ago, his comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle would definitely be inferior to Di Shisan’s.","“Jian Wushuang, I already know the level of your comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle. What I want to know next is your attainments in swordsmanship,” Di Shisan said.","“I’m looking forward to it too,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“In that case, I’ll draw my sword.” Di Shisan’s face was cold, but the sword in his hand suddenly burst out with a bright light.","The light was like a huge sun. It was vast and majestic. Countless powerful sword essences were completely condensed in the sun.","Di Shisan drew his sword.","He did not move. He just pointed the sword in his hand in the direction of Jian Wushuang.","In an instant, the huge sword essence ‘sun’ swept out. When it appeared in the Void where Jian Wushuang was, it directly exploded.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Countless solemn and cold sword shadows formed a huge sea of sword essence in an instant.","The Sea of sword essence covered the sky and covered the earth. For a moment, it crazily pressed down on Jian Wushuang from all directions.","It was like an extremely powerful sword principle domain. In this sea of sword essence, Di Shisan was like the master of sword principle.","“The two of them are finally getting serious,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, who was watching the battle, said.","“Watch carefully.” Temporal Temple Master also revealed an expectant look.","Jian Wushuang, who was completely covered by the sword principle domain, was surprised when he saw the scene around him.","“This move...is so familiar.”","He knew this move.","In his previous life, he had encountered a crisis in the Eternal Chaotic World. When he faced the blood emperor from the blood clan, Di Shisan had fought with him and used the same move.","However, because he was in the Eternal Chaotic World and was restricted by the Heavenly Dao, Di Shisan only had the strength of a half-step divine devil. The power of this move was probably less than one-millionth of its original power.","Until now, Di Shisan’s strength had recovered to its peak. Without any restrictions, the true power of this move had been fully displayed in his hands.","The sword essence ocean that was rampantly charging toward Jian Wushuang was like a tidal wave. Even Jian Wushuang could not help but exclaim in surprise.","“It’s just the impact of the Sword Essence Ocean?” Jian Wushuang frowned. “No, it shouldn’t be so simple.”","Although the sword essence impact in front of him was terrifying and would affect his strength to a great extent, judging from the power of the sword essence ocean, this sword was not so simple.","And it was true.","“Jian Wushuang, take my sword.”","“Emperor Sword!”","Di Shisan glanced at Jian Wushuang and slashed out with the divine sword in his hand.","It seemed to be an ordinary sword, but the moment it was slashed out, a dazzling sword light swept out.","The sword light was so dazzling that it could cause damage to the eyes of ordinary cultivators. The dazzling light instantly made it the focus of the world.","It was as if this sword was the only thing left in everyone’s eyes.","“An absolute art at the Ruler Realm?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm.","He saw that this sword was extraordinary, but he was not afraid. His body swayed, and a violent force was released instantly.","“Peerless Sword Manual, Xi Xiang!”","The cold sword light suddenly slashed down with endless violent intent.","In the blink of an eye, it collided with the dazzling sword light.","Both were ultimate skills at the Ruler Realm, and the power they used was exactly the same. Even their comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle was almost the same.","The two sword lights disappeared almost at the same time.","“Di Shisan, is your swordsmanship only at this level?” Jian Wushuang looked at Di Shisan.","Di Shisan merely glanced at Jian Wushuang and did not say anything. However, he struck out with his divine sword again."]},{"number":3704,"title":"Chapter 3704 - Swordsmanship System","paragraphs":["Di Shisan attacked again, but this time, hua! Hua! Hua! Hua! Hua!","One after another, dazzling sword lights whistled out.","Each sword light was so dazzling and eye-catching.","Each sword light was so tyrannical.","However, there were dozens of such sword lights from Di Shisan’s hands.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","The spectators were shocked when they saw the sword essence from Di Shisan’s hands.","“How could this be?”","“Those sword skills are so powerful. I feel that every sword move is an absolute art at the Ruler Realm!”","“He has used so many absolute arts at once?”","Everyone was shocked.","An absolute art at the level of a Ruler was extremely powerful.","It was not easy to use an absolute art at this level.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of sword principle was very high, and he had even created an advanced level seven absolute art, he still had to use an elementary level seven absolute art one sword at a time, unlike Di Shisan, he used dozens of sword lights in one breath, each of which was comparable to an absolute art at the Ruler Realm.","“It’s because of this sword principle domain.”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, but he was not afraid at all when he saw the sword lights coming at him.","He moved his body to meet them and waved the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand.","Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang!","A series of clashing sounds rang out as Jian Wushuang blocked the dozens of sword lights.","However, they were all absolute arts at the Ruler level. It was very difficult for Jian Wushuang to block them. After dozens of collisions, he was forced to retreat a great distance.","Seeing this, Di Shisan’s eyes were still cold. Then, he waved his hand again.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","One after another, dazzling sword light swept out like a storm.","The onlookers were completely stunned by this scene.","They did not expect that Di Shisan could use a sword skill at the Ruler Realm so easily. It was as if he could do it with ease.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened, and then a shocking sword essence burst out.","This sword essence was filled with hatred that would not rest until death.","“An absolute art at the level of a Ruler!”","It was also an offensive sword art, but it was much more powerful than the one created by Jian Wushuang.","If the move was the most common level seven absolute art, then the move would not rest until death was the best level among the level seven absolute arts.","Boom!","With a violent boom, a huge hole was blasted open in the void.","In the hole, a terrifying power swept out with a hatred that would not rest until death. It swept in all directions and instantly crushed all the brilliant sword lights unleashed by Di Shisan.","Jian Wushuang also took a step forward and appeared in front of Di Shisan.","Whoosh!","The violent power and endless flames rose in an instant.","It was an advanced level seven skill, star fire burning the sun!","Boom!","It was like a volcano that had been silent for hundreds of millions of years suddenly exploded. This sword attack contained extremely terrifying power and completely exploded in front of Di Shisan.","Seeing this, Di Shisan’s expression was still very calm.","The moment the sword light slashed over, the longsword in his hand was stretched out straight.","“Hidden sword!”","The two words were light, but there was a unique sword essence sweeping up.","At this moment, the void where Di Shisan was seemed to have begun to undergo a huge change.","It was clearly a vast void, but it suddenly formed a storm eye. A terrifying vortex-like eye with a diameter of more than 1,000 meters appeared.","The terrifying thing was that the eye of the storm was completely formed by sword essence.","Jian Wushuang’s sword skill, which contained explosive power, displayed its full power in the eye of the storm. However, it was completely destroyed by the power contained in the eye of the storm in a moment, there was nothing left.","Buzz!","With the change of sword essence, the huge vortex-like eye of the storm suddenly disappeared. Di Shisan appeared in front of Jian Wushuang again with a calm expression. Even though he took Jian Wushuang’s terrifying sword attack head-on, there was no change at all.","Obviously, Jian Wushuang’s sword attack had been easily blocked by Di Shisan. Not only did he not suffer any damage, but he did not even take a step back.","How could Di Shisan not move after receiving Jian Wushuang’s most powerful sword attack 30 years ago?","“What a terrifying sword art. It actually weakened the power of the Starfire Burning Sun in an instant. Di Shisan, you actually created such an amazing defensive sword art.” Jian Wushuang stared at Di Shisan in shock.","“Jian Wushuang, your sword art is indeed very powerful. At least in terms of attack and killing, the explosive power of your sword art is far greater than my most powerful sword attack. However, sword principle is not just about attack and killing power,” Di Shisan said calmly.","“Do you know the difference between you and me?","“In terms of swordsmanship, I have created a complete swordsmanship system. With the sword world as the core, my swordsmanship evolved into the Emperor Sword, which can continuously attack, and the hidden sword, which can defend against all kinds of attacks. In addition, there are all kinds of swordsmanship that can be used to tie down enemies and instantly kill them!","“This is a complete swordsmanship system. It can be used to attack, defend, advance, and retreat. It also complements each other. In fact, in this sword world, the consumption of my swordsmanship is very low!","“However, your swordsmanship is different. Although your swordsmanship includes all aspects, all of these aspects are used to attack and kill. In other words, your swordsmanship only pursues attacking and killing, but in terms of defense, advance, and retreat, you are far inferior to me!","“Today’s battle, you are in my sword world. Even if you use all your swordsmanship, you can’t break my hidden sword. But against my swordsmanship, you don’t have any means of defense. Therefore, you will definitely lose this battle.”","Di Shisan’s expression was still extremely cold, but his words were full of absolute confidence.","He was indeed full of confidence in his swordsmanship system. It was because of this that he was so confident that he could defeat Jian Wushuang in sword principle.","It turned out that his confidence was not groundless. In the short exchange just now, Jian Wushuang had already used an advanced level seven secret skill. It should be the strongest move that Jian Wushuang had created, however, he still could not break his hidden sword.","As long as he could not break his hidden sword, Di Shisan would be invincible in the sword world.","..."]},{"number":3705,"title":"Chapter 3705 - The Winner Is Decided?","paragraphs":["“A complete swordsmanship system?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Once upon a time, he also wanted to create a complete swordsmanship system.","Therefore, there was the later Peerless Sword Manual.","However, as Di Shisan said, the Peerless Sword manual was full of offensive swordsmanship, but it did not even have a single defensive swordsmanship. It was indeed incomplete.","On the other hand, Di Shisan’s swordsmanship was based on the sword world, which evolved into the Emperor Sword and the hidden sword, which could be used for both offense and defense.","The sword world itself was equivalent to the realm of swordsmanship. At that time, the impact of the sea of sword essence had always affected Jian Wushuang.","In addition to what Di Shisan had said, his swordsmanship was indeed a complete system.","Moreover, this swordsmanship system was like a magic array. It could complement each other, attack and defense, and advance and retreat at the same time.","This swordsmanship was indeed powerful.","Di Shisan, who was once known as the number one sword principle genius in the Divine Beginning Realm, was finally experienced by Jian Wushuang today.","There were many aspects in his opponent’s swordsmanship that he could not compare with.","And this was because he had made great progress in sword principle and swordsmanship over the past 30 years by comprehending the secret inscriptions in the Heaven Suppression Tablet. Otherwise, he would have been defeated by Di Shisan in the contest of sword principle.","“Di Shisan, I’d like to see whether your swordsmanship system is really complete and whether it’s really that powerful.” Jian Wushuang licked his lips and attacked again in the next moment.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Sword light flashed and activated the universe origin of sword principle.","On the battlefield, Jian Wushuang had displayed his swordsmanship to the fullest.","He had displayed the several sword skills in the Wushuang Sword Manual, Purple Charm, Sword Rainbow, and other sword skills he had created in that special space and time, as well as Star Fire Burning Sun, a seventh-level advanced absolute art created by Jian Wushuang.","He attacked again and again, trying to break through Di Shisan’s hidden sword while fighting against the Emperor 13 Emperor Sword.","Unfortunately, Di Shisan’s hidden sword seemed to be integrated with the entire sword world. This sword technique was almost flawless. Even Starfire Burning Sun could not move the hidden sword, and Jian Wushuang’s other sword techniques could not break it either.","On the other hand, Di Shisan’s emperor sword did not seem to be very powerful, but the key was that it was easy for him to use it. With a casual attack, dozens of sword lights and dozens of emperor swords slashed at Jian Wushuang at the same time, which brought great trouble to Jian Wushuang.","There was also the sea of sword essence that was constantly being attacked. During the battle, Di Shisan even performed several other sword skills derived from the sword world, and one of them was extremely powerful, it was not much weaker than Jian Wushuang’s Star Fire Burning Sun.","Anyone with a discerning eye could see that Jian Wushuang was at an absolute disadvantage.","It was normal. As long as he could not break the hidden sword, Di Shisan would be invincible from the very beginning.","“As expected of Di Shisan. His self-created sword technique system can be attacked from afar and defended from close range. Moreover, it is impeccable. Even Heavenly Sword Marquis could not do anything against Di Shisan’s sword technique in the sword world.”","“In fact, Heavenly Sword Marquis’ swordsmanship is already very powerful and terrifying, especially that sword that suddenly erupted like a raging fire. Its power is really terrifying and it is so powerful that it is suffocating. However, even that sword can’t break through Di Shisan’s hidden sword.”","“This Di Shisan, I don’t know how he created this swordsmanship. It’s really too powerful.”","The surrounding spectators all praised him.","They could see that Jian Wushuang was at a disadvantage in this battle. However, they did not feel that Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was weak. It was because Di Shisan’s swordsmanship system was too powerful and too abnormal.","Even the Rulers sighed secretly when they saw the scene in front of them.","“It seems that the winner is decided,” Xuan Yan said with a smile.","“What a pity.” The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance sighed, “Actually, in terms of comprehension of the Sword Dao universe origin, Heavenly Sword Marquis isn’t any weaker than Di Shisan. However, in terms of the sword techniques created by both sides, Di Shisan is still slightly stronger.”","“If it was a head-on battle, our little friend Heavenly Sword Marquis wouldn’t be any weaker than Di Shisan. In fact, he might even be a little stronger. Unfortunately, Di Shisan has already created a complete sword technique system and is almost invincible in the sword world. With the same level of power, our little friend Heavenly Marquis really can’t do anything about it.” The Temporal Temple Master added.","“It’s normal for him to lose. After all, Di Shisan has been passed down since the era of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. Moreover, Di Shisan has stayed at the level of a Principles Master for a very long time. He has been studying the way of the sword for a very long time. That’s why he was able to create this complete sword technique system. As for Heavenly Sword Marquis, the time he has spent practicing is still too short. Moreover, he hasn’t grasped the origin of the universe of Sword Dao for too long. He still has a long way to go in terms of sword techniques.”","“However, it’s only a matter of time before he surpasses Di Shisan in the future,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“I hope this battle won’t be a big blow to the Heavenly Sword Marquis,” the Temporal Temple Master sighed.","Among the three Rulers, Xuan Yan was the only one who was better, but the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master felt it was a pity.","They actually hoped that Jian Wushuang could defeat Di Shisan in this battle, but the reality was...","“Jian Wushuang, you can’t break my hidden sword. Admit defeat.”","On the battlefield, Di Shisan stared at Jian Wushuang with a cold expression.","From the beginning to the end of the battle, Di Shisan appeared extremely calm. On the other hand, Jian Wushuang had been forced into a sorry state by Di Shisan’s swordsmanship.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had never been able to break Di Shisan’s hidden sword. Therefore, in many people’s eyes, the outcome of the battle was already decided.","However, after hearing Di Shisan’s words, Jian Wushuang smiled. “Di Shisan, the swordsmanship system that you created really impressed me and gave me a lot of inspiration. I didn’t expect that swordsmanship could form such a complete system. It could even evolve on its own and complement each other.”","“I have to thank you for teaching me a lesson. However, it’s unlikely that you want me to admit defeat so easily.”","“Oh?” Di Shisan looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","Jian Wushuang still did not recognize the current situation. Could it be that he still had some trump cards in sword principle that he had not used?","“Di Shisan, I admit that if I fought you 30 years ago, I would never be your match. But now, I might not be your match.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","“Do you have a stronger sword skill?” Di Shisan’s eyes flashed with a hint of surprise.","Jian Wushuang smiled in tacit agreement.","It was true that the strongest sword skill he had created 30 years ago was Starfire Burning Sun.","However, in the past 30 years, he had been comprehending secret inscriptions under the Heaven Suppression Tablet and had made great progress in sword principle. Therefore, he had made a great breakthrough in sword skill.","Now, he had indeed created a sword art that was far stronger than the spark burning the sun!","..."]},{"number":3706,"title":"Chapter 3706 - Falling Into the Underworld","paragraphs":["“Di Shisan, take this sword of mine.”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, and the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand glowed with a faint blood-red light.","He held the Blood Mountain Sword with both hands and raised it high. Suddenly, a large amount of sword principle universe origin seemed to be attracted by it and surged toward him.","Jian Wushuang’s sword was still in the process of brewing.","However, the process of brewing shocked everyone present.","“Does Heavenly Sword Marquis really have a stronger swordsmanship?”","“It seems so.”","“Just looking at the process of brewing, the power of his sword is extraordinary.”","The surrounding spectators were staring at the scene.","As for Di Shisan, his expression was still cold as he stared at Jian Wushuang. “It’s useless. Your comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle is similar to mine. The sword skill that you can create with this level of comprehension is at most at the advanced level of level seven. With this level of sword skill, you won’t be able to break my hidden sword.”","“Oh, really?” Jian Wushuang smiled noncommittally.","Then, the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand finally fell down.","Whoosh!","The sword slashed out, and the void turned into chaos.","There was no sound of explosion or air explosion. At this moment, the sword that Jian Wushuang slashed out did not seem to have any terrifying power.","However...when the divine sword fell, a cold sword light mercilessly cut through the space, mercilessly tearing apart everything in front of it, and mercilessly slashing toward Di Shisan.","If the seventh-level advanced skill, Starfire Burning Sun, which Jian Wushuang had created before, was extremely violent and had a shocking burst of power in an instant, then the sword he was using now was cold and merciless!","This cold and merciless sword seemed to be able to cut through everything in its path.","No one, no matter what, could withstand its sharp edge.","The name of this sword was ‘Fallen Yellow Spring’.","The sword landed on the road to the yellow spring!","This sword should have been performed more appropriately by the Netherworld Divine Sword, but now, because it was only a contest of sword principle, Jian Wushuang could display its tyrannical power with the Blood Mountain Divine Sword.","The onlookers were shocked when they saw the cold and merciless sword light, which seemed to be able to cut through everything.","“What a terrifying sword!”","“This sword is too powerful. Even though it is far away from us, I can still feel the invincible power contained in this sword.”","“This sword is indeed stronger than the sword technique that Heavenly Sword Marquis used previously. I wonder if Di Shisan can block it.”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with anticipation as they stared at the battlefield.","Everyone was staring intently, afraid that they would miss even a single scene.","In the middle of the battlefield, the cold and merciless sword light that was invincible had already appeared in front of Di Shisan.","Di Shisan’s expression did not change at all.","“Hidden sword!”","As Di Shisan’s voice fell, the terrifying vortex-like eye of the wind that was over a thousand meters in diameter appeared once again.","The eye of the wind still contained the power to kill everything. It was enough to neutralize any attack.","Previously, no matter what sword skill Jian Wushuang used, he could not defeat the eye of the wind even with the Star Fire Burning Sun. Instead, the power of the sword skill was completely neutralized by the eye of the wind.","With this move, Di Shisan was almost invincible in the sword world.","Now, Di Shisan was using the same move. The difference was that he was facing Jian Wushuang’s fall of the yellow spring, which could cut through all obstacles in front of him.","Chi!","There was still no loud explosion. The cold and ruthless sword light swept into the center of the eye of the wind, producing only the sound of energy colliding with each other.","Originally, everyone thought that this cold and ruthless sword light should be gradually destroyed by the eye of the wind like before.","However, suddenly...bang!","The entire wind eye suddenly emitted an intense rumbling sound. Immediately, countless sword intent violently rose. This sword intent Vortex Wind Eye also lost its previous balance and directly became chaotic.","At the very center of the wind eye, that icy cold and merciless sword light erupted with a bright light.","Crash! The entire wind eye was completely shattered.","The sword essence in the sky scattered crazily in all directions.","“What?”","Di Shisan finally revealed a look of shock. The confidence in the depths of his heart had disappeared the moment the eye of the storm was shattered.","He had thought that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the origin of the universe of sword principle was similar to his, and that the sword skill he could create was at most at the advanced level of level seven. It was not very strong.","It turned out that Jian Wushuang’s sword of the underworld was indeed only at the advanced level of level seven.","However, he had never expected that this sword would directly destroy his hidden sword.","“The universe principles!”","“There is a trace of the aura of the universe principles in this sword!”","Di Shisan’s body trembled and his pupils dilated.","The moment the sword essence wind eye dissipated, he sensed a trace of special aura contained in the cold and ruthless sword light.","Although he had never come into close contact with that extremely special aura, he had at least sensed it before.","It was the aura of the supreme universe principles, which could only be possessed by the universe principles.","There was actually a trace of the aura of the universe principles contained in Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship?","This was simply incredible.","Compared to Di Shisan’s shock, Jian Wushuang appeared very calm. There was also a faint smile on his face.","“In the past 30 years, I’ve been studying the secret inscription under the Heaven Suppression Tablet. The secret inscription was derived from the universe principles, and the aura of the universe principles was extremely rich. When the universe principles descended, I also came into close contact with the universe principles...because I came into close contact with them and had the opportunity to comprehend them, I was able to grasp a trace of the aura of the universe principles with the help of the universe principles in the secret inscription!”","“Although the aura of the universe principles is very weak and insignificant, it comes from the supreme universe principles. I integrated it into my swordsmanship and created this move.”","“That’s right. Di Shisan’s hidden sword is very impressive. Ordinary Advanced Level Seven Absolute Arts can’t break his hidden sword, but a sword art containing the aura of the universe principles is enough to break his hidden sword.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","The aura of the universe principles was only a trace of the aura of the universe principles, not the real universe principles.","Under normal circumstances, only supreme experts were qualified to comprehend the universe principles and grasp a trace of the universe principles. But if it was just the aura of the universe principles, a Ruler Realm cultivator...but it can be mastered.","Now, Jian Wushuang had just grasped the breath of the universe principles.","..."]},{"number":3707,"title":"Chapter 3707 - Victory or Defeat","paragraphs":["Chi chi!","After the sword will wind eye was shattered, the cold and merciless sword will wind eye didn’t completely disappear. Instead, it carried extraordinary power and directly slashed at Di Shisan’s body.","The sword light finally dissipated, but the world completely fell silent.","Around the battlefield, countless experts looked at the scene in front of them, and their eyes flashed with intense shock.","“Di Shisan’s hidden sword has been broken?”","“His swordsmanship system has been defeated by Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“Has he lost?”","A series of shocked voices sounded one after another.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void with a sword in one hand and stared at Di Shisan.","Di Shisan looked at the white mark on his supreme treasure armor with a trace of disbelief in his eyes.","But soon, Di Shisan’s expression calmed down. He raised his head again and looked at Jian Wushuang with a rare smile on his face. “Jian Wushuang, you’ve won this battle.”","He had won!","This battle was indeed Jian Wushuang’s victory!","Everyone saw that Jian Wushuang’s strongest sword attack had directly destroyed Di Shisan’s swordsmanship system and slashed at Di Shisan’s body.","Although this sword attack did not cause much damage to Di Shisan, it was able to defeat his swordsmanship system. This meant that Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was stronger than Di Shisan’s!","Di Shisan had lost and was completely convinced of his defeat.","“The swordsmanship system you created is indeed very impressive. If I hadn’t had some special opportunities over the years and made great progress in swordsmanship, I would definitely not be your opponent,” Jian Wushuang also praised.","He sincerely praised Di Shisan.","Whether it was his understanding of swordsmanship or the swordsmanship system he created, Di Shisan was indeed amazing.","In particular, the swordsmanship system had given him a lot of inspiration. If he had not been able to infuse a trace of universe principles aura into his swordsmanship by chance, he would not have been able to defeat Di Shisan in swordsmanship.","Therefore, a sword principle expert like Di Shisan was naturally worthy of Jian Wushuang’s respect.","“A loss is a loss. There is no other reason. From today onwards, you are truly the strongest in the Divine Beginning Realm with the strongest sword principle,” Di Shisan said.","Although he had lost, there was not a hint of disappointment in his words. On the contrary, there was a hint of joy in his voice.","It was obvious that he hoped that Jian Wushuang could defeat him in sword principle.","The reason was because he had been invincible in sword principle for a long time.","The so-called loneliness of an expert was precisely because he had always been invincible. That was why he longed for someone to challenge his position and even defeat him in sword principle. However, no one had been able to do so for a long time, because of this, he could not find an opponent in sword principle and felt extremely bored.","But today, someone had done so.","Jian Wushuang had used sword principle and defeated him fair and square.","This actually made him feel a sense of relief and at the same time, a sense of joy from the bottom of his heart.","In addition, there was another reason. It was because Jian Wushuang was carrying the hope of the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","Only Jian Wushuang could free the Divine Beginning Realm from the control of Devil Cloud Star Master, and only he could restore the Divine Beginning Realm to normal operation.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang’s strength was crucial to the Divine Beginning Realm.","Now, seeing that Jian Wushuang’s attainments in sword principle were so high and that he had even incorporated a trace of the universe’s principles into his swordsmanship, Di Shisan was amazed and happy that Jian Wushuang was so strong.","The stronger Jian Wushuang was, the greater the hope of representing the Divine Beginning Realm.","When the surrounding experts heard Di Shisan say that from today onward, Jian Wushuang was the strongest in sword principle in the Divine Beginning Realm, they were all shocked.","Then, countless eyes filled with respect and admiration looked at Jian Wushuang.","In the void next to him, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Xuan Yan also rushed over.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you are indeed powerful to defeat Di Shisan in sword principle,” Xuan Yan said.","He did not like Jian Wushuang at first, mainly because of Xuan Yi.","However, because of Jian Wushuang’s astonishing strength, he changed his attitude toward Jian Wushuang. Now that Jian Wushuang had defeated Di Shisan in sword principle, even he could not help but exclaim in admiration.","He was well aware of Di Shisan’s attainments in sword principle. Di Shisan’s talent in sword principle had once terrified him.","But now, Jian Wushuang’s talent in sword principle was clearly stronger than Di Shisan’s!","“You’re so young, and you’re only a Principles Master, but you’ve already grasped a trace of the aura of the universe’s principles. This is incredible. Marquis Jian, I look forward to your growth in the future.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s eyes flickered with a rich light, he stared at Jian Wushuang.","“You’re welcome.” Jian Wushuang smiled and looked around. “Today’s battle has come to an end. If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave.”","Jian Wushuang did not stay any longer.","He had been immersed in studying the first layer of the secret inscription in the Heaven Suppression Tablet. It was only because he had made an agreement with Di Shisan that he stopped the shocking sword principle battle.","But now that the battle was over, he naturally had to return to the Eternal Chaotic World to study the secret inscription in the Heaven Suppression Tablet again.","After all, the secret inscription in the Heaven Suppression Tablet was too profound. Even though it was only the first level, he had not been able to enter the rudiments even after spending 30 years.","After Jian Wushuang left, the spectators also dispersed.","However, after this battle, Jian Wushuang’s title of the strongest sword principle in the Divine Beginning Realm was completely confirmed.","And the original title was Di Shisan’s.","Although Di Shisan was defeated by Jian Wushuang, he did not suffer the slightest blow. On the contrary, because of Jian Wushuang’s last sword strike that carried the aura of universe principles, and because he was defeated by Jian Wushuang in sword principle...it had actually caused a great impact on his heart.","This impact made the bottleneck that he had been stuck at for countless years begin to loosen up.","Di Shisan had also benefited greatly from this battle.","Therefore, after this battle ended, Di Shisan immediately began his closed-door cultivation.","...","In front of the Heaven Suppression Tablet in the Eternal Chaotic World, Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged again.","“I didn’t expect that just a trace of the aura of the universe principles could improve the power of my swordsmanship to a whole new level. I wonder how strong I will be if I really master a trace of the universe principles one day.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, his eyes flashed sharply.","However, he quickly closed his eyes and began to immerse himself in comprehending the first layer of the secret inscription.","Time passed once again..."]},{"number":3708,"title":"Chapter 3708 - Red Cloud Mist Tide","paragraphs":["In the blink of an eye, 5,000 years had passed since the battle between Jian Wushuang and Di Shisan.","During these 5,000 years, Jian Wushuang had been comprehending the first level of the secret inscription in front of the Heaven Suppression Tablet. During these 5,000 years, the Divine Beginning Realm had been extremely calm. Almost nothing major had happened. The only thing that was more eye-catching was...it was only because of the rise of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect that they had regained their position in the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the universe void, in the star field where the Divine Beginning Realm was located, it was one of the three battlefields, Crimson Stone Mountain!","The vast and boundless blood-red land was like a huge blood-red mouth, devouring everything.","No experts who were adventuring in Crimson Stone Mountain dared to set foot on the blood-red land. They could only stand on the blood-red stones that stood on the blood-red land.","As one of the three great Universe Battlefields, Crimson Stone Mountain was filled with endless dangers and opportunities. Naturally, there were many strong warriors here.","In the core area of Crimson Stone Mountain, two Principles Masters landed on a blood-red rock.","One of them was tall, and the other was short. The Aura on their bodies was not weak, and they had already reached the sixth level of the Void Space Realm.","“Our luck is really bad. We have been here for tens of thousands of years, but we haven’t gotten a single true treasure.” The taller man curled his lips and said.","“Don’t be ungrateful. Although we haven’t acquired any universe true treasures of top-tier or higher over the years, we’ve still acquired a few basic true treasures, and we’ve even acquired two senior Rulers. We’ve already gained quite a bit. If you want to acquire higher-level and more precious true treasures, you can do so, but you’ll have to venture deeper,” the short old man said.","“Deeper?” The tall man’s pupils constricted, but he shook his head. “This is already the core region. If we go any deeper, it’ll be too dangerous for both of us.”","“It’s good that you know.” The short old man smiled.","And just as the two of them were casually conversing...","Boom!","The world suddenly shook violently, and the entire Crimson Stone Mountain and the blood-red continent below began to tremble violently.","“What...what’s going on?”","“What’s going on?”","The tall man and the short old man were both shocked as they looked around at the void in a daze.","Suddenly, bang!","In front of them, somewhere on the blood-red land, there was a loud bang. Following that, the blood-red land exploded, and large patches of blood-red clouds erupted like lava from a volcano, they directly erupted from the exploded land.","The red clouds swept wildly, and their power was earth-shaking.","In the blink of an eye, the majestic red clouds had already arrived in front of the blood stone that the tall man and the short old man were standing in.","“Hurry up and leave!”","The tall man and the short old man were both shocked, and they did not hesitate to burst out with their fastest speed to rush toward the void behind them.","As soon as they left, the vast blood-colored cloud invaded them and completely covered the blood stone they were at earlier.","After it was covered, the blood stone did not change much. However, from within the blood-colored cloud, one could clearly hear the terrifying sound of erosion.","This sound caused the expressions of the tall man and the short old man to change drastically.","However, before the two of them could rejoice that they had escaped a calamity, the blood-colored fog once again swept over.","At the same time, on the blood-colored land not too far away from them, bang!","The same thing happened.","Similarly, it was as if a volcano had erupted from the ground. Large swaths of blood-colored fog erupted from the ground and swept wildly in all directions.","It was not just the area where the tall man and the short old man were located. At this moment, Crimson Stone Mountain was already in the midst of a huge riot.","Deep within Crimson Stone Mountain, in every corner, the blood-colored ground suddenly exploded. Countless blood-colored clouds erupted from within and wildly swept away everything in the surroundings.","The entire Crimson Stone Mountain was like a huge active volcano that had completely erupted.","That power was earth-shattering.","And the countless cultivators who were wandering around Crimson Stone Mountain, after seeing this scene, they were shocked and terrified at first, but very quickly, they turned into joy.","“Red Cloud Mist Tide, this is the Red Cloud Mist Tide!”","“So many blood colored clouds, erupting from underground, engulfing the entire Crimson Stone Mountain, this is the legendary Red Cloud Mist Tide!”","“The Red Cloud Mist Tide has finally appeared again.”","Many cultivators who had been adventuring in the Universe Battlefield for a long time and knew more about it had already understood why there was such a drastic change in Crimson Stone Mountain.","They also understood that the drastic change in Crimson Stone Mountain this time was the legendary Red Cloud Mist Tide!","And the Red Cloud Mist Tide was quite dangerous. To the cultivators who were adventuring on Crimson Stone Mountain, it was definitely on the level of a disaster.","This was because the blood-colored mist that was erupting from underground contained a terrifying erosive power. It was enough to easily corrode all the divine power of the Principles Masters. Therefore, even the Principles Masters.., if they were not careful and were completely covered by the blood-colored mist, the chances of them dying were very high.","Therefore, almost all the Principles Masters on Crimson Stone Mountain were frantically fleeing for their lives.","In the depths of Crimson Stone Mountain, the tall man and the short old man who happened to be at the center of the Red Cloud Mist Tide were frantically fleeing. Their hearts were trembling with fear.","“Red Cloud Mist Tide! I didn’t expect that the two of us would actually encounter the Red Cloud Mist Tide. Furthermore, we happened to be right in the middle of it. This time, we’re in big trouble!” The tall man said in a low voice.","“Damn it. Wasn’t the Red Cloud Mist Tide only a short while ago? Why did it erupt again in such a short time?” The short old man cursed in a low voice.","“Who knows? Most people would be extremely happy to see the Red Cloud Mist Tide erupt. I believe that many people in this galaxy would be pleasantly surprised after hearing the news. However, the Red Cloud Mist Tide is a disaster for you and me, who are at the center of the Red Cloud Mist Tide!”","“We have to think of a way to quickly escape from this fog tide. Otherwise, when the fog tide in all directions connects together, the two of US will be dead for sure!” The tall man said.","“Hurry up and escape!”","At this moment, the two of them were frantically fleeing for their lives.","They only wanted to find a gap in the red fog tide in all directions and escape.","However, they didn’t know if they could find that gap or if it was too late.","However, just as they had said, although the two of them were terrified and running for their lives, many experts in this star area became excited after hearing the news of the Red Cloud Mist Tide."]},{"number":3709,"title":"Chapter 3709 - Excitement","paragraphs":["North Sea Palace.","As one of the top three forces in the entire Starfield, the North Sea Palace knew about the Red Cloud Mist Tide at Crimson Stone Mountain.","In the Grand Palace, almost all the top experts of the North Sea Palace had arrived. Even those who had been adventuring in the three battlefields had their incarnations gathered here.","The three Rulers of the North Sea Palace were seated at the very top.","“It has only been 120 million years since the last time the Red Cloud Mist Tide appeared. It actually appeared again?”","“The time it appeared this time is indeed a bit too early.”","“That’s normal. The Red Cloud Mist Tide didn’t appear at a regular time, and the longest time it appeared was 800 million years ago. This time, it has been 120 million years, which isn’t too short.”“Please reading on >”","The high-level experts of the North Sea Palace were all discussing.","“After the Red Cloud Mist Sea appears, the Red Cloud World should also appear.” A peak level six Principles Master suddenly said.","At the mention of the Red Cloud World, smiles appeared on the faces of the many experts of the North Sea Palace.","Clearly, the reason why they were so excited when they heard that the Red Cloud Mist Sea appeared was because of the Red Cloud World.","At this moment, the Sky Roc Ruler, who was the strongest and had the highest status among the three Rulers, personally spoke out, “After the Red Cloud Sea appears, the Red Cloud World will immediately appear. Every time the Red Cloud World appears, it will be a great opportunity. This time, it will be no exception.”","“Therefore, the experts under the North Sea Palace can make preparations now. In ten days, all of you will follow me to Crimson Stone Mountain. I will personally go to the Red Cloud World this time. Longyuan, you will go with me. As for Xing Kang, you will stay in the North Sea Palace to keep watch.”","......","Sky Roc Ruler glanced at the two Rulers.","Although they were both Rulers, the two clearly followed Sky Roc Ruler’s lead.","“Yes.” Ruler Longyuan and Ruler Xing Kang both nodded.","Ruler Longyuan’s eyes were clearly filled with a hint of excitement. As for Ruler Xing Kang, although he felt a bit regretful, he didn’t complain.","Ruler Xing Kang was the weakest of the three Rulers in terms of power, after all. It made sense for him to stay behind to keep watch. As for the opportunities within the Red Cloud World, Sky Roc Ruler and Ruler Longyuan would have to fight over them.","Ten days later, the people of the North Sea Palace set off.","...","In the vast void of the universe, a triangular gray palace quietly floated there.","In this palace were Elder Dark Bone and Life Fall King.","Although these two had stayed in this palace for a long time, they knew clearly about the major events that had happened in this star field.","The two had immediately learned of the appearance of the Red Cloud Mist Tide at Crimson Stone Mountain.","“The Red Cloud Mist Tide has appeared. It seems that the Red Cloud World will soon see the light of day again.” Elder Dark Bone laughed calmly.","Elder Dark Bone had lived for an incomparably long time. He was someone who had lived in the same era as the Temporal Temple lord. He had experienced the Red Cloud Mist Tide many times, so he naturally knew of it.","“I’ve heard of the Red Cloud World as well. It is said to be a great opportunity. Many Rulers in this region are extremely excited about this opportunity. They definitely won’t miss it.” Life Fall King said.","“I see.” Elder Dark Bone nodded. He then asked, “Life Fall, you are a Ruler Realm expert as well. This time, the Red Cloud World has appeared. Don’t you want to go take a look and try your luck?”","“Of course I want to go. If I miss such an opportunity, who knows how long it will take next time?” Life Fall King smiled. “Elder Dark Bone, what about you?”","“As for me...” Elder Dark Bone pondered for a moment, then smiled. “I have nothing to do these few years anyway. Let’s go take a look.”","“Then let’s go together.” Life Fall King smiled.","Soon, Elder Dark Bone and Life Fall King headed toward Crimson Stone Mountain.","...","The Star Palace was a fairly famous power in this starfield. There were quite a few cultivators in the Star Palace who had been adventuring within Crimson Stone Mountain.","When the dramatic changes occurred within Crimson Stone Mountain, the Star Palace received the news as well.","Upon receiving the news, Daoist Xuan God immediately summoned the many experts of the highest level of the Star Palace.","Within the towering palace, more than ten figures were seated.","These ten figures were all the most powerful experts of the six realms within the starpalace.","“The appearance of the Red Cloud Mist Tide means that the Red Cloud World will immediately reappear in the mortal world. If any of you are interested in the opportunities within the Red Cloud World, you can head to Crimson Stone Mountain as soon as possible and enter the Red Cloud World to search for opportunities. I have only one request for you.” Daoist Xuan God looked downwards.","“When we arrive at the Red Cloud World, you must unite as much as possible so that we can obtain the greatest benefits for our Star Palace.”","“Yes.”","The ten or so Principles Masters nodded solemnly and quickly left.","After these Principles Masters left...buzz! Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Four figures appeared around Daoist Xuan God.","They were Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor.","Among them, Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master were all in the Divine Beginning Realm. Only their consciousness avatars appeared here.","“Xuan God, why did you summon us here?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","Jian Wushuang also looked at Daoist Xuan God.","He was meditating under the Heaven Suppression Tablet in the Eternal Chaotic World when Xuan God suddenly sent him a message, asking him to be aware of it.","Xuan God knew that Jian Wushuang had been cultivating all these years. Under normal circumstances, Xuan God would not disturb him unless there was something important.","“Yes, there is. Three days ago, red clouds covered the sky at Crimson Stone Mountain. As expected, the Red Cloud Mist Tide appeared again,” said Xuan God.","“Red Cloud Mist Tide?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were stunned when they heard this, and then they were pleasantly surprised.","Only Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","He had not cultivated for a long time, and he did not spend much time in the Universe Battlefield. He had never been to Crimson Stone Mountain, so he did not know many things.","He did not know what the so-called Red Cloud Mist Tide was.","Daoist Xuan God, who was standing beside him, naturally noticed Jian Wushuang’s confusion, he could not help laughing and said, “The Red Cloud Mist Tide is a unique phenomenon in Crimson Stone Mountain. When it appears, the red clouds cover the sky and almost cover the entire Crimson Stone Mountain. The terrifying corrosive power contained in the red clouds is enough to easily kill the Principles Master. Therefore, the Red Cloud Mist Tide is equivalent to a disaster for Crimson Stone Mountain.”","This explanation made Jian Wushuang even more confused.","“Since it’s a disaster, why are you so surprised?” Jian Wushuang asked in puzzlement.","..."]},{"number":3710,"title":"Chapter 3710 - Red Cloud World","paragraphs":["“Since it’s a disaster, why are you so surprised?”","Jian Wushuang really did not understand.","Seeing this, Daoist Xuan God and the others looked at each other and smiled.","“My young friend, you may not know this, but the Red Cloud Mist Tide is indeed a disaster for Crimson Stone Mountain. However, under this disaster, there are also huge opportunities,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","“Opportunities?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Red Cloud World is one of the biggest opportunities in Crimson Stone Mountain,” Daoist Xuan God said, “every time the Red Cloud Mist Tide appears, the Red Cloud World will reappear in the human world. At that time, all cultivators can enter the Red Cloud World and stay there for 10,000 years.","“And the Red Cloud World is full of endless opportunities and treasures. As long as you are lucky and have a certain strength, you can get these opportunities.","“Since the three great battlefields began to exist in this star area, the Red Cloud World of Crimson Stone Mountain has appeared many times. Under normal circumstances, the Red Cloud Mist Tide will only appear once every several hundred million years. Naturally, the Red Cloud World will only open once every several hundred million years. However, there is no set time. Sometimes, the longest time is eight hundred million years.","“Every time the Red Cloud World opens, countless experts from the various powers in this starfield will go crazy and venture into the Red Cloud World. Of course, many of them have obtained great fortunes there.","“For example, billions of years ago, there was a Ruler of principles. His strength was quite ordinary, but he was lucky enough to obtain a great fortune in the Red Cloud World. After staying in the Red Cloud World for 10,000 years, he immediately reached the Ruleric level. He also had a powerful secret art, and his combat power was comparable to that of top Rulers!","“There’s also someone who got a precious inheritance in the Red Cloud World. From then on, he soared to the sky and reached the top of this star area in just a few hundred thousand years. Then, he went to the depths of the universe to explore.","“Of course, these are all rare opportunities. Not only the Red Cloud World, but many other places in the three battlefields are hiding such great opportunities. However, those great opportunities contain great dangers, while the Red Cloud World is relatively easy to encounter. Moreover, the danger is smaller.","“However, in terms of true treasures...every time the Red Cloud World reappears in the human world, there will be a large number of universe true treasures emerging. For example, top-tier and Pinnacle universe true treasures, be it attack weapons, true treasure armor, domain type, suppression type, flying type, and so on, all of them are available. In addition, there are many of them. Even Supreme universe true treasures...","......","“Every time the Red Cloud World reappears, during these 10,000 years, there will definitely be supreme universe true treasures emerging, and not just one, but a total of 10. Although most of them are attack weapons, true treasure armor, and other special types of supreme universe true treasures will also be present.","“For example, Heaven Ancestor’s axe, which is a supreme universe true treasure, was obtained from the last time the Red Cloud World appeared,” said Daoist Xuan God with a laugh.","“Haha, I was purely lucky that time. I just happened to come across a supreme universe true treasure appearing, and it just so happened that I could use it.” Heaven Ancestor laughed very proudly.","In terms of power, the heavenly clan was considered quite ordinary among the great beings at the Ruler Realm. Under normal circumstances, a low-level Ruler like him would not be able to use a supreme universe true treasure unless he had the support of a major power, however, the Heaven Ancestor was lucky enough to obtain a suitable giant axe in the Red Cloud World.","Hearing their conversation, Jian Wushuang could not help but feel excited.","As Daoist Xuan God had said, the great opportunities in the Red Cloud World were not very attractive to Jian Wushuang.","After all, those great opportunities were usually only available to those who were truly lucky. Under normal circumstances, it would be considered good enough for one person to obtain such a great opportunity in the Red Cloud World, Jian Wushuang did not think that he would be so lucky.","However, the supreme treasures that were born in the Red Cloud World in the past 10,000 years made Jian Wushuang’s heart flutter.","There were a large number of top-tier and peak-tier universe supreme treasures, and even 10 supreme universe Supreme Treasures!","Supreme universe Supreme Treasures, supreme treasures of that level, were enough for experts at the Ruler Realm to fight madly for them.","There were many great beings at the Ruler Realm in this star field, but none of them had a supreme universe true treasure. These Rulers were all eager to get a supreme universe true treasure that was suitable for them, just like Heaven Ancestor.","Normally, they roamed the three battlefields. Although there were many supreme universe true treasures in the three battlefields, only one could be born after a long time, unlike the Red Cloud World. As long as the Red Cloud World was opened...within 10,000 years, no less than 10 supreme universe true treasures would be born.","Who would want to miss such an opportunity?","It was no wonder that the great beings of the various powers in this starfield were so eager to see the Red Cloud World.","It was no wonder that Daoist Xuan God and the others were so excited and surprised.","The Red Cloud World was a great blessing to the Principles Masters of this starfield and the Rulers.","“My young friend, you are no weaker than an advanced Ruler now. However, although you have the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword that you got from the Sky Roc Ruler and the Mountain River Map and the Heaven Suppression Tablet that your master left for you, I’m afraid that you can’t control or use them now. The Supreme Treasure Divine Sword is still not enough for you,” said Daoist Xuan God.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He also understood that if he had the Divine Sword of Styx as his most powerful weapon and the map of mountains and rivers, he would be able to master the Heaven Suppression Tablet one day, it was definitely a very rich treasure.","However, his enemy came from the distant Devil Cloud Star, the Star Master.","The Master of the Devil Cloud Star was a Master of a second-level Astral World. He had a lot of resources, so he must have all kinds of treasures. He was much richer than Jian Wushuang.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang must find a way to get more supreme treasures. At the very least, he must have a decent supreme treasure armor?","“It’s definitely good news for us that the Red Cloud World has come out at this time. This means that we can get as many supreme treasures for you as possible in the next 10,000 years. When the Master of the Devil Cloud Star arrives, we will have a better chance of winning,” said Daoist Xuan God.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“By the way, Xuan God, there are countless opportunities and treasures in the Red Cloud World. I wonder if there are treasures like the Ice Heart Glazed Jade in the Red Cloud World?” Jian Wushuang asked."]},{"number":3711,"title":"Chapter 3711 - Rumors","paragraphs":["“Iceheart glazed jade?” Daoist Xuan God frowned slightly. “As far as I know, the Red Cloud World has appeared so many times. Countless treasures have been born, and many opportunities have been obtained. As for secret arts and techniques, they have also been obtained by others. But as for natural treasures...I’ve never heard of anyone obtaining them from within.”","“Well, there doesn’t seem to be any special natural treasures in the Red Cloud World. However, I have heard of a rumor about the Red Cloud World,” Temporal Temple Master suddenly said.","“A rumor?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you may not know this, but the Red Cloud World does not only have one heaven and earth. Instead, it is divided into three levels, just like our Divine Beginning Realm. After experts from this star field entered the Red Cloud World, they have always been exploring the first level. As for the second level and the third level, no one has ever set foot in it.”","“Therefore, there is a rumor that whoever has the ability to step into the Second Heaven can choose one of the many treasures in the Red Cloud World. Among them, there might be a genius treasure like the Ice Heart Glazed Jade,” Temporal Temple Master said.“Please reading on >”","“There is such a rumor?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he said in a deep voice, “Has anyone confirmed the rumor?”","“No.” Temporal Temple Master shook his head. “Although the Red Cloud Mist Tide has appeared many times and countless experts have entered the Red Cloud World, no one seems to be able to step into the Second Heaven.”","“What’s going on? Don’t know how to get to the Second Heaven, or?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No, the path to the Second Heaven has been known to the public for a long time. In the center of the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World, there is a towering mountain, called Heaven-treading Mountain. There are many dangers on Heaven-treading Mountain, and there are experts guarding it.”","“For a long time, those experts who entered the Red Cloud World would try to reach the top of Heaven-treading Mountain before the 10,000-year deadline. But in all these years, no one has really reached the top of Heaven-treading Mountain,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","It had been a long time, but no one had ever reached the top of Heaven-treading Mountain. One could imagine how difficult it was.","“My young friend, you have only cultivated for a short time and are only at the level of a Principles Master, but your battle strength is comparable to an advanced Ruler. If you go to Heaven-treading Mountain, you might have a chance to reach the top,” Temporal Temple Master said.","......","“Temporal, you think too highly of me. It’s not that easy.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Temporal Temple Master merely shrugged.","Of course, he also knew that it was not that easy to truly reach the top of Heaven-treading Mountain.","Even if Jian Wushuang was a monster, no one had been able to reach the top of Heaven-treading Mountain for so many years.","“This trip to the Red Cloud World is of great significance to the Divine Beginning Realm. We can’t be careless. Therefore, the three of you, Heavenly Marquis, Zhan Tian, and Temporal, will go there personally. The Heaven Ancestor will return to the Divine Beginning Realm to oversee it while I will continue to stay in Star Palace to gather intelligence and provide emergency support. Do you have any objections?” Daoist Xuan God looked around and asked.","Jian Wushuang and the others looked at each other and nodded.","There were five master-level experts present, and Jian Wushuang was the absolute core. The entire Divine Beginning Realm and Star Palace served Jian Wushuang, and only Jian Wushuang’s strength could grow as fast as possible, only the Divine Beginning Realm had the capital to contend with Devil Cloud Star.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang had to go to the Red Cloud World in person. Only the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, whose strength was no less than Jian Wushuang’s, had the battle strength of an advanced master. With his strength, he would have a higher chance of obtaining supreme treasures in the Red Cloud World.","As for the Temporal Temple Master, he had an extraordinary use of the principles of time and space. When they went to the Red Cloud World together, he could be of great help to Jian Wushuang or the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master in an emergency.","It was indeed the best choice for the three of them to go to the Red Cloud World.","As for Daoist Xuan God and the Heaven Ancestor, they could stay.","“Since everyone has agreed, let’s Get Ready and meet up in Star Palace as soon as possible,” said Daoist Xuan God.","“Okay.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. His body swayed and his consciousness avatar disappeared.","In the Eternal Chaotic World, in front of the Heaven Suppression Tablet under the ancient battlefield.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes had already opened.","“Red Cloud World?” Jian Wushuang muttered, his eyes narrowing slightly. “For me, the Red Cloud World is indeed a good opportunity to get a chance and a supreme treasure. If I miss this opportunity, I’m afraid I won’t know where to get a suitable supreme treasure in the future.”","“In 10,000 years, no less than 10 supreme universe supreme treasures will be born...no matter what, I have to find a way to get one or two, or at least one Supreme Treasure Armor.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands and stood up, looking at the Heaven Suppression Tablet in front of him.","The huge Heaven Suppression Tablet, which was 30,000 feet tall, was still standing there calmly.","During the past 5,000 years, Jian Wushuang had been carefully comprehending the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","However, even after 5,000 years, Jian Wushuang had only comprehended 20-30% of the first level of the secret pattern in the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","20-30% was far from being completely mastered.","Obviously, he still had a long way to go before he could truly master the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","However, even though he had only comprehended 20-30% of the secret patterns, Jian Wushuang’s progress of 5,000 years was still very huge.","In the beginning, he had only comprehended the Heaven Suppression Tablet for 30 years, but his comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle had improved a lot. He had even grasped a trace of the aura of the universe principles, thus, he had defeated Di Shisan by relying on his swordsmanship.","He had improved so much in thirty years.","Now, he had studied for a full five thousand years.","In these five thousand years, although his improvement speed was not as fast as it was at the beginning, it was still quite frightening.","Not to mention other things, just in terms of the Sword Dao, his comprehension of the universe origin of the Sword Dao was much stronger than before. If previously, he had only comprehended a trace of the universe origin of the Sword Dao, but now...he could at least be considered to have crossed the threshold.","Now, with a casual sword technique, the universe origin of Sword Dao contained in that sword technique was much denser than before, and its power was naturally much stronger than before.","His sword technique was also much stronger than before.","Now, if he were to fight with Di Shisan again, even if he didn’t rely on the universe principles aura, he would have the confidence to defeat Di Shisan’s sword technique system just by relying on his comprehension of the universe origin of Sword Dao, Di Shisan would not be able to resist even a little bit of the universe principles aura.","..."]},{"number":3712,"title":"Chapter 3712 - Outside Crimson Stone Mountain","paragraphs":["And this was only the improvement in Sword Dao and swordsmanship.","Five Thousand Years of comprehending under the Heaven Suppression Tablet, one had to know that the secret engravings in the Heaven Suppression Tablet were derived from the principles of the universe, and the principles of the universe were lofty and inclusive. On the way of comprehending, even the principles of heaven and earth...in terms of the principles of heaven and earth.","For example, he had completely comprehended the three principles of Temporal, reincarnation, and destruction. Naturally, he could not improve because he had already comprehended them. However, his application of the three principles was much better than before.","The better he used the principles, the stronger the three principles combined with the divine power, and the stronger Jian Wushuang’s overall strength.","In addition to the three principles, he had also begun to comprehend the fourth principles, the Earth principles, in the past 5,000 years!","Although he had barely begun to come into contact with the universe principles and his sword principle had reached the sword principle universe origin, the heaven and earth rule was still something that many Principles Masters and Rulers in the universe wanted to comprehend.","In order to break through from Principles Master to Ruler, he had to first comprehend the four principles and completely fuse them together.","When Jian Wushuang went to the Principles Temple to test his affinity with the principles of Heaven and earth, he knew that other than the three principles of Temporal, reincarnation, and destruction, the principles of gold, the principles of fate, and the principles of earth had the highest affinity.","The reason why Jian Wushuang chose the principles of Earth as the fourth principle for his comprehension was mainly because of the battle with Di Shisan.","The battle with Di Shisan had inspired him greatly and made him realize the shortcomings of his swordsmanship.","This shortcoming was that his swordsmanship was almost all offensive swordsmanship without any defensive swordsmanship. As for other domain-type swordsmanship and trapping swordsmanship, they were even less.","Purely offensive swordsmanship was indeed too monotonous and incomplete.","After realizing this, he would naturally begin to make changes to his swordsmanship in the future.","As for the principles of the Earth, they were thick and heavy, and were the ones with the strongest defensive ability among the few great principles that had a higher affinity with him.","Comprehending the principles of the Earth would be of great benefit to his defensive swordsmanship in the future.","On the other hand, the principles of metal and fate...one of them was still extremely strong and focused on offense.","The other one was illusory, and the principles of fate were few and far between among the many cultivators in the universe. It was not easy to reach the peak of the principles of fate.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang chose the principles of the Earth.","In the past 5,000 years, he had been comprehending the principles of the Earth under the Heaven Suppression Tablet. With the help of the mystery of the secret inscription, his comprehension of the principles of the Earth had reached an extremely high level from the beginning until now. He was not far from completely comprehending them.","“I haven’t reached the peak of the principles of the Earth yet. When I completely comprehend the principles of the Earth one day and completely fuse them with the three principles of Temporal, reincarnation, and destruction, I don’t know if I can break through to the Ruler realm. But when the time comes, I can combine the principles of the earth and the principles of reincarnation and begin to focus on creating defensive swordsmanship,” Jian Wushuang thought.","The principles of the Earth was good at body protection and defense.","The principles of reincarnation contained the power of yin and yang of life and death. It was also very good at body protection and defense.","The combination of the two was naturally more impressive.","“However, even if I haven’t completely comprehended the principles of the Earth, with my attainments in sword principle and the 5,000 years of comprehension, I still created a body protection swordsmanship based on the principles of the Earth.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang headed toward the Star Palace.","Soon, Jian Wushuang stepped into the universe void again and arrived at the Star Palace. He also met up with the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","“Let’s go.”","After the three of them met up, they headed directly toward Crimson Stone Mountain without any hesitation.","...","Crimson Stone Mountain was one of the three Universe Battlefields in this star field.","However, due to the appearance of the Red Cloud Mist Tide, Crimson Stone Mountain had become the absolute focus of this star field. Even now, when they were exploring the other two battlefields...most of them had already rushed to Crimson Stone Mountain.","When Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master arrived at the border of Crimson Stone Mountain, the vast Crimson Stone Mountain was completely covered by the towering red clouds.","The red clouds soared into the sky, and their power was earth-shaking.","“It’s been so long, but the Red Cloud Mist Tide still hasn’t dissipated? And it’s really wide. It erupted from the core of Crimson Stone Mountain, and it actually covered the entire Crimson Stone Mountain.” Jian Wushuang revealed a surprised look.","“It’s normal. The Red Cloud Mist Tide usually appears for a year or even several years. It’s only been a month since the Red Cloud Mist Tide erupted. It’s still very early. We can only wait here until the Red Cloud Mist Tide has completely retreated before we can enter,” the Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang was slightly enlightened.","According to Daoist Xuan God, the Red Cloud Mist Tide was extremely terrifying and would be a huge disaster for the entire Crimson Stone Mountain.","Although he already had the battle strength of an advanced Ruler and had cultivated the supreme-level undying celestial body, he still did not dare to directly enter the Red Cloud Mist Tide. After all, the Red Cloud Mist Tide was boundless, the erosion ability was terrifying. Once a person was trapped in it, he was likely to be corroded to death by the Red Cloud Mist Tide, and the sovereign was no exception.","“I’ve instructed the Principles Masters under Star Palace who are eager to enter the Red Cloud World, as well as the experts under the three major Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm, to come here as soon as possible to meet us. After the Red Cloud Mist Tide has dispersed, they will enter the Red Cloud World together,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","The appearance of the Red Cloud World had shocked the entire star field, and countless experts were eager to enter it.","The experts from Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances were no exception. However, most of the Principles Masters were wandering in the three battlefields, and they were very scattered. The appearance of the Red Cloud World...the experts from the other two battlefields had rushed over. The experts who had been wandering in Crimson Stone Mountain had long left.","“Let’s wait.”","Jian Wushuang said and then waited quietly.","As time passed, more and more experts arrived around Crimson Stone Mountain.","More and more experts from Star Palace gathered behind Jian Wushuang and the other two. A year after the Red Cloud Mist Tide erupted, the Principles Masters from Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances gathered behind Jian Wushuang and the other two, all of them were Principles Masters above the fifth realm of the void.","After all, although the Red Cloud World was full of opportunities, because there were many experts who entered, the fights were very fierce. The weaker ones were basically courting death if Principles Masters below the fifth realm entered, therefore, most of those who dared to enter the Red Cloud World were above the fifth realm of the void.","They were generally at the peak of the five states of the void, and there were also many who had reached the six states of the void."]},{"number":3713,"title":"Chapter 3713 - Rulers Are as Common as Clouds","paragraphs":["Not only the people from Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances, but also the top experts from many forces in the star area had gathered around Crimson Stone Mountain.","As Jian Wushuang’s soul power swept through the void, he could sense thousands of strong auras. Crimson Stone Mountain was vast and boundless, there were dozens of entrances to Crimson Stone Mountain and the Red Cloud World.","There were dozens of entrances. Jian Wushuang and the others had already gathered more than 1,000 people at one of the entrances. All of them were experts above the fifth realm of the void.","If all the entrances were added up, there were too many top experts gathered around Crimson Stone Mountain.","“There are so many people.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","“The attraction of the Red Cloud World is no small matter. Not only the experts who have been wandering around the three battlefields, but also many experts who have been living in seclusion for a long time and have never been to the Universe Battlefields. When they heard the news, almost all of them came. Not only the Principles Masters, but also the masters...many ancient existences will definitely come when they know that the Red Cloud World has opened.”","“In total, there should be no less than 40 Rulers,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised.","40 Rulers...the number looked terrifying, but in fact, there were several Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm alone. The Divine Beginning Realm was just a third-class Astral World that had not evolved to its peak.","One had to know that there were dozens of Astral Worlds in this Starfield, and many of them had long since reached their peak. In addition, there were quite a few Astral Worlds that had gone into decline, but they were left behind by the experts.","Even though a large portion of them chose to enter the depths of the universe to explore, there were still quite a few who continued to stay in this starfield.","If all these were added up, the number of Rulers in this starfield was not small.","It was normal for 30 to 40 masters to come to the Red Cloud World at the same time.","“It seems that it won’t be easy for us to get one or two supreme universe supreme treasures from the Red Cloud World,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Of course it won’t be easy. Last time, the Heaven Ancestor was very lucky to get a supreme universe supreme treasure. However, this time, we have three masters, and both of your combat strength are comparable to advanced masters. In addition, I have a deep understanding of Temporal. As long as we can find a supreme universe supreme treasure, we have a good chance of getting it,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","While Jian Wushuang was talking with Temporal Temple Master, more than 1,000 experts gathered at the entrance and whispered among themselves.","Did someone look at Jian Wushuang and the others.","There was nothing they could do. Although there were many experts at the entrance, there were only two experts at the Ruler Realm. They were both on Jian Wushuang’s side, so it was difficult for them not to attract attention.","“Are all the people in the Void from Star Palace? No, some don’t seem to be.”","“Not all of them are from Star Palace. Some of them are from the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, according to the news, the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm are in the same boat as Star Palace. Now, I know the Temporal Temple Master who is standing among the two Rulers. As for the other one...”","“That’s the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. He once roamed the Universe Battlefield, and he’s quite famous. It’s just that he hasn’t roamed the Universe Battlefield for many years. It’s said that something happened in the Divine Beginning Realm, and because of some special reasons, the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance has been staying in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“Tsk tsk, your news is already out of date. Some time ago, a good friend of mine came to visit me. He’s a solitary expert from the Divine Beginning Realm. He told me that the Divine Beginning Realm had a great change not long ago. The original Ruler of the Three Saint Realms had been completely destroyed, and now, the Divine Beginning Realm is said to be an iron bucket!”","“And the current leader of the Divine Beginning Realm is not only the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor, but also an expert named Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“The Three Saint Realms have been destroyed?”","“No wonder the Holy Island seems to have been destroyed by the Star Palace.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis? Who is that Heavenly Sword Marquis? Is he also a Ruler?”","Many experts secretly communicated through voice transmission.","The red-haired elder, who clearly had some understanding of the situation in the Divine Beginning Realm, smiled and said, “You may not know the name of Heavenly Sword Marquis, but I’m sure you know the famous Blood Sword Master, right?”","“Blood Sword Master?”","Many experts present were stunned. They subconsciously looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the middle of Temporal Temple Master and Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and then throbbed.","Indeed, they did not know Heavenly Sword Marquis.","But they did not know the Blood Sword Master.","He had defeated five experts of the ultimate six realm by himself. In this star field, he was known as the strongest Principles Master.","“That Heavenly Sword Marquis is the Blood Sword Master. I heard that he has the strength of a Ruler now,” the red-haired elder said with a smile.","“A Ruler?” Everyone was shocked.","“How is that possible? He has the strength of a Ruler?”","“Judging from his aura, he is just a Principles Master. He hasn’t become a Ruler yet.”","“It’s hard to say. He had a great encounter before. When he defeated the five experts of the ultimate six realms, his strength was already very close to that of a Ruler. Now, after nearly 10,000 years, he might have made a breakthrough and really have the strength of a Ruler.”","Everyone was talking.","But there was no doubt that they were full of respect for Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master.","These Principles Masters could not afford to offend an expert at the level of a Ruler.","As for Jian Wushuang, regardless of whether he really possessed the battle strength of a Ruler, he had already defeated five experts at the pinnacle of the six realms. He was widely recognized as the strongest among the Principles Masters in this star area, this was enough to make the Principles Masters tremble.","When the Red Cloud Mist Tide dispersed and they entered the Red Cloud World, they would definitely stay far away from Jian Wushuang if they encountered him.","At this moment...","Buzz!","The space around them shook slightly, and then a white-robed figure slowly stepped out.","As soon as this person appeared, an extremely powerful aura immediately swept out.","“A Ruler, another Ruler?”","“Another Ruler is coming?”","More than 1,000 experts at the entrance immediately looked over when they sensed the aura.","Even Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master looked at the newcomer.","When they saw the newcomer clearly, the corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up into a playful smile.","“It’s him?”"]},{"number":3714,"title":"Chapter 3714 - Scattered","paragraphs":["“Ruler of blueness, it’s Ruler of blueness!”","The numerous Principles Masters at the entrance were shocked when they saw the white-robed figure.","Ruler of blueness was quite famous in the three battlefields.","When Ruler of blueness arrived at the entrance, he immediately sensed the presence of the people from Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances. At the same time, he also noticed Jian Wushuang’s half-smile gaze.","The gaze made his heart tremble, but he immediately lowered his body and bowed slightly in Jian Wushuang’s direction through the void.","“You’re quite tactful.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","“It seems that after the last time, you’ve become afraid of the Heavenly Sword Marquis,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","Others thought that he was a solitary Ruler, but only Jian Wushuang and the others knew that he was actually an avatar of the Earth Saint Star Master.","Jian Wushuang had killed his way into the holy star for the sake of the Ice Heart Glazed Jade. He had beaten the holy star master so badly that he had to lower his head and reveal his secret.","The secret was the black Ruler.","Jian Wushuang knew the true identity of the black Ruler, but the Principles Masters at the entrance did not know, let alone the relationship between the black Ruler and Jian Wushuang.","Therefore, when they saw the actions of the Ruler, they were surprised.","“What is the Ruler doing?”","“He is bowing. is he bowing to the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master or the Temporal Temple Master?”","“He should be the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master. I heard that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master is an advanced Ruler, so he should be stronger than the Ruler.”","Although these Principles Masters said this, they still had a trace of doubt in their hearts.","Under normal circumstances, even if the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was a high-level Ruler and was stronger than Ruler Uqing, Ruler Uqing did not need to bow directly. At most, he would just show a little respect.","However, Ruler Uqing’s current actions clearly carried a trace of respect.","He was a real Ruler after all. was there a need for him to be so respectful to an advanced Ruler?","What the Principles Masters did not know was that the Ruler was not afraid of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, much less Temporal Temple Master. What he was truly afraid of was Jian Wushuang!","However, because Jian Wushuang was still a Principles Master and had yet to show his real combat strength to the outside world, the people around him did not know this.","Time continued to pass.","In the blink of an eye, another three months had passed.","Buzz!","In the vast Crimson Stone Mountain in front of them, the red jade that filled the heaven and earth suddenly surged up. Then, large patches of red clouds began to shrink toward the depths of Crimson Stone Mountain.","This scene caused the eyes of the experts at the entrance to light up.","“The Red Cloud Mist Tide is going to disappear.”","“It’s finally going to disappear.”","“Once the Red Cloud Mist Tide is gone, we can enter the Red Cloud World. I can’t wait any longer.”","Many experts began to look forward to it.","Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the others also stared at the changes in Crimson Stone Mountain.","When they saw the red cloud begin to shrink, and in the blink of an eye, it had already shrunk out of their sight, they immediately started to move.","“Let’s go!”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master took the lead.","Jian Wushuang, Temporal Temple Master, Star Palace, and the Principles Masters of the three Freedom Alliances followed behind. They rushed into Crimson Stone Mountain.","Not only them, but the more than 1,500 Principles Masters gathered at the entrance also rushed into Crimson Stone Mountain like wasps.","Crimson Stone Mountain became completely lively.","...","“The entrance to the Red Cloud World is under the blood-red land of Crimson Stone Mountain. Usually, the land of Crimson Stone Mountain is covered with red clouds. No one can sneak into the underground through the red clouds. Only when the Red Cloud Mist Tide appears and the red clouds shrink to the deepest part of Crimson Stone Mountain will the entrance to the Red Cloud World See the light of day again.”","“Oh, the entrance is down there.”","Jian Wushuang and the others had already arrived at Crimson Stone Mountain. Not long after they entered, they saw an endless abyss with a layer of faint red mist at the bottom of the abyss. According to what Temporal Temple Master had said, that layer of red mist was the entrance to the Red Cloud World.","“How big is the entrance?” Jian Wushuang asked subconsciously.","“It’s very big, covering almost the entire Crimson Stone Mountain. So now, no matter which direction the cultivators enter from, they can see the Abyss after entering Crimson Stone Mountain. Naturally, they can also see the entrance below the Abyss.” Temporal Temple Master said, “Everyone, let’s not waste any time. Let’s enter the Red Cloud World now.”","“Alright.”","Everyone nodded in unison. Immediately, their figures rushed down the abyss.","In just a short moment, they had arrived above the layer of red fog.","“Enter.”","The Temporal Temple Master let out a low cry. Everyone passed through the red fog and entered the Red Cloud World.","...","The sky of the Red Cloud World was filled with red clouds, dyeing the entire sky red.","There were no living plants on the same red land. There was a boundless red land everywhere. Occasionally, one could see bald red mountains or boulders.","Whoosh!","With a flash of light, Jian Wushuang appeared in the void of the Red Cloud World.","As soon as he appeared, Jian Wushuang immediately released his soul power to cover the surrounding sky.","“The void of the Red Cloud World seems to be much more stable than the three battlefields. Even if I release my soul power at full strength, I can only cover an area of 100,000 kilometers.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly.","The area of 100,000 kilometers seemed to be very large, but in fact, if Jian Wushuang was in the Divine Beginning Realm, it would be easy for him to cover millions of kilometers with his soul power with just a thought.","Of course, in the universe void, he would be more restricted, but it was not too outrageous.","In the three Universe Battlefields, his soul power could only cover an area of 1,000,000 miles.","In the Red Cloud World, it could only cover an area of 100,000 miles, which was already a big limit.","“There are eight Principles Masters in the area of 100,000 miles, but none of them belong to Star Palace or the three Freedom Alliances.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened slightly.","Before entering the Red Cloud World, he had heard from Temporal Temple Master that even though they entered the Red Cloud World together, as long as they passed through the entrance of the Red Cloud World, they would spread out and spread out to different corners of the Red Cloud World.","That was why he did not have any experts from his side.","“Fortunately, although they have spread out, there is no restriction on communication in the Red Cloud World.” Jian Wushuang flipped his hand and took out a communication token.","“Heaven-cleaving, Temporal.”","Jian Wushuang immediately sent a message to Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","..."]},{"number":3715,"title":"Chapter 3715 - Was Easily Obtained","paragraphs":["“Do you know your current location?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I should be on the fourth continent,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“I’m on the Sixth Continent. What about you, Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","“I was teleported to a wasteland. There’s nothing within a radius of 100,000 kilometers that I can identify. So I don’t know which continent I’m on,” Jian Wushuang said.","There were seven continents in the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World.","Except for the Seventh Continent, which was in the center, the other six continents were scattered around and close to each other.","Before entering the Red Cloud World, Jian Wushuang had obtained a star map of the seven continents in the Red Cloud World. On the star map, there were many marked places on the continents, including mountains, bloody rocks, and so on, there were also some abandoned buildings and even some battlefields.","These things were easy to identify. However, there were no such things within a radius of 100,000 miles in the wilderness where Jian Wushuang was now.","“My young friend, you should find out which continent you are on as soon as possible,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Suddenly...buzz!","A majestic aura suddenly came from the void not far away, causing the heaven and earth to tremble.","“What’s this?” Jian Wushuang’s expression could not help but change.","“What’s wrong?” Temporal Temple Master asked.","“It seems that my luck is good. As soon as I came to the Red Cloud World, I encountered the birth of a true treasure. Judging from the aura of the true treasure, its level is not low,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“In that case, go and fight for it. Try to get as many supreme treasures as you can,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang smiled with a hint of excitement in his eyes, “Judging from its aura, I’m afraid that the place where the Supreme Treasure was born is about 500,000 miles away from me. With my speed, I can reach it in a moment.”","Jian Wushuang immediately rushed toward the place where the Supreme Treasure was born at his fastest speed.","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived at the place where the Supreme Treasure was born.","He saw a dark golden long stick floating in the void, surrounded by a layer of dark golden light. The aura of the supreme treasure was emitted from the long stick.","“A top-tier Universe Supreme Treasure?” Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","When he arrived in the void, the dark golden long staff had completely appeared.","For a moment...","“Snatch!”","“Hurry up and snatch the Supreme Treasure!”","“This long staff is mine!”","There were 17 Principles Masters who had arrived in the void earlier than Jian Wushuang. Among them, there were seven at the peak of the Void Fifth Realm and ten at the sixth realm, one of them was an expert at the peak of the sixth realm!","The 17 Principles Masters rushed out at the same time after the dark golden long staff was completely born.","The fight began in an instant.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of violent explosions could be heard.","At this moment, these Principles Masters unleashed their strongest strength. Some of them held magic weapons and rushed forward to fight. Some of them used their true treasures or secret skills to help their experts fight for the true treasures, some of them used escape techniques to sneak toward the long staff.","Those Principles Masters who could reach the peak of the fifth level of the Void Space Realm or the sixth level of the Void Space Realm were all powerful and had extraordinary techniques. At this moment, in order to fight for the true treasures, they were displaying their power and techniques to the fullest.","However, among the 17 Principles Masters present, the most dazzling one was still the peak of the sixth level. He was the most powerful, and he was also very good at protecting his body. He directly relied on his tyrannical power and protective ability to charge at the front, he even easily pushed back the two senior great beings of the sixth level who were fighting with him.","In the blink of an eye, he had already arrived in front of the dark golden long staff. He was less than 100 meters away from the dark golden long staff.","“Haha, this top-tier universe true treasure is mine.” The wild man who looked like a savage laughed loudly.","Suddenly, a phantom-like figure appeared in the void space in front of him. It was also beside the dark golden long staff.","As soon as this figure appeared, he waved his hand and kept the dark golden long staff into his interspatial ring.","This scene caused the savage-like man’s face to instantly turn ferocious.","“Escape art?”","“You dare to steal my treasure? You’re courting death!”","The savage-like man’s eyes were burning with rage. He didn’t even look at the other party’s appearance. He only saw that after the other party kept the dark golden long staff into his interspatial ring, he immediately attacked. A huge axe was swung out like lightning...the huge axe was surrounded by layers of flames, which burned the void crazily. In the blink of an eye, it had appeared in front of his opponent.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","“Swish!”","A sword essence instantly gathered in front of him.","This sword essence seemed weak, but when it flew out and hit your huge axe, it instantly sent the huge axe flying. The sword essence did not lose its momentum and swept past the savage-looking man’s neck.","The savage-like man widened his eyes. It was not until he was about to die that he was able to truly see the other party’s appearance.","At the same time, he also understood why he, a powerful expert at the peak of the sixth level, did not even have the slightest chance to struggle before he was instantly killed by the other party.","“So it’s him?”","The savage-like man was filled with unwillingness and fear, but his voice had already been completely cut off.","In the surrounding void, the other 16 Principles Masters who wanted to fight for the dark-gold long staff were terrified when they saw this scene.","They did not recognize Jian Wushuang at first, but after the savage-looking man died, they immediately recognized him.","“It’s Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“Blood Sword Master?”","“Go, hurry up and leave!”","None of the 16 Principles Masters present hesitated. They no longer had any greed for the dark golden long staff. They immediately turned around and left this place at the fastest speed possible.","No one dared to stay even half a step, let alone fight for it.","What a joke. This starfield acknowledged that the strongest Principles Master, Blood Sword Master, was there. How could they fight for it?","Even if all of them joined hands, Blood Sword Master could easily kill them all.","In the blink of an eye, all the Principles Masters in the area had left, and the fight was over.","“A top-tier universe true treasure, so easy to get?” Jian Wushuang stood there with both hands, a strange smile on his face.","What he did not know was that there were too many universe true treasures in the Red Cloud World.","If he were to wander in the three battlefields, even in the deepest part of the battlefield, he would usually need to spend some time in the drill ground to encounter a higher-tier true treasure, however, in the Red Cloud World...there were countless high-tier and top-tier universe true treasures. With his battle strength, it was easy for him to get a top-tier universe true treasure.","..."]},{"number":3716,"title":"Chapter 3716 - Nine Emperor Pavilion","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang got a top-tier universe supreme treasure as soon as he entered the Red Cloud World, and it was very easy. This made Jian Wushuang look forward to the Red Cloud World even more.","With the appearance of one Supreme Treasure after another, the feast in the Red Cloud World had really begun.","In the blink of an eye, 20 years had passed.","“Heaven-cleaving, congratulations on obtaining another advanced Supreme Treasure Armor.” Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master exchanged messages.","“Haha, I was lucky. This time, the Supreme Treasure Armor was born less than 300,000 miles away from me, and I was the only Ruler around. I got it easily.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master laughed heartily.","“You’ve been lucky for 20 years,” said Temporal Temple Master. “Over the past 20 years, I’ve gotten more true treasures than you.”","“Not at all,” said Temporal Temple Master. “I’ve gotten a lot of true treasures in the past 20 years. There are eight of them, but most of them are low-level and high-level true treasures. There’s only one top-tier true treasure.”","“What else do you want? I haven’t obtained a single top-grade true treasure in the past 20 years. I’ve only obtained two high-grade true treasures and one low-grade true treasure,” said the Temporal Temple Master unhappily, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re a little luckier than me. You’ve obtained at least one top-grade true treasure.”","“It’s not bad.” Jian Wushuang just smiled.","There were too many supreme treasures in the Red Cloud World.","It was terrifying.","In the short span of 20 years, there were countless supreme treasures born in the Red Cloud World. Naturally, these supreme treasures were also obtained by the surrounding cultivators.","As for how much they got, it depended on their strength and luck.","Among them, luck was very important.","In the past 20 years, for example, Jian Wushuang only got one top-tier universe supreme treasure at the beginning, and then he got one advanced universe supreme treasure and two elementary supreme treasures.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was incredibly lucky. In just 20 years, he had obtained a total of eight universe true treasures, including top-tier true treasures.","“Don’t worry. The Red Cloud World will be open for 10,000 years. Although there will be more true treasures in the beginning, there will be more in the future. With our strength, I’m afraid we’ll be able to gain a lot after 10,000 years,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“That’s true. It’s been 10,000 years. It’s only been 20 years. It’s still very early.” Temporal Temple Master laughed, “In the past 20 years, not a single supreme true treasure has been born in the Red Cloud World. It seems that only two supreme true treasures have been born.”","The three of them roamed the Red Cloud World, while Daoist Xuan God sat in the Star Palace, gathering intelligence for them.","In the past twenty years, Daoist Xuan God had informed them of the number of supreme treasures and supreme true treasures that had been born in the Red Cloud World.","Thus, they knew that in the past twenty years, only two supreme true treasures had been born in the Red Cloud World.","“The number of supreme true treasures born in the Red Cloud World has always been low, but there are many of them. However, later on, the number of supreme true treasures that are born will greatly decrease, but the quality will increase. In the future, the supreme true treasures that are born will usually be at least high-grade, and very few low-grade true treasures will be born,” said the Temporal Temple Master.","“As long as they are in front of us or we have a chance to get them, we should not let them go. Although they are useless to us, they are very useful to our Principles Masters.”","“If we get a lot of them, we can take them to the Nine Emperor Pavilion and exchange them for some high-level treasures,” said the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“Nine Emperor Pavilion?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “What is this Nine Emperor Pavilion?”","“You don’t Know?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was surprised.","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","“Haha, my dear Heavenly Sword Marquis, you haven’t been in the Universe Battlefield for a long time. In addition, you rarely have the opportunity to contact the Nine Emperor Pavilion, so Xuan God and I didn’t tell him about it,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“I see.” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master understood, then, he continued, “The Nine Emperor Pavilion is an extremely ancient and powerful force. It is said that the nest of the Nine Emperor Pavilion is in the deepest part of the universe. Furthermore, it is an Ruler. Its force is spread throughout every corner of the universe.”","“For example, this star field that we are in can only be considered as a corner of the universe. Even so, there is still a Nine Emperor Pavilion in this star field.”","“The Nine Emperor Pavilion does not compete for Rulery or participate in the fight between the forces in our star field. They are not even interested in the endless opportunities in the three battlefields of our star field. They only do business,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said with a smile.","“Business?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, to put it bluntly, the Nine Emperor Pavilion is a large-scale trading place. If you have powerful or special treasures that you don’t need, you can put them in the Nine Emperor Pavilion and entrust them to sell or exchange for you. At the same time, you can use your own things in the Nine Emperor Pavilion to exchange for the treasures in the Nine Emperor Pavilion,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master continued to explain.","“If we get enough treasures in the Red Cloud World, we can go to the Nine Emperor Pavilion and exchange them for higher-level treasures. For example, you can exchange a dozen top-tier treasures for a top-tier treasure.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then asked, “Does the Nine Emperor Pavilion have all kinds of treasures?”","“Well...not really.”","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master shook his head. “If it were the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the deepest part of the universe, it would have everything. However, we can’t guarantee that the Nine Emperor Pavilion in our star field has all kinds of treasures. However, we can be sure that the Nine Emperor Pavilion has many supreme true treasures, not just one or two. As long as you pay a high price, you can go there to exchange for the supreme true treasures.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, are you asking if the Nine Emperor Pavilion has the Ice Heart Glazed Jade?” Temporal Temple Master suddenly asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He had just found out about the existence of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. According to the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, since the Nine Emperor Pavilion was so powerful, it might have the Ice Heart Glazed Jade.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, I can tell you that the Nine Emperor Pavilion does not have this Ice Heart Glazed Jade.” The Temporal Temple Master said seriously, “Because when I found out that you needed the Ice Heart Glazed Jade, Xuan God sent someone to the Nine Emperor Pavilion to inquire about it.”"]},{"number":3717,"title":"Chapter 3717 - Ci Hong Master","paragraphs":["“What’s the result?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The Nine Emperor Pavilion said that there is no Ice Heart Glazed Jade in this star field. However, as long as they are given three supreme true treasure armors, they can get one from other territories, but it will take a longer time,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“How long will it take?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I can’t guarantee it, but it’s said to be within 500,000 years,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“500,000 years?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He did not care about three pinnacle true treasure armors.","He had killed three Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm. He had obtained four pinnacle true treasure armors from them, and even one supreme true treasure from each of the three Rulers, he had also obtained three supreme true treasures, although they were all offensive.","It could be said that he now had a very rich family.","He could even afford three supreme true treasures, not to mention three supreme true treasure armors. The key was that it would take too long for the Nine Emperor Pavilion to get one from other territories.","Although it was within 500,000 years...he was sure that it was not a short time. It would take at least 300,000 to 400,000 years. It was still too long for Jian Wushuang.","“Phew!”","He exhaled lightly and gradually regained his calm.","“Although it’s a long time, it’s at least a way. After I leave the Red Cloud World, I’ll go to the Nine Emperor Pavilion myself,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","At this moment...","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed. He flipped his hand and took out a token.","This token belonged to one of the three Freedom Alliances, a Principles Master of the Heaven Ancestor Daoist field.","Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances were on the same side. During their adventure in the Red Cloud World, Star Palace and the experts of the three Freedom Alliances exchanged messaging tokens with each other.","Star Palace and the experts of the three Freedom Alliances who entered the Red Cloud World also had Jian Wushuang’s messaging token. They could directly communicate with Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, it was the Principles Master who sent him a message.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, I’m Ice Dust Master of the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect. I’m on the Third Continent, and there’s a pinnacle true treasure armor in the Void where I am now,” Ice Dust Master’s anxious voice came from the token.","“Pinnacle True Treasure Armor?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He had been in the Red Cloud World for 20 years, and he had already figured out his current location. He was on the Third Continent.","After figuring out his location, he instructed all the experts of Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances on the Third Continent to inform him immediately if they discovered the birth of a pinnacle true treasure. He would rush there as soon as possible.","There was a supreme true treasure armor in the Void where Ice Dust Master was.","“In the past 20 years, only two supreme true treasures have been born in the Red Cloud World, and they are only offensive weapons. Now, a supreme true treasure armor has been born, and it happens to be on my Third Continent,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Tell me your current location, and I’ll rush over immediately,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","Ice Dust Master immediately told Jian Wushuang where he was.","After comparing the star map, Jian Wushuang immediately determined the distance between him and Ice Dust Master.","“Damn, there’s a distance of 16 million miles between us. No wonder I didn’t sense the aura of the supreme true treasure armor,” Jian Wushuang thought.","When a supreme true treasure was born, there would usually be a big commotion, especially when the aura of the supreme true treasure was spread over a wide area.","When a supreme treasure was born, the commotion would be even greater, but the commotion would not travel more than 16 million miles.","“A supreme treasure will be born longer than an ordinary high-level or top-tier supreme treasure. It will take me a while to cover the distance of 16 million miles. I hope I can make it in time.” Jian Wushuang did not hesitate, he set off immediately.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master also knew that Jian Wushuang was going to the place where the true treasure was born. They all sent messages to him, “Good luck, my Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","...","If he could teleport or time-space teleport, Jian Wushuang would have arrived at the place within 16 million miles in an instant.","Unfortunately, in the Red Cloud World, there was no way to teleport. Jian Wushuang could only rely on his own speed. It took him some time to get there.","By the time Jian Wushuang arrived, the pinnacle true treasure armor had completely appeared. The fight for it had already begun. The Pinnacle True Treasure Armor had now fallen into the hands of a Principles Master named Ci Hong.","Ci Hong Master was an expert at the pinnacle of the six realms of the void. He was extremely powerful. During the fight, he had used his tyrannical strength to seize the pinnacle true treasure armor from many experts.","However, even though the pinnacle true treasure armor had fallen into his hands, the great beings around him did not intend to let Ci Hong Master off just like that.","One had to know that for Principles Masters, a top-tier universe true treasure was enough for them to fight madly for it. As for Pinnacle True Treasures...within this star domain, there were only a handful of Principles Masters who had pinnacle true treasures, and almost all of them were only offensive weapons.","A top-tier true treasure armor would make even a Ruler Realm expert envious, let alone a Principles Master.","Because of this, even though they knew that Ci Hong Master was not to be trifled with, the surrounding Principles Masters still rushed forward to kill him.","As for Ci Hong Master, although he was powerful, he did not have a very good escape technique. Faced with the siege of many experts, he could not break out immediately, which gave Jian Wushuang a chance to participate in the fight.","When Jian Wushuang appeared on the battlefield, the Principles Masters were fighting each other, and Ci Hong Master was already red-eyed from the battle.","In a short period of encirclement, he had killed three Principles Masters with his overwhelming strength, but he had also consumed a lot of his divine power.","“Let’s end it here.”","Jian Wushuang said coldly, and he appeared directly in the center of the battlefield.","At the same time, a terrifying divine power spread out and pressed down on the entire battlefield.","Although Jian Wushuang did not use his full strength, this divine power was still far beyond that of an ordinary Principles Master. The Principles Masters on the battlefield were shocked, they all stopped moving.","“Ci Hong Master, hand over the pinnacle true treasure armor. I won’t make things difficult for you.”","Jian Wushuang looked at Ci Hong Master calmly with his hands behind his back."]},{"number":3718,"title":"Chapter 3718 - Who Should I Give It To?","paragraphs":["“Blood, Blood Sword Master?”","Ci Hong Master looked at Jian Wushuang who appeared in front of him with an extremely ugly expression.","In terms of strength, he was indeed very strong. Even among the ultimate experts of Principles Masters, he was barely qualified to be in the top ten.","It could be said that with such strength, he could almost walk unhindered among the Principles Masters.","However, there were still two Principles Masters who were enough to make him fear.","One of them was Blood Saber Emperor, and the other was Blood Sword Master.","Among them, Blood Saber Emperor had been famous in this star field for a long time. He had been regarded by many people as the strongest Principles Master in this star field, and his strength was very close to that of a Ruler.","As for Jian Wushuang, although he had not risen for as long as Blood Saber Emperor, his battle record was even more terrifying than that of Blood Saber Emperor.","He had defeated five experts of the pinnacle of the six realm and killed one of them. In one battle, he directly replaced Blood Saber Emperor and became the strongest among the Principles Masters in this star field.","Both of them were far stronger than him in terms of strength.","Normally, if he were to fight Blood Sword Master, he would choose to retreat without hesitation.","But now, he had no way to retreat.","If he did not hand over the pinnacle true treasure, Blood Sword Master and the other Principles Masters would not let him go.","But he could not give up the pinnacle true treasure.","How could he give up the pinnacle true treasure armor, which even a Ruler Realm great being would fight for?","“Even if you’re Blood Sword Master, even if you’re stronger than me, the true treasure armor has already fallen into my hands. If you want it, you’ll have to see if you have the ability to do so,” Ci Hong Master roared, a monstrous wave of Qi swept up from his body.","He did not choose to fight head-on with Jian Wushuang. Instead, he rushed to one side of the void.","But the moment he moved...buzz!","A weak sword light caught up with him and entered his body.","Ci Hong Master’s body trembled, and fear appeared in his eyes.","More than 90% of his divine power was destroyed in an instant, and his aura became extremely weak.","“Ci Hong Master, hand over the true treasure armor. Otherwise, I won’t hold back next time.” Jian Wushuang’s cold voice sounded again.","Ci Hong Master turned his head stiffly. He looked at Jian Wushuang, his eyes filled with unwillingness and disbelief.","He was unwilling to hand over the supreme true treasure armor just like that.","He was in disbelief because of the strength Jian Wushuang had shown.","It was too powerful!","A tiny sword light entered his body and instantly destroyed 90% of his divine power. This was even when Jian Wushuang had held back.","If he did not hold back, that tiny sword light would have killed him.","“How is this possible? How can the Blood Sword Master be so strong?” Ci Hong Master was completely shocked by Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Although Jian Wushuang had the battle strength of a Ruler or even an advanced Ruler, few people in the outside world knew about his battle strength.","Most people still knew about Jian Wushuang when he defeated five experts of the pinnacle of the six realm in Devil Smoke Valley alone.","At that time, Jian Wushuang was invincible among the Principles Masters.","Although Ci Hong Master knew that he could not defeat him, he was confident that he could hold on for a while. He even had a chance to escape from Jian Wushuang.","However, she did not expect that Jian Wushuang’s real strength was much stronger than before.","“Master, Blood Sword Master definitely has the battle strength of a master. He can kill me with a raise of his hand.” Blood Sword Master’s heart turned cold.","“Why? Are you still unwilling to hand it over?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had already given Blood Sword Master a chance. If the latter did not know what was good for her, then he could not be blamed.","“Blood Sword Master, you win.” Ci Hong Master smiled bitterly.","In the face of absolute strength, he had nothing to hold on to. If he continued to hold on, he would simply be courting death.","Ci Hong Master exhaled lightly and prepared to take out the supreme true treasure armor and hand it to Jian Wushuang.","The surrounding Principles Masters only watched this scene, but no one came forward to stop him. Although they were full of desire for the supreme true treasure armor, no one dared to snatch it from Jian Wushuang.","But at this moment...","Whoosh!","A figure suddenly appeared in the void beside them.","As soon as this person appeared, an extremely powerful aura, far superior to that of the Principles Masters present, spread out.","Sensing this aura, the experts present were all shocked.","“Ruler!”","“A Ruler has arrived!”","Immediately, many eyes turned to look at the figure.","Ci Hong Master also stopped what he was doing and looked over.","A middle-aged man in a white robe was floating there calmly. He frowned slightly as he looked at the void in front of him.","“Ruler Wu Qing!”","“It’s Ruler Wu Qing!”","The surrounding Principles Masters had already recognized the person.","“So it’s Ruler Wu Qing. He’s also on the Third Continent.” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a playful smile.","He had met the Ruler of the Black Cloud World at the entrance of the Red Cloud World. At that time, the Ruler of the Black Cloud World was still in awe of him.","Later, when they entered the Red Cloud World, everyone spread out. The Ruler of the Black Cloud World had come to the Third Continent just like Jian Wushuang, and now they had met.","Jian Wushuang did not care about the arrival of the Ruler of the Black Cloud World. However, the surrounding Principles Masters all had strange expressions on their faces.","For these Principles Masters, when Jian Wushuang appeared in the void, it meant that the supreme true treasure armor had nothing to do with them, especially when Jian Wushuang revealed his terrifying strength, he had severely injured Ci Hong Master in an instant, and the surrounding Principles Masters no longer had the slightest desire to fight over it.","Even Ci Hong Master had intended to hand over the supreme true treasure armor to Jian Wushuang.","But at this moment, a Ruler Realm expert was present. This was interesting.","After all, the pinnacle true treasure armor was still in Ci Hong Master’s hands.","Ci Hong Master was at a loss and did not know what to do.","He held the pinnacle true treasure armor, looked at Jian Wushuang, then looked at Ruler Wu Qing beside him. For a moment, he did not know who to give the pinnacle true treasure armor to.","If he gave it to Jian Wushuang, what would happen to the master next to him?","If he gave it to the master, Blood Sword Master, who was right in front of him, would be angry enough to kill him in an instant."]},{"number":3719,"title":"Chapter 3719 - Someone Wants to See Me?","paragraphs":["Ci Hong Master was at a loss as to who to give the supreme true treasure armor to.","Jian Wushuang was the first to speak. “Master Wu Qing, are you here to fight with me for the Supreme True Treasure Armor?”","“Pinnacle True Treasure Armor?” Master Wu Qing’s pupils shrank, but he immediately relaxed, he smiled faintly and said, “Blood Sword Master, you misunderstood me. I only came here because I sensed the movement in the void. Since you came here first, and the pinnacle true treasure armor is about to fall into your hands, I have nothing to fight for.”","“After all, there must be a first come, first served basis.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","The surrounding Principles Masters looked even weirder.","In the Red Cloud World, there was no such thing as a first come, first served basis for the fight for a supreme treasure?","What a joke.","“Since the fight has come to an end, I’ll take my leave.” Master Wu Qing ignored the doubts of the surrounding people and turned to leave.","Soon, Ruler Wu Qing disappeared from everyone’s sight.","This scene shocked all the Principles Masters present.","“How can this be? Ruler Wu Qing is leaving just like that?”","“He left without even thinking about the fight. Since when did this Ruler Wu Qing become so easy to talk to?”","“Could it be that Ruler Wu Qing is afraid of the Star Palace behind Blood Sword Master? That’s not right. Although the Star Palace is a large force, it’s not so powerful that no one dares to provoke it like the North Sea Palace. This Ruler Wu Qing shouldn’t have to worry about the Star Palace at all.”","“Or could it be that Ruler Wu Qing knows that Blood Sword Master is powerful, and he can’t do anything to him, so he can only leave, but that pinnacle true treasure armor hasn’t fallen into Blood Sword Master’s hands yet?”","The surrounding Principles Masters obviously could not understand Ruler Wu Qing’s actions.","They also could not understand why Ruler Wu Qing would leave without even thinking about fighting for it.","After all, it was a supreme true treasure armor, which was enough to make many Rulers jealous and fight for it.","The only one who was not surprised by the Ruler’s departure was Jian Wushuang himself.","“Haha, you are quite sensible.” Jian Wushuang smiled secretly.","He knew why the Ruler left. Apparently, the latter did not want to fight with him for a supreme true treasure armor.","“It’s just a pinnacle true treasure armor. It’s not a supreme true treasure. I don’t need to provoke Blood Sword Master for such a true treasure. Otherwise...not only will I be able to get it, but if I offend Blood Sword Master, not only will my secret be exposed, but Blood Sword Master can ally with the Rulers of Star Palace to kill me and even my true body.”","“Once they target me, I won’t be able to escape.”","Master Blackie had a clear idea.","If it was a supreme true treasure, he had to use it for himself, or a supreme true treasure that could tempt him. Only then would he have a chance to fight Jian Wushuang.","Otherwise, he would never dare to provoke Jian Wushuang.","Once Master Blackie left, there was no longer any suspense in the fight.","Ci Hong Master handed the supreme true treasure armor to Jian Wushuang. After checking it, Jian Wushuang found that although the supreme true treasure armor was indeed at the level of a supreme true treasure, in terms of quality, it was still inferior to his Blood Demon Cave Armor.","He certainly would not use this true treasure, but he could use it to exchange for other true treasures in the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the future.","It was already a great harvest for him to get a supreme true treasure armor in 20 years.","The fight for the supreme true treasure in the Red Cloud World continued.","In a flash, another 50 years had passed.","In these 50 years, there were already 12 supreme true treasures in the Red Cloud World, most of which were attack treasures. Jian Wushuang had only gotten one supreme true treasure armor, another pinnacle true treasure, which was even more valuable in terms of soul attacks, had been obtained by a Ruler.","The vast land was blood-red.","Hum! A faint sound of a blade was heard.","In the void space in front of them, a purple saber was floating quietly. An aura of an advanced universe true treasure emanated from the saber.","The moment the purple saber was completely born, more than a dozen Principles Masters who had been waiting around instantly swarmed over.","But suddenly...a vast Temporal energy swept out like ripples.","All the Principles Masters who were charging at the purple saber were greatly restricted by the Temporal energy, and their speed was greatly reduced.","Then, under everyone’s gaze, a ghost-like figure appeared next to the purple saber, and with a wave of his hand, he put the purple saber into his interspatial ring.","Seeing that the purple saber had been taken away by the other party, the ten Principles Masters were momentarily shocked and angry, but then they looked helpless.","Because they had clearly seen the person who had taken the purple saber.","That was Blood Sword Master, the acknowledged strongest existence among the Principles Masters of this star field.","When the purple saber fell into Blood Sword Master’s hands, they had no chance to fight for it.","Suddenly, the ten Principles Masters began to disperse.","Jian Wushuang was about to leave, but a figure rushed toward him.","“Well?” Jian Wushuang looked at the person who appeared in front of him.","“Tian Hen, greetings, Blood Sword Master,” the person said respectfully.","“Divine Master Tian Hen, What’s the matter?” Jian Wushuang asked casually.","Jian Wushuang knew Divine Master Tian Hen. He was a strong expert at the pinnacle of the six realms, so he was not qualified to compete with him for the Supreme Treasure.","“Well, I have a good friend who wants to meet you, Blood Sword Master, so he asked me to ask you to wait here for a while,” Divine Master Tian Hen said.","“Oh? Someone wants to meet me?” Jian Wushuang looked strange. “Who’s your good friend?”","“Well, you’ll know when he arrives, Blood Sword Master,” Divine Master Tian Hen said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “Okay, I’ll stay here for a while. But I’ll only wait for an hour. If your good friend doesn’t arrive in an hour, I’ll leave.”","“Don’t worry. My good friend came to the Third Continent ten years ago when he heard that you were there. He’s not too far away from us now. He’ll arrive in an hour at most,” the Divine Master Tian Hen said.","“Then I’ll wait,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","He did not know who the good friend the Divine Master Tian Hen was talking about was, but he had absolute strength. He was not worried that the Divine Master Tian Hen would plot against him."]},{"number":3720,"title":"Chapter 3720 - Jian Wushuang and the Blood Saber Emperor","paragraphs":["Just as the Divine Master Tian Hen had said, his good friend soon arrived.","He wore blood-red hair and a blood-red robe, and carried a blood-red demonic saber on his back. He looked very young. When he arrived in the void, he immediately looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Saber Emperor, so it’s him?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He already knew why the other party was looking for him.","Jian Wushuang also knew about Blood Saber Emperor.","Before he rose to power and was recognized as the strongest Principles Master among the experts in this star field, the strongest Principles Master in this star field was Blood Saber Emperor.","Blood Saber Emperor’s battle strength was very terrifying. He had defeated three experts of the pinnacle of the six realm by himself, and that was many years ago.","Over the past hundreds of thousands of years, the Blood Saber Emperor rarely fought. No one knew how strong he had become, but he was definitely stronger than before.","In addition, the Blood Saber Emperor’s saber technique was very famous in this star field.","“Blood Sword Master, nice to meet you.” The Blood Saber Emperor stared at Jian Wushuang and greeted him politely at the beginning.","“Blood Saber Emperor, I’ve heard a lot about you.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“I asked Tian Hen to come out and ask you to wait for me here,” Blood Saber Emperor said.","“I know.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “If I’m not wrong, you want to see me so badly. You must want to fight me, right?”","“Yes.” Blood Saber Emperor did not try to hide anything. “I saw the mirror image of you fighting with Blood Saber Emperor and the other five experts at the pinnacle of the sixth realm. You are indeed very strong. Even I don’t have much confidence in fighting you. I also know that you haven’t cultivated for a long time. It has been more than 10,000 years since the battle, so you should be stronger.”","“Although I know that your strength is above mine, I still want to fight you face to face.”","The Blood Saber Emperor licked his lips, his eyes filled with the desire to fight.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","It was normal for him to want to fight even though he knew that his opponent was stronger than him.","Many people in the world were like this. Even Jian Wushuang, when he met an expert of the same level who was stronger than him, knew that he was not his opponent, but he still wanted to fight him.","“Should we fight now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course. It’s not easy to meet you in the Red Cloud World. It’s a rare opportunity. Of course, we have to seize it,” Blood Saber Emperor said.","“Then you should fight,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","Blood Saber Emperor narrowed his eyes and felt a little dissatisfied.","Although he had admitted that Jian Wushuang was stronger than him, he was not that strong. He had given Jian Wushuang enough respect, but it seemed that Jian Wushuang did not care about him at all, of course, the Blood Saber Emperor was displeased.","“In that case, be careful.”","The Blood Saber Emperor did not hesitate about Jian Wushuang’s behavior. Instead, he chose to fight and speak with strength.","Clang!","A cold light flashed, and the blood-red charming saber behind Blood Saber Emperor was unsheathed. It was not only extremely cold, but also extremely powerful.","It was a supreme supreme treasure saber.","“Blood Sword Master, draw your sword,” Blood Saber Emperor shouted in a low voice.","“I don’t need it for the time being.” Jian Wushuang shook his head slightly.","“Arrogant!” Blood Saber Emperor was immediately furious. A surge of majestic divine power burst out, and he held the saber with both hands at the same time.","Whoosh!","The saber slashed out, and in an instant, a mighty blood-red saber light swept out.","The saber light was extremely dazzling and spread out in the void like a dazzling blood-red saber river.","In the blood-red saber river, there was a suffocating and cold aura.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. The moment the blood-red saber river swept in front of him, he raised his hand and casually pointed at the void in front of him.","It seemed to be an easy task, but a stream of sword essence immediately gathered in front of him.","The sword essence spread out like a blooming lotus.","Buzz!","Under the impact of the sword essence, the blood-red saber river instantly collapsed. Countless divine power frantically swept out in the surroundings, creating a great disturbance in the world.","“It’s so easy to break my saber skill?”","Blood Saber Emperor was shocked.","Although that saber skill was not his strongest, it was still one of the top three saber skills he had created. In addition, he had used all his strength to burst out his own power to the maximum.","After all, Blood Saber Emperor was a special life form.","After a special life form reached the peak of the six realms, the divine power it released was far more powerful than that of an ordinary Principles Master. It was not much weaker than a Ruler.","Even so, Jian Wushuang still easily broke his saber technique.","“Blood Sword Master, it seems that I’ve underestimated you. Not only do you have a better understanding of sword principle than an ordinary Principles Master, but you’re also not much weaker than me in terms of divine power,” Blood Saber Emperor said seriously.","“Blood Saber Emperor, you’d better use your strongest skills and saber techniques, or you won’t stand a chance,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“As you wish.” Blood Saber Emperor did not waste any time. Layers of divine power surged out from his body, and an extremely powerful divine power aura that far surpassed that of a Principles Master burst out from his body.","Blood Saber Emperor was a special life form, so his divine power was extremely powerful.","Now, he had performed an extremely powerful secret skill that could increase his divine power in a short period of time.","He had spent a lot of effort and money to obtain this secret skill in the deepest part of Crimson Stone Mountain. It was enough to allow his strength to reach a whole new level in a short period of time.","With this secret skill and his special physique, he even dared to confront a Ruler Realm expert head-on for a certain period of time.","“Humph!”","With a cold snort, the air beneath the feet of the Blood Saber Emperor exploded.","His figure appeared in front of Jian Wushuang as if he had teleported. The blood-red demonic saber in his hand flashed continuously like a real demonic charm.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The extremely cold saber light was incredibly fast as it slashed toward Jian Wushuang in all directions.","An overwhelming pressure also pressed toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was still very relaxed in the face of this overwhelming attack. He put one hand behind his back and casually used the other hand as a sword.","Each sword seemed very casual, but there was a trace of the universe origin of sword principle in his swordsmanship, which clashed with the saber light of the Blood Saber Emperor.","..."]},{"number":3721,"title":"Chapter 3721 - Baby-Like","paragraphs":["With the sound of the collision, Jian Wushuang blocked all the saber lights that Blood Saber Emperor used.","“Amazing! I used my most powerful secret skill, and the divine power that burst out at this moment is no less than that of an ordinary Ruler. But he can still block my saber lights so easily?” Blood Saber Emperor’s eyes were full of excitement.","In the next moment, he no longer held back.","“Blood Sword Master, take my strongest saber.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Blood Saber Emperor’s figure suddenly retreated. As he retreated, the blood-colored bewitching charm battle saber in his hand suddenly slashed out.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Endless blood-colored saber lights suddenly burst out.","Each of these blood-colored saber lights was like a blood-colored moon. There were hundreds and thousands of these blood-colored saber lights. They were like an enormous ocean of saber lights, blotting out the sky and covering the sun.","For a moment, the entire world was covered by this ocean of blood-colored blade lights.","At the center of this ocean of blood-colored blade lights, an aura that could make countless Principles Masters tremble suddenly rose.","At the end of the horizon, a cold blood-colored light rushed straight over.","This blood-colored light was incomparably dazzling. At the moment it lit up, the entire ocean of blood-colored blade lights around it seemed to have lost its color.","The entire world seemed to have turned completely dark. In this boundless darkness, there was only this blood light left.","It was the focus of the world and the only color in the world.","“This saber move is not bad.”","Jian Wushuang smiled slightly. He still did not draw his sword. He still used his finger as a sword.","When the blood light approached him, his right finger also stretched out straight like a sharp sword, stabbing toward the void in front of him.","Jian Wushuang still did not use his sword skill. Instead, he simply stabbed forward. However, there was an extremely dense sword principle universe origin in his hand.","In an instant, everything around him disappeared.","The sea of blood-red saber light had completely disappeared. The blood light, which had previously been the only color in the world, immediately dimmed and almost disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s finger, which did not contain any power, had already touched the Blood Saber Emperor’s chest.","“You lost,” Jian Wushuang said lightly.","“How, how is this possible?”","The Blood Saber Emperor still stood there, staring at the finger on his chest. His eyes were wide open, and his mind was blank.","He was completely dumbfounded.","He did not expect that his most powerful saber move, which he was proud of, was already an ultimate skill at the Ruler Realm. In addition, after he used the secret skill, he temporarily had divine power comparable to that of a Ruler, at this moment, his battle strength should be infinitely close to that of a Ruler.","However, such a saber move was still easily defeated by Jian Wushuang.","He did not even draw his sword. He just used his fingers to defeat his swordsmanship and then pressed it on his chest.","It felt like a giant was bullying a weak baby.","He could see that Jian Wushuang did not use his full strength. He had always been casual and easy, but even so, he still easily defeated him.","He was completely crushed by Jian Wushuang, and he was bullied by Jian Wushuang.","In the Void, the Divine Master, who had been watching the battle, was also stunned.","“How could it be? How could the Blood Saber Emperor be defeated so miserably?”","“Even if the Blood Sword Master is more powerful than the Blood Saber Emperor, he didn’t know that the gap is so big. Could it be...”","The Divine Master immediately thought of a possibility.","At this moment, the Blood Saber Emperor had barely calmed down. He raised his head and looked deeply at Jian Wushuang, asking, “Blood Sword Master, have you become a Ruler?”","“A Ruler?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he laughed, “I haven’t become a Ruler, but my strength has long surpassed that of an ordinary primary Ruler.”","“You haven’t broken through to the Ruler Realm, but your battle strength has surpassed that of an ordinary Ruler?” Blood Saber Emperor was stunned. After a long while, he let out a helpless sigh, “It seems that I’ve entered the Heaven-viewing Realm. I thought that I should be the strongest among the Principles Masters. Even if you were stronger than me, you wouldn’t be much stronger. But in the end...you’re much stronger than me. You’re on a completely different level.”","“Blood Saber Emperor, don’t be discouraged. I’m able to reach this stage not only because I have many special reasons, but also because I’ve had some special encounters. As for you, you’re indeed very terrifying among the Principles Masters,” Jian Wushuang said.","He did not say this to comfort Blood Saber Emperor, but because the latter’s strength was indeed very impressive.","At least among the Principles Masters, the Blood Saber Emperor’s strength was definitely recognized by Jian Wushuang.","He was a special life form and had a powerful divine power secret skill. He could release divine power that was not inferior to that of an ordinary primary Ruler in a short period of time. In addition, he had created an absolute art at the level of a Ruler. Such strength...to a certain extent, he was not much weaker than a primary Ruler.","“No matter how powerful I am, I am no match for you. This battle with you has made me realize that there is always someone stronger than me. In this starfield alone, there are many Principles Masters who are far stronger than me, not to mention the entire vast universe. There must be many more terrifying geniuses and great beings like you, or even stronger than you. I can not wait any longer.”","“After the competition in the Red Cloud World is over, I’ll set off to the depths of the universe!” Blood Saber Emperor said.","“You’re going to explore the depths of the Universe?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Blood Saber Emperor, who was watching the battle in the void, was also shocked.","He did not expect that Blood Saber Emperor would have such a thought after the battle with Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Sword Master, thank you for this battle,” Blood Saber Emperor said.","“You’re welcome.” Jian Wushuang was calm.","“By the way, there’s something you don’t know yet, right?” Blood Saber Emperor suddenly asked.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Not long ago, a Sword Stone was born around the 17th ruins on the Third Continent,” Blood Saber Emperor said.","“Sword Stone?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He was on the Third Continent, and Daoist Xuan God had been collecting information about the Red Cloud World through various channels, but he had never heard of any Sword Stone.","“What’s so special about this Sword Stone? Who got it in the end?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I don’t know its specific use, but I’m sure it’s very useful for cultivators who are comprehending sword principle. When it was born, it was connected to the Red Cloud World, so no one could take it away. Therefore, it should still be there. If you have time, you can go and take a look yourself,” Blood Saber Emperor said.","..."]},{"number":3722,"title":"Chapter 3722 - Sword Stone","paragraphs":["Blood Saber Emperor and Divine Master Tian Hen soon left.","However, Blood Saber Emperor told Jian Wushuang about the existence of the Sword Stone.","“Sword Stone?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. “Since it happened to appear on the Third Continent, I can’t miss it.”","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and headed straight for the Sword Stone.","The Red Cloud World was very large, with seven continents.","The Third Continent alone was extremely vast, covering a radius of billions of miles.","Within this billions of miles, there were a large number of ruins, which were marked by the experts of this star field for identification.","The 17th ruins should be near the center of the Third Continent, so Jian Wushuang soon arrived there.","After arriving at the 17th ruins, Jian Wushuang spread out his soul power and easily found the Sword Stone.","“That’s the Sword Stone?”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","There was indeed a huge blood stone in his soul perception. At first glance, it looked no different from the ordinary stones in the Red Cloud World, but at this moment, there were many Principles Masters gathered there. Most of them...were sitting cross-legged under the blood stone and meditating.","Jian Wushuang soon arrived in front of the blood stone. When he arrived, he finally saw the peculiarity of the blood stone.","......","It was made of the same material as the ordinary blood stone. The difference was that there were four large golden words in the middle of the Sword Stone.","‘Feng Xiao Xiao Xi!’","Looking at the four golden words in the middle of the Sword Stone, an ancient and ethereal aura instantly came toward him.","In an instant, even Jian Wushuang could not help being affected by the four golden words. His consciousness became empty and ethereal.","“What a terrifying concept!”","“Even I can’t help being affected?”","Jian Wushuang was startled awake instantly, but he took a deep breath.","He stared at the four golden words on the Sword Stone. Each golden word contained a unique concept.","As he focused his mind, the Sword Stone in front of Jian Wushuang suddenly changed.","The four golden characters on the Sword Stone were no longer ordinary characters. They seemed to have come alive.","The golden characters evolved in Jian Wushuang’s mind, and in the blink of an eye, they turned into four astonishing sword skills.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened. He was completely stunned by the sword skills that were transformed from the four golden characters.","They were too powerful and too terrifying!","The sword skills alone brought a sense of terror to Jian Wushuang.","Without a doubt, any one of these four sword skills could be said to be earth-shaking!","The person who left the four ancient characters on the Sword Stone must be an earth-shaking super expert.","Jian Wushuang even felt that the person who had left the four characters must be a supreme expert.","Only the words left by experts above the supreme expert could evolve into such terrifying swordsmanship.","“No wonder this blood stone is called the Sword Stone!”","“No wonder so many Principles Masters came to this Sword Stone to meditate.”","Jian Wushuang was extremely excited.","He knew that these Principles Masters must be experts who were good at sword principle. They had some attainments in sword principle, but none of them had comprehended the universe origin of sword principle.(Search N ewNovel *)","Without comprehending the universe origin of sword principle, even if they came to the Sword Stone, they would not be able to feel the existence of the four sword skills.","They could feel very little.","But even a few things, such as some simple concepts, were enough for the Principles Masters to remain silent for a long time.","But Jian Wushuang was different.","He had stepped into the threshold of the universe origin of Sword Principle, especially after comprehending the Heaven Suppression Tablet for 5,000 years. He had made great progress in sword principle. Now, he could see the four ancient golden characters in front of the Sword Stone, but he could see the complete four sword skills derived from these four characters.","Any one of these four sword skills was earth-shaking.","It was definitely a great opportunity for Jian Wushuang.","“Three of these four sword skills are offensive sword skills, but the other one seems to be defensive body-protection sword skill?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He carefully felt the four sword skills he saw.","Among the four sword skills, three were mainly offensive. Some were extremely powerful, stronger than the previous one.","Some were as fast as ghosts, killing their opponents in an instant.","However, these three sword skills were undoubtedly frontal sword skills.","Only the last one, which was derived from the word ‘xi’, was a sword skill that gave Jian Wushuang the feeling that it was a natural sword skill in body-protection.","This made Jian Wushuang start to ponder.","“The four sword skills derived from the golden words on the Sword Stone are all profound and unfathomable. The Red Cloud World will be closed again after 10,000 years at most. In just 10,000 years, I still have to fight for the Supreme Treasure. It’s impossible for me to comprehend all four sword skills at the same time. I can only choose one sword skill and concentrate on comprehending it!”","“Since I can only choose one, I have to think carefully about which one to choose,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","If he had enough time, or if he could collect the Sword Stone and take it out of the Red Cloud World, he would not be in a hurry. He would spend his time comprehending four sword skills at the same time.","Unfortunately, when he came to the Sword Stone, he saw that it was completely integrated with the Red Cloud World. He could not move or collect the Sword Stone.","If he directly divided the Sword Stone into two and took away the part containing the four golden characters...it would not work either.","Because Jian Wushuang found that the four golden characters and the Sword Stone had been completely integrated. If the Sword Stone was damaged, the four golden characters’ artistic conception would also be greatly affected. If the Sword Stone was cut into two...the essence realm contained in the four golden words would disappear completely. Naturally, Jian Wushuang would not be able to sense the existence of sword skills from the four golden words.","He had no choice but to stay here like the Principles Masters and quietly meditate.","Therefore, he could only choose one of the four sword skills to meditate, so that he could make greater progress.","As for which of the four sword skills to choose, Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment and then made a decision.","“Three of the four sword skills are offensive sword skills, but there is only one defensive sword skill. Obviously, defensive sword skills are much more difficult than offensive sword skills.”","Jian Wushuang understood that defensive sword skills were indeed much rarer than ordinary offensive sword skills."]},{"number":3723,"title":"Chapter 3723 - Comprehension","paragraphs":["“In addition, I’m most skilled in offensive swordsmanship. As for defensive swordsmanship, although I’ve created a sword technique, that sword technique isn’t perfect, and its level is very low. I can’t use it at all. If I were to encounter a slightly stronger Ruler, it would probably be able to easily defeat my defensive swordsmanship.","“Now that I have such a good opportunity in front of me, I can’t miss it.”","“I’ll meditate on this defensive sword skill and then perfect the defensive sword skill I created.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled. He had made up his mind.","Jian Wushuang immediately found a front seat under the Sword Stone and sat down cross-legged. Then he closed his eyes and began meditating.","He was meditating on the word ‘Xi’ in the four golden characters on the Sword Stone.","As for the Principles Masters, they had already sensed it when Jian Wushuang arrived, but they did not panic.","After all, the opportunity in the Sword Stone was not the fight for the Supreme Treasures that had been born before.","Only one person could get the Supreme Treasures, so the fight was naturally more intense.","However, the opportunity in the Sword Stone could be obtained as long as one came here, because no one could take it.","Therefore, no one would attack anyone who came here as long as it did not interfere with their comprehension or if someone tried to destroy the Sword Stone.","Everyone would just have to rely on their own abilities.","Everything in front of the Sword Stone appeared very peaceful.","......","Because the Sword Stone had just been born not long ago, not many people knew about it at first. Jian Wushuang also learned about the existence of the Sword Stone from the Blood Saber Emperor, but Daoist Xuan God did not send a message to him.","However, as time passed, more and more people knew about it. Naturally, more and more Principles Masters came to the Sword Stone to meditate.","The number of Principles Masters in this Star Field was frightening, and there were many experts who were good at sword principle among the Principles Masters. Now in the Third Continent...the number of Principles Masters who came to the Sword Stone was probably only a small part of the total number of Principles Masters who were good at sword principle in the Star Field, but there were hundreds of them.","Hundreds of people were meditating under the Sword Stone at the same time, so it was inevitable that some people would fight over it because of the distance between them and the Sword Stone. Those Principles Masters who wanted to meditate under the Sword Stone naturally wanted to find a place closer to the Sword Stone.","However, no matter how much they fought for a better place to meditate, no one would come to disturb Jian Wushuang’s meditation.","He sat cross-legged under the Sword Stone and was the closest to the Sword Stone, but no one dared to come forward and swap places with him.","“Endless and endless...this concept is like the life and death knot of the reincarnation principles, but I can feel that the rules contained in this sword skill are far more than just the reincarnation principles. There are seven or eight principles of the earth principles, the water principles, the light principles, and the dark principles.”","Jian Wushuang was completely immersed in the comprehension of the body-protecting sword skill.","As he comprehended, he became more and more shocked.","He was shocked by the strength of the expert who had left the four sword skills.","He had left a word casually, and the derived sword skill contained seven or eight principles at the same time, and they were all perfectly integrated.","Moreover, this was only one sword skill. The other three sword skills contained all kinds of principles, and they were all integrated.","In other words, the expert had grasped and fused at least a dozen principles. What did this mean?","“Perhaps that expert had comprehended the universe origin and had a very high understanding of the universe origin, so he directly understood many of the principles.”","“But for me, the principles contained in this sword skill can be ignored. What I want to comprehend and understand is the essence of this body-protection sword skill, or even master this essence, and then perfect my move, ‘Earth Guard’,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Earth Guard was the name of the protective sword skill that Jian Wushuang had comprehended in front of the Heaven Suppression Tablet for 5,000 years and combined with the earth principles. This sword skill was still in its infancy and was far from being perfect, moreover, his comprehension of the earth principles was not very high.","However, Jian Wushuang now felt that as long as he could comprehend some of the endless essence contained in this sword skill and integrate it into his sword skill...the power of his Earth Guard would be much stronger.","Jian Wushuang had come into contact with and comprehended the endless essence.","However, his understanding of this essence was not very high. At least, he was far inferior to the supreme expert who had left four ancient words on the Sword Stone.","He could only continue to comprehend and improve it...","In the Red Cloud World, the crazy competition continued.","One Universe Supreme Treasure after another was born in the various continents of the Red Cloud World. Countless experts killed crazily for it, and naturally, countless experts died because of it.","But for now, it had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","He stayed under the Sword Stone and was completely immersed in the comprehension of the body-protecting sword skill. He had already sent a message to the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and the others. Unless there was something urgent or a Supreme Treasure was born, he should not come and disturb him.","Right now, all he could think about was his ‘Earth Guard’ move.","In a flash, Jian Wushuang had been studying under the Sword Stone for 400 years.","During these 400 years, many major events had happened in the Red Cloud World. The biggest one was the birth of a Supreme True Treasure on the First Continent.","A Supreme True Treasure was enough to make many Rulers fight for it. In the 10,000 years in the Red Cloud World, there would definitely be more than one Supreme True Treasure. Everyone knew this, however, when the first Supreme True Treasure emerged, it still caused a bloody storm.","Countless great beings participated in the battle. Even Rulers were present. There were three of them, and the three Rulers fought madly. In the end, the most powerful senior Ruler took the Supreme True Treasure, he left.","Although the Ruler did not die in the battle, there were nearly 100 Principles Masters who died!","The scene was terrifying.","However, because the First Continent was a certain distance away from Jian Wushuang’s Third Continent, and even further away from the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the three of them did not have time to participate in the battle, Jian Wushuang had also been meditating under the Sword Stone.","During these 400 years of meditation, Jian Wushuang’s progress had naturally been tremendous."]},{"number":3724,"title":"Chapter 3724 - Asking For Help","paragraphs":["“The swordsmanship in the Sword Stone is really incredible. I have carefully studied it for 400 years, and I have made great progress in the principles of the Earth. I have almost completely mastered the principles of the Earth.”","“As for the swordsmanship, I have been perfecting the move of the Earth Guard over the past 400 years. It’s much more powerful than before. If I use this move now, I’m afraid that ordinary Rulers would not be able to break it. As for the advanced Rulers, it’s hard to say whether they can break it. However, this move of mine still has a lot of room for improvement. I can continue to improve it.”","Jian Wushuang was extremely excited.","After 400 years of meditation, he was looking forward to the Earth Guard move that he had created.","He was very curious about the extent of the Earth Guard move if he continued to meditate and perfect it.","But at this moment...","“Blood Sword Master, help! Come and save me!”","An anxious cry for help came from one of the tokens in Jian Wushuang’s interspatial ring.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, and he took out the token.","“Master Guchi, what’s going on?” Jian Wushuang asked immediately.","“It’s Pupil Master.” On the other end of the token, Master Guchi said immediately, “Just now, I obtained a top-tier domain type True Treasure in a fight. I’ve already obtained it, and the fight has already ended. However, just as I was about to leave, Pupil Master rushed over and asked me to hand over the top-tier domain type True Treasure.”","“If I refuse, Pupil Master will attack me directly. I can only rely on my trump card, the fire-cleansing formation, to survive. With Pupil Master’s strength, it’s only a matter of time before he breaks my formation.”","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang’s expression became serious.","Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances had sent many experts into the Red Cloud World this time.","These experts were scattered among the seven continents. Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master were on the Third Continent, the Fourth Continent, and the Sixth Continent respectively. Therefore, they had long given orders, if there was anything urgent in the three continents, they could directly send a message to them.","Now that Master Guchi had encountered Pupil Master, he was in deep danger. Naturally, he would send a message to him at once.","“Master Guchi is one of the top experts in Star Palace. He has the strength of the pinnacle of the six realms and is very strong in life-preservation. Once his strongest trump card, the fire-purging formation, was used, no one among the Principles Masters could break it except for me and Blood Saber Emperor. But now, he has encountered Pupil Master...” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","Pupil Master was a genuine Ruler-level expert and had been famous for a long time. Although he was only a primary Ruler, his strength was extremely strong among primary Rulers, no wonder Master Guchi had asked for help.","In fact, under normal circumstances, a great Ruler-level great being would not lower himself to deal with a Principles Master.","Unless there was a great benefit, or the other party had a treasure that made him envious.","However, what Master Guchi had obtained was only a top-tier domain type True Treasure. Even if it was a top-tier domain type True Treasure, it was at most equivalent to a pinnacle True Treasure. For such a True Treasure...most Rulers would not choose to lower their status to deal with Principles Masters.","However, this Pupil Master was definitely one of the very few Rulers in this Star Field who did not care about their status at all.","Pupil Master was notorious within this Star Field.","He was a great being who traveled alone to begin with. He had no ties to anyone, and he did not even have a single disciple. Therefore, he had never cared about what others thought of him. He only knew how to do things his own way. Naturally, he had never cared about his own status, as long as it was a treasure that he fancied, he would not mind fighting for it, let alone a Principles Master or even an Immortal Saint.","For example, Master Guchi might not be interested in obtaining a top-tier domain-type Supreme Treasure, but such a treasure was very valuable. Even a Ruler would not ignore it, therefore, he made his move right away.","“Master Guchi, pass me your current position,” Jian Wushuang said.","Master Guchi immediately passed his current position to Jian Wushuang. After comparing it on the Star Map, Jian Wushuang immediately made a decision.","“I’m more than 50 million miles away from your position. It’ll take me some time to arrive at such a long distance even if I travel at full speed. Master Guchi, try your best to use your fire-cleansing formation to stall this Pupil Master until I arrive.","“However, if your fire-cleansing formation reaches its limit before I arrive and can’t hold on any longer, you can give him the top-tier domain type True Treasure. It’s just a top-tier domain type True Treasure. If you can’t, then give it up. Don’t lose your life over it,” Jian Wushuang warned.","“Yes, I’ll try my best to stall him.” Master Guchi gritted his teeth.","Jian Wushuang did not waste any more time. He immediately rushed toward Master Guchi’s position.","Jian Wushuang pushed his speed to the maximum along the way.","He had no choice. This time, he was not going to fight for a True Treasure, but to save his life.","To him, a top-tier domain type True Treasure was nothing, but Master Guchi’s life was different.","Although Star Palace had many great beings under its command, there were not many Principles Masters who had reached the sixth level or above. As for those who had reached the pinnacle of the six realm, including Master Guchi, there were only two of them.","Naturally, these two pinnacle of the six realm were very important to Star Palace. If one of them died, it would be a great loss to Star Palace.","On the Third Continent, in a vast blood-colored void.","“Boom, boom,bBoom!” Endless pure white flames burned wildly, covering the surrounding void that was over 10,000 meters wide.","This void that was over 10,000 meters wide had completely sunk into a sea of pure white flames, and in the middle of the sea of flames, bang! bang! bang!","Numerous intense explosions rang out continuously, shaking the world.","“Haha! This lord has underestimated an ant like you. This fire formation of yours is quite unique. Even this lord would find it difficult to break it in a short period of time. “A cold laughter reverberated in the world, a towering blood-colored figure stood in the middle of the pure white sea of fire.","This blood-colored figure was surrounded by a dense blood cloud. The blood cloud rolled and an endless killing aura spread out.","This blood-colored figure was Pupil Master.","Not far in front of Pupil Master, in the center of this pure white sea of fire, Master Guchi gritted his teeth, and his expression was quite unsightly.","“Pupil Master, I’ve already sent a message to my Lord Palace Master. Lord Palace Master and Temporal Temple Master will be here soon. If you’re smart, then leave quickly. Otherwise, when my Lord Palace Master arrives...” Master Guchi shouted in a low voice."]},{"number":3725,"title":"Chapter 3725 - Cleansing Fire Formation","paragraphs":["“Haha, your Palace Master?”","Pupil Master looked at Master Guchi mockingly. “Kid, don’t think that I don’t know anything about this Star Field just because I’ve been traveling alone. I know very well that your palace master didn’t come to the Red Cloud World this time. As for the Temporal Temple Master you mentioned, he’s on the Fourth Continent now. How could he make it here in time?”","“It’s impossible for them to get here. Even if they do, what can they do?”","“I, Eye Master, have ruled this universe for so many years. I’m not even afraid of a senior Ruler. Why would I care about Star Palace Palace Master and Temporal Temple Master? What a joke!”","“Kid, I advise you to stop struggling and give me that top-tier domain type True Treasure and the array you’re using right now. I might spare your life. Otherwise, when I break this array, you’ll die!”","Pupil Master’s words made Master Guchi’s face turn extremely ugly.","He had not expected Pupil Master to be so shameless. Not only had he attacked him, a Principles Master, for a top-tier domain type True Treasure, but now that he had seen the cleansing fire array he had used, he even wanted him to hand over the array as well.","This cleansing fire array was his strongest trump card, and it was also his strongest reliance.","He had gotten this array many years ago when he was adventuring in Quicksand Demon Realm. He had been lucky enough to get it. Over the years, this array had saved his life more than once.","To him, this array was far more important than that top-tier domain type True Treasure.","Now, Pupil Master wanted him to hand over this array as well?","How was that possible?","He would rather die than hand it over!","Now, he could only hope that Blood Sword Master would arrive earlier.","Although he did not know Jian Wushuang’s true strength, judging from his position in Star Palace and the attitudes of Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others toward him, Jian Wushuang was not much weaker than the Ruler, the difference was not too great.","As long as he arrived and joined hands with him, he should be able to stop Pupil Master.","“Humph, you’re so stubborn. Since you don’t want to hand it over, then die.”","Pupil Master’s voice was cold, and the terrifying blood cloud rolled. It rushed toward the pure white sea of fire crazily with a shocking power. Master Guchi could only rely on the magic formation to resist it. However, as Pupil Master’s true strength erupted, his pressure naturally increased sharply.","As time passed, it became more and more difficult for him to resist it. The fire-cleansing magic formation gradually reached its limit.","“Damn it, why isn’t Blood Sword Master here yet?”","Master Guchi’s face was completely distorted. He could already sense that the fire-cleansing formation could not hold on any longer. He could only grit his teeth and continue to resist, praying that Jian Wushuang would arrive earlier.","However, they were 50 million miles away. Even if Jian Wushuang rushed at full speed, it would still take some time.","There were many Principles Masters gathered in the void around the pure white fire sea.","Many of them had participated in the fight for the top-tier domain type True Treasure. Some of them had sensed the huge commotion and rushed over.","These Principles Masters stood in the void around the fire-cleansing formation and watched the scene from afar.","When they saw that Master Guchi had been pushed to his limit by Pupil Master, many Principles Masters could not help but sigh.","“This Master Guchi is already extremely powerful, and he has a life-saving trump card like the cleansing fire formation. Logically speaking, he should be able to do as he pleases as long as he doesn’t run into a Ruler. I didn’t expect his luck to be so bad. He just so happened to run into a Ruler, and it was this Pupil Master who didn’t care about his status at all.”","“This Master Guchi is really unlucky. We all know Eye Master’s temper and personality. Anyone who is targeted by him will have a headache.”","“There’s nothing we can do. Unless this Master Guchi hands over that top-tier domain type True Treasure and his purifying fire array, he’ll probably die!”","“That top-tier domain type True Treasure is still fine. Anyway, he just got it. Just take it as bad luck and hand it over. The problem is that Eye Master is still interested in his purifying fire array. Everyone knows that this purifying fire array is Master Guchi’s strongest trump card. Why would Master Guchi hand over such a treasure?”","“You’re right. If it were me, I wouldn’t hand it over either.”","Many Principles Masters were discussing among themselves. Most of them sympathized with Master Guchi and felt that he was unlucky.","As time passed, the spectators could clearly feel that Master Guchi could not hold on any longer.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was still more than 20 million miles away from the void. It would take him a while to arrive.","“Haha, boy, you can’t hold on any longer, can you?”","Wanton laughter echoed in the world. Rumble! The world shook and endless power burst out, shattering the pure white sea of fire that covered tens of thousands of miles on the battlefield, the sea of fire finally could not withstand the impact of the terrifying power and dissipated directly.","The fire cleansing formation of Master Guchi was directly destroyed by Eye Master.","Without the obstruction of the fire cleansing formation, with Master Guchi’s strength, he would not be able to face Eye Master head-on.","When they realized this, many people around them secretly sighed. Even Master Guchi himself let out a miserable laugh, a trace of despair in his eyes.","However, just as Eye Master was about to attack and directly kill Master Guchi, a human figure had unknowingly appeared around this area of the void.","“It’s quite lively here.”","A low chuckle with a hint of playfulness sounded in the area.","This low chuckle attracted the attention of everyone present. Even Pupil Master, who was about to make a move, stopped what he was doing and looked at the person.","When he saw the person’s appearance clearly, Pupil Master could not help but frown.","The person was a strange old man with a scarlet cape. The old man had a thin face and a hooked nose. His eyes were very small, like those of a mouse. He even narrowed his eyes slightly, giving off an extremely shrewd look, the teasing smile on the old man’s lips made his entire person appear a little more evil.","The aura on this strange old man’s body was actually not very strong. It was very obvious that he was only at the level of a Principles Master.","However, they were both Principles Masters. Pupil Master did not put that Master Guchi in his eyes at all. However, when he saw this strange old man, Pupil Master frowned slightly.","“Dark Bone! It’s Elder Dark Bone!”","“Among the Principles Masters in this Star Field, Elder Dark Bone is said to have the most skills and the strongest survival ability!”","“It’s him?”","The Principles Masters around the battlefield were all shocked when they saw this weird old man.","..."]},{"number":3726,"title":"Chapter 3726 - The Troublesome Elder Dark Bone","paragraphs":["Elder Dark Bone was too famous in this Star Field.","In the eyes of many experts in this Star Field, if one wanted to choose the strongest Principles Master, it would undoubtedly be decided between the Blood Sword Master and the Blood Saber Emperor.","However, if they were talking about the most troublesome Principles Master, 99% of the people would immediately think of this Elder Dark Bone.","This Elder Dark Bone was famous for his many tricks and was extremely difficult to deal with.","He had faced many Ruler-level experts on more than one occasion. He had even faced high-level Rulers directly. The other party had used all of his tricks, but he was still unable to do anything to him.","He had even dared to scheme against Rulers in this Star Field. Because of this, he had offended quite a few Rulers, but so far, he was still alive and well.","Such a person...even though he was only a Ruler of Principles, even the current Pupil Master did not dare to directly ignore his existence.","“Dark Bone, what are you doing here?”","The Pupil Master was not in a hurry to act. Instead, he turned his head and asked.","“This old man just happened to pass by and happened to see you, a high and mighty Ruler, acting against a Principles Master without any regard for your status. That’s why I came here to take a look.” Elder Dark Bone laughed.","“Just to take a look?” Pupil Master’s voice was low.","“Originally, I just wanted to take a look. However, after seeing that the person you are dealing with is this Master Guchi, this old man changed his mind.” Elder Dark Bone said.","“What do you mean?” Pupil Master’s expression sank.","“This Master Guchi has nothing to do with me. However, my relationship with the people from Star Palace is quite good, so I can only let you give me some face, Pupil Master.” Elder Dark Bone said with a faint smile.","Once these words were said, the surrounding people were all stunned. Even Master Guchi himself was incomparably shocked.","Elder Dark Bone said these words, clearly intending to interfere in this matter.","“Dark Bone, you want me to give you face? Hmph, you are only a mere Principles Master. What right do you have to ask me to give you face?” Pupil Master shouted.","“It’s fine. Since you don’t want to give me face, Pupil Master, then let’s see if you have the ability to kill Master Guchi right under my nose.” Elder Dark Bone laughed casually, however, this laughter contained absolute confidence.","Pupil Master narrowed his eyes slightly.","The entire world fell silent.","Suddenly...xiu!","A stream of light flashed, and Pupil Master attacked with lightning speed. A terrifying Ruler level aura instantly covered and pressed down on Master Guchi’s body, and his speed reached its peak, clearly, he was planning to use his fastest speed to kill Master Guchi before Elder Dark Bone reached his limit.","However, the moment Pupil took the initiative to move, Elder Dark Bone, who was standing at the edge, suddenly moved.","He simply moved, but it felt as if he had teleported directly across the battlefield. Before Pupil Master appeared in front of Master Guchi, Elder Dark Bone’s figure blocked in front of him.","“You’re courting death!”","Pupil Master’s face was cold, and the killing intent in his eyes rose sharply.","He held a long red rod in one hand. This long rod emitted an incomparably dense destructive aura as it smashed toward Elder Dark Bone in a mighty manner.","Elder Dark Bone was not afraid at all when he saw this. He waved his hand, and a cold blade light slashed out directly as if it was splitting the heavens and earth apart.","Bang!","The two collided head-on. Pupil Master was a mighty Ruler-level expert after all, and in terms of power, he was far stronger than Elder Dark Bone. This collision had shattered that blade light at the first instant...even Elder Dark Bone’s entire body was forced back a few steps.","“Tsk tsk, as expected of a Ruler.”","Elder Dark Bone stood up steadily, but his face was still smiling. His aura did not weaken at all.","“Dark Bone, since you intend to get involved in this mess, then you should follow Master Guchi and die together.” Pupil Master’s killing intent soared.","“You still want to kill me?” Elder Dark Bone chuckled, “It’s not that I’m arrogant, but in this Star Field, aside from those few apex Rulers, no one else can kill me.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Elder Dark Bone’s body suddenly flashed, and in an instant, hundreds of thousands of figures of Elder Dark Bone appeared in the Void.","These hundreds of thousands of old monsters all had the same appearance, demeanor, and aura.","The many Principles Masters who were watching the battle immediately used their soul energy to cover the area, but none of them could tell which one was Elder Dark Bone’s true body.","“An illusion?”","“Humph, it’s just a small trick.”","Pupil Master snorted coldly and waved his sleeve. Immediately, majestic godly power condensed in front of him, turning into godly power spikes that instantly shot out in all directions.","These godly power spikes were densely packed and passed through hundreds and thousands of Elder Dark Bone’s figures, but they didn’t cause any ripples at all.","“What?”","Pupil Master’s face changed. “Is his real body not among these figures? Is he hiding with the escape art?”","“No, if he really used the escape art, he shouldn’t be able to hide from my soul power.”","Pupil Master’s eyes focused.","The escape art could hide from the soul power of a cultivator.","Jian Wushuang had practiced the shadowless evasive skill.","However, this kind of evasive skill could be easily seen by an ordinary expert, but it could be seen by a real expert.","As for Pupil Master, he was a Ruler-level expert. If a Principles Master really used the evasive skill, it would be impossible to hide from him.","In this case, it meant that Elder Dark Bone’s original body was indeed among the hundreds of figures, but he could not find it and could not attack it.","“Hmph, even if I can’t find your true body, my target isn’t you in the first place.” Pupil Master snorted softly. Following which, his body swayed, choosing to ignore Elder Dark Bone and continue to charge toward Master Guchi.","However, just as his body moved...","“I already said that it’s impossible for you to kill Master Guchi under my nose. You just won’t believe it.”","A mocking voice suddenly sounded beside Pupil Master, and the figure of Elder Dark Bone, who was the closest to Pupil Master, directly waved the battle saber in his hand.","This saber immediately slashed out a streak of light in the air, directly flashing toward Pupil Master’s head. Pupil Master’s figure had no choice but to immediately retreat, returning to where he had been standing before.","Once again looking at the hundreds and thousands of figures of Elder Dark Bone, Pupil Master’s expression had already become extremely unsightly.","Although Elder Dark Bone had only revealed a portion of his techniques during the short exchange of blows, this portion of his techniques had already caused Pupil Master to feel that it was extremely difficult to deal with.","Just like what Elder Dark Bone had said, if it was not for his consent, it was utterly impossible for Pupil Master to kill Master Guchi right under his nose.","..."]},{"number":3727,"title":"Chapter 3727 - Blood Sword Master Arrives","paragraphs":["“Elder Dark Bone, are you really going to go against me?” Pupil Master shouted sternly.","“Go against you?” Elder Dark Bone deliberately pondered for a moment before saying, “Actually, I don’t have to stop you.”","“Hm?” Pupil Master’s expression changed.","Not far behind Elder Dark Bone, Master Guchi was shocked.","“Pupil Master, you may not know this, but I have been in Red Cloud World for some time, and my luck is not very good. But so far, I have only obtained two True Treasures, and they are only elementary True Treasures. The gains are really not that great,” said Elder Dark Bone.","Pupil Master’s Pupils constricted. He glanced at Elder Dark Bone and said in a low voice, “Just tell me what you want.”","“It’s simple. A top-tier True Treasure armor. I won’t care about it anymore,” said Elder Dark Bone with a smile.","His words immediately caused a commotion in the surrounding void space.","“This Elder Dark Bone is really daring.”","“He dares to directly threaten Pupil Master and ask for a True Treasure from Pupil Master. Among Principles Masters, I’m afraid only he, Elder Dark Bone, dares to do that.”","“That’s normal. Elder Dark Bone is famous for his many tricks. He has strong life-saving abilities, and he is extremely difficult to deal with. If he doesn’t want to give way, Pupil Master really can’t do anything to that idiotic master. Besides, Elder Dark Bone has lived for so many years, and he has offended many Rulers. He doesn’t even care about a senior Ruler, so why would he care about a mere Pupil Master?”","“I have to say, a Principles Master dared to ask a Ruler for a True Treasure so directly. This Elder Dark Bone is indeed admirable.”","Most of the Principles Masters around felt a trace of excitement and admiration in their hearts.","It must be known that Principles Masters and Rulers were a huge watershed.","Rulers were high and mighty, and Principles Masters were nothing more than ants in front of Rulers.","The Principles Masters who had been adventuring in this Star Field had long been used to Rulers being high and mighty. However, when they saw a Ruler being defeated by a Principles Master, they naturally felt relieved and comfortable.","Pupil Master’s face was extremely gloomy. Sometimes, he didn’t care about his status or face, but a Ruler was threatened by a Principles Master and asked for a True Treasure in front of so many people, he still felt embarrassed.","He stared at Elder Dark Bone, but he hesitated.","“It’s not about face, but benefits!”","“It’s just a top-tier True Treasure armor. It’s not that valuable. The top-tier domain type True Treasure that ancient chi master just got is comparable to two or three top-tier True Treasure armor, and his purifying fire array is quite mysterious. It’s probably more valuable than a normal pinnacle True Treasure. If I kill him, I’ll get more benefits than a top-tier True Treasure armor.”","“The most important thing is...that Master Guchi has something that my treasure craves.”","Pupil Master narrowed his eyes and glanced at Master Guchi from the corner of his eye.","Everyone thought that he did not care about his status to kill Master Guchi just to get the top-tier domain type True Treasure that Master Guchi had just obtained and the cleansing fire array.","But in reality, it was not that simple.","Pupil Master had an extremely special treasure on him.","And Master Guchi had something that special treasure desired, and that was the most important reason.","“No matter what, I have to kill Master Guchi and get his universe ring. As for a top-tier True Treasure armor, it’s nothing.”","Pupil Master had made up his mind. He waved his hand, and a silver armor that gave off the aura of a top-tier True Treasure flew toward Elder Dark Bone.","Elder Dark Bone reached out and took it. After sensing it with his consciousness, he nodded slightly. “As expected of a Ruler. He has an extraordinary family background. He’s very generous.”","“Dark Bone, I’ve given you the top-tier True Treasure armor. Now, can you move aside?” Pupil Master asked in a low voice.","“No rush.” Elder Dark Bone still shook his head.","“Dark Bone!” Pupil Master was furious.","“Haha, don’t be so angry yet.” Elder Dark Bone smiled. “Since you’ve already given me the top-tier True Treasure armor, then I’ll keep my promise and stay out of this matter. I’m not in a hurry to leave. I just want to ask you, Pupil Master. You don’t care about your identity, and you even gave me a top-tier True Treasure armor to kill Master Guchi. Is it really for the top-tier domain type True Treasure in Master Guchi’s hands?”","“Humph,” said Pupil Master, “a top-tier domain type True Treasure armor isn’t worth it. However, the array that Master Guchi used to block me is quite special. I’m interested in it.”.","“Oh, is that all?” Dark Bone looked at Pupil Master strangely.","“What do you think?” Pupil Master tried to suppress the anger in his heart.","Elder Dark Bone raised his eyebrows and did not think any further.","Actually, there was not much to think about. Pupil Master was famous in this Star Field for not caring about his status. It was normal for him to set his eyes on Master Guchi and want the treasures in Master Guchi’s hands. It was not suspicious at all.","“If that’s the case, then this old man will step aside now. You can do whatever you want from now on. Although this old man will step aside, if you still can’t kill Master Guchi later, then you can’t blame this old man.” Elder Dark Bone said playfully.","“Hmph, as long as you’re not in the way, if this seat wants to kill Master Guchi, then no one can stop it.” Pupil Master snorted.","“Is that so? That might not be the case.”","Elder Dark Bone grinned. His soul power had already sensed the arrival of a person.","Master Guchi, who was behind Elder Dark Bone, had also received the message. His face also revealed a trace of joy.","In the void not far away, a figure had appeared and was rushing toward the void at the fastest speed.","Elder Dark Bone had just stepped aside, and before Pupil Master could continue to attack Master Guchi, the figure had already arrived at the center of the void and stood beside Master Guchi.","“Master Guchi, are you okay?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I’m fine. Fortunately, master nether bone acted in time and stopped Pupil Master for a while. Otherwise, I would have died and would not have waited for you to arrive, Blood Sword Master,” Master Guchi said.","Jian Wushuang glanced around and saw Elder Dark Bone. He immediately smiled and said, “Thank you, Elder Dark Bone.”","“Don’t mention it. I just wanted to get a top-tier Supreme Treasure armor, not because of you or the people from your Star Palace,” Elder Dark Bone said with a smile.","When the people around saw Jian Wushuang’s arrival, they became excited again."]},{"number":3728,"title":"Chapter 3728 - Overbearing","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword Master is the Blood Sword Master of Star Palace!”","“Blood Sword Master is the most powerful Principles Master in our Star Field. I’ve heard that he also roams the Third Continent. Now it seems that he must have received a request from Master Guchi to come here.”","“Blood Sword Master is here. This is going to be a good show. However, can Blood Sword Master deal with Pupil Master with his strength alone?”","“It’s hard to say. Although Blood Sword Master is very strong and invincible among Principles Masters, he doesn’t have the endless means like Elder Dark Bone. I think it’s very difficult for him to face a Ruler head-on.”","Many Principles Masters who were watching the battle discussed among themselves.","Their impression of Jian Wushuang remained the same as more than 10,000 years ago, when he defeated five Principles Masters head-on in Devil Smoke Valley.","In that battle, although Jian Wushuang showed his invincible strength as a Principles Master, he was still on a different level compared to a Ruler.","Therefore, most people were full of doubts about whether Jian Wushuang could deal with Pupil Master.","“Elder Dark Bone, let’s catch up later. Let me get rid of Pupil Master first,” Jian Wushuang said with a bright smile.","“Okay, but Pupil Master is not weak. You have to be careful,” Elder Dark Bone said with a faint smile.","However, Jian Wushuang looked extremely relaxed.","As for the Pupil Master, when he saw Jian Wushuang, he was stunned for some reason.","Yes, he was stunned.","He was not surprised by Jian Wushuang’s sudden arrival, but because of the special treasure on his body.","For some reason, when Jian Wushuang arrived and appeared in the void in front of him, the special treasure on his body went completely crazy.","It was an unprecedented excitement and desire.","It was like a wolf that had been hungry for 10 days and 10 nights suddenly seeing a sheep.","The treasure on his body was so hot and crazy at this moment.","“What’s going on?”","“What on earth is on Blood Sword Master’s body that makes my treasure so excited and crazy?!”","“It’s crazy. I’ve never seen it so excited and eager since I got it.”","Pupil Master’s eyes instantly became extremely hot.","However, he quickly covered up the heat.","In the Void, Elder Dark Bone had moved to the side, leaving only Jian Wushuang, Master Guchi, and Pupil Master standing there.","Jian Wushuang and Master Guchi naturally stood together.","“Blood Sword Master, this Pupil Master is indeed very powerful. He is definitely one of the strongest among the primary Rulers. He has broken my strongest trump card, the fire-purging formation. I won’t be able to use it again in a short time. With his speed, it will be difficult for us to escape from him.”","“So, I’m afraid you and I have to work together to find a way to deal with him,” Master Guchi said.","Without the fire-cleansing formation, Master Guchi would not be able to deal with Pupil Master.","However, he knew that Blood Sword Master was very strong, so there was still a chance for them to survive if they worked together.","However, after hearing his words, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “Master Guchi, you can leave. Leave Pupil Master to me.”","“Leave him to you alone?” Master Guchi was stunned.","“I’m enough.” Jian Wushuang was very confident. “Leave him alone.”","Master Guchi’s eyes narrowed slightly. He glanced at Jian Wushuang and did not think much about it. Instead, he rushed toward the void behind him.","Seeing this, Pupil Master had no intention of stopping him.","After Jian Wushuang came to this void, Pupil Master only had Jian Wushuang in his eyes. He did not care about Master Guchi anymore.","Even if Master Guchi turned around and ran away, he would not chase after him anymore.","For him, Jian Wushuang was now his first target.","“Blood Sword Master, the most powerful Principles Master in this Star Field.” Pupil Master grinned. He glanced at Master Guchi behind him, and the smile on his face grew wider. “It seems that you plan to deal with me alone. Humph, you’re really arrogant.”","“Arrogant?”","Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly, but there was a trace of excitement in his heart.","It was not his fault that he was excited. After all, since he broke through to the Principles Master level and his strength soared, he had never really fought a fair fight with a Ruler-level expert.","Although he had fought with the Heaven Roc Ruler, fought with the Heaven Ancestor, and even killed three Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm.","However, he had only passively blocked three attacks from the Heaven Roc Ruler.","The Heaven Ancestor had only sparred with him so that he had a basic understanding of his strength.","As for the three Rulers killed in the Divine Beginning Realm, they were restricted by the Heavenly Dao and could not display their strength.","Therefore, he had never fought with a Ruler who could unleash his full strength.","Until now, Pupil Master was standing in front of him...","“Pupil Master, in this Star Field, he is a primary Ruler who stands at the top.” Information about Pupil Master flashed in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Pupil Master was not only powerful, but he also had many treasures.","It was said that not only did he have a Supreme True Treasure magic weapon, but he also had a Supreme True Treasure armor!","Moreover, his life-saving ability was not weak. Even if he encountered an advanced Ruler, he would not be afraid.","Such a powerful Ruler was a suitable opponent for Jian Wushuang.","“This is the first time I have fought a Ruler-level expert in the Universe Battlefield, and there are so many people watching...I’ll use Pupil Master to show my power in this battle.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light, and he immediately shouted, “Pupil Master, hand over the three Supreme Treasures, and we’ll forget about today’s matter. Otherwise, my blood sword and the Rulers of Star Palace will chase you to the ends of the Earth!”","This shout, which contained a magnificent power, suddenly exploded in the world.","The void became quiet.","Silence!","Everyone was silent. They stared at Jian Wushuang with wide eyes.","They had just said that Blood Sword Master and Master Guchi would join hands to stop Pupil Master.","But who would have thought that Blood Sword Master would demand Pupil Master to hand over three Supreme True Treasures?","He must not have figured out the situation on the battlefield yet, right?","Even Master Guchi was at a loss at this moment.","“Kid, how dare you!”","Pupil Master was so angry that he started to laugh, and his entire face was contorted.","He did not say any more nonsense, and he immediately made his move."]},{"number":3729,"title":"Chapter 3729 - Battle Pupil Master","paragraphs":["Rumble!","The mighty divine power of a Ruler formed a huge prison, pressing down on Jian Wushuang from all directions.","The divine power was like a prison!","The divine power of a Ruler was countless times stronger than that of a Principles Master.","Under normal circumstances, a Principles Master would not be able to withstand the divine power of a Ruler.","Under the pressure of the majestic divine might, Pupil Master took a step forward and instantly crossed the Void to arrive in front of Jian Wushuang. The red long staff in his hand brought with it an earth-shaking destructive aura as it smashed down angrily, the terrifying power contained in it caused spatial ripples to appear in the void of the Red Cloud World.","These spatial ripples intersected and spread wildly in all directions.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang drew his sword.","An extremely cold and terrifying sword essence instantly swept through the heaven and earth.","The vast void fell into a freezing cold because the divine sword was unsheathed.","The coldness was like a knife. Even though they were far away, it still scraped the faces of the Principles Masters present.","“That sword!”","The eyes of everyone watching the battle instantly focused on the black divine sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand that exuded a cold and terrifying aura.","It was the Netherworld Sword!","“The strongest Universe Supreme Treasure!”","“This Blood Sword Master has a Supreme Treasure!”","There was an uproar in the surrounding void.","Even among Rulers, many did not have Supreme Treasures.","However, Jian Wushuang, a Principles Master, had a Supreme Treasure in his hand. No one had expected that.","Even Pupil Master was extremely surprised when he saw the divine sword that Jian Wushuang took out.","Although he was surprised, Pupil Master still did not put Jian Wushuang in his eyes.","“Humph, so what if you have the most powerful Universe Supreme Treasure? You’re still just an ant.” Pupil Master’s eyes flashed with a fierce light. The red long staff that he threw out trembled slightly, and its power instantly increased dramatically.","“I won’t rest until I die!”","Jian Wushuang directly threw out his sword. A sword light filled with endless hatred and hatred instantly went toward the red long staff.","This sword light not only contained terrifying power, but it also contained a trace of sword principle universe origin, which instantly raised the power of sword arts to a whole new level.","Clang!","When the two collided head-on, an electric arc flashed and then disappeared.","“What?”","Pupil Master was shocked.","From the sword light that Jian Wushuang displayed, he could feel an extremely strong power that was not weaker than his.","Whoosh!","Pupil Master immediately retreated, and Jian Wushuang also retreated.","“Humph!”","After he stabilized himself, Pupil Master’s eyes turned cold again. He held the long staff in both hands, and his destructive aura burst out. The blood cloud around him also rose to the maximum.","His aura was much stronger than before. His body swayed, and he charged toward Jian Wushuang again.","“Jian Ruhong!”","Jian Wushuang held the sword in one hand and pointed it at Pupil Master. He did not intend to retreat at all. He faced the attack head-on.","Clang! Clang! Bang!","Heavy clashing sounds could be heard, and the sound of power colliding kept ringing out.","In the center of the battlefield, two figures were frantically clashing, and terrifying power was wildly spreading out in all directions.","The fierce battle between the two was clearly at a white-hot stage.","The surrounding Principles Masters who were watching the battle had long since been stunned.","“A battle between Rulers! This is a battle between Rulers!”","“That Blood Sword Master is actually going to face a Ruler head-on?”","“How is this possible?”","Exclamations sounded in the surrounding void.","Unlike Elder Dark Bone, who relied on special methods to fight against each other, Jian Wushuang was fighting against Pupil Master head-on.","A Principles Master was fighting against a Ruler and a very strong Ruler. How could they be evenly matched?","“Ruler battle power!”","“This Blood Sword Master already has Ruler battle power!”","Everyone immediately understood this point.","To be able to fight head-on with an extremely powerful Ruler to such an extent, his strength must be at the Ruler level.","Hong!","Another intense explosion sounded, and the two figures in the void finally separated.","“Blood Sword Master, I have underestimated you. I didn’t expect that a mere Principles Master like you would actually possess the battle prowess of a Ruler?” Pupil Master’s eyes were already filled with blood threads, and there was a faint madness in them.","“But even so, you don’t have the right to act so arrogantly in front of me!”","“Die!”","Pupil Master’s killing intent soared to the skies.","At the moment he moved, the large blood cloud around him condensed crazily, and in the blink of an eye, it turned into a towering Three-Headed Demon God.","The Three-Headed Demon God also held a red long staff in his hand, and as Pupil Master moved, he launched a powerful attack.","It was the same staff skill, but when the Three-Headed Demon God condensed it, its power was at least twice as strong as before!","“Is this your real strength?” Jian Wushuang curled his lips slightly, not surprised at all.","Pupil Master was able to make such a name for himself in this Star Field, so his strength was certainly not just that.","“Unfortunately, this strength is not enough!”","Jian Wushuang focused his eyes and immediately used his life divine power and Heaven-cleaving skill.","When these two secret skills were used at the same time, the power of Jian Wushuang’s divine power instantly increased by three times!","The divine power of three times the power of a primary Ruler had barely reached the threshold of an Advanced Ruler.","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all. He relied on his secret skills to greatly increase his strength and once again fought against his opponent.","The two once again engaged in a frenzied battle. Jian Wushuang fully displayed his understanding of the universe origin of sword principle. Each of his sword moves contained the universe origin of sword principle. His swordsmanship was extremely profound and powerful.","Although Pupil Master’s staff skill was also powerful, he did not comprehend the universe origin and was obviously inferior to Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship in the occult.","As for the power, although he had used a secret skill and his power had greatly increased, he was at most on par with Jian Wushuang.","The power was equal, but Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship had a great advantage. Therefore, Pupil Master was actually at a disadvantage in this fight.","“How could this be?”","Pupil Master, who was madly fighting with Jian Wushuang, was shocked and in disbelief.","“I’ve already used my strongest strength, but I still can’t take him down. I’m even...at a disadvantage?”","“How is this possible?”","“How could a mere Principles Master be so strong?”","Pupil Master was completely shocked by Jian Wushuang’s strength.","He was not the only one. The Principles Masters watching the battle were also stunned.","..."]},{"number":3730,"title":"Chapter 3730 - Vomiting Blood","paragraphs":["No one had expected that Blood Sword Master, who was only a Principles Master, would not only be able to fight Pupil Master head-on, but he would also be able to gain the upper hand even if Pupil Master unleashed his full strength!","Blood Sword Master could no longer have the battle strength of a Ruler, but his battle strength had already surpassed most of the primary Rulers, including Pupil Master, who was a top existence among the primary Rulers, in terms of battle strength, he was clearly inferior to Blood Sword Master.","“Pupil Master, is this your strongest strength?” Jian Wushuang stared at Pupil Master with a cold gaze. “Humph, how dare you bully my Star Palace with such strength?”","“Hand over three Pinnacle True Treasures honestly, or I’ll teach you a lesson today.”","“How dare you!” Pupil Master was extremely shocked and angry.","However, no matter how shocked and angry he was, the strength Jian Wushuang displayed was indeed slightly stronger than his.","Suddenly, Pupil Master flashed a sharp light, he snorted and said, “Boy, I admit that I underestimated you and your Star Palace. I didn’t expect a monster like you to appear in the Star Palace. You’re just a Principles Master, but your battle strength is stronger than that of an ordinary Ruler!","“However, you want me to lower my head and hand over three Pinnacle True Treasures? Dream on!","“So what if you are slightly stronger than me? What can you do to me?”","Pupil Master was fearless.","He admitted that Jian Wushuang was slightly stronger than him.","However, he was only slightly stronger. He could not even suppress him, so how could he be afraid?","“You won’t lower your head, right? Then I’ll beat you until you lower your head.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold. He took a step forward, and a terrifying power suddenly condensed on the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand.","Whoosh!","He slashed out, and the void turned into chaos.","There was no sound of explosion or air explosion. At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s sword did not seem to have any terrifying power.","However...when the divine sword fell, a cold sword light mercilessly cut through space, mercilessly tearing apart everything in front of it, and mercilessly slashing toward Pupil Master.","Sword skill, fall to the Netherworld!","With one sword move, it was the blue fall to the Netherworld!","This sword move was the astonishing sword skill that had forcefully broken through the sword skill system of Di Shisan when they were fighting.","Not only was this swordsmanship extremely powerful, but it also contained a trace of the aura of the universe’s principles!","The aura of the universe’s principles was very weak at first, but after Jian Wushuang had comprehended it under the Heaven Suppression Tablet for 5,000 years, he performed it again, the aura of the universe’s principles contained in the swordsmanship was obviously much stronger than before.","The power of the swordsmanship was also much stronger than before.","The swordsmanship alone contained more universe origin of sword principle.","The level of the swordsmanship could no longer be measured by the level of the absolute art, but it was undoubtedly Jian Wushuang’s strongest move.","The strongest move was directed at Pupil Master. At the same time, Jian Wushuang used the power of the will given by the universe principles!","After all, the power of the will given by the universal principles was unique.","It could double the basic power of Jian Wushuang’s full strength!","In other words, when Jian Wushuang used the life divine power and the heaven-cleaving skill, the power of his divine power was three times that of a primary Ruler. Now, when he used the power of the will, it was six times that of a primary Ruler.","Six times, how amazing was that?","Boom!","The shocking sword light tore everything apart mercilessly.","Pupil Master seemed to have sensed the extraordinary power of Jian Wushuang’s sword. He focused his eyes and held the red long staff with both hands. The Three-Headed Demon God behind him let out a shrill roar, then the long staff suddenly enlarged and smashed straight out.","In the blink of an eye, it collided with the sword light.","Clang!","A metallic sound rang out. The moment the red long staff made contact with the sword light, it immediately changed the direction of the shocking power contained in the sword light. The Pupil Master’s entire body was unsteady, the merciless sword light continued to slash at the Pupil Master.","In the end, it slashed at Pupil Master’s divine body without any obstruction.","Pu!","A large mouthful of fresh blood violently spurted out of Pupil Master’s mouth. This fresh blood dyed the armor on his body red.","Pupil Master’s face turned a few shades paler, and his figure was in an incomparably miserable state as he retreated explosively.","This scene caused the surrounding Principles Masters watching the battle to be flabbergasted!","“He spat out blood?”","“A dignified Pupil Master fought head-on with this Blood Sword Master, and in the end, he was smashed by Blood Sword Master’s sword until he spat out blood?”","“He didn’t succeed in his sneak attack, but in a head-on fight, he defeated Pupil Master’s attack and smashed Pupil Master until he spat out blood.”","The many Principles Masters present could not believe what they were seeing.","There was nothing they could do. The scene before their eyes was simply too unbelievable.","The difference between a Ruler and a Principles Master was simply too great. Anyone below a Ruler was an ant, and this was something that was publicly acknowledged.","However, the scene before their eyes completely broke common sense.","A Principles Master was comparable to a Ruler and could even defeat a Ruler!","Did they not see that Pupil Master had been beaten until he vomited blood by Blood Sword Master?","At this moment, Pupil Master was also stunned.","“How could he be so powerful?”","Pupil Master stared at Jian Wushuang with a horrified expression.","Others did not know his strength and trump card, but he knew it very well.","After using a secret skill and three demon gods appeared around him, his strength could even fight with an Advanced Ruler in a short time.","With such strength, he was completely crushed by his opponent with his strongest strike.","Even when his opponent destroyed his attack, he was also smashed to the point that he vomited blood?","Although it was not a big deal for a Ruler to spit out two mouthfuls, and the consumption of divine power was not too great, it meant that the residual power of Jian Wushuang’s sword had hurt him.","“He defeated my attack, but the power of his sword can still hurt me?” Pupil Master’s heart was in turmoil.","After all, he was wearing the Supreme True Treasure Armor.","With the protection of the Supreme True Treasure Armor, he was still injured by the residual power of Jian Wushuang’s sword. What did this mean?","It meant that the power of Jian Wushuang’s sword was incredible.","“Only the top few Advanced Rulers could perform such a powerful attack. Blood Sword Master’s battle strength is much stronger than ordinary Advanced Rulers!”","Pupil Master’s heart finally began to tremble.","..."]},{"number":3731,"title":"Chapter 3731 - Was Completely Suppressed","paragraphs":["Pupil Master had roamed the three battlefields for many years. He had faced many Advanced Rulers.","However, with his strength and his Supreme True Treasure Armor, those Advanced Rulers could not do anything to him. It would be as difficult as ascending to heaven to hurt him.","However, Jian Wushuang’s sword attack had made Pupil Master understand that Jian Wushuang’s strongest battle strength was definitely stronger than most senior Rulers. Only the top few senior Rulers could unleash such power, only then could he defeat his attack and hurt him through the Supreme Treasure Armor.","Such strength was enough to make Pupil Master feel fear.","Unlike Pupil Master and everyone else who were shocked, Jian Wushuang frowned slightly when he saw Pupil Master spit out blood.","He did not expect that he would only barely make Pupil Master spit out blood after displaying his strongest move. He did not expend much of his divine power.","“The Supreme True Treasure Armor is indeed incomparable to ordinary Pinnacle True Treasure Armor,” Jian Wushuang thought.","He knew that if Pupil Master did not have Supreme Treasure Armor and only had Supreme Treasure Armor, his sword attack with the Netherworld Divine Sword would have severely injured him, at least 10 to 20 percent of his divine power would have been consumed, but the divine power consumed by Pupil Master was negligible.","“With the protection of Supreme Treasure Armor, I can’t kill him alone.” Jian Wushuang understood this, but then he snorted and said, “Even if I can’t kill him, I have to teach him a lesson!”","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold, and he attacked again with shocking power.","Jian Wushuang hated Pupil Master a little.","As a Ruler, he did not care about his identity and attacked the Principles Master without any reason.","Such a person who did not care about his own reputation was despised.","Moreover, it was not the first time that Pupil Master had provoked Star Palace. Jian Wushuang had read that during his time in the three battlefields, Pupil Master had attacked experts from Star Palace several times, he had even made Star Palace suffer a setback and paid a great price.","However, because Pupil Master was strong and had the protection of the Supreme True Treasure Armor, Star Palace had been unable to do anything to him. They could only be angry but did not dare to say anything. Unexpectedly, Pupil Master had become even worse. This time in the Red Cloud World, he also targeted Master Guchi, almost causing Star Palace to lose one of its two experts at the pinnacle of the six realm.","After repeatedly bullying Star Palace, Jian Wushuang now had the ability to teach Pupil Master a deep lesson.","Even if he could not kill him, he had to at least let Pupil Master remember this lesson. In the Red Cloud World, including when he was adventuring on the three battlefields, he would have some scruples when he encountered experts from Star Palace, he did not dare to kill them recklessly.","Jian Wushuang unleashed his full strength.","Although he had fought Pupil Master before, he had never used the power of the will given by the universe principles, nor had he used his swordsmanship at full strength.","But now, Jian Wushuang’s full strength could only be described as valiant or terrifying.","His divine power was shockingly powerful.","His swordsmanship was even more mysterious. Each of his sword contained an extremely rich sword principle universe origin.","Although Pupil Master also used his full strength, he was completely crushed by Jian Wushuang in a fight.","It was one-sided!","Anyone with a discerning eye could see that Pupil Master was no match for Jian Wushuang.","“He’s too strong. His combat strength is too strong!”","“His divine power is definitely at the Advanced Ruler level. He’s stronger than ordinary Advanced Rulers, so he’s naturally much stronger than me.”","“His swordsmanship is even more terrifying. His understanding of sword principle is much higher than all the sword principle experts I’ve met. Sword principle origin. Yes, he has already stepped into the sword principle universe origin, and every move he makes contains a rich sword principle universe origin. His swordsmanship is not only extremely powerful, but also extremely profound. It’s not something I can compare to.”","The power of the divine power was comparable to that of a superior Ruler, and in his opinion, even a superior Ruler might not be as good as Jian Wushuang’s understanding of sword principle. This resulted in Jian Wushuang’s terrifying strength, he was definitely the best among the superior Rulers.","Pupil Master was completely unable to contend with him.","“It’s better to leave first.”","After a short exchange of blows, Pupil Master was completely shocked by Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Naturally, he had no intention to continue fighting with Jian Wushuang.","Although Jian Wushuang had something that made him extremely desperate for a special treasure, with his current strength, it was definitely not something he could get.","He could only leave first and then think of other ways.","Pupil Master wanted to leave, but Jian Wushuang did not intend to let him leave.","“Magic Sand Domain!”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and instantly, endless black sand rolled up crazily. In the blink of an eye, it formed a huge black sand sea that covered the entire heaven and earth void.","Pupil Master’s figure was also covered by the black sand sea.","“A Domain Type True Treasure? Judging from its aura, it’s a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure!” Pupil Master was shocked.","Domain Type True Treasures were extremely precious among the many True Treasures of the same level.","As for a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure, its value was not much lower than a Supreme True Treasure.","Although he was a Ruler, and for some special reasons, he had accumulated two Supreme True Treasures over a long period of time. One was an attack type True Treasure, and the other was a Supreme True Treasure Armor. However, a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure...he did not have one.","However, he did not expect that Jian Wushuang, a Principles Master, not only had a supreme offensive weapon, but he also had a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure?","What Pupil Master did not know was that although Jian Wushuang was a Principles Master, he had killed three Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm. The three Rulers were all from the second-level Star World, Devil Cloud Star. They were all extraordinary, Jian Wushuang had obtained this Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure from one of the Rulers. It was a ring called the Devil Sand Ring.","Jian Wushuang had long recognized the Devil Sand Ring as his master. Now, when he used it, it instantly formed a huge devil sand ocean that suppressed everything.","When Pupil Master was trapped in the devil sand ocean, he was immediately suppressed. His speed was greatly reduced, and his overall strength was greatly suppressed.","“Blood Sword Master, I’m leaving. Don’t go too far!” Pupil Master could feel the suppression of the surrounding sea of devil sand, and he could not help being shocked and angry.","“Go too far?” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. “I’ve already said that if you don’t hand over three Pinnacle True Treasures to make amends, you won’t be able to leave so easily!”","..."]},{"number":3732,"title":"Chapter 3732 - Escaped?","paragraphs":["“Kill!”","Relying on the suppression of the Magic Sand Realm, Jian Wushuang came to the front of the Pupil Master again. The fierce sword light continued to crush the Pupil Master with an unstoppable momentum.","The Pupil Master could only barely resist, but it became more and more difficult.","Under the suppression of the Magic Sand Realm, it was obviously impossible for him to escape from Jian Wushuang by normal means.","“Blood Sword Master, you win this time. I’ll remember you.”","Pupil Master gritted his teeth and shouted, and then his Qi and blood suddenly surged.","Boom! Pupil Master’s divine body was bulging, but the divine power aura emitted from his body was obviously weakened.","Swish!","A burst of blood light burst out, leaving a trail of blood shadows in the void. The Pupil Master rushed out of the area of the magic sand domain and soon disappeared from Jian Wushuang’s sight.","“Did he escape?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, but he was not surprised.","He knew very well that it was impossible for him to kill the Pupil Master alone since his strength had reached the level of the Pupil Master. The Pupil Master had been acting recklessly in this Star Field for so many years and had offended countless experts, however, he was still alive and well, so he naturally had a life-saving trump card.","It was obvious that Pupil Master had used a life-saving secret skill and left this time.","“It’s not bad to be able to force him to use a life-saving secret skill,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The many Principles Masters watching the battle around them sighed when they saw Pupil Master turn into a bloody light and leave.","“He escaped. Pupil Master actually used a life-saving secret technique to escape?”","“Tsk tsk, a mighty Ruler, and an extremely powerful Ruler at that. But today, he’s facing a Principles Master, yet he can only use a life-saving secret technique to escape? Isn’t this a little too laughable?”","“Indeed. In this battle, Pupil Master has indeed lost a lot of face. As for Blood Sword Master, with his realm as a Principles Master, he directly suppressed Pupil Master and forced him to use a life-saving secret technique to escape. This battle record is enough to look down on this Star Field.”","“From today on, Blood Sword Master’s reputation will reach a new peak.”","Many Principles Masters around the battlefield were staring at Jian Wushuang.","There was not only shock and awe in their eyes, but also a hint of admiration.","They were Principles Masters. They were usually respectful when they saw the Ruler, but Blood Sword Master was able to defeat him and force him to use his life-saving secret skill to escape. How could they not admire him?","In the center of the battlefield, Jian Wushuang had already put the Netherworld Divine Sword back into its sheath. Elder Dark Bone and Master Guchi had also walked toward him.","“Haha, Heavenly Sword Marquis, you really surprised me today.” Elder Dark Bone had a bright smile on his face, and his small eyes were slightly narrowed with a strange look, “Although I’m also a Principles Master, I can only rely on some special means to protect myself when facing a Ruler, but you can kill a Ruler and force him to use a life-saving secret skill to escape.”","“Tsk tsk, amazing, amazing!”","Even Elder Dark Bone could not help but praise him.","“Elder Dark Bone is too polite. In fact, I’m not much stronger than Pupil Master. He also has the protection of the Supreme True Treasure Armor. Even if he doesn’t escape and continues to fight with me, I won’t be able to kill him,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“That’s true, but you’re still very impressive,” Elder Dark Bone said.","“Yes, for a Principles Master to be able to do this, I’m afraid you’re the First Blood Sword Master in the history of this Star Field,” Master Guchi could not help but say.","“The first person in history?” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Others might not know, but he knew very well.","When his Master Xuan Yi was a Principles Master, his battle strength was comparable to that of a superior Ruler with the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","His current battle strength was considered relatively strong among Advanced Rulers, but it was still inferior to that of a superior Ruler.","“Elder Dark Bone, thank you for your help this time. If you hadn’t stopped Pupil Master in time, I’m afraid that Master Guchi would have died at Pupil Master’s hands. By the time I arrived, Pupil Master would have already gotten the treasure and left,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Haha, it’s nothing. Besides, I also got a top-tier Supreme Treasure Armor from Pupil Master. It’s a great reward,” Elder Dark Bone said with a casual smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","Jian Wushuang knew a little about Elder Dark Bone. Although he was not from Star Palace, he came from the Divine Beginning Realm.","Moreover, he also knew the ultimate secret of the Divine Beginning Realm. Therefore, Elder Dark Bone was on the same side as Star Palace and Jian Wushuang.","Because of this, Elder Dark Bone had helped him several times in the Divine Beginning Realm.","This time in the Red Cloud World, when Elder Dark Bone saw that Master Guchi of Star Palace was threatened, he directly helped him.","“By the way, Elder Dark Bone, are you wandering alone in the Red Cloud World? Where is Life Fall King?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Life Fall King was the Ruler Jian Wushuang had met in the Divine Beginning Realm. He was Elder Dark Bone’s good friend and had met Jian Wushuang once.","“Life fall also came to the Red Cloud World, but you know that there are seven continents in the Red Cloud World. Although I entered the Red Cloud World at the same time with him, we have already separated. He is now wandering on the First Continent, and I am on the Third Continent,” Elder Dark Bone said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you think that Pupil Master’s behavior is a bit strange?” Elder Dark Bone suddenly asked.","“Strange?” Jian Wushuang frowned, he said subconsciously, “Pupil Master is famous for being shameless and unreasonable in this Star Field. He only cares about profit. When he saw that Master Guchi had obtained a top-tier Domain Type True Treasure, he became greedy and directly seized it. It doesn’t seem wrong.”","Pupil Master had been in the three battlefields for many years, and there had been many cases where he had attacked Principles Master because of a treasure. It seemed normal for him to attack Master Guchi this time.","“I just thought that he was too straightforward when he gave me that top-tier True Treasure armor,” Elder Dark Bone said, “but maybe it was because he took a fancy to Master Guchi’s purifying fire array that he gave me a top-tier True Treasure armor so readily.” He did not continue to dwell on this issue.","“Heavenly Marquis Sword, I’ll take my leave now that things are settled.”","Elder Dark Bone quickly bade Jian Wushuang farewell and left.","..."]},{"number":3733,"title":"Chapter 3733 - Was Sensational","paragraphs":["After Elder Dark Bone left, only Jian Wushuang and Master Guchi remained in the void of the battlefield.","“Guchi, thank you for saving my life, Master Blood Sword!” Master Guchi said gratefully.","“You’re the Principles Master of Star Palace, so it’s my duty to save you.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “But Master Guchi, I’m not too far away from you this time, and Elder Dark Bone helped you along the way. That’s why you were able to hold on until I arrived. But if I encounter such a crisis again, I might not be able to make it.”","“So you must be careful in the Red Cloud World from now on. After all, there are many Rulers here. Although you have the battle strength of the Ultimate Six Realms and the protection of the fire-cleansing formation, a Ruler-level expert can still kill you with his full strength. If you die, Star Palace will lose one less expert of the ultimate six realms. This loss is no small matter.”","“I understand.” Master Guchi nodded heavily.","He was indeed a little too confident in the beginning. To be exact, he had underestimated a Ruler.","He thought that with the protection of the net fire array, even a Ruler-level great being might not be able to kill him. That was why when Pupil Master had rushed over and asked him to hand over that top-tier Domain Type True Treasure, he had been selfish, he did not want to hand it over.","But in the end, he almost died.","If he had handed over the supreme Domain Type True Treasure honestly from the beginning, there might not have been anything that would have happened.","Of course, this was also because they did not know Pupil Master’s true intentions.","“In short, it’s best to be careful. A True Treasure is important, but your life is much more valuable than a True Treasure,” Jian Wushuang reminded before leaving.","After Jian Wushuang left, the numerous Principles Masters who had been surrounding the battlefield also left.","After they left, the Principles Masters immediately reported the battle they had just witnessed to their respective forces, the astral world, or their good friends.","The news spread like wildfire. It did not take long for the experts in the Star Field to learn about the shocking battle.","For a moment, countless great beings in this Star Field were shocked.","There was nothing they could do. This battle was too shocking.","It could even be said that it was unbelievable.","Who was the Pupil Master?","He was a supreme being who had dominated this Star Field and made many great beings from various powers suffer losses. He could be said to have been dominating this Star Field.","His power could not be said to be too powerful among Rulers. After all, he could not be said to be a true senior Ruler. However, the key point was that he had many True Treasures and many means.","He had a Supreme True Treasure that could attack godly weapons, and he had a Supreme True Treasure Armor that could protect his body. That alone was enough to make senior Rulers unable to do anything to him.","There had been more than one senior Ruler who had attacked him not to kill him, but just to teach him a lesson. However, those senior Rulers could not do it.","Even senior Rulers could not hurt him.","Only a superior Ruler was qualified to make Pupil Master bow his head, but he could only bow his head.","If a superior Ruler had come to kill him personally, he might not have been able to kill him.","However, this time, such an exceptional figure had suffered a great setback.","He had fallen at the hands of Jian Wushuang, a mere Principles Master!","The dignified Pupil Master had been completely crushed by Jian Wushuang in a head-on fight. Jian Wushuang had even defeated Pupil Master’s attack with a single sword strike, causing him to vomit blood at the same time.","In the end, Pupil Master was forced to use his life-saving secret skill and escape in a sorry state.","What kind of strength was this?","“Advanced Ruler, Blood Sword Master has the battle strength of an Advanced Ruler at least!”","“Advanced Ruler is for sure. It seems that his battle strength is very strong even among Advanced Rulers, and he is one of the top ones. Only in this way can he make Pupil Master, who has the Supreme True Treasure Armor, vomit blood in a head-on fight.”","“What is going on with this Blood Sword Master? Isn’t he a Principles Master? How can he be so powerful?”","“He is indeed only at the level of a Principles Master. There is no doubt about that. As for why his combat power is so powerful, we do not know. However, if nothing goes wrong, it may be related to the special opportunity he had in the life and death region.”","“Right. This Blood Sword Master was not very famous at first, and he was not very strong among the Principles Masters. However, because he had stayed in the Life and Death Realm for nearly 100,000 years, after he came out, he defeated five ultimate experts of the six states by himself and became the strongest among the Principles Masters in this star area. However, only 10,000 years have passed, and his combat strength is already comparable to that of a senior Ruler. There is no doubt that he must have obtained an incredible opportunity in the Life and Death Realm.”","“The question is, what did he gain in the Life and Death Realm?”","“Who knows? In short, after this battle, we can no longer treat Blood Sword Master as a Principles Master. We must treat him as a Ruler, or even an Advanced Ruler.”","Countless experts in the Star Field were shocked by Jian Wushuang’s astonishing strength.","Countless experts were shocked by Jian Wushuang’s battle record.","Countless experts were discussing this matter crazily, discussing Jian Wushuang.","The name Blood Sword Master had once again shocked the entire Star Field after more than 10,000 years.","The difference was that his battle record this time was far more brilliant than the last time, so the shock he caused was naturally greater.","...","Within the Red Cloud World.","“Haha, Heavenly Marquis Sword, congratulations. This time, you have truly made a name for yourself in this Star Field.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master laughed out loud as he sent a message over.","“My young friend Heavenly Marquis has long made a name for himself in this Star Field. However, the commotion he caused this time was even greater and the commotion was even greater. A Ruler of Principles actually killed that eye lord and forced him to flee with his head in his hands. By now, all the Rulers in this Star Field probably already know of your existence. Furthermore, they will all remember you. In the future, they will definitely not dare to underestimate you in the slightest.”","“Well, I was a Ruler in the three battlefields, and now he has sent me a message to ask about you,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang only smiled when he received the message from the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","He knew that if he made a move, it would cause a stir in the Star Field. He had been prepared for this.","“It’s a pity. I had planned to fight for the Supreme True Treasure the next time I encountered it. This way, I might be able to gain the upper hand and catch the masters who fought with me off guard. Who knew that I would encounter a Pupil Master and expose my strength in advance?” Jian Wushuang sighed, but he did not care too much about it.","..."]},{"number":3734,"title":"Chapter 3734 - Perfection","paragraphs":["If he was exposed, so be it. It was just a loss of opportunity for him. It was not a big deal.","The only regret was that even though Pupil Master had suffered a setback this time, he had only lost some face and a top-tier True Treasure armor. This loss was nothing to Pupil Master, it was not enough to make him feel sorry for him. He probably would not be too afraid of him.","If Pupil Master did not fear him this time, it was inevitable that he would not seek revenge in the future.","Although Jian Wushuang did not care about Pupil Master’s Revenge, Star Palace did.","He shook his head and did not think much about it.","“My young friend, are you still planning to meditate in front of the Sword Stone?” Temporal Temple Master suddenly asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “The Sword Stone contains extremely exquisite swordsmanship, but I’m very helpful.”","“In that case, continue to meditate. If there is a Supreme Treasure in the Red Cloud World, we will inform you,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay,” Jian Wushuang replied.","It did not take long for Jian Wushuang to return to the front of the Sword Stone.","Because he had left, the position that was closest to the Sword Stone had been occupied by someone else. However, Jian Wushuang’s strength was there. As soon as he showed up, the person immediately stepped aside, Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged in front of the Sword Stone and continued to meditate on the fourth sword skill.","In a flash, 3,000 years had passed.","During these 3,000 years, there were naturally countless Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World. Even the strongest Supreme Treasure had been born three times.","However, these three Supreme Treasures were only offensive divine weapons. In the end, they were obtained by three different Rulers.","As for the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, in these 3,000 years, each of them had obtained one Supreme Treasure, but they did not obtain the strongest Supreme Treasure.","This was also due to their bad luck. Out of the three Supreme True Treasures that had been born, only one had been born on the Sixth Continent where Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was located. However, the location of the birth was extremely far away from where Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was located. However, when Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master arrived...that Supreme True Treasure had already fallen into the hands of an extremely powerful senior Ruler. Naturally, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was unable to continue fighting over it.","During the past 3,000 years, the Third Continent had been relatively calm. No Supreme True Treasure had been born. Only a Pinnacle True Treasure had been born, which had led to fierce fights, however, it had not reached the stage where a Ruler expert had to fight to the death.","As for Jian Wushuang, he had been staying in front of the Sword Stone for the past 3,000 years. He had been studying and comprehending the fourth sword skill contained in the Sword Stone, so as to perfect the move, ‘Earth Guard’.","Over the past 3,000 years of comprehension, his understanding of sword principle had reached a higher level, and he could activate more universe origin of sword principle. Most importantly, the move, Earth Guard, had reached its limit under his continuous improvement, finally, it had reached its limit.","“Almost there.”","Under the Sword Stone, Jian Wushuang’s eyes had opened again.","“Over the past 3,000 years of comprehension and countless deductions in my mind, I have already perfected the move, Earth Guard, to the limit that I can reach now. Even if the sword skill contained in the Sword Stone is still unfathomable to me, I can’t continue to improve it,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He had indeed reached the limit of the Earth Guard.","If he wanted to improve further, it would be difficult to comprehend the sword skill in the Sword Stone. He had to improve his understanding of the sword principle first. As his understanding of the sword principle became higher and higher, that move...could continue to be improved.","However, Jian Wushuang’s understanding of the sword principle was already very high and had long surpassed the level of an ordinary Ruler.","With this foundation, he could deduce the protective swordsmanship of Earth Guard to the extreme. What kind of defensive ability would this move have?","Jian Wushuang did not know, but he had a bottom line. At the very least, an ordinary elementary or even Advanced Ruler would not be able to defeat his swordsmanship.","As for whether a superior Ruler would be able to defeat him, he did not know.","“Before, although my swordsmanship was not bad, I was good at offensive swordsmanship. If I met an expert with similar strength, my swordsmanship would have an advantage. But if I met an expert whose strength was far greater than mine, my offensive swordsmanship would be useless.”","“But now...with the Earth Guard, even if I met an expert whose strength was far greater than mine, it would not be so easy for him to completely crush me.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","After more than 3,000 years of meditation under the Sword Stone, his strength did not seem to have improved much. However, in fact, after more than 3,000 years of meditation, he had perfected the Earth Guard, this made his swordsmanship much more perfect than before.","In the future, his swordsmanship could be both offensive and defensive. Whether he met someone with similar strength or an expert whose strength was far stronger than his, he could deal with them.","This kind of gain was much more difficult than his improvement in strength.","“I have to thank the person who left the words on the Sword Stone.” Jian Wushuang looked at the Sword Stone in front of him.","The four huge golden words on the Sword Stone emitted an extremely ancient and special aura. Each of the four golden words contained a profound sword skill.","Over the past 3,000 years, Jian Wushuang had only comprehended one of them, which was the body-protecting sword skill.","In fact, the other three offensive sword skills were also very impressive. Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang did not intend to continue comprehending them.","“I have comprehended under the Sword Stone for so many years, and I have already gained a lot. I should be satisfied. After all, the Red Cloud World has only opened once for 10,000 years. In the remaining time, I still have to explore the Red Cloud World,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","If he was in the outside world, he would not mind continuing to meditate under the condition that he had enough time.","However, he was in the Red Cloud World after all. There were many opportunities in the Red Cloud World, not just the Sword Stone.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang could not spend all his time meditating on the sword skill in the Sword Stone.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang stood up, took one last look at the Sword Stone, and then planned to turn around and leave.","But just as he turned around...","Buzz!","A majestic Supreme Treasure aura suddenly burst out from the surrounding void.","This Supreme Treasure aura was extremely powerful, and it swept in all directions almost in an instant.","The vast world began to tremble in an instant."]},{"number":3735,"title":"Chapter 3735 - The Strongest Flight Type","paragraphs":["The sudden burst of the True Treasure’s aura naturally attracted Jian Wushuang and the nearly 100 Principles Masters who were comprehending sword principle in front of the Sword Stone.","Immediately, the over 100 Principles Masters stood up.","Jian Wushuang also raised his head and looked at the source of the True Treasure’s aura.","It was very close to where he was. Very close!","As he released his soul power wantonly, it instantly covered an area of 100,000 miles. Less than 50,000 miles in front of him, the source of the True Treasure aura was there, Jian Wushuang saw a huge blood-colored vortex appearing in the center of the Earth. In the middle of the blood-colored vortex, a pair of pitch-black, cold wings slowly extended out.","“Wings? A Flight Type True Treasure?”","“And this aura...”","Even Jian Wushuang could not suppress the shock and joy in his heart when he felt the aura of the True Treasure emitted by the black wings and the great commotion around him.","Whoosh!","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang immediately rushed toward the location of the black wings at his fastest speed.","At the same time, the hundreds of Principles Masters who had been comprehending sword principle in front of the Sword Stone also rushed toward the black wings like wasps.","However, Jian Wushuang was much faster than the ordinary Principles Masters. Soon, he arrived at the void around the giant blood vortex.","He was also the first person to arrive here.","Standing in the void around the blood-red vortex, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were like lightning. He stared at the black wings that were slowly breaking out of the blood-red vortex, and his body trembled with excitement.","“It’s indeed the strongest Supreme Treasure!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","The strongest Universe Supreme Treasure, and it was a flight type Supreme Treasure such as wings?","Among all the universe True Treasures, due to the different functions of each type, the value of this True Treasure was naturally different.","Among them, the supreme universe True Treasure was, without a doubt, enough to cause the Rulers to go crazy for it.","And a supreme universe True Treasure armor was enough to drive the Rulers crazy and make them throw caution to the wind!","But now, the black wings that appeared in front of Jian Wushuang, which were breaking free from the blood-colored whirlpool, was clearly a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure!","Flight Type...in terms of value, it was even higher than the Supreme Treasure Armor. It was completely comparable to the most powerful Domain Type Supreme Treasure.","If such a Supreme Treasure was not born in the Red Cloud World, but in other parts of the Star Field, it would cause a stir in the entire Star Field!","“I am the first person to come to the vicinity of the black wing, but unfortunately, the wing has not been fully born yet.” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","In the Red Cloud World, it took a certain amount of time for a Supreme Treasure to be born. Jian Wushuang knew this very well.","As the most powerful flying Supreme Treasure, the black wings would be born even longer.","Although he was the first to arrive here, it would not take long for a large number of experts to arrive.","“No matter what, I must find a way to get the wings.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were burning, and he immediately took out his messaging token.","“Heaven-cleaving and Temporal, I have the strongest Flight Type Supreme Treasure. It’s around me. I’m the first to arrive at the scene,” Jian Wushuang sent a message.","“What?”","“The strongest Flight Type Supreme Treasure?”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were immediately shocked.","After the shock, there was an unprecedented ecstasy.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, this strongest Flight Type Supreme Treasure is much more precious than the strongest Supreme Treasure Armor. If you can get it, then our trip in the Red Cloud World will be worthwhile. So, you must find a way to get it,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said excitedly.","“Yes, a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure is too important. If you have one in the future, your life-saving ability will definitely be upgraded to a whole new level. Even if the original body of Devil Cloud Star Master arrives personally in the future, he might not be able to kill you.” Temporal Temple Master was also extremely excited.","“I know, but this Flight Type Supreme True Treasure is so precious. The competition for it will definitely be fierce. I don’t know if I can get my hands on it,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","It was not because he was not confident.","It was because the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure was so precious that even Rulers would lose their minds, let alone Principles Masters.","Moreover, the birth of the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure would take a long time, and it would attract more experts. Even Rulers on the Third Continent would be alarmed. In such an environment...it was not easy to get his hands on the most powerful flight-type True Treasure.","Besides, even if he was lucky enough to get his hands on the most powerful flight-type True Treasure, it would still be a problem for him to keep it.","“No matter what, you should think of a way to get your hands on the most powerful flight-type True Treasure first. I will rush to the Third Continent with Zhan Tian as fast as possible. Zhan Tian is far away from you, so it might take some time, but I can get there in half a day,” Temporal Temple Master said seriously.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily.","Jian Wushuang knew how Temporal Temple Master worked. If he was with him, it would be much easier for him to escape and save his life.","Of course, all of this was just empty talk. After all, the black wings had not been born yet, and he had not gotten his hands on them yet.","At that moment, attracted by the appearance of the black wings, more than 200 great beings had rushed to the surroundings of the blood-red whirlpool.","The main reason was that the place where the black wings had been born was too close to the Sword Stone. The appearance of the black wings had spread the news, and almost all of the 100 Principles Masters under the Sword Stone had arrived.","When they arrived, they naturally saw the level of the black wings.","“A Supreme True Treasure! This aura is definitely a Supreme True Treasure!”","“Black wings! This is a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure!”","“A Supreme True Treasure? And it’s an extremely rare Flight Type True Treasure! Oh my God!”","Around the blood-red whirlpool, the eyes of the more than 200 Principles Masters turned red.","Under those red eyes, they were filled with desire and madness.","At the same time, these Principles Masters immediately passed on this matter to the experts on the Third Continent who could arrive at the fastest speed.","For a time, the entire Third Continent, and even the entire Red Cloud World, were completely shaken.","..."]},{"number":3736,"title":"Chapter 3736 - Tyrant Axe","paragraphs":["Supreme True Treasures were precious to begin with.","Supreme Flight Type True Treasures were enough to make people go crazy.","After hearing that a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure had been born, many great beings on the Third Continent went crazy. Countless great beings, including those Rulers who were adventuring on the Third Continent, rushed over at the fastest speed, regardless of whether they were far from the place of birth or close to it, regardless of whether they were close or far away from the place of birth.","For a time, the location of the blood-red vortex became the focus of the entire Red Cloud World.","“The speed of the emergence of the black wings is too slow.”","Although Jian Wushuang was the first to arrive at the place of birth, as time passed, when two-thirds of the black wings broke free from the blood-red vortex, there were already more than 500 experts gathered around.","More than 500 people, although they were all Principles Masters, could not pose a threat to Jian Wushuang. However, the number of them could not be completely ignored by Jian Wushuang.","Moreover, the black wings still had not fully emerged. There was still an endless stream of experts arriving from all directions.","Although Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master, he was undoubtedly the focus of attention of all the Principles Masters present.","“It’s Blood Sword Master!”","“Damn it, Blood Sword Master is actually here. Now it’s going to be very difficult for us to fight for the black wings.”","“Humph, even if Blood Sword Master is as powerful as a Ruler, it won’t be so easy for him to get the black wings later.”","Many strange gazes swept over Jian Wushuang from time to time.","There were more than 500 Principles Masters present. Some were strong and some were weak. There were also a few who had reached the pinnacle of the six realm.","However, everyone knew that Jian Wushuang was the most terrifying of them all. When the black wings fully emerged, fighting over them would be the greatest threat to these Principles Masters.","“These Principles Masters are all very wary of me.” Jian Wushuang sensed the gazes around him and could not help narrowing his eyes.","He had no choice. His previous battle with Pupil Master had made him famous.","Now everyone knew that his battle strength was comparable to that of a Ruler, or even an Advanced Ruler. It was definitely not something that an ordinary Principles Master could compare to.","Since everyone present was only a Principles Master and no Ruler was present, he was naturally the most eye-catching one.","“It will take some time before the emergence of the wings. Although more experts will arrive during this time, I’m confident that I can obtain the black wings if only a Principles Master arrives and not a Ruler-level expert. I’m afraid that a Ruler will arrive.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Jian Wushuang was not worried about the number of Principles Masters unless they were like the Blood Saber Emperor, who could unleash the strength of an ordinary Ruler in a short period of time.","These Principles Masters would not be able to stop him now.","However, it would be different if a Ruler-level expert was present.","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed. “Damn it, what I’m afraid of comes true.”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked to the side. His soul power had already sensed an extremely powerful aura and was rushing over at a terrifying speed.","In just an instant, he appeared around the blood-colored vortex and a golden figure slowly appeared.","It was a tall man wearing golden armor, boots, and carrying a golden axe on his back.","This tall man’s eyes were long and narrow, and his eyes were suffused with a faint golden light. When he arrived near the blood-colored vortex, he glanced at the black wings that were slowly breaking out from the core of the blood-colored vortex, and his eyes instantly lit up, a hint of fanaticism appeared on his face.","“Tyrant Axe!”","“It’s Ruler Tyrant Axe!”","“He actually came as well.”","When the surrounding Principles Masters saw this person, they immediately began to stir.","Many people looked at the golden figure with fear and respect in their eyes.","Ruler Tyrant Axe was also a famous and powerful Advanced Ruler in this Star Field. He was also the leader of a force.","“I was worried that there would be an expert at the Ruler level here, but now there’s an expert at the Advanced Ruler level.”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened at the sight of the arrival of the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","An Advanced Ruler was qualified to stop him.","He was not confident that he could defeat the well-known Ruler Tyrant Axe in a head-on battle, let alone fighting for treasures.","The reason why the Ruler Tyrant Axe had such a name was that his axe skills were extremely powerful and terrifying.","“It seems that I’m quite lucky. There are six or seven people who live in the Third Continent, and I’m the first one to arrive at the place where the flying Supreme True Treasure was born.” Ruler Tyrant Axe’s soul power swept through the surrounding void, he did not sense any other Ruler’s aura.","Although there was no Ruler, there was still one aura that he could not ignore.","“Is this kid the Blood Sword Master?” The Ruler Tyrant Axe fixed his gaze on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked at him as well.","Their eyes met, creating a faint electric spark in the void, but that was it.","The black wings had not yet been born, and there were so many Principles Masters around, so they naturally could not fight first.","“Humph, I heard that Blood Sword Master defeated Pupil Master and forced him to flee. He is quite capable, but Pupil Master is only a primary Ruler, but I’m different.”","“Blood Sword Master, I hope you don’t block my way later, or else...” A sneer appeared on Tyrant Axe’s lips.","He did not know that Jian Wushuang had the same thoughts as him.","The black wings that were about to break free from the blood-red vortex were the most powerful Flight Type True Treasure. Jian Wushuang was determined to obtain it.","Even if the Tyrant Axe Ruler was present, Jian Wushuang would not be afraid. If the Tyrant Axe Ruler stood in his way, Jian Wushuang would fight him to a draw.","At the bottom of the blood-red vortex, 80-90% of the black wings were already exposed. They were about to be completely revealed.","At this moment, more than 700 Principles Masters had gathered here. Some of them were astonishingly famous and powerful, fortunately, other than Ruler Tyrant Axe, there was no other Ruler present.","Beside the blood-colored vortex, more than 700 experts were staring at the bottom of the vortex, staring at the black wings.","Everyone was waiting for the black wings to come out completely.","Finally, the last part of the black wings broke out of the blood-red whirlpool, and the entire black wings rose up.","At the same time, the majestic aura of the Supreme True Treasure swept out instantly."]},{"number":3737,"title":"Chapter 3737 - Fight","paragraphs":["“It’s born!”","More than 700 great beings around the blood-colored whirlpool were shocked when they saw the black wings break free from the blood-colored whirlpool.","Then, sou! Sou! Sou! Sou! Sou! Sou!","Numerous figures moved almost at the same time.","“Hurry up and grab it!”","“The strongest Flight Type Supreme Treasure is mine. I’ll kill anyone who dares to block me!”","“I’ll risk it all for the wings!”","More than 700 Principles Masters frantically rushed toward the center of the blood-colored vortex, which was the black wings.","Everyone instantly sped up, hoping that they would be the first to reach the black wings and put them into their interspatial rings.","As for Jian Wushuang and the Ruler Tyrant Axe, they also moved at once.","Jian Wushuang used the shadowless escape art and burst out with his fastest speed.","And at the moment he moved...","“Magic Sand Realm!”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and endless black sand swept up crazily. In the blink of an eye, it formed a huge black sand sea that covered the entire heaven and earth void.","The surrounding void, which was more than 10,000 miles wide, including the bloody whirlpool at the center, was covered by the black sand sea. Naturally, it also included the Principles Masters who rushed toward the black wings at the first opportunity.","The terrifying Magic Sand Realm suppressed the speed of all the Principles Masters present.","“A Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure!”","“It’s Blood Sword Master’s Magic Sand Realm!”","“Damn it, this domain suppression is too strong.”","The Principles Masters were caught in the Magic Sand Realm, and their speed was greatly reduced. Their expressions changed greatly.","A few Principles Masters took out their Domain Type True Treasures at once, trying to resist the impact of the Magic Sand Realm.","However, the most powerful Principles Masters were only at the pinnacle of the six realm. What True Treasures could they have?","It was already good enough to have a top-tier Domain Type Supreme Treasure, but such a Supreme Treasure could not withstand Jian Wushuang’s Magic Sand Realm and was crushed as usual.","They still could not recover their peak speed.","However, among the many forces on the field, the only one who was not affected by Jian Wushuang’s Magic Sand Realm was the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","As a Ruler and the leader of a force, the Ruler Tyrant Axe had many True Treasures. Although he only had a golden axe in his hand, he had a Pinnacle True Treasure, he had almost all kinds of Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasures.","A vast green sea of fire swept out and formed a green sea of fire around the Ruler Tyrant Axe. The Green Sea of Fire released a terrifying aura, it collided with Jian Wushuang’s black quicksand domain, and the two collided head-on. For a time, it was impossible to tell who was stronger.","Because of the protection of the Green Sea of Fire Domain, the Ruler Tyrant Axe was not suppressed at all. As a Ruler, his speed was also frighteningly fast.","At least, he was faster than Jian Wushuang.","“Oh no!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed. He also realized that he was not as fast as the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","Now, the two of them rushed toward the black wings from almost the same distance at the same time. However, if the Ruler Tyrant Axe was not hindered by anything else, he would definitely arrive before the black wings.","Once the black wings fell into the Ruler Tyrant Axe’s hands, it would be too difficult to get them again.","“Humph.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned for a moment, then he unsheathed his Netherworld Divine Sword.","The ice-cold Black Divine Sword released the aura of the most powerful Supreme Treasure. Jian Wushuang instantly unleashed the power of his divine power and used his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill.","Even the power of his will, which was given by the universal principles, was unleashed by Jian Wushuang at this moment without holding back.","“Starfire Burning Sun!”","A trace of ruthlessness flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Whoosh! A violent sword light slashed through the void in an instant. With a terrifying power, it slashed toward the Ruler Tyrant Axe at an even faster speed.","“You want to block me?”","The Ruler Tyrant Axe was so domineering that he naturally saw the sword light coming toward him. However, a trace of disdain flashed in his eyes.","The surging divine power instantly soared into the sky. The Ruler Tyrant Axe was almost in front of the black wings. He had already stretched out his left hand and was about to put the black wings back into his interspatial ring. At this moment, he did not choose to withdraw his hand to block Jian Wushuang’s sword.","Instead, he continued to withdraw the black wings with his left hand, while his right hand instantly pulled out the golden axe behind him and swung it toward the sword light.","Whoosh!","The terrifying strike caused an ear-piercing sonic boom in the air.","It was as if heaven and earth could not withstand the power of the axe and were about to be split apart by it.","An Advanced Ruler’s every move was earth-shattering.","Even though the axe of the Ruler Tyrant Axe was not the strongest, its power was still extremely powerful. Logically speaking, it should be able to defeat an elementary Ruler head-on.","However, Tyrant Axe was facing Jian Wushuang, who had unleashed his strongest power.","Bang!","An explosion sounded from a distance, and a terrifying power spread out like a tidal wave.","Tyrant Axe’s left hand was less than three meters away from the black wings. At such a close distance, Tyrant Axe revealed a look of ecstasy.","He had thought that he was determined to get the black wings.","But in the end...a terrifying power was transmitted through the giant axe in his hand.","“What?”","Ruler Tyrant Axe’s expression changed, and his eyes were filled with shock.","At that moment, he felt that terrifying power. Not only did that power change the direction of his giant axe, but it also immediately struck his divine body, creating an extremely powerful impact force.","Ruler Tyrant Axe was protected by a Pinnacle True Treasure Armor, and his divine body was extremely powerful. Such an impact force could hardly damage his divine body.","However, although he would not be injured, when such a force hit his body, the impact force still sent him flying.","“No!”","Ruler Tyrant Axe shouted.","The black wings were about to fall into his hands, but he was getting farther and farther away from them.","He was pushed back by Jian Wushuang’s sword. Although he was not far away, when he regained his balance and intended to continue fighting for them, Jian Wushuang had already appeared in front of the black wings, with a wave of his hand, he put the black wings into his interspatial ring.","“I got it!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were also filled with unconcealable excitement and ecstasy.","..."]},{"number":3738,"title":"Chapter 3738 - Sword Rain","paragraphs":["The black wings had been obtained. Although the fight was still going on, what happened next was much easier for Jian Wushuang.","When the surrounding Principles Masters saw Jian Wushuang put the black wings into his interspatial ring, their eyes immediately turned scarlet.","“The wings have fallen into the hands of Blood Sword Master?”","“Humph, I don’t care if he’s Blood Sword Master or not. If he dares to snatch the wings, die!”","“Kill him!”","The Principles Masters were filled with killing intent.","Normally, when these Principles Masters saw Jian Wushuang, they would avoid him without hesitation. They did not dare to have any more thoughts.","However, it was different at this moment. These Principles Masters had been blinded by the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure.","Not to mention Jian Wushuang, the Principles Master, who was standing in front of them, they would not hesitate to attack even a genuine top-tier master.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of powerful attacks erupted at the same time.","There were more than 700 Principles Masters around, and at least half of them attacked Jian Wushuang directly.","The attacks were full of saber lights, sword shadows, whips, and mountains. They were all direct attacks.","Some Principles Masters also used special attack methods or secret skills, such as soul attacks, illusions, and the effects of some special secret skills.","In short, Jian Wushuang had become the focus of everyone’s attacks.","There were so many attacks coming from all directions that even a Ruler-level expert would not dare to underestimate them. Although Jian Wushuang was strong, he could not resist the attacks of so many people at the same time.","Boom!","A large amount of power hit Jian Wushuang without being hindered.","Jian Wushuang was covered by the violent power.","But in just a moment...","“Humph!”","With a cold snort and a cold sword light, all the power in front of him was annihilated. Jian Wushuang stepped out of the vast power.","“He’s not dead?”","“So many of us attacked at the same time, but we failed to kill him. It seems that he hasn’t been injured.”","“So what? Let’s keep attacking. I don’t believe that a mere Principles Master can stop so many of us.”","The Principles Masters, who were blinded by greed, immediately prepared for the second round.","However, Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","“You...are courting death!”","Jian Wushuang’s killing intent surged. He pointed the Netherworld Divine Sword in his right hand toward the void in front of him, and vast divine power instantly burst out.","“Sword rain!”","Buzz!","A cold sword shadow flew straight out. It looked very thin, as if it did not have much power.","However, after it flew out, it suddenly broke into thousands of tiny sword shadows the size of silver needles.","These tiny sword shadows scattered from the top of the void.","It was as if a sword rain had suddenly appeared between heaven and earth.","The sword rain was so fast that the Principles Masters in front of Jian Wushuang did not have time to react. The tiny sword shadows had already entered their divine bodies.","The void in front of them suddenly stopped.","There were more than 80 Principles Masters in the void, but at this moment, their eyes were wide open and full of fear.","The next moment...weng!","Of these 80 Principles Masters, other than the two strongest ones who were at the pinnacle of the six realm, who were still standing there, the rest were silently falling to the ground below.","They fell to the spot, and actually did not stand up again.","With one sword strike, nearly 80 Principles Masters died on the spot!","They were terrified!","They were shocked!","All the Principles Masters felt their scalps go numb when they saw this scene.","They had been rushing toward Jian Wushuang crazily, but at this moment, all the Principles Masters stopped moving.","Although they were blinded by the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure for a short time, they were not idiots.","They would also feel scared.","The scene before them made their hair stand on end.","He had killed nearly 80 Principles Masters with just one sword attack?","What did that mean?","After all, there were only about 700 Principles Masters, and Jian Wushuang had killed nearly 80 of them with one sword attack. Did that mean that he could kill almost all of them with just 10 sword attacks?","“How, how is this possible?”","“The power of one strike is so terrifying!”","“Monster, Blood Sword Master is a monster. How could we try to snatch the treasure from him? Are we courting death?”","The Principles Masters’ heads were buzzing, and their madness and desire for the strongest Flight Type True Treasure was gradually suppressed by their reason.","True, True Treasures were good, but they had to be alive to take them.","Jian Wushuang naturally noticed the changes in the eyes and expressions of the Principles Masters around him. He could see that they had been shocked by his sword attack.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang felt relieved.","Although these Principles Masters were hardly a threat to him.","If he had slaughtered them without restraint, he could have easily killed all of them with the sword rain move.","But if he had done so, he would have offended too many people.","There were more than 700 Principles Masters. These Principles Masters came from various forces, Star Worlds, and some big forces. If he slaughtered them all at once, he would immediately become the common enemy of this Star Field.","Although he was not afraid, he would implicate the Star Palace.","Now, these Principles Masters were all intimidated by his sword and did not want to fight for it anymore. That was naturally the best.","“Fortunately, when I was meditating under the Heaven Suppression Tablet, I thought that I might face a siege in the future, so I created the sword rain move. Otherwise, if I used other sword skills, even if they were more powerful, they would not be as powerful as they are now,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","The first move of sword rain was created when he was meditating under the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","This move was not too mysterious. The reason why it could kill nearly 80 Principles Masters at one time was that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of sword principle was too high and his divine power was too strong, these Principles Masters with average strength could hardly survive the sword rain.","But those who were strong, like the two pinnacle of the six realm, could still survive this move."]},{"number":3739,"title":"Chapter 3739 - Suppression Formation","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang had killed nearly 80 Principles Masters with a sword rain. He had stunned all the Principles Masters present.","Of course, this did not include the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","“Boy, hand over your wings!”","With an angry roar, the golden-armored Ruler Tyrant Axe held the huge golden axe in one hand, but his entire body suddenly expanded.","The Ruler Tyrant Axe, who was only the size of a normal human and could only be considered tall, suddenly turned into a 10-meter-tall golden giant. The golden giant emitted a monstrous aura, and his killing intent soared to the sky, he was like a slaughter demon god who had walked out of hell.","He took a series of steps, each step heavily trampling on the void. If it were in the void in the outside world, the terrifying power would have immediately exploded.","In just a few steps, the Golden Demonic God formed by the Tyrant Axe Ruler appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. The giant golden axe in his hand slashed down in a mighty and furious manner.","Whoosh!","The giant golden axe shadow seemed to split the heaven and earth into two,","the suffocating and terrifying aura emitted from the golden axe shadow caused the surrounding Principles Masters to change their expressions.","Jian Wushuang’s expression also darkened.","He could ignore all the Principles Masters present, but he did not dare to ignore the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","After all, he was a genuine and extremely powerful Advanced Ruler.","“Humph!”","Jian Wushuang snorted and instantly displayed his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill.","The power of the will given by the universe principles was also unleashed to the maximum.","“Starfire Burning Sun!”","The sword light that was filled with endless violence slashed out in an instant, colliding head-on with the huge golden axe shadow that was slashing over.","There was a loud clang, and the world shook.","The Principles Masters who were watching the battle felt a piercing pain in their ears. At the same time, the terrifying power swept over from the place where the two powers collided.","Hua la...endless godly power destroyed everything in the surroundings as easily as breaking dry weeds. Among them, a few Principles Masters who were relatively close to it were affected by this terrifying godly power because they could not dodge in time, in almost an instant, their godly bodies were destroyed and disappeared from the world.","This scene caused everyone to suck in a breath of cold air.","“Retreat! Quickly retreat!”","“Just the aftershock alone can easily annihilate a void six level Principles Master. Just how terrifying is this power?”","“It’s too terrifying. A high level Ruler level fierce battle isn’t something we can interfere with.”","The surrounding Principles Masters all retreated to a distance away from the battlefield.","Even though they still harbored great ambitions toward the black wings, they did not dare to barge into this terrifying battlefield even if they were beaten to death.","After all, treasures were not as important as life.","And in the center of the battlefield...whoosh! Whoosh!","The two figures separated again.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he stared at the Tyrant Axe.","The Tyrant Axe narrowed his eyes slightly.","“Good boy. I heard that you defeated Pupil Master and forced him to flee. Others said that you have the battle strength of an Advanced Ruler, but I didn’t take it seriously. But now, when we fight, even I have to admit that you do have the battle strength of an Advanced Ruler. You are even very strong among Advanced Rulers. At least in terms of power, you are not weaker than me.” The Tyrant Axe said in a deep voice.","The Ruler Tyrant Axe was as domineering as his name suggested.","His strongest attack was also an extremely overbearing and tyrannical attack.","However, when he used his axe skill to fight head-on with Jian Wushuang, he did not have the slightest advantage. This made him immediately understand that Jian Wushuang was no weaker than him in terms of attack.","“Ruler Tyrant Axe, the wings have fallen into my hands. If you want them, you’ll have to kill me. But do you think you can do that with your strength?” Jian Wushuang snorted coldly.","“Humph, I can’t kill you, but since the black wings have fallen into your hands, don’t think about leaving so easily!” Ruler Tyrant Axe was domineering and shouted, “Blood Sword Master, take my axe.”","Rumble!","The world shook. Ruler Tyrant Axe raised the Golden Axe in both hands at the same time.","In an instant, another mighty axe with suffocating power came crushing toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He was not afraid of the Ruler Tyrant Axe in a one-on-one fight. If he really fought, he might be able to suppress the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","However...he had just obtained the black wings, so he did not have time to fight with the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","After all, the birth of the most powerful Flight Type True Treasure was so huge that the entire Third Continent and even the entire Red Cloud World were shocked.","Not to mention the other continents, all the experts on the Third Continent were probably rushing here. Even if there was only one Ruler Tyrant Axe standing in front of him, if time passed, there would be a second one, if the third Ruler was present, it would be very troublesome for him.","“I can’t tangle with this Ruler Tyrant Axe. I have to think of a way to leave first.” Jian Wushuang knew very well in his heart.","He did not want to fight. All he wanted to do was leave.","The Ruler Tyrant Axe naturally saw through his intentions.","“Humph, Blood Sword Master, you want to leave? It’s not that easy.”","The Ruler Tyrant Axe let out a low growl. On the way to fight with Jian Wushuang, he suddenly flipped his hand and took out a small pyramid. This ‘pyramid’ emitted an extremely dense aura of a True Treasure.","“A suppression-type Supreme Treasure?” Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed.","“The beginning of heaven and earth can suppress everything!”","Ruler Tyrant Axe’s eyes were cold. He directly threw the pyramid into the void above him.","Suddenly, a burst of bright golden light burst out from the pyramid, and the pyramid was magnified in everyone’s sight.","A layer of hazy golden light swept out in the surroundings, covering an area of hundreds of thousands of miles.","The pyramid covered the entire area.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang was also covered by the pyramid.","“Haha, Blood Sword Master, you can’t escape. My Golden Tower is a Pinnacle Suppression Type True Treasure. Even a Superior Ruler can’t break it in a short period of time. It’s impossible for you to escape from it,” Ruler Tyrant Axe said with a sneer.","Jian Wushuang’s expression turned ugly.","His soul power swept out, and he could feel how powerful the suppression formation released by the pyramid was. Just as Ruler Tyrant Axe had said, he could not break the suppression formation in a short period of time, naturally, he could not leave from here.","..."]},{"number":3740,"title":"Chapter 3740 - One Against Two","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword Master, don’t even think about leaving until you hand over the black wings,” Ruler Tyrant Axe shouted.","“Humph, Tyrant Axe, you think too highly of yourself. So what if you have a Suppression Type Pinnacle True Treasure? Even if I can’t leave, how can you kill me?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold, there was no fear in his expression.","He just did not want to cause too much trouble, so he wanted to leave as soon as possible.","But now that he could not leave, there was nothing to be afraid of.","It was not easy to kill him in this Star Field with his life-saving means.","“Let’s try it.”","Ruler Tyrant Axe did not want to waste time with Jian Wushuang. He transformed into a golden demonic god and dashed toward Jian Wushuang with the mighty golden axe in his hand.","Jian Wushuang also went up to meet him.","Jian Wushuang showed his full strength. He even exerted the power of his will, which was given by the universal laws. His battle strength soared and he was much stronger than ordinary Advanced Rulers in terms of basic divine power. With his swordsmanship...he was not afraid to fight head-on with Ruler Tyrant Axe.","He even had a slight advantage in the fight.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","A series of low, terrifying explosions and collisions could be heard.","The fierce battle between the two turned the sky and earth dark.","The surrounding Principles Masters who were watching the battle were already terrified.","“This Blood Sword Master is so powerful, so terrifying!”","“He is indeed terrifying. He is just a Principles Master. I originally thought that it would be inconceivable for him to have the battle power of a high-level Ruler, but I didn’t expect him to be even more powerful than the rumors had said. Ruler Tyrant Axe is already considered extremely powerful amongst high-level Rulers, and his axe techniques are tyrannical. He specializes in killing, but in the end, when he fought with the Blood Sword Master, he ended up being at a disadvantage.”","“The Blood Sword Master is slightly stronger than the Tyrant Axe Ruler in terms of direct combat ability.”","The Principles Masters were all amazed.","While Jian Wushuang and the Tyrant Axe Ruler were engaged in a frenzied battle, there was still an endless stream of experts rushing over.","Although the Tyrant Axe Ruler’s suppression-type Supreme Treasure suppressed everything around and prevented Jian Wushuang from leaving, it did not stop people from rushing over.","Therefore, as time passed, more and more experts came to the void.","When these experts arrived, they immediately saw the terrifying battle between the Rulers in the center of the battlefield.","While they were shocked, the new Principles Masters quickly figured out what had happened and knew that the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure had fallen into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","“The Supreme Flight Type True Treasure is in Blood Sword Master’s hands?” Someone suggested?","“What are we waiting for? Why don’t we kill Blood Sword Master Together? Then we can fight for the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure. If so many Principles Masters join hands, even if they are Rulers, they will have to retreat,” Someone suggested.","“Kill Blood Sword Master together?”","As soon as the suggestion was made, someone sneered, “If you want to go, go ahead. I forgot to tell you that Blood Sword Master killed nearly 80 Principles Masters with one sword attack.”","“What?”","Those Principles Masters who had just arrived in the void were shocked.","Killed nearly 80 Principles Masters with one sword attack?","And this matter was confirmed immediately because too many people had seen it at that time.","With such a result, the new Principles Masters became much quieter. From the beginning to the end, none of the Principles Masters did not want to fight anymore.","Of course, Jian Wushuang’s achievement of killing nearly 80 Principles Masters with one sword stroke could shock many Principles Masters, but it could not shock a Ruler-level expert.","In addition to the Ruler Tyrant Axe, who had rushed to the battle with Jian Wushuang, a second Ruler-level expert soon arrived in the void.","The second master was an acquaintance of Jian Wushuang.","It was Pupil Master, who had been defeated by Jian Wushuang 3,000 years ago and had no choice but to flee in embarrassment!","“Blood Sword Master!”","As soon as Pupil Master arrived in the void, his faintly red eyes immediately locked onto Jian Wushuang.","On the way here, he had learned that the most powerful Flight Type Supreme Treasure had fallen into Jian Wushuang’s hands. Now, Jian Wushuang was engaged in a fierce battle with the Ruler Tyrant Axe.","The occupation in front of him made Pupil Master realize that it was impossible for the Ruler Tyrant Axe to defeat Jian Wushuang alone, and it was also impossible for him to hand over the black wings.","Pupil Master stepped forward without hesitation.","“Ruler Tyrant Axe, let’s join hands and teach this arrogant kid a good lesson,” Pupil Master shouted in a low voice.","“Okay.” Ruler Tyrant Axe nodded. “This kid is not weak, and his ability to fight head-on is not weaker than mine. However, no matter how strong he is, he is only a Principles Master. His body protection ability should not be that strong. Help me from the side and kill him when you have the chance.”","“Okay.” Pupil Master nodded heavily.","They all understood that it was almost impossible for Jian Wushuang to hand over the wings in his hands.","In that case, they had to find a way to kill Jian Wushuang.","Although Jian Wushuang was very strong, he was only a Principles Master, so his life-saving ability could not be compared to an ordinary Ruler. This also gave them hope to kill Jian Wushuang.","Rumble! The endless blood clouds rolled.","A monstrous wave of air pressed toward Jian Wushuang.","Pupil Master also made a move, and he did his best.","Having fought with Jian Wushuang in a head-on battle, he knew that Jian Wushuang was definitely stronger than him.","“Pupil Master?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and glanced at Pupil Master, but he was still not afraid.","He did not care about the Ruler Tyrant Axe at all.","Even with Pupil Master, he was still not qualified to threaten him.","So what if they joined hands?","Even if the two Rulers joined hands, with his current strength, he could still fight them head-on and even suppress them.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang attacked with all his strength.","Not only did he unleash his power to the maximum, but most importantly, his swordsmanship had finally been completely unleashed.","It should be known that he had entered the origin of the sword universe very early in his understanding of sword principle, which was a step that most Rulers had never reached.","After a long period of time, especially five thousand years of comprehension under the heaven suppressing tablet, and three thousand years of study within the Sword Stone, his comprehension of the Sword Dao grew increasingly higher and higher. The current him...had already truly stepped into the origin of the sword universe.","His comprehension of the Sword Dao had long surpassed that of an ordinary high-level Ruler. Even if it was a peak Ruler, there were probably only a few who could match up to him.","With such a high understanding of the sword, his attainments in swordsmanship were naturally high as well."]},{"number":3741,"title":"Chapter 3741 - Master Qing","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang, who was besieged by the two Rulers, released sword essence and terrifying sword light one after another.","The sword light was swift, violent, ethereal, or as fast as lightning!","Relying on his swordsmanship, Jian Wushuang was not at a disadvantage when fighting against the two Rulers at the same time. Instead, he had completely suppressed the two Rulers.","Yes, he was suppressing them!","Although the Ruler Tyrant Axe’s axe skill was overbearing and powerful, it was not exquisite enough. Previously, Jian Wushuang was able to gain the upper hand in a head-on fight with him. Now, he did not choose to fight head-on, instead, he used his exquisite swordsmanship to fight fiercely with him. With one sword move after another, the Ruler Tyrant Axe could only struggle to resist.","As for Pupil Master, his strength was much weaker than the Ruler Tyrant Axe’s. It was even easier for him to crush Jian Wushuang with a thunderbolt-like method.","Even if it was one against two, the two masters were still no match for him.","“Too strong!”","“One against two, but he suppressed the two masters?”","“Is this the true strength of Blood Sword Master?”","The surrounding Principles Masters were all stunned.","If they had not seen it with their own eyes, they would never have believed that a Principles Master could be so strong.","Now that they thought about what the Tyrant Axe Ruler and Pupil Master had said, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master, so his body-protection ability should not be that strong. They could find an opportunity to kill him. It seemed to be a joke.","Both of them had been crushed by Jian Wushuang. How could they find an opportunity to kill him?","Even if Jian Wushuang’s protective ability was not strong, could they touch his divine body?","“How? How could this be?” The Tyrant Axe roared in disbelief.","“This kid’s swordsmanship is so terrifying. When he fought with me 3,000 years ago, his swordsmanship had not reached such a terrifying level,” Pupil Master also hissed.","He did not know that during the 3,000 years, Jian Wushuang had been meditating under the Sword Stone. Although most of the time, he was meditating to perfect the Earth Guard, while he was meditating, his understanding of sword principle was constantly improving, and his swordsmanship was also constantly improving.","In addition, when Jian Wushuang fought with him 3,000 years ago, he did not use his full strength.","If he did not use his full strength, Pupil Master would not be able to resist.","Heaven and earth shook.","Jian Wushuang’s terrifying strength shocked everyone present.","The surrounding Principles Masters who were watching the battle had some illusions about the strongest Flight Type True Treasure, but now that they saw Jian Wushuang’s terrifying strength with their own eyes...even the two Rulers were crushed by Jian Wushuang.","This scene made the Principles Masters lose interest in the black wings.","“The two Rulers were suppressed by Blood Sword Master even when they joined hands. Do we have to wait for the third Ruler to come in person before we have a chance to subdue Blood Sword Master?”","“The third Ruler?”","Everyone was moved.","But at this moment...","“He’s here! The third Ruler is here!” A cry of surprise suddenly sounded.","Everyone immediately looked over and saw a cyan figure appearing in the void in front of the battlefield.","It was an absolute beauty in a cyan robe. Her face was cold as if she did not belong to the mortal world. A faint divine power aura spread from her body.","Although the divine power aura was very weak, everyone present was shocked when they sensed it.","Even Jian Wushuang, the Ruler Tyrant Axe, and the Pupil Master, who were fighting fiercely on the battlefield, were shocked when they sensed the divine power aura.","It was because the divine power aura was much stronger than the divine power aura of an ordinary Senior Ruler.","There was no doubt that the person who came was a Superior Ruler!","“Master Qing!”","“It’s Master Qing from the Heavenly Lake Astral World!”","“It’s her?”","Many Principles Masters around started to tremble.","Master Qing was different from the other Rulers in this astral region. She had been around for a long time and had been famous for a long time.","She was a Ruler who had just risen, and it had only been a million years since then.","And it had only taken her a few hundred thousand years to become one of the top Rulers.","Without a doubt, she was a true genius.","The Heaven Lake Astral World was the same as the Divine Beginning Realm. It was only a third-grade astral world that had yet to reach its peak. However, because of Master Qing’s existence, the countless forces in this astral world did not dare to provoke her.","After all, she was a genuine Superior Ruler.","In this star area, aside from Master Qing, there were no more than five known Superior Rulers who were still in the star area.","Such a Ruler was certainly awe-inspiring.","“Haha, Master Qing is actually here. I don’t have to worry that no one can subdue you.” Pupil Master stared at Jian Wushuang and sneered.","“Humph, even if Master Qing can subdue me, I’ll only give him the black wings. As for Pupil Master and Ruler Tyrant Axe, I’m afraid you two should stop thinking about it.” Jian Wushuang sneered.","Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master’s eyes immediately darkened.","Of course, they longed for the black wings.","However, what Jian Wushuang said was the truth. Since Master Qing was here, Jian Wushuang would only give her the black wings even if she could subdue him with the strength of a Superior Ruler, he would never give them the black wings.","If Master Qing got the black wings, they would not even have the desire to fight for it.","Snatching a Supreme Treasure from a Superior Ruler? That would be a joke.","“You are the Blood Sword Master.”","Master Qing stood at the edge of the battlefield and did not immediately enter the battlefield. Instead, she stared at Jian Wushuang coldly.","“It’s me.”","Jian Wushuang, Ruler Tyrant Axe, and the other two stopped. Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Master Qing is here for the wings, right?”","“Yes.” Master Qing nodded. “The strongest Flight Type Supreme Treasure is not something you can have. Hand over the wings, and I promise to give you an Attack type Supreme Treasure, a pinnacle Suppression Type, a pinnacle soul defense type, and a pinnacle Flight Type Supreme Treasure as compensation.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and nodded inwardly.","It had to be said that Master Qing was quite kind. She did not directly snatch it from the beginning, but was willing to hand over True Treasures in exchange.","Although the price she was willing to pay for the True Treasure was not as high as that of the strongest Flight Type True Treasure, it was still pretty good.","Unfortunately, it was not easy to get a chance to get a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure. Naturally, Jian Wushuang would not let it go so easily.","..."]},{"number":3742,"title":"Chapter 3742 - Three Spears","paragraphs":["“Master Qing, I’m sorry. This flying Supreme True Treasure is very useful to me, so I can’t agree to it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You can’t agree?” Master Qing’s expression remained unchanged. “Then I’m sorry.”","“What? Master Qing, as a Superior Ruler, is going to attack me, a Principles Master, without any regard for my reputation?” Jian Wushuang laughed.","“Yes, you are a Principles Master. But in terms of combat strength, you can suppress both the Ruler Tyrant Axe and the Pupil Master. I’m not far from a Superior Ruler. How can I attack you without respect?” Master Qing’s voice was cold.","“But I’m a Superior Ruler, so I won’t bully you. How about this? You take three of my strikes, and if you aren’t seriously injured by me after three strikes, I’ll turn around and leave.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows, but he found it funny in his heart.","Master Qing seemed to be merciful. As long as he was not seriously injured by the three strikes, she would leave.","But in fact, all the smart people knew that Master Qing would try her best to unleash her strongest battle strength as a Superior Ruler.","If Jian Wushuang could not withstand the three strikes and was killed or seriously injured, Master Qing would continue to attack.","However, if Jian Wushuang could withstand the three strikes and was not seriously injured...even the strongest attack could not seriously injure Jian Wushuang, it meant that Master Qing could not kill Jian Wushuang at all, so she had to leave.","In other words, Master Qing did not say these words to show mercy, but to make it sound nice.","If she was really worried about her status as a Superior Ruler, she should say that if Jian Wushuang did not die in the three strikes, she would immediately turn around and leave.","Just that she did not injure him severely..","If she could injure him severely, it meant that she had the ability to kill Jian Wushuang.","If she could not injure him severely, she could do nothing to Jian Wushuang.","“Master Qing, what you said is really nice.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, but he still nodded and said, “Okay, let me see how strong a Superior Ruler is.”","Jian Wushuang was also looking forward to it.","He had come into contact with a Superior Ruler before, and that was the Heaven Roc Ruler of the North Sea Palace.","The Heaven Roc Ruler had also attacked him, but the Heaven Roc Ruler had been holding back and had not used all of his strength.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang’s strength was still relatively weak at that time, so he could not fully feel the gap between him and the Heaven Roc Ruler.","But now it was different.","“Master Qing, show me your spear skills.”","Jian Wushuang held the Netherworld Divine Sword with one hand, and his divine power surged crazily.","He would not underestimate a superior master. He had already exerted the power of the universe principles to the maximum.","Master Qing’s eyes were cold. With a flip of her hand, a silver spear appeared in her hand.","The silver spear was at least two meters long. The moment it appeared in Master Qing’s hand, a cold chill instantly swept out. The surrounding void immediately froze under the attack of the chill, the entire world became extremely cold.","“What a cold spear!”","Jian Wushuang glanced at the silver spear in Master Qing’s hand. There was no doubt that the silver spear in Master Qing’s hand was a Supreme True Treasure magic weapon.","In terms of power, it was definitely not weaker than his Netherworld Divine Sword.","“Blood Sword Master, watch carefully. This is the first spear.”","As Master Qing’s voice fell, the silver spear in his hand stabbed forward.","Swish!","The silver light flashed and the cold spear streaked across the void. Wherever it passed, the space instantly froze into ice.","The world immediately became dark and gloomy.","In this dark world, there was only this bright silver light, which was extremely dazzling and emitted a cold luster.","“So fast!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a trace of surprise.","This spear move was too fast.","It almost instantly pierced through the void and appeared in front of him. He did not even have time to carefully feel the power of this spear move.","Without much time to think, Jian Wushuang directly struck out with his sword.","“Starfire Burning Sun!”","Jian Wushuang’s divine power surged, and he immediately used the heaven-cleaving skill. His strength reached its peak at this moment.","The violent sword light instantly slashed out, bringing with it a terrifying power as it collided head-on with the silver light.","Clang!","With a loud sound, Jian Wushuang’s body suddenly trembled, and he staggered back a few steps. Each step was heavy and powerful, trampling on the void.","However, there was no doubt that Jian Wushuang had received the spear.","Moreover, he had blocked the attack with his sword skill. Although he was completely suppressed, he still managed to block the attack without too much power hitting his body.","“That’s right. To be able to block my spear with the power of your sword skill, it proves that your strength is the best among the Advanced Rulers. However, your strength is still not enough to defeat me,” Master Qing said coldly.","“Master Qing, let’s cut the crap. I’ve taken your first spear. Now, let me see your second spear,” Jian Wushuang said excitedly.","Master Qing’s first spear had already amazed Jian Wushuang. He was indeed a Superior Ruler.","It was obvious that Master Qing had just casually used her spear and did not use much strength. However, he still easily defeated his star fire burning sun and completely suppressed it.","As for the second spear that Master Qing was about to use, it was definitely stronger.","“Watch carefully for the second spear.”","A trace of coldness flashed through Master Qing’s eyes.","Previously, he had only casually stabbed forward with the first spear. However, during the process of the second spear, a large amount of ice condensed in front of her.","A suffocating chill spread out.","Master Qing’s silver spear, as well as her hand holding the spear, were covered in frost. Along with a gust of cold air, Master Qing spat out.","Whoosh!","The long spear was another explosive thrust.","With this thrust, the void in a radius of 10,000 kilometers was completely frozen into a world of ice and snow.","The silver spear also turned into a huge icicle, carrying a terrifying penetrating power as it stabbed toward Jian Wushuang.","The power of this spear was definitely several times stronger than the first one!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes shone with a fierce light.","He held the Netherworld Divine Sword with both hands at the same time.","Whoosh!","The sword slashed out, and the void turned into chaos.","There was no sound of explosion or air explosion. Jian Wushuang’s sword did not seem to have a terrifying power.","However...when the divine sword fell, a cold sword light mercilessly cut through the space, mercilessly tearing through everything in front of it, tearing through the ice and snow, and mercilessly slashing toward the huge icicle."]},{"number":3743,"title":"Chapter 3743 - Jian Wushuang’s Protective Ability","paragraphs":["Fallen yellow spring!","The strongest sword attack created by Jian Wushuang!","If the Starfire Burning Sun was extremely violent and had a sudden burst of astonishing power, then the fallen yellow spring was cold and ruthless!","This cold and ruthless sword attack seemed to be able to cut through everything it encountered.","No one, no matter what, could withstand its sharp edge.","There was also a trace of the aura of the universe’s principles in this sword.","It was precisely because of the aura of the universe’s principles that the power of this sword was so terrifying.","Back in the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang had fought with Di Shisan in the sword principle battle. In the end, Jian Wushuang had used this sword to defeat Di Shisan’s swordsmanship system and obtain victory.","However, it had been more than 8,000 years since that battle. During those 8,000 years, Jian Wushuang had first studied under the Heaven Suppression Tablet for 5,000 years, and then he studied under the Sword Stone for 3,000 years, he had made great progress in his swordsmanship, and the aura of the universe principles he had grasped had become stronger.","Naturally, the power of this sword move was far from what he could compare with before.","“This sword move!”","Pupil Master, who was watching the battle, saw Jian Wushuang’s sword move and his expression changed drastically.","He clearly remembered that 3,000 years ago, Jian Wushuang had used this sword move to beat him until he vomited blood.","After all, he had the protection of the Supreme Treasure Armor, yet he still vomited blood. One could imagine how powerful that sword move was.","Now that Jian Wushuang was using it again, the power of his swordsmanship was even stronger than before?","It had to be said that the power of Jian Wushuang’s sword was indeed earth-shaking.","At least, the Tyrant Axe thought that he could not perform an attack of this level.","However, what Jian Wushuang was facing was, after all, a genuine Superior Ruler.","A Superior Ruler’s battle strength was far stronger than a Superior Ruler’s.","The cold and terrifying icicle pierced toward Jian Wushuang, and his cold and ruthless sword light came into direct contact with it.","Swish! Swish!","The sound of divine power squeezing against the impact rang out, and the final result was still Jian Wushuang’s sword light being crushed.","The cold and ruthless sword light also lasted for a while, but it completely dissipated. The icicle still carried extraordinary power and directly hit Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang’s body shook violently, and he was knocked back.","After a long while, he finally managed to stand firm in the void.","After he stood firm, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at Master Qing again. He could not help but exclaim, “No wonder you’re a Superior Ruler. You’re amazing!”","Jian Wushuang was indeed amazed.","Her most terrifying and confident sword attack was the one that fell into the yellow springs.","After all, it was a strike with the aura of a universe principles. It was ridiculously powerful, but unfortunately, a Superior Ruler was much more powerful than him in terms of divine power alone. As for Master Qing’s strike just now, it was also extremely powerful, so...he was still crushed.","However, although he was crushed, the remaining power of the strike did not cause much damage to him.","It was normal for Jian Wushuang to have a Supreme True Treasure Armor to protect his body. At the same time, he had cultivated the supreme eternal celestial body, which was as tough as a Supreme Treasure. If the power of the spear had not been offset by his falling styx swordsmanship, he might have been injured, if it had hit his divine body, it might have caused him some damage.","However, with the help of the swordsmanship, the damage caused by the spear was negligible. Jian Wushuang did not care at all.","“Although my spear was blocked by his swordsmanship and weakened by more than half of its power, more than 30% of its power still hit his divine body directly. How could he be completely fine under the impact of 30% of its power?","“The divine power aura on his body did not weaken at all?” Master Qing finally frowned.","The two Rulers watching the battle, including the Principles Masters, were also shocked by this scene.","“How is this possible? This Blood Sword Master was clearly struck by Master Qing’s spear technique, but why isn’t he injured?”","“Although the power of that spear technique was more than half negated by Blood Sword Master’s sword-arts, it still has more than 30% of its power left. Under normal circumstances, even an ordinary high-level Ruler would be injured or severely injured after receiving more than 30% of a top-tier Ruler’s power. How could this Blood Sword Master, a Principles Master, act as though nothing had happened?”","“Didn’t they say that as a Principles Master, his divine body is not that strong? But now, it seems that his divine body is much stronger than that of an ordinary Ruler.”","An uproar resounded throughout the world.","Indeed, before this, almost everyone thought that although Jian Wushuang’s offensive power was comparable to that of an Advanced Ruler, and he was even the best among Advanced Rulers, his defensive ability should not be that strong.","It was also because of this that the Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master felt that there was a glimmer of hope that they could kill Jian Wushuang.","But now, the scene in front of them showed that the Blood Sword Master’s protective ability was not weak at all?","The head-on attack of a Superior Ruler contained more than 30% of its power. He only relied on his divine body to withstand it, but he was completely fine.","“Is this kid pretending? He’s already heavily injured, but he’s just pretending to be fine?” A Principles Master could not help but say.","However, as soon as he finished his words, many people looked at him as if they were looking at a fool.","It was true that one could disguise his appearance and behavior, but the divine power aura on his body could not be disguised.","If a person was seriously injured, the divine power aura on his body would be greatly weakened, but the divine power aura on Jian Wushuang’s body did not seem to be weakened at all.","“Blood Sword Master, it seems that I have underestimated you. As a Principles Master, not only can your offensive power rival that of an Advanced Ruler, but your protective ability is also much stronger than that of an ordinary Ruler. I’m afraid that no one below the level of a Superior Ruler can defeat you with this protective ability alone,” Master Qing said in a deep voice.","Her words immediately attracted the agreement of the surrounding experts.","Indeed, when Jian Wushuang had cultivated the first level of the supreme eternal divine body, he was already destined to be able to do whatever he wanted among Senior Rulers. However, he could not ignore a Superior Ruler, that was why Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others wanted to get him a Supreme True Treasure Armor.","If he had the Supreme True Treasure Armor and Jian Wushuang’s powerful divine body, he would have no fear even if he encountered a Superior Ruler.","“Blood Sword Master, I’m going to use my third spear.”","Master Qing gripped the silver spear in her hand, and her eyes became sharp. “I’ll keep my word. If I can’t severely injure you with this spear, I’ll turn around and leave immediately.”","..."]},{"number":3744,"title":"Chapter 3744 - Earth Protection","paragraphs":["“Come on.”","Jian Wushuang clenched the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand, his eyes full of expectation.","The two strikes that Master Qing had performed were ridiculously powerful. Jian Wushuang had already performed his strongest swordsmanship, but he was still crushed.","Now, how powerful was the third strike that Master Qing was about to perform?","The many Principles Masters who were watching the battle were all eagerly waiting.","They also wanted to personally witness Master Qing’s strongest spear attack.","“Divine punishment!” Master Qing said coldly. Weng! The vast amount of pure divine power that only a peak Ruler possessed instantly swept out.","The moment this pure divine power swept out, the divine power aura that Master Qing emitted was slightly weaker than before.","Although it did not weaken much, it was weakened.","Clearly, it was not easy for Master Qing to unleash this strongest spear attack.","The world fell silent.","Under everyone’s gaze, Master Qing slowly extended the silver-colored spear in her hand.","This silver-colored spear turned into a silver-colored bolt of lightning. Under the gathering of that majestic divine power, it suddenly erupted.","Rumble! The silver spear, which was originally of normal size, was enlarged at a terrifying speed. In the blink of an eye, it extended to a length of 30,000 feet. Its size was so huge that it was like a pillar supporting the sky. The 30,000-foot-long silver spear...it easily pierced through the space and came straight for Jian Wushuang.","For a moment, the entire world was filled with an ear-piercing sound of an explosion.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void in front of the long spear. He saw the long spear magnify and then stab at him. At this moment, he felt as if he was caught in a violent storm. His silver robe...his hair was fluttering in the wind.","“What a terrifying power!”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and was extremely surprised.","He had just received the first and second strikes from Master Qing. Although the power of the two strikes was far more powerful than his own, at least Jian Wushuang could cope with it.","However, the third strike gave him a feeling that he could not fight back at all.","This strike could completely crush everything.","Although he had created an extraordinary sword art, no matter how much strength he used, he would be completely defeated by this strike.","Jian Wushuang immediately understood that he could not use his sword art to fight this strike head-on.","However, just because he could not fight it head-on did not mean that Jian Wushuang could not resist it.","“Such a powerful attack. Let me test the results of my 3,000 years of work.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands tightly, his eyes shining brightly.","“Earth Guard!”","Jian Wushuang brandished his sword.","The Netherworld Divine Sword seemed to be casually slashed out, but it contained a special mystery.","Buzz, buzz, buzz. A large amount of sword essence, accompanied by a large amount of earthy yellow energy, rose in an instant.","Earth protection was based on the principles of the Earth.","The earth was heavy and sentimental!","With Jian Wushuang’s attainments in sword principle...in an instant, a layer of earthy yellow sword domain was formed!","Sword Domain, Earth Sword Domain!","After the first layer of Earth Sword Domain appeared, a second and third layer of Earth Sword Domain immediately condensed.","In the blink of an eye, 12 Earth Sword Domains were formed in front of Jian Wushuang!","“The Earth Sword Domain is the product of my perfect combination of the earth principles and the origin of the sword principle universe. It has a strong body protection ability. The Earth Sword Domain alone should be able to easily withstand the full-strength attack of a Primary Ruler. Now, I have condensed 12 Earth Sword Domains at the same time. In addition, I have integrated the endless essence into this move. I want to see if I can withstand this spear!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a brilliant light.","Boom!","The 30,000-meter-long silver spear, which contained the power to destroy heaven and earth, finally stabbed at Jian Wushuang.","It immediately stabbed at the earthy yellow sword domain in front of Jian Wushuang.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","In just an instant, the 12 Earth Sword Domains collapsed into seven, and more than half of them collapsed.","Then it was followed by another bang! Bang! With two consecutive sounds, the eighth and ninth great Earth Sword Domains collapsed.","However, starting from the tenth great Earth Sword Domain, the momentum of the long spear’s attack clearly slowed down.","Bang!","The tenth Great Earth Sword Domain was still defeated.","The eleventh great Earth Sword Domain lasted for a full moment before it was also defeated.","When it reached the twelfth and final great Earth Sword Domain, the long spear still attacked the twelfth great Earth Sword Domain for a period of time, but in the end, it was still unable to completely defeat the twelfth Great Earth Sword Domain, the giant spear stopped in the void, and its power was completely exhausted.","Buzz! The 30,000-meter-long silver spear dissipated and returned to its original appearance in Master Qing’s hand.","However, at this moment, Master Qing’s face was filled with shock and disbelief.","Not only her, but the other two Rulers who were watching the battle, including the Ruler Tyrant Axe and the Pupil Ruler, as well as the numerous Principles Masters, were completely dumbfounded.","Although Jian Wushuang had blocked the previous two strikes, everyone could see that he had not been able to block them easily.","Now, the third strike was Master Qing’s strongest strike. She had paid a certain price in order to use this strike. Logically speaking, this strike should have been enough to completely crush Jian Wushuang, at the very least, it should have been enough to injure Jian Wushuang to a certain extent.","However, the result surprised everyone.","Jian Wushuang had blocked the most powerful spear strike without any damage.","Such a terrifying spear strike could not really hit his divine body. The strange earthy yellow power in front of Jian Wushuang had completely blocked the power of the spear strike, he did not even retreat.","“How is this possible?” Pupil Master could not help but roar.","“What is that power?” Ruler Tyrant Axe stared at Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, great waves also rose in Master Qing’s heart.","She stared at Jian Wushuang and recalled the scene just now.","“Is that power...a Supreme Treasure?”","“No, that feeling is not a True Treasure, but...swordsmanship?”","“Yes, it’s swordsmanship!”","Master Qing’s eyes narrowed. “The protective swordsmanship of a Principles Master completely blocked my most powerful divine punishment spear.”","Master Qing could hardly believe it was true.","But the truth was right in front of her.","“Master Qing, thank you.”","Jian Wushuang said with a smile on his face and a deep breath in his heart.","“I spent most of the 3,000 years cultivating under the Sword Stone to perfect the Earth Guard. Finally, I was able to condense 12 Earth Sword Domains at the same time, each stronger than the last. It turns out that I didn’t waste these 3,000 years!” Jian Wushuang was very excited."]},{"number":3745,"title":"Chapter 3745 - Acknowledgment","paragraphs":["Three thousand years ago, when he first came to the Red Cloud World, the Earth Guard technique he created was still very young. It could only form one great Earth Sword Domain.","And the Earth at that time was still very pure.","But in these three thousand years, he had studied and studied under the Sword Stone. By now, he could form a total of twelve great Earth Sword Domains, most importantly, the 12 levels of the Earth Sword Domain contained an endless essence, which combined perfectly to make the 12 levels of the Earth Sword Domain stronger and more resilient.","After reaching this stage, although Jian Wushuang knew that the protective ability of his sword should be extremely strong, at the very least, he should be able to completely block an attack at the Advanced Ruler level. As for an attack at the Superior Ruler level...whether it could be blocked or not, he was not confident.","Now that he was fighting with a Superior Ruler, and Master Qing had used her strongest spear, she was unable to break through all 12 levels of the Earth Sword Domain, this made Jian Wushuang almost overjoyed!","Master Qing’s strongest spear was unable to break through all 12 levels of the Earth Sword Domain, which meant that the defensive ability of the Earth Guard was much stronger than she had imagined.","His 3,000 years of comprehension had not been in vain.","Unlike Jian Wushuang’s excitement, the people around him had long been shocked.","“Blood Sword Master.”","Master Qing looked at Jian Wushuang again, and her expression slowly disappeared, returning to her usual cold expression. “You are a Principles Master, so your battle strength is not weaker than an Advanced Ruler. I didn’t expect your defensive ability to be even more terrifying!","“Not only do you have an extremely powerful divine body, which can withstand thirty percent of my attack head-on without being damaged, but you also know such a terrifying defensive sword technique. With this defensive sword technique, I’m afraid that even among the top Rulers, only a handful of them have the ability to kill you. At the very least, among the top Rulers in this star area, no one should have this kind of power.”","Master Qing had spoken based on her own feelings. At least, that was what she thought.","However, as soon as her words left her mouth, the surrounding void immediately erupted into an intense commotion.","“Heavens, Master Qing actually said that no one in this Star Field can kill the Blood Sword Master?”","“That’s normal. Didn’t you see how Master Qing unleashed her strongest spear, only to be completely blocked by the protective sword-art of the Blood Sword Master?”","“With that body-protecting sword-art and his extremely powerful divine body, none of the top Rulers in this Star Field would be able to do anything to him if they didn’t work together.”","“This Blood Sword Master is just a mere Principles Master. It’s one thing for him to be as powerful as a Senior Ruler, but I didn’t expect his life-saving ability to be so incredible. He’s really a monster.”","“We wanted to kill such a monster to fight for his wings? It’s just a pipe dream.”","Exclamations sounded one after another.","Master Qing spoke again, “Blood Sword Master, although you’re just a Principles Master, you have such powerful strength and life-saving means. It’s only right that the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure fell into your hands. You’re qualified to possess such a True Treasure.”","After saying that, Master Qing looked at Jian Wushuang seriously, then turned around, apparently intending to leave.","However, before she left, she glanced at Ruler Tyrant Axe, who was beside her. “Ruler Tyrant Axe, your Suppression-type True Treasure has been suppressing this place. Don’t tell me you want to keep me here as well?”","Ruler Tyrant Axe’s face changed.","Previously, he had used his Suppression-type True Treasure to suppress the void just to prevent Jian Wushuang from escaping. He had no intention of stopping Master Qing.","But now, Master Qing was going to leave because of his Suppression-type True Treasure.","Ruler Tyrant Axe gritted his teeth and looked at Master Qing, then at Jian Wushuang. He sighed in his heart.","“I thought Blood Sword Master was only a Principles Master. Although he’s strong, his ability to protect his body shouldn’t be that strong. As long as a few more Rulers join hands, I’m sure I can kill him. I didn’t expect Blood Sword Master’s ability to protect his body to be so strong that even Master Qing couldn’t do anything to him. I’m just an Advanced Ruler.”","Tyrant Axe shook his head. He did not persist any longer. With a wave of his hand, he withdrew the suppression formation in the surrounding void.","After the suppression formation was withdrawn, Master Qing left immediately.","“Master Qing has already left. Why? Do you two intend to stay and continue to be trampled by me?” Jian Wushuang looked at Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master with interest.","The Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master looked at each other in dismay.","“Master Blood Sword, you’re good.” The Ruler Tyrant Axe said and then turned to leave.","Pupil Master’s eyes flashed with a fierce light.","He had a grudge with Jian Wushuang. If he had the chance, he would not hesitate to deal with Jian Wushuang. However, now that Master Qing and the Ruler Tyrant Axe had left, he alone...he would be completely crushed by Jian Wushuang. Naturally, he did not dare to stay any longer.","Soon, the three Rulers left one after another.","Even the Rulers left. The Principles Masters around them did not have the slightest intention of fighting over it. Soon, they dispersed and left.","The fight for the strongest Flight Type True Treasure had finally come to an end.","...","Jian Wushuang was slowly moving forward in the void of the Third Continent in the Red Cloud World.","He was holding two messaging tokens in his hands. One belonged to the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the other belonged to the Temporal Temple Master.","“My young friend, I admire you. You were able to defeat the Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master by yourself in the realm of Principles Master. You were even able to take three strikes from Master Qing head-on without any damage. Moreover, Master Qing paid a certain price to use his most powerful strike, but he was unable to break your protective sword skill. This really makes us Rulers feel ashamed,” The Temporal Temple Master exclaimed.","Temporal Temple Master knew that Jian Wushuang had obtained the lightest Flight Type Supreme Treasure, so he had rushed here as fast as he could.","However, on the way, he received news that Jian Wushuang’s crisis had been resolved, and he knew the process of the previous battle.","Even Temporal Temple Master, who had a certain understanding of Jian Wushuang, could not help but exclaim in admiration.","“Indeed. Master Qing is a genuine Superior Ruler. Her strongest spear attack could not even break your protective swordsmanship. Heavenly Sword Marquis, when did your protective swordsmanship become so powerful?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master could not help asking.","..."]},{"number":3746,"title":"Chapter 3746 - Celestial Light Wings (Part One)","paragraphs":["“To tell you the truth, during the past 3,000 years, I have not been searching for Supreme Treasures on the Third Continent. Instead, I have been comprehending the swordsmanship under the Sword Stone. Among the four swordsmanship of the Sword Stone, there happens to be an extremely profound protective swordsmanship. I have been comprehending it for a full 3,000 years before I was able to perfect the protective swordsmanship that I created to this extent,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Is that so?”","“No Wonder I sent you a message earlier. You said you were meditating, so you were meditating on such swordsmanship.”","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master also understood.","“By the way, my young friend, the most powerful Flight Type Supreme Treasure is now in your hands. You should quickly refine it and take a look,” the Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and temporarily cut off the communication with them. Then, he found a quiet place and took out the black wings.","The pitch-black wings were extremely cold to the touch.","The wings were covered with complicated and mysterious secret patterns, which even Jian Wushuang could not see through.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and then began to try to refine the black wings.","When he began to refine them, he was immediately met with a resistance.","“As expected.” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and was not surprised.","It was not easy to refine a Supreme Treasure, even an ordinary Supreme Treasure. If he wanted to refine this Supreme Treasure, he had to meet the requirements of this Supreme Treasure.","And the requirements for refining the strongest Universe Supreme Treasure would be even higher.","For example, Jian Wushuang’s Netherworld Divine Sword was the strongest Universe Supreme Treasure, so the requirements were extremely harsh. Fortunately, when Jian Wushuang obtained the Netherworld Divine Sword, he had already stepped into the sword universe origin, at that time, he had already met the requirements for refining the Netherworld Divine Sword, so he could easily refine it.","However, as the strongest Flight Type Supreme Treasure, the black wings were more valuable than the Netherworld Divine Sword, so the requirements for refining it were naturally higher.","However, Jian Wushuang’s current strength was far from what he could compare with before.","“The requirements for refining the black wings seem to be related to the universe principles?”","As Jian Wushuang studied it, he soon learned the threshold for refining the black wings, which he had just met.","Soon, the black wings were successfully refined by him.","As soon as he finished refining them, he immediately got the information about the black wings.","It was the most powerful Flight Type Supreme Treasure, the Celestial Light Wings!","“Celestial Light Wings? That’s a good name,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","Like ordinary flying and protective armor treasures, the Celestial Light Wings had three different levels of power. In addition, it contained two secret skills.","The first was the three levels of power. Each level was higher than the other, but the conditions to activate it were more and more difficult.","The first level of power needed to be able to clearly sense the existence of the universe principles before it could be activated.","The second level of power required one to truly comprehend a trace of the universe principles before it could be activated.","The third level of power required one to have a certain level of comprehension of the universe principles before it could be activated.","“The universe principles?”","“The conditions for activating the Celestial Light Wings are actually related to the universe principles. The higher one’s comprehension of the universe principles, the stronger the power that can be activated?” Jian Wushuang was secretly surprised, but he immediately understood.","The most powerful Universe Supreme Treasure, and it was a special Supreme Treasure such as the flight type, was indeed qualified to involve the universe origin.","Jian Wushuang now met the requirements for activating the first level of the three levels of power of the Celestial Light Wings.","The first level of power only needed to be able to clearly sense the existence of the universe principles. He had already achieved this step when the universe principles personally descended on him.","Moreover, he had already grasped a trace of the aura of the universe principles. Now, he was not only satisfied, but he had even exceeded the requirement to activate the first level of power.","However, the second level of power of the Celestial Light Wings required him to truly comprehend a trace of the universe principles, which was relatively far away for Jian Wushuang.","“Let’s test the first level of power first.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. The black wings in his hand instantly merged with the surface of his body and then spread out behind him.","The huge black wings emitted a special mysterious wave. With a thought from Jian Wushuang, the first level of power was instantly activated.","Puff! Puff, the wings were suddenly spread.","Swish!","A stream of light instantly rushed out. In the blink of an eye, he appeared in the void 100,000 miles away.","“This, this speed...”","Jian Wushuang stopped in the void with a hint of excitement in his eyes.","“Too fast, this is too fast,” Jian Wushuang exclaimed.","It was too fast.","In the blink of an eye, he had traveled 100,000 miles.","After all, this was in the Red Cloud World, where the heaven and earth were greatly restricted. It was not as unbridled as in the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the blink of an eye, he had traveled 100,000 miles at such a terrifying speed that even a Superior Ruler could only be so fast.","“My speed was relatively fast before, and I was definitely not inferior to an ordinary Ruler. However, compared to the speed at which I’m using the Celestial Light Wings, it’s nothing!”","“It’s too fast. Even a Superior Ruler’s full speed might not be able to compare to mine.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists.","He did not know how fast a Superior Ruler was, but he could make a basic judgment. The previous Pupil Master was too fast, when he was facing Jian Wushuang, he could not escape with his life-saving secret skill.","However, when Pupil Master used his life-saving secret skill, his speed was much slower than Jian Wushuang’s.","From this, he could roughly guess.","He knew that with the most powerful Flight Type True Treasure, his speed would be greatly improved.","However, he did not expect that his speed would be improved so much.","He could have it all at once, and it was even faster than the speed of an ordinary top-tier Ruler.","Moreover, this was only the first level of the power of the Celestial Light Wings. If he had the chance to comprehend a trace of the universe principles and activate the second level of the power of the Celestial Light Wings in the future, his speed would be even faster, would it not be even faster?","“The second level of power...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with anticipation.","The threshold of the second level of power of the Celestial Light Wings was to comprehend a trace of the universe principles.","Under normal circumstances, only supreme experts were qualified to comprehend the universe principles. However, this was only under normal circumstances.","Jian Wushuang was well aware that there were many things in this world and this vast universe that could not be inferred with common sense, such as those geniuses who could not be inferred with common sense.","Those geniuses were terrifyingly talented. They could comprehend a trace of the universe principles at the Ruler level, or even better, they could grasp a trace of the universe principles at the Principles Master level. It was not impossible."]},{"number":3747,"title":"Chapter 3747 - Celestial Light Wings (Part Two)","paragraphs":["Although Jian Wushuang was not blindly confident that he could compete with the incredible geniuses in the universe, it was still a hope.","“This is only the basic power of Celestial Light Wings. It contains two secret skills,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","The Celestial Light Wings contained two secret skills, namely, the Mystic Light Phantom and the Mystic Light Realm.","The Mystic Light Phantom was a movement skill secret skill that was performed with the help of the Celestial Light Wings.","As for the Mystic Light Realm, like its name, it was naturally a realm performed by the Celestial Light Wings.","These two secret skills were performed together with the Celestial Light Wings, so their power was naturally extraordinary.","However, Jian Wushuang also needed to comprehend these two secret skills before he could use them.","“A movement skill and a realm-type skill. I hope they can surprise me.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and directly sat down cross-legged and began to carefully comprehend these two secret skills.","In a flash, ten years passed.","In the vast and rolling red clouds in the void, whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Numerous phantom-like streamers flickered and changed in the void one after another.","Every time they flickered, they would appear in the void hundreds of feet away, and there was almost no interval between the flashes.","Countless phantom-like streamers flickered.","After a long time, all the phantom-like streamers disappeared. Jian Wushuang’s figure gradually took shape in the center of the Void.","“Incredible. This movement skill is incredible!”","“It’s better to describe it as close-range teleportation than movement skill.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining with a bright light.","In the past ten years of meditation, he had completely mastered the two secret skills, the Mystic Light Phantom and the Mystic Light Realm.","What he had just displayed was the Mystic Light Phantom. It seemed to be a movement technique, but in reality, every flash of the Mystic Light Phantom had teleported from one part of the Void to another.","It was just like the Temporal teleportation in the Temporal divine art created by the Temporal Temple Master.","The difference was that Temporal teleportation was a secret technique for escaping. It could send messages from a distance based on the spatial coordinates left behind.","Although this secret skill had a strong life-saving ability, it was only useful for ordinary Principles Masters.","After all, this secret skill would be restricted by Temporal imprisonment.","Once someone was able to use Temporal imprisonment, it would be impossible for them to use Temporal teleportation.","With Jian Wushuang’s current strength, those who could threaten him and allow him to escape were at least Rulers. As a Ruler, even if he was not good at Temporal rules, he must have treasures in the Temporal field and could easily use the Temporal imprisonment.","Therefore, the Temporal imprisonment was no longer useful to Jian Wushuang.","However, the close-range teleportation used in the Mystic Light Phantom movement was not affected by the Temporal imprisonment. Even if it was only a short-range Temporal imprisonment, it could only move a few thousand feet at a time, at most a few dozen miles, however, the Mystic Light Phantom could be used continuously.","Imagine if Jian Wushuang used this secret skill in a close-range fight with a Ruler, he could move around the Ruler and change his position, the Ruler basically could not capture his exact location.","From the beginning, he could rely on this movement skill to stand invincible!","“This movement technique is indeed worthy of being used in conjunction with the most powerful flying treasure, the Celestial Light Wings. It’s really amazing.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with joy. “As for the Mystic Light Realm...”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. The secret patterns on the Celestial Light Wings lit up instantly. In an instant, a large amount of pitch-black flowing light burst out from the wings.","The black flowing light swept out in all directions.","In the blink of an eye, it covered tens of thousands of miles around, causing the area to fall into a pitch-black flowing light realm.","Although it was a secret skill, the movement and appearance of the Mystic Light Realm was like the impact of a normal domain-type Supreme Treasure.","As for its power...","“Domain, suppression!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice. Instantly, a terrifying suppression was generated in the huge flowing light realm.","The suppression was so strong that the space began to tremble crazily.","“The suppression effect of this realm is so strong.” Jian Wushuang, who was at the center of the realm and was in control of the realm, could clearly feel the suppression power of this realm.","He immediately sensed that the suppression effect of the Mystic Light Realm was not weaker than ordinary Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasures, and it was even stronger than ordinary Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasures.","For example, his Magic Sand Realm was a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure, but its power was slightly weaker than that of the Mystic Light Realm at this moment.","However, the Mystic Light Realm was only a secret skill used with the help of the mystic light Celestial Light Wings, not a domain-type True Treasure.","This secret skill could be perfectly combined with a Domain Type Supreme Treasure.","“Magic Sand Realm, out!”","With a thought from Jian Wushuang, the black quicksand that filled the sky instantly rushed out. It also spread out for tens of thousands of miles. It did not clash with the black flowing light that filled the sky. Instead, the two types were perfectly combined.","The Mystic Light Realm and the Magic Sand Realm were perfectly combined.","In an instant...","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The terrifying power of the realm burst out. The black quicksand around the flowing light rushed crazily. The suppression of the realm was much stronger than the Magic Sand Realm and the Mystic Light Realm.","“This power...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with unconcealable joy.","He had not expected that the secret skill of the mystic light Celestial Light Wings would be so powerful.","The flowing light phantom had already surprised him.","And this Mystic Light Realm made him even more ecstatic.","This was a Domain Type secret technique. Combined with his Devil Sand Domain, it had formed an even more terrifying domain that was far more powerful than a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure.","One had to know that Domain Type True Treasures were very useful in battles between Great Beings.","The strength of a Domain Type True Treasure could allow a cultivator to gain the absolute advantage in a fierce battle.","Previously, when Jian Wushuang and the Tyrant Axe Ruler were fighting for the Celestial Light Wings, he had used the Magic Sand Realm to restrict the Tyrant Axe Ruler’s speed. Unfortunately, the Tyrant Axe Ruler also had a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure, the two domains clashed, and neither was able to restrict the other.","However, if he had a stronger Domain Type True Treasure, it could suppress the Tyrant Axe’s domain, greatly reducing his speed and strength, and making it easier for him to obtain the Celestial Light Wings."]},{"number":3748,"title":"Chapter 3748 - There Were Six","paragraphs":["“With the help of the Celestial Light Wings, I can perfectly combine the Mystic Light Realm and the Magic Sand Realm. In the future, unless I meet an expert with the strongest domain-type Supreme Treasure, I’ll be able to take the initiative in fighting for it.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","The combination of the Mystic Light Realm and the Magic Sand Realm was enough to suppress a Supreme Domain Type Supreme Treasure.","However, it was still weaker than a Supreme Domain Type Supreme Treasure.","However, how many people in this Star Field had a Supreme Domain Type Supreme Treasure?","After obtaining the Celestial Light Wings, not only did it greatly increase his life-saving ability, but it also contained two secret skills, which greatly increased Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Next, Jian Wushuang’s goal should be to obtain the most powerful protective armor.","In the Red Cloud World, the emergence and competition for the Celestial Light Wings caused a great sensation.","This caused a sensation not only for the most powerful Flight Type Supreme Treasure, but also for Jian Wushuang’s strength.","He thought that Jian Wushuang was powerful enough to completely suppress Pupil Master in a head-on battle and force her to flee in a sorry state. He did not expect that his true strength was even stronger. Even when the Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master joined hands, he could even suppress Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master.","Especially his body-protection ability.","Not to mention his powerful divine body, his body-protection swordsmanship, which could block Master Qing’s strongest spear attack, was shocking enough.","However, the Red Cloud World was still a battlefield for the fight for Supreme Treasures.","And the fight for the Celestial Light Wings was just one of the fights.","As more and more Supreme Treasures were born, the fight for the Supreme Treasures gradually died down.","The experts of the Red Cloud World continued to fight for the Supreme Treasures.","Jian Wushuang continued to explore the Third Continent.","In the blink of an eye, another 2,000 years passed.","During these 2,000 years, the number of Supreme Treasures born in the Red Cloud World gradually decreased, but the quality of the Supreme Treasures gradually improved.","Jian Wushuang had also obtained a few Supreme Treasures, but they were only at the level of a top-tier Supreme Treasure.","“My Heavenly Marquis friend, I just received news that another Supreme Treasure has appeared on the First Continent. It’s an offensive divine sword. It seems to be very powerful,” Temporal Temple Master sent a message.","“A divine sword?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but then he shook his head. “I already have the Netherworld Magic Sword, which is the most powerful magic weapon in terms of attack. It’s enough for me to use my swordsmanship. Even if I get another one, it won’t be of much use.”","“Yes.” Temporal Temple Master nodded. “The appearance of the magic sword caused a lot of competition. In the end, it was obtained by a lucky Senior Ruler. With this magic sword, there are already six Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World.”","“Under normal circumstances, there are about ten Supreme True Treasures in the Red Cloud World. Now that six have been born, there are not many left. Among the six Supreme True Treasures, four are offensive weapons, one is the strongest Flight Type True Treasure you have obtained, and the other is the Supreme True Treasure Armor, which was obtained by the Sky Roc Ruler.”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","More than 1,000 years ago, on the Second Continent, there was indeed a Supreme True Treasure Armor.","The birth of the Supreme True Treasure Armor caused a huge commotion, and it also caused a frenzy of competition on the Second Continent.","However, the Second Continent and the Third Continent where Jian Wushuang was located were far apart. Although Jian Wushuang had received the news, before he could rush over, the Supreme True Treasure Armor had already fallen into the hands of Sky Roc Ruler, who was adventuring in the Second Continent.","Sky Roc Ruler was one of the Palace Masters of the North Sea Palace and a Superior Ruler.","Jian Wushuang had fought with Sky Roc Ruler before, and his strength was probably above that of Master Qing.","If the Supreme True Treasure Armor fell into the hands of a Superior Ruler, who would be qualified to fight for it in this Star Field?","Jian Wushuang could only feel regret in his heart.","“The Sky Roc Ruler is a Superior Ruler, and he is the Palace Master of the North Sea Palace. He already has a Supreme True Treasure Armor. Now that he has another one, he is of no use. He can only keep the Supreme True Treasure Armor in the North Sea Palace and let other Rulers of the North Sea Palace use it, or he can simply put the Supreme True Treasure Armor in the Nine Emperor Pavilion and exchange it for other True Treasures.”","“If it were any other Superior Ruler, we might have tried to exchange the Supreme True Treasure Armor with another Supreme True Treasure. However, the one who got the Supreme True Treasure Armor was Sky Roc Ruler. After what happened last time, it’s almost impossible for us to negotiate with him again,” Temporal Temple Master said with a wry smile.","Jian Wushuang also shrugged helplessly.","He had obtained the Netherworld Divine Sword from the Sky Roc Ruler, and the means he had used that time were not that glorious. It could be said that he had schemed against the Sky Roc Ruler and made the Sky Roc Ruler suffer a loss for nothing.","Although the Sky Roc Ruler was concerned about his face and was willing to accept his loss, he was afraid that he would not feel comfortable.","At this time, it was obviously impossible for him to exchange for the Supreme True Treasure Armor from the Sky Roc Ruler.","Unless he exchanged for it with the heaven-fleeing wings, which were more valuable than the Supreme True Treasure Armor and could be of great use to Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang would not be willing to do so.","“Although there are many Supreme True Treasures in the Red Cloud World every time it opens, there will only be one Supreme True Treasure Armor every time it opens. If I miss that one, I’m afraid that there will only be other Supreme True Treasure Armors in the Red Cloud World the next time it opens,” Jian Wushuang sighed.","The Red Cloud World had been opened many times in this Star Field, and everyone knew the underlying rules.","For example, every time the Red Cloud World opened, there would be about ten Supreme True Treasures.","At the same time, these ten Supreme True Treasures mostly focused on offensive magic weapons. As for the Supreme True Treasure Armor, Flight Type, Suppression Type, Domain Type, and Soul Type, they rarely appeared, it All depended on luck.","Moreover, every time the Red Cloud World opened, the Supreme True Treasures such as the armor, the Flight Type, the Suppression Type, the Domain Type, and the Soul Type would only appear once.","For example, since Jian Wushuang had already obtained the Celestial Light Wings, the Red Cloud World would never produce another Supreme True Treasure like the Flight Type.","It was the same for the Supreme Treasure Armor.","“We wanted to find a Supreme True Treasure Armor to protect you when the Red Cloud World appeared, but now it seems that there is no chance. However, you have also obtained a Supreme Flight Type Supreme True Treasure, which is more valuable,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“Temporal, Heaven-cleaving, I actually have an idea,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said."]},{"number":3749,"title":"Chapter 3749 - Hunting Plan","paragraphs":["“What do you think?” asked the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“I’m thinking that there are many experts in the Red Cloud World. If we really want to get a Supreme True Treasure Armor, we don’t necessarily have to rely on the appearance of the Supreme True Treasure. Maybe we can think of other ways, such as hunting a Ruler with a Supreme True Treasure Armor,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Hunting a Ruler?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were shocked, but then they began to ponder.","It was not that they had never thought of hunting a Ruler who had a Supreme Treasure Armor, but they were just thinking about it.","After all, experts at the Ruler level were extremely strong and most of them had strong life-saving means. Even the simplest Primary Ruler would find it extremely difficult to hunt.","For example, Jian Wushuang, Daoist Xuan God, and Temporal Temple Master had once killed their way to the Holy Star and threatened the Holy Star Master.","At that time, the Holy Star Master had indeed felt a great threat and had lowered his head.","However, this was mainly because Jian Wushuang and the others had not really killed him and forced him into a corner. Otherwise, if the Holy Star Master had revealed his strongest trump card, he might have been able to put up a fight.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang and the others had directly attacked the lair of the Earth Saint Star Master. The Earth Saint Star Master had been too confident at the beginning and did not know Jian Wushuang’s true strength. Therefore, he did not flee immediately, which gave them an opportunity.","However, if an ordinary Ruler was in a place like the Red Cloud World, they would remain vigilant. As long as they sensed the aura of other Rulers approaching, they would be alert immediately, if two or three Rulers approached at the same time, the Ruler would not hesitate to retreat and would not give them a chance to kill him.","“It’s too difficult to kill a Ruler.”","Temporal Temple Master shook his head slightly. “We have to find a perfect opportunity to kill an ordinary first-level Ruler, not to mention a Ruler with Supreme True Treasure Armor. Even a first-level Ruler with Supreme True Treasure Armor has an extremely powerful protective ability. Even a top-tier Senior Ruler would find it difficult to kill him.”","“Yes, a Ruler with Supreme True Treasure Armor is too difficult to kill. Even a top-tier Ruler might not be able to kill a Ruler with Supreme True Treasure Armor,” said the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","He knew that a Ruler with Supreme True Treasure Armor was difficult to kill, but he was confident in his current strength.","“You two, I fought Pupil Master with Supreme True Treasure Armor and injured him with my full strength. At that time, it was very difficult for me to kill him, but now, it’s not impossible,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Oh?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were surprised.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how confident are you?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","“About 40%. If you two can come and help me, then I’m 60% confident,” Jian Wushuang said.","“60%?” The eyes of Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master lit up.","It was too difficult for them to kill a Ruler with the protection of the Supreme True Treasure Armor. They could have tried to kill Jian Wushuang even if he said they were 10% or 20% confident, but now they were 60% confident...","“60% sure, we can try, but I don’t know who we are going to kill, Pupil Master?” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes, him.” Jian Wushuang already had a target.","In this Star Field, there were not many Rulers with Supreme True Treasure Armor, and most of them were Supreme Rulers or stronger Advanced Rulers.","Jian Wushuang had no intention of killing a Ruler of that level.","As for a Primary Ruler with Supreme True Treasure Armors, Jian Wushuang only knew about Pupil Master.","Pupil Master was a loner and did not have a good character. He did not care about his status and attacked some Principles Masters as he pleased. Over the years, he had killed many Principles Masters on the three battlefields, and he had offended many experts from different forces.","Because Pupil Master was strong and had the Supreme True Treasure Armor, few people could do anything to him.","If Jian Wushuang killed such a Ruler, he would not offend anyone even if he was exposed. On the contrary, many people would want him to kill Pupil Master.","“Pupil Master is indeed the easiest target to kill. Whether we kill him or not, no one will say anything afterward. However, Pupil Master is not weak. He is already very strong among the Primary Rulers, and his life-saving methods don’t seem weak either,” Temporal Temple Master muttered.","“I’ve experienced his strength, so I don’t mind. The key is his life-saving methods. Last time, I fought with him, and although I forced him to use a life-saving method, it might not be his full trump card. Therefore, we have to be fully prepared if we want to kill him,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","“That’s right. If you want to kill a Ruler, you must first not give him a chance to escape. Temporal, with your attainments in Temporal, what can you do?” asked the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“At most, I can guarantee that he won’t be able to use any Temporal means or treasures to escape and completely imprison the Temporal,” said the Temporal Temple Master.","“That alone is not enough. Even if Temporal is sealed, his life-saving skills can be used at a speed that is much faster than that of an ordinary Ruler,” said the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“Don’t worry about that. I have the Celestial Light Wings. I don’t think he can match my speed,” Jian Wushuang said confidently.","What a joke. With the Celestial Light Wings, his speed could instantly surpass that of an ordinary Superior Ruler. He did not believe that Pupil Master could be faster than him.","“Even so, we still have to be prepared in case, such as setting up some special arrays in advance or using a Suppression Type True Treasure to suppress the void, so that he can not escape,” said the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“If it’s a Suppression Type True Treasure, Xuan God does have a top-tier Suppression Type True Treasure, and it’s of a very high quality. Should we ask him to deliver it personally?” said the Temporal Temple Master.","“No need.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Have you forgotten that we have a Supreme Suppression Type True Treasure in the Divine Beginning Realm? And that Supreme Suppression Type True Treasure has always been in my hands.”","“You mean the Mountain River Map?”","Both Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were stunned.","..."]},{"number":3750,"title":"Chapter 3750 - The Target, Pupil Master!","paragraphs":["The Mountain River Map was Xuan Yi’s strongest Suppression Type Supreme Treasure, and it had always been in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","However, because the level of the map was too high, Jian Wushuang had been unable to use its strongest power. However, the map had always been one of Jian Wushuang’s strongest trump cards. Until the last moment, he would not use it easily.","Now, as long as he could kill Pupil Master, Jian Wushuang did not mind using this trump card.","“The map is indeed the strongest Suppression Type Supreme Treasure, but the threshold to use this Supreme Treasure is very high. Heavenly Sword Marquis, can you use all of the power of the map now?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“Of course I can’t use all of its power, but only a part of its power is enough to suppress a Primary Ruler like Pupil Master and make him unable to escape,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s enough that he can do that.” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master nodded. “In that case, let’s not delay. Temporal and I will rush to the Third Continent immediately. Also, send an order to Star Palace, which is exploring the Third Continent, and the experts of the three Freedom Alliances to find out the location of Pupil Master.”","“Wait for the three of us to arrive, then we’ll act immediately.”","“Okay.”","Jian Wushuang and Temporal Temple Master nodded one after another.","After breaking the communication, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master immediately rushed to the Third Continent as fast as they could.","Although Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were on different continents, it only took less than a day for an expert at the Ruler level to arrive at the Third Continent. The three experts at the Ruler level of the Divine Beginning Realm had already gathered.","At the same time, the orders of the three of them had been passed down. Star Palace and the Great Beings from the three Freedom Alliances who were adventuring on the Third Continent began to pay attention to Pupil Master’s position.","Pupil Master was, after all, a true Ruler, and he had the protection of the most powerful True Treasure Armor. He was practically able to do whatever he wanted on the Third Continent. Naturally, he did not have any qualms about doing things. If they wanted to find his position...it was very easy.","Ten days later.","In the Red Void space on the Third Continent.","Buzz!","A war blade appeared out of thin air. This war blade was a top-tier True Treasure, and it was very valuable. Naturally, it attracted many great beings to fight for it.","In this fight, Blood Ancestor from the Heaven Ancestor Daoist sect, one of the three Freedom Alliances, was very lucky. He took the war blade.","Although there were quite a few lords of laws rushing over, there weren’t many of them, and their strength wasn’t too tyrannical. Seeing that the battle saber had already fallen into the hands of the blood clan, they could only give up and didn’t step out to snatch it, just as the blood clan was about to take the battle saber and leave this piece of void space...","A terrifying aura suddenly descended.","The person who came was none other than the eye lord.","Pupil Master stood in the void space and looked down at Blood Ancestor. That Ruler-level aura directly pressed down on Blood Ancestor’s body, and Blood Ancestor could not help but tremble.","Blood Ancestor’s face instantly became extremely unsightly.","“Lord Pupil Master, it’s just an ordinary top-tier True Treasure,” Blood Ancestor said in a low voice. “You don’t have to lower your status as a Ruler, do you?”.","“Cut the crap. Hand it over, or you’ll die!” Pupil Master’s eyes turned cold.","Although Blood Ancestor was unwilling to give up, he did not dare to disobey Pupil Master because of his power. He took out the blade and handed it to Pupil Master.","“Humph! You know your place.”","Pupil Master sneered, put the blade into his universe ring, and left.","However, he did not notice the cold and resentful eyes of the Blood Ancestor after he left.","“Temporal Temple Master, I’ve met Pupil Master. My position is...” The Blood Ancestor had already sent a message to Temporal Temple Master.","...","Pupil Master was moving forward slowly in the void. There was a hint of pride on his face.","“That ant just now wasn’t too stupid. If he didn’t hand it over or talked back to me, I would have a reason to kill him directly.” Pupil Master sneered, “Although he’s just an ordinary Principles Master in the Divine Beginning Realm, if I can kill him, I’ll be relieved.”","Pupil Master really wanted to kill the Blood Ancestor.","It was not because the Blood Ancestor had a treasure that attracted him, nor was it because of a top-tier Supreme Treasure, the war saber.","The real reason was that the Blood Ancestor came from the Divine Beginning Realm and the three Freedom Alliances.","Pupil Master had also heard that Jian Wushuang was not only from Star Palace, but also had an extraordinary relationship with the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm. He had previously been angered by Jian Wushuang and had fled in a sorry state after being killed by Jian Wushuang, of course, he had some complaints in his heart.","Killing a Principles Master from the three Freedom Alliances would not completely relieve Pupil Master’s anger, but at least it would make him feel slightly better.","Unfortunately, the speed at which the Blood Ancestor handed over the treasure was too fast, so he did not have the opportunity or excuse to act.","He was a Ruler, and it was already excessive for him to take the initiative to force a Ruler of Principles to hand over the treasure. If the other party had already handed over the treasure and he still killed the other party, then it would indeed be a little too much, this would also cause many Rulers in this Star Field to dislike him.","Thus, he did not act directly just now.","“Hmph, it doesn’t matter. There are so many experts from the Star Palace and the three major Freedom Alliances adventuring in the Red Cloud World. In the future, there will be plenty of opportunities to encounter experts from the Star Palace and the three major Freedom Alliances. When the time comes, we’ll find an opportunity to kill a few more.” Pupil Master laughed coldly.","He had been adventuring in this Star Field for so long, and had always been free to do whatever he wanted.","With his strength and life-saving trump cards, he rarely suffered defeat in this Star Field.","However, in the fierce battle with Jian Wushuang, not only did he suffer defeat, but he also lost a lot of face.","As a mighty Ruler, he was killed by a Principles Master and fled in a sorry state. This made him a joke for a moment. Of course, he wanted to take revenge on Jian Wushuang.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang was so powerful that he could not take revenge on Jian Wushuang.","“Humph, Blood Sword Master, I can’t take revenge on you, but I can take revenge on your subordinates. What can you do to me?” Pupil Master sneered in his heart.","However, at this moment, a familiar aura suddenly appeared in the range of his soul power.","The appearance of this aura immediately caused Pupil Master’s expression to change.","“This aura...is Blood Sword Master?” Pupil Master’s expression immediately became serious. “Blood Sword Master actually came to the void near me. Did he just happen to pass by?”","Pupil Master did not doubt it at first.","After all, Jian Wushuang had been adventuring in the Third Continent. Although the Third Continent was quite big, after adventuring for so many years, it was normal for them to meet each other halfway.","..."]},{"number":3751,"title":"Chapter 3751 - Approaching","paragraphs":["Pupil Master’s expression immediately turned grave when he discovered that Jian Wushuang had appeared within his soul perception.","At the same time, the special treasure hidden in his body once again revealed an unprecedented desire.","“As expected, as long as Blood Sword Master appears, my treasure will be extremely restless. It seems that Blood Sword Master indeed has something that the treasure desperately desires. Unfortunately...” Pupil Master’s gaze darkened slightly, but he began to comfort the treasure.","“Don’t worry, baby. I’ll definitely think of a way to get the thing in Blood Sword Master’s hands in the future. But for now, it’s better to leave.”","Pupil Master shook his head. He had no intention of meeting Jian Wushuang.","After all, Jian Wushuang was far stronger than him and they had long been enemies. He had been beaten up by Jian Wushuang and had to flee in a sorry state.","Now that he was alone, he naturally did not dare to face Jian Wushuang again, so he could only choose to retreat.","It was funny to say that a mighty Ruler wanted to avoid a Principles Master on his own initiative.","“Blood Sword Master, I’ll let you be complacent for a while. I’ll definitely get back at you in the future.” Pupil Master clenched his hands and secretly hated Jian Wushuang.","He had deliberately bypassed Jian Wushuang.","However, he soon found that although he had bypassed him, Blood Sword Master had changed his direction at the same time and rushed toward him.","“Blood Sword Master has the strength of an Advanced Ruler, so his soul perception must be strong. I can sense his existence, so he should be able to sense me. Now that I’ve bypassed him, he’s unyieldingly approaching me?” Pupil Master’s expression was a little ugly.","As a Ruler, he had already avoided a Principles Master, but the Principles Master did not give up and continued to rush toward him.","Although he was extremely angry, Pupil Master still did not have the intention to face Jian Wushuang.","He continued to change directions and increased his speed.","However, when he changed directions, Jian Wushuang immediately changed directions. After he increased his speed, Jian Wushuang also increased his speed.","It was obvious that he was completely focused on him.","“Blood Sword Master, what are you doing?”","In a rage, Pupil Master shouted directly through his consciousness.","“Pupil Master, at least we’ve met twice before. We can be considered acquaintances. Now that we’ve met for the third time on the Third Continent, it’s a bit unreasonable for you to leave without even greeting me,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“I’m unreasonable?” The corner of Pupil Master’s mouth twitched slightly. “I don’t have any friendship with you, so there’s no need for me to greet you. I’m leaving now, so don’t follow me.”","“What’s the rush? Why don’t we sit down and have a chat?” Jian Wushuang smiled and sped up again.","The faster he sped up, the more alert Pupil Master became, and his speed also began to explode.","“Pupil Master is really alert.” Jian Wushuang could not help shaking his head, but then he felt relieved.","“That’s right. After all, we are in the Red Cloud World. Fighting and killing are too crazy. He knows my strength well. Although he never thought that I could kill him, he knows that I can easily defeat him. It’s normal that he doesn’t dare to meet me. After all, he was beaten up by me last time. I don’t think he would want to meet me again.”","Jian Wushuang smiled in his heart. Suddenly, his expression changed and he sent a voice transmission, “Pupil Master, don’t leave in a hurry. To be honest, I came here because I have something to ask you.”","“What is it?” Although Pupil Master replied, he did not stop.","“It’s like this. I heard that you once obtained a special treasure by chance, and that treasure is very useful to me. That’s why I wanted to talk to you,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Special treasure?”","When Pupil Master heard this, his vigilance instantly soared.","He did have an extremely special treasure, which was his biggest secret. In this world, no one else knew about it except himself.","The reason why he had recklessly attacked some Principles Masters in this territory all these years, regardless of his status, was largely because of that special treasure.","Now that Jian Wushuang mentioned the special treasure, Pupil Master immediately thought of the treasure in his hand.","But the question was, how did Blood Sword Master know that he had that treasure? Or was the special treasure mentioned by Blood Sword Master not that one?","“Blood Sword Master, I don’t know what the Special Treasure you mentioned is,” Pupil Master said directly.","“You don’t know, Pupil Master? That’s impossible. I know very well that the treasure is in your hands.” Jian Wushuang pretended to be very confident, then he said, “Pupil Master, I think you should stop for now. Let’s find a place to talk.”","Pupil Master’s eyes darkened slightly.","He did not dare to face Jian Wushuang directly, but what Jian Wushuang said just now made him hesitate.","He was not sure if the special treasure Jian Wushuang mentioned was his treasure. If it was true...if the existence of the treasure was known by the Blood Sword Master, it would definitely be a big trouble for him once it was spread.","Therefore, he also knew what the Special Treasure Jian Wushuang mentioned was.","“Okay, I agree to talk to you. As for the place, you don’t have to choose. It’s right here. I Won’t leave, and you don’t come closer. You and I are so far away in the void, so we can communicate through consciousness,” Pupil Master said seriously.","“Consciousness communication?” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Yes.”","With that, Jian Wushuang stopped walking.","Pupil Master’s figure also stopped in the void.","The two were separated by nearly 70,000 miles of void, and they were holding each other from a distance.","Seeing Pupil Master’s figure really stop, Jian Wushuang did not show any change on the surface, but he secretly smiled in his heart.","He did not know what Special Treasure Pupil Master had obtained. The reason why he said that was so that Pupil Master could stop moving so that Temporal Temple Master could hide in the surrounding void space.","Jian Wushuang knew very well that a Primary Ruler like Pupil Master, who had extraordinary strength and possessed Supreme True Treasure Armor, must have obtained some special opportunities or fortunes. Most likely, he had also obtained some special treasures, this was very normal.","Most Principles Masters had obtained some special treasures, not to mention a Ruler. Jian Wushuang only said it was a special treasure, but he did not specify which one. Pupil Master would be even more apprehensive, he did not dare to underestimate his words.","As expected, Pupil Master was fooled.","He had stopped moving. Although there was still a distance of 70,000 miles between him and Jian Wushuang, this distance was nothing to him."]},{"number":3752,"title":"Chapter 3752 - Was Set Up","paragraphs":["“Temporal Temple Master, Pupil Master has stopped. He is in the void where I am. You can set up now,” Jian Wushuang secretly sent a message.","“Well, give me 10 seconds,” Temporal Temple Master replied.","“Okay, I’ll try my best to help you.” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","“Blood Sword Master, what do you want to say to me? Tell me.” Pupil Master stood in the void with a cold expression.","He did not see anything unusual about Jian Wushuang. Deep down, although he was vigilant against Jian Wushuang, he was not afraid of him.","After all, he was a Ruler-level expert with the protection of the Supreme True Treasure Armor. He might not even be afraid of a Superior Ruler, let alone a mere Blood Sword Master.","He was not worried that Jian Wushuang would threaten his life. He was only cautious because he was afraid that Jian Wushuang would find an opportunity to beat him up.","“Pupil Master, it has been 5,000 years since the Red Cloud World opened. You have been exploring the Third Continent and searching for True Treasures for the past 5,000 years. You must have obtained a lot of True Treasures, right?” Jian Wushuang asked casually.","“Fortunately, I’ve got something, but it’s nothing compared to you, Blood Sword Master. After all, you’ve got a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure,” Pupil Master said.","“Haha, it’s just luck,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Pupil Master’s eyes darkened, he growled, “Blood Sword Master, didn’t you say you wanted the special treasure in my hand? I’ve been adventuring for so many years, and I’ve gotten a lot of special treasures, but I don’t know which one you’re talking about.”","“There’s no rush. Before we talk about the special treasure, there’s something we need to settle first,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What is it?” Pupil Master looked at Jian Wushuang from a distance of 70,000 miles.","“Of course it’s a grudge between you and me.” Jian Wushuang’s voice sank, “Pupil Master, as far as I know, Star Palace, including the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm, has no grudge with you in the beginning. Even if we fought before, it was only because you didn’t care about your status and attacked the Master Guchi, a subordinate of Star Palace.”","“Yes, I did hurt you in that battle and caused you to lose a lot of face, but that was because you provoked me first. Besides, everyone in this Star Field knows about your character. Losing some face is nothing to you.”","“But in the thousands of years of that battle, you repeatedly attacked our Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances’ Principles Masters in the Red Cloud World. It’s obvious that you deliberately targeted my people. Pupil Master, you won’t deny this, right?”","Jian Wushuang looked straight at Pupil Master.","“I thought you came here for a reason, but it turns out that you’re here to punish me.” Pupil Master sneered, “Blood Sword Master, I admit that you’re extremely talented. No one in the star area is as talented as you, and you’re far stronger than me in terms of strength. Unfortunately, although you’re stronger than me, you can’t kill me.”","“You know my character. Since you have offended me, I will not let you go. I have been merciful over the years. Although I forced the Principles Masters of Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances to hand over their Supreme Treasures, I didn’t kill them.”","“Speaking of which, I have already given you a lot of face.”","“It seems that I have to thank you?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","“There’s no need to thank me. Blood Sword Master, if this is the reason why you came here today, I’ll tell you now. If you want me to give up and not attack the Principles Masters of your Star Palace and the three Freedom Alliances, then it’s easy. Hand over three Pinnacle True Treasures and apologize to me, and I’ll give up.” Pupil Master sneered.","“Three Pinnacle True Treasures?” Jian Wushuang sneered in his heart.","When he had fought Pupil Master, he had forced Pupil Master to hand over three Pinnacle True Treasures to make amends, but Pupil Master refused.","Now, Pupil Master was forcing him to hand over three Pinnacle True Treasures.","He was really reckless.","Although he was sneering in his heart, Jian Wushuang frowned on the surface and said in a low voice, “Pupil Master, you are too much. Do you really want to fight to the death with me?”","“Fight to the death?”","“Haha, Blood Sword Master, you are the Young Palace Master of Star Palace and have a close relationship with the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm. So many people under your command need your protection, but I’m different. I’m alone. As the saying goes, bare feet are not afraid of wearing shoes. You Can’t kill me, so what right do you have to fight to the death with me?” Pupil Master sneered.","“Very good. In that case, there’s nothing to talk about,” Jian Wushuang said.","The reason why he did not continue to talk to Pupil Master was that ten breaths had passed during their conversation.","Temporal Temple Master had sent him a message saying that everything had been arranged.","“Humph, I never wanted to talk to you.” Pupil Master’s voice was cold, “Blood Sword Master, you said that you knew that I had an extremely special treasure and wanted to discuss it with me. Now it seems that you’re just lying to me. In that case, I don’t have time to chat with you. Goodbye.”","After saying that, Pupil Master turned around and was about to leave.","“You want to leave? Can you leave?”","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. A pair of huge black wings suddenly spread out behind him.","Whoosh!","The first layer of power of the Celestial Light Wings was activated instantly. Jian Wushuang turned into a black thunderbolt and streaked across the void.","“Is that...the strongest Flight Type True Treasure?”","Pupil Master’s expression changed the moment he saw the black wings spread out.","Then he saw the black thunderbolt that Jian Wushuang had transformed into.","“So fast!”","“It’s too fast!”","A hint of shock appeared on Pupil Master’s face.","Jian Wushuang’s speed was indeed too fast, so fast that he was shocked.","After all, he was a very strong Primary Ruler, so his speed was not weak. In addition, he had a life-saving secret skill. When he used it, his speed could even rival that of a Superior Ruler in a short time.","But now, Pupil Master found that Jian Wushuang’s speed was even faster than that of a Superior Ruler.","Even if he used his life-saving secret skill, his speed was still no match for Jian Wushuang’s.","This made him give up the idea of using his life-saving secret skill to escape.","Whoosh!","With the help of the Celestial Light Wings, Jian Wushuang crossed 70,000 miles in an instant and appeared in front of Pupil Master.","..."]},{"number":3753,"title":"Chapter 3753 - The True Intention","paragraphs":["Pupil Master was displeased to see Jian Wushuang appear in front of him from 70,000 miles away in an instant, especially the huge black wings on his back.","“His speed after using the strongest Flight Type True Treasure is really terrifying!”","“I wonder where Blood Sword Master got such a treasure.”","Pupil Master clenched his hands.","A Supreme Flight Type True Treasure at this level would be coveted by even a top-tier master, and a low-level master like him could only sigh in admiration. However, a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure like this...had actually been obtained by a Principles Master like Blood Sword Master.","Of course, Pupil Master would be jealous. He was extremely jealous.","Unfortunately, jealousy was jealousy. He also knew that he could not fight for the Supreme Flight Type True Treasure from Jian Wushuang now.","Not to mention him, even an ordinary top-tier Ruler would not be able to do so.","“Pupil Master, the matter has not been resolved. Where do you plan to go in such a hurry?” The black wings on Jian Wushuang’s back emitted a terrifying dark light. His face was cold as he stared at Pupil Master, who was right in front of him.","Pupil Master’s pupils constricted, “Previously, Blood Sword Master was stronger than me, but once I used my life-saving secret skill, I could easily escape. But now, Blood Sword Master has obtained a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure and is faster than ordinary supreme masters. It’s impossible for me to escape with my life-saving secret skill","“However, although I’m no match for him, it’s impossible for him to kill me.”","The Pupil Master was still very confident in his life-saving methods.","However, at this moment...","“Eh?” The Pupil Master’s expression suddenly changed. He had already sensed an unusual fluctuation from the surrounding Temporal.","“This is...Temporal imprisonment? No, it’s not that simple.”","The Pupil Master’s expression finally changed.","Temporal imprisonment, including many unique Temporal methods, was usually used to imitate the escape of others.","But now, the surrounding Temporal had been secretly set up by someone, so the opponent’s target...","“Blood Sword Master, why did you let someone imprison the surrounding Temporal?” Pupil Master shouted coldly.","“Oh, you finally noticed it? But it’s over.” Jian Wushuang smiled and waved his hand. A golden light instantly rushed out and merged into the void above.","Rumble!","The world suddenly shook, and then an ancient and majestic aura slowly descended.","The sky above, which had been rolling with red clouds, suddenly split open, and a brand-new world slowly appeared in front of the world.","This world was beautiful and magnificent, like a fairyland in a painting.","In fact, this world was originally a scroll world.","“Mountain River Map...Nine Dragons Heaven Killing Array, open!”","Boom!","The heaven and earth suddenly trembled. In the painting scroll world above, the nine huge continents in the painting scroll world suddenly erupted with dazzling golden light!","A total of nine dragon spirit golden lights burst out from the nine regions, shooting toward nine different directions in the void below.","In the blink of an eye, a huge golden dragon spirit magic array was formed.","The Mountain River Map was the most powerful suppressing treasure.","The nine-dragon heaven-killing magic array was the most powerful killing move in the Mountain River Map.","This killing move could suppress heaven and earth, suppress powerful enemies, and suppress everything.","Now, under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, the nine-dragon heaven-killing magic array created by the nine dragon spirits was suppressing the void where Jian Wushuang was.","The area around the void was hundreds of thousands of miles wide, and it was all under the suppression of the formation.","Just like the supreme suppression-type Supreme Treasure that Tyrant Axe had taken out to suppress the surrounding void, Jian Wushuang could not leave directly. After the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation suppressed the surrounding void, Pupil Master naturally could not leave the void in a short time.","Unless he could break the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation by force, or if he had a special Temporal True Treasure, he could travel freely in the Red Cloud World.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang had made two preparations. He had asked Temporal Temple Master to set up a Temporal technique in the surroundings. Even if Pupil Master had a special Temporal True Treasure, he could not leave directly.","Therefore, he had only one method left, which was to break the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation by force.","However, the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation was activated by Jian Wushuang’s divine power, which was comparable to that of a Senior Ruler. It even contained a trace of the aura of a universe formation, even a Superior Ruler would not be able to break it in a short time, let alone a mere junior Ruler like Pupil Master.","“The nine-dragon heaven-killing formation and the Temporal technique of Temporal Temple Master have been set up. Pupil Master will not be able to escape from this void for a short time.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining with a bright light, he had calmed down.","Compared to Jian Wushuang, Pupil Master was a little flustered.","“A Suppression Type True Treasure?","“Judging from its aura, it seems to be stronger than an ordinary pinnacle Suppression Type True Treasure. Moreover, it has secretly set up a Temporal technique. Could it be that Blood Sword Master’s purpose is...” A hint of shock flashed in Pupil Master’s eyes, he stared at Jian Wushuang.","In such a situation, it would be foolish if he could not figure out Jian Wushuang’s real intention.","Such a set-up clearly showed that Jian Wushuang’s purpose was not to solve the problem verbally, but to kill him.","“Blood Sword Master, how dare you try to kill me?”","Pupil Master was shocked and furious.","However, his anger only lasted for a moment before he burst into laughter. “Haha, Blood Sword Master, you really dare to try? How dare you, a mere Principles Master, try to kill me?”","“What a joke! What a joke!”","“I am a Master with the Supreme True Treasure Armor. Even a top-tier master might not be able to kill me. Who Do you think you are, Blood Sword Master?”","Jian Wushuang could not be bothered to waste his breath on Pupil Master. His eyes were filled with killing intent.","The moment the nine-dragon Heaven-cleaving formation was set up, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master, who had been hiding in the void, appeared and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","“You’re not the only one. Do you have any helpers?”","Pupil Master sensed the auras of the two masters at once.","“One of them is Temporal Temple Master, and the other should be Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.”","“Humph, a junior master who specializes in Temporal techniques, a senior master, and you, Blood Sword Master. Do the three of them want to keep me here?”","Pupil Master curled his lips slightly. He did not cause the two masters to show any fear.","..."]},{"number":3754,"title":"Chapter 3754 - Suppression of the Realm","paragraphs":["There was nothing to be afraid of.","As a mighty Ruler, he had the protection of the Supreme Treasure Armor, and his life-saving ability was not weak. He was confident that he could protect himself even against a Superior Ruler.","Now, although he had fallen into the trap set by Jian Wushuang and the other two, it was almost impossible for Jian Wushuang and the other two to kill him.","At least, that was what Pupil Master thought.","“He is now completely trapped in the void and can not leave for a short time. However, there are many experts in the Red Cloud World, so someone must have noticed the movement here. Therefore, we should kill Pupil Master as soon as possible,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said in a low voice.","“Okay, let’s do it.”","Jian Wushuang did not waste any more time. With the Netherworld Divine Sword in hand, his power burst out to the maximum.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang pointed his sword out, and in an instant, countless sword shadows lit up in the void.","These sword shadows were densely packed, and each of them exuded a heart-palpitating aura.","Among the countless sword shadows, one was the most dazzling and the most terrifying.","The Sword Shadow was also magnified in the Pupil of the Pupil Master.","The Pupil Master knew that he was no match for Jian Wushuang. However, under such circumstances, he had no choice but to retreat. He saw the red long staff emitting a destructive aura appear in his hand. The red long staff suddenly extended out, then, it furiously smashed toward the most dazzling sword light.","Bang!","The two collided, and the power of the sword shadow was obviously far greater than Pupil Master’s long staff.","Pupil Master’s red long staff was slightly changed by the attack, and his entire body staggered backward.","At this time, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master appeared in the Void.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master held a three-meter-long cyan long saber, which was covered with a layer of dense cyan-purple energy. It followed the cyan battle saber of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","Hua!","The heaven and earth seemed to have been split apart by this blade.","The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was called Heaven-cleaving. His blade technique was as if it could split the heaven and earth. It was extremely tyrannical and terrifying.","Its power was naturally also shockingly strong.","The Pupil Master had just stabilized his body when the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s blade light that seemed to split the heaven and earth ferociously slashed toward him. The Pupil Master could only barely swing the red long staff in his hand to block.","However, Pupil Master let out a muffled groan after the collision.","“What powerful power!”","“It has been many years since this Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master has moved around this Star Field. Previously, it was said that his strength was only at the threshold of Advanced Ruler realm. But now, just the power of this saber strike is probably very powerful even among Advanced Rulers,” Pupil Master thought.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had been in the Fourth Heaven of the Divine Beginning Realm, so he had not been in this Star Field for a long time.","Since he had not been out, no one knew how strong he was.","But after so many years, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s strength had improved, so it was reasonable.","“A Blood Sword Master could easily defeat me, and now there is a Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master?” Pupil Master’s face was unsightly.","He only had the battle strength of a Primary Ruler. Facing two experts of the Advanced Ruler realm at the same time, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was definitely the best among the Advanced Rulers.","When the two of them worked together, Pupil Master could not deal with them at all. He was completely crushed and trampled by the two of them. He had almost no ability to resist.","However, although Pupil Master was crushed and trampled, he had the Supreme True Treasure Armor to protect his body. The power of Jian Wushuang and Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was mostly blocked by his Supreme True Treasure Armor, only a small part of the power actually affected his divine body, and the damage it caused was negligible.","“Haha, Blood Sword Master and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, I’ve said that the two of you can’t kill me alone.” Pupil Master laughed wildly.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s face darkened. “The protective ability of the Supreme True Treasure Armor is really amazing. You and I have suppressed him for so long, and several of our attacks hit him head-on. However, the damage caused to him is still not great, and his divine power is still very abundant.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He could also see that.","When he first met Pupil Master, he had unleashed his strongest strength and used his strongest sword technique, which contained the aura of the universe origin, but it had only barely caused Pupil Master to vomit blood, however, it still did not consume much of his divine power.","Now, although he and Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master were working together, he did not use all of his strength, and the threat that Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master posed to Pupil Master was very limited.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you should have a way, right?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes, watch me.” Jian Wushuang nodded and waved his hand.","“Magic Sand Realm, come out!”","Whoosh! A large amount of black quicksand swept out and instantly covered the entire world, turning it into a sea of black magic sand.","Pupil Master, who was in the middle of the sea of black magic sand, was naturally suppressed by the Magic Sand Realm.","“Is it another pinnacle Domain Type Supreme Treasure?”Pupil Master’s face darkened, not surprised.","When he first met Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang had used the Magic Sand Realm to suppress him.","He did not care. Even if he was suppressed by the realm, the effect was limited. At most, it would weaken his strength slightly.","However, after the Magic Sand Realm appeared and covered the entire world, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold again.","“Mystic Light Realm!”","The secret patterns on the body of the wings lit up instantly. In an instant, a large amount of pitch-black flowing light burst out from the wings.","Like the Magic Sand Realm, the pitch-black flowing light swept out and covered tens of thousands of miles in the blink of an eye.","After these black streamers appeared, they did not have any friction or impulse with the Magic Sand Realm. Instead, they blended perfectly with each other.","The black magic sand was surrounded by a large number of black streamers, filling the heaven and earth.","The Mystic Light Realm and the Magic Sand Realm were a perfect combination!","“Realm, suppress!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice.","In an instant","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The world trembled.","The terrifying power of the realm burst out. The black sand surrounded by flowing light attacked everything crazily, as if it could easily kill the world.","Pupil Master, who was at the core of the realm, was only suppressed by the Magic Sand Realm at first and did not take it to heart. But now, faced with the pressure of the new realm formed by the combination of the Mystic Light Realm and the Magic Sand Realm...instantly...the Pupil Master staggered, and he almost lost his balance.","He could only feel an enormous amount of power pressing down on his body, causing him, as a Ruler, to find it hard to breathe."]},{"number":3755,"title":"Chapter 3755 - Danger","paragraphs":["“How is this possible?”","“How can this domain be so powerful?”","Pupil Master’s expression changed drastically.","He did not care too much about the domain suppression of a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure.","However, now that Mystic Light Realm and Magic Sand Realm were combined, the domain suppression effect was obviously much stronger than that of a normal Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure.","The suppression brought on by the domain was not much weaker than that of a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure.","Pupil Master’s entire body was greatly restricted, and his power was greatly reduced.","Furthermore, the suppression brought on by the domain was not only affecting his power, but his reaction speed and other aspects were also reduced by a level.","However, no matter how strong the suppression of the realm was, it did not affect his protective ability.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang moved.","Swish!","A phantom-like flowing light flashed.","Before Pupil Master could react, Jian Wushuang still appeared by his side. At the same time, the Netherworld Divine Sword had already swept toward him.","“What?” Pupil Master was shocked.","It was too fast. Pupil Master did not manage to catch Jian Wushuang’s figure at all. The cold Netherworld Divine Sword had already struck his body.","Clang!","The sound of metal colliding rang out, and Pupil Master’s body trembled slightly.","This was a direct attack on his divine body. Pupil Master did not use any means or attack to block it. Even though he had the Supreme True Treasure Armor to block 99% of the attack’s power...however, the last part of the power still shook his divine body, causing a trace of blood to flow from the corner of his mouth.","“Blood Sword Master is much stronger than Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master. If I can’t block his swordsmanship in time and it hits me directly, I’ll still be injured.” Pupil Master’s face darkened slightly.","He understood that although his body-protection ability was great, he could not completely ignore Jian Wushuang’s attack.","At the very least, if he did not defend against Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship and relied solely on his divine body, he would still be injured even with the protection of the Supreme True Treasure Armor.","Although the injury was very light, he would be more and more seriously injured and consume more and more divine power.","“Sure enough, even if I don’t have time to use my strongest swordsmanship, I can still hurt him with my full strength, even if I use my swordsmanship casually.” Jian Wushuang also noticed this, he could not help laughing coldly in his heart.","He did not want to kill Pupil Master quickly. As long as he could hurt him, it was enough.","Then...swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","Streams of ghostly flowing light suddenly began to flicker and change in the void.","It was too fast and too strange.","Every time it flickered, it could easily appear in the void 300 meters away, as if it was moving in close proximity.","Pupil Master had released his soul power to the maximum, but he found that his soul power could not keep up with Jian Wushuang’s transformation.","“This, this...” Pupil Master’s eyes widened in shock.","However, Jian Wushuang had already attacked again and again.","Every time he attacked, he relied on the Mystic Light Phantom to move close to him and constantly change his position, so Pupil Master could not react in time.","Although each sword skill he displayed was not his strongest, it was extremely fast and had a strong piercing force. Pupil Master could not defend in time.","Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang!","One after another, the sound of metal colliding could be heard.","Pupil Master had become a living target, surrounded by Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship that came from all directions.","The sword lights were almost unimpeded as they struck Pupil Master head-on.","In a short while, Pupil Master had withstood Jian Wushuang’s dozens of sword lights.","“It’s too terrifying. His movement technique is too terrifying!”","“I can’t block it. I have no time to use my staff technique to block it!”","Pupil Master was shocked.","At first, he was not anxious at all. He thought that Jian Wushuang would not be able to kill him. Even if he joined hands with the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, he would at most be able to trample him.","But now, under the pressure of the terrifying domain, Jian Wushuang’s terrifying movement technique left him with no choice but to stare blankly at Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship.","He was like a living target. No matter how Jian Wushuang attacked, he had no room to resist or resist.","Under such crazy attacks, even with the protection of the Supreme Treasure Armor, each of Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship could only cause limited damage to his divine body. Naturally, he did not care about one or two attacks, however, after dozens or even dozens of such attacks, the damage to his divine body would increase, and his divine power would be slowly consumed.","The most terrifying thing was that he was completely helpless against Jian Wushuang’s attack.","He had tried his best to block Jian Wushuang’s attack, but it was useless.","He did not even touch the corner of Jian Wushuang’s clothes. He could not react to Jian Wushuang’s attack at all.","“How could this be?”","“How could the Blood Sword Master have such incredible movement skills?”","“We’re in big trouble!”","Pupil Master finally became anxious.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master’s eyes lit up when they saw this scene.","“I didn’t expect my little friend, the Heavenly Marquis, to have mastered such a terrifying movement technique. No wonder, no wonder he has such a high chance of killing Pupil Master.” The Temporal Temple Master was excited.","“This movement technique changes time and time again, just like Temporal teleportation. Moreover, it changes directions in an instant and appears in every corner. Such a movement technique is indeed terrifying.” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was also secretly amazed. “As far as I know, Heavenly Sword Marquis has never mastered such a movement technique before. Could it be because of the strongest Flight Type True Treasure?”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master could not help but look at the pair of black wings on Jian Wushuang’s back.","At this moment, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had completely stopped and allowed Jian Wushuang to deal with Pupil Master.","Under the watchful eyes of Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master, Pupil Master was completely unable to withstand Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship. His divine body was damaged time and time again, and his divine power was constantly being depleted. Before long, Pupil Master’s divine power had been depleted by more than 10%, naturally, his aura had weakened a lot.","“There’s hope.”","“If this continues, Pupil Master’s divine power will be exhausted in at most 15 minutes. By then, he’ll definitely die!”","The eyes of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master lit up.","At this moment, they indeed saw hope in Jian Wushuang to kill Pupil Master.","Pupil Master was very clear about the current situation. At the same time, he knew that if this continued, he would really be in danger.","..."]},{"number":3756,"title":"Chapter 3756 - Devil Flame Body","paragraphs":["“This void has been completely suppressed. I have no way to escape. In a head-on battle, this Blood Sword Master is far stronger than me. Especially when he uses that strange movement technique, I have no way to resist. My divine power is being consumed too quickly.”","“No, I can’t continue like this.”","Pupil Master’s gaze was gloomy.","He understood that if this continued, when his divine power was completely exhausted, he would definitely die.","“There’s no other way. I can only use that treasure.” Pupil Master made up his mind. His eyes were filled with shocking killing intent.","“Blood Sword Master, you forced me to do this.”","With a low shout, Pupil Master flipped his hand and took out an item.","“What did he take out?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master, who were standing in the surrounding void, immediately looked at him.","“Is that...a gourd?” Jian Wushuang also saw what Pupil Master took out.","It was a Blood-Red Gourd that was crystal clear.","At first glance, this Blood-Red Gourd was no different from an ordinary gourd. Jian Wushuang could not immediately sense anything special from it.","However, when Pupil Master looked at the Blood-Red Gourd in his hand, his eyes turned scarlet.","It was a feeling of fanaticism and madness.","It was as if what he was holding in his hand was not a gourd, but an ultimate treasure that could shake heaven and earth. It was enough to make Pupil Master disregard everything.","“Pupil Master is so conspicuous that he was almost forced into a desperate situation by me. At this time, he took out this gourd...what exactly is in the gourd?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Haha, baby, my baby, wake up.”","Pupil Master let out a cold laugh, which echoed in the surrounding void. At the same time, he opened the stopper of the Blood-Red Gourd.","Suddenly...a suffocating and terrifying power suddenly burst out of the Blood-Red Gourd.","It was a pitch-black and boundless flame, which was cold enough to make Rulers tremble.","It erupted from the Blood-Red Gourd. In an instant, the void of the Red Cloud World seemed to be unable to withstand the power of this black flame, and it actually collapsed.","Soon after, a large amount of black flame wildly danced, and it actually surged toward Pupil Master’s body.","In the blink of an eye, Pupil Master’s entire body was enveloped by that monstrous black flame, and his body expanded by a full circle.","Buzz!","A suffocating and terrifying aura spread out from Pupil Master’s body, directly suppressing the entire scene.","The impact of this terrifying aura actually greatly affected the magic sand Mystic Light Realm that had been filling the surroundings, greatly reducing the suppression effect of the domain.","“This is?” Jian Wushuang looked at Pupil Master in surprise.","Not only him, but also the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were also shocked.","They could not believe that the person standing in front of them was Pupil Master?","Although his body had completely changed, his aura had undergone a tremendous change. Originally, Pupil Master was only a Primary Ruler, although he was slightly stronger, his divine power aura was at most close to that of a High Ruler.","But now, under the cover of the black flames, this Pupil Master’s Divine power aura had increased by several times. That terrifying and monstrous aura was definitely much stronger than that of an ordinary High Ruler. Even when compared to a Peak Ruler...the difference did not seem to be too great.","Not only his divine power aura, even the Pupil Master’s soul origin aura seemed to have undergone some slight changes at this moment.","“Blood Sword Master!”","A low roar came out of Pupil Master’s mouth. Blue veins popped up on his face, and his face was completely distorted. His eyes were filled with unprecedented anger, “You’re just a Principles Master, but you forced me to use my treasure and summon the Devil Flame Body. Even if I die, I should be proud.”","“Devil Flame Body?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Go to hell.” A fierce light flashed in Pupil Master’s eyes, and the red long staff in his hand was instantly thrown out in anger.","Boom!","The air was forcefully torn apart.","The red long staff, which was emitting an endless destructive aura, burst out with a speed and power that was several times faster than before. In a flash, it appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was secretly shocked. He could use the Mystic Light Phantom to resist, but on second thought, he chose to swing the Netherworld Divine Sword to meet it directly.","“Starfire Burning Sun!”","Whoosh!","An extremely violent sword light fiercely slashed out and directly collided with the red longstaff shadow.","With this collision, Jian Wushuang immediately sensed the extremely powerful power from the Netherworld Divine Sword.","Under the impact of this power, he staggered back a few steps.","Of course, Pupil Master also retreated, but he only retreated three steps before he stopped again.","“This...” Jian Wushuang was a little confused.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were also shocked.","Pupil Master was only a Primary Ruler.","5,000 years ago, when Jian Wushuang first met Pupil Master, he could easily defeat him.","The second time they met was during the battle for the Celestial Light Wings. Jian Wushuang could easily defeat him with the help of Ruler Tyrant Axe.","In terms of strength, Jian Wushuang was much stronger than Pupil Master.","Everyone knew this.","But now?","Jian Wushuang had a head-on collision with Pupil Master, but Pupil Master had the slight advantage?","The moment Pupil Master used the Devil Flame Body, his strength had increased to such an extent?","“He seems to have grasped more power than me. There’s no need to fight him head-on.”","Although Jian Wushuang was shocked by Pupil Master’s sudden increase in strength, he was still calm. He quickly attacked again.","This time, he did not choose to fight the Pupil Master head-on. Instead, he used the Mystic Light Phantom and used his movement skills to move around and attack the surroundings.","The strength of the Pupil Master, who was possessed by the Devil Flame Body, had increased dramatically. He was almost a Superior Ruler. However, even though his strength had greatly increased, he was still a living target in front of Jian Wushuang’s terrifying movement skills.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","Streams of cold sword light mercilessly bombarded Pupil Master’s body.","Just like before, Pupil Master was completely unable to withstand Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship.","However, with the Devil Flame Body, the layer of black flames on the surface of his body also contained an extremely powerful protective effect.","Any attack from Jian Wushuang would be weakened by the layer of black flames, and the damage to the divine body of the Pupil Master would be even less."]},{"number":3757,"title":"Chapter 3757 - Competition of Consumption?","paragraphs":["“Haha, Blood Sword Master, do you only dare to fight me with your movement skills?","“You’re just like a fly, flying around without any interest. If you have the ability, fight me head-on.” Pupil Master laughed, however, as he laughed, his face became more and more ferocious and twisted.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and continued to attack.","The divine body of the Pupil Master would still be damaged and his divine power would still be consumed.","However, the rate of consumption was much slower than before.","“It’s too slow. At this rate, it will take at least four hours for his divine power to be completely consumed.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Haha, Blood Sword Master, aren’t you strong? But your swordsmanship is just scratching my itch. You want to kill me with such strength?","“What a joke.” Pupil Master continued to sneer.","“Pupil Master, you’re just borrowing a trump card. Even if you have a trump card, you’re still a living target in front of me. You’ll only be trampled by me. What’s there to be proud of?” Jian Wushuang sneered at the same time, “Besides, even if you use the Devil Flame Body to make it much more difficult for me to kill you, it’ll only take me a little more time.”","“Since you’re trapped in this void, there’s no way for you to escape. Let’s waste our time. I won’t be able to kill you in a short time, but I don’t believe you can hold on for another four or two hours.”","...","“One or two hours?” Pupil Master’s gaze sank, following which, he smiled and said, “Blood Sword Master, do you think that this seat is easy to fool?","“You are currently controlling two Domain Type techniques at the same time, as well as that suppression-type magic array. Furthermore, you have been using such a terrifying movement technique to execute sword techniques to kill me time and time again. Although my divine power is indeed being depleted after each attack, the consumption of your divine power is even greater!","“You are only a Principles Master. Even if your divine power is greater than that of an ordinary Principles Master, how vast can it be? Can you hold on for four hours?”","What Pupil Master said was the truth.","Jian Wushuang was using too many techniques.","He was controlling the Mountain River Map to use the nine dragons heaven-killing formation, the Mystic Light Realm and the Magic Sand Realm at the same time. He was also using the Mystic Light Phantom Formation in the Celestial Light Wings to move closer and closer, he kept looking for opportunities to hurt Pupil Master.","All of these methods required a vast amount of divine power.","Even a real Ruler would not be able to hold on for long with so many powerful methods, let alone a Principles Master. His divine power would be completely exhausted.","However, Pupil Master did not know that Jian Wushuang was a special life form.","Moreover, he was a perfect special life-form. When his life level reached the perfect stage, his divine power was far more abundant than that of a Ruler.","It was impossible for other Principles Masters and Rulers to last for four hours with so many techniques. However, Jian Wushuang could definitely hold on.","Jian Wushuang had even calculated that if he continued to use up his divine power at this rate, he would at most use up 30% of his divine power after four hours.","In that case, what was there to worry about?","“Pupil Master, let’s see who can last until the end.” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and sped up his attack.","“Humph!” Pupil Master snorted and tried to block Jian Wushuang’s attack. He also tried to counterattack.","However, in the face of Jian Wushuang’s movement skills, it was all in vain.","An hour passed quickly.","During this hour, Jian Wushuang had never stopped attacking Pupil Master. During this time, he had used countless sword skills to attack Pupil Master head-on.","However, even after such a fierce storm of attacks, Pupil Master’s Divine Power had only been used up by 40%.","However, the consumption of 40% of his divine power caused Pupil Master’s expression to change again.","“Blood Sword Master used so many techniques at the same time and kept attacking me like a storm. Logically speaking, his divine power should have been used up long ago. However, judging from his current appearance, his divine power is still very abundant.”","While Pupil Master was enduring Jian Wushuang’s sword skill attack, he was also observing Jian Wushuang.","He wanted to wait for Jian Wushuang’s divine power to be used up, but after waiting for an hour, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was still abundant, and the storm-like attack did not stop.","“Monster, Blood Sword Master is really a monster.” Pupil Master cursed in his heart, but he still did not show any fear.","“Blood Sword Master, it seems that I underestimated you. Your divine power is abundant, and I’m afraid I can’t compete with you in terms of consumption. But even so, you’re still not good enough to kill me.” Pupil Master sneered.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","How could Pupil Master be so confident at this critical moment?","Could it be that he still had other trump cards that he had not used?","But Pupil Master’s trump cards were already terrifying enough. It was unlikely that he would use other trump cards?","If he did not have other trump cards, how could Pupil Master be confident that he could survive?","Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","But at this moment, Temporal Temple Master, who was standing in the void, suddenly changed his expression, he quickly said, “My young friend, a Principles Master of the Temporal Temple just reported that he saw Ruler Hong thousands of miles away from us. Ruler Hong was very fast and travel-worn. It seems that he is coming toward us.”","“What?”","Jian Wushuang and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s expressions changed.","Ruler Hong?","He was rushing toward them?","“Haha, is he finally coming?”","After hearing the words of the Temporal Temple Master, Pupil Master burst into laughter, “Blood Sword Master, I have to say that the means you have set up this time are indeed very impressive. You immediately sealed my chance of escape. Your strength and the means you have prepared are even more powerful. If I didn’t have a treasure to protect my body, I might have been killed by you.”","“But unfortunately, no matter how many plans you made, you made a mistake. I wasn’t killed by you in a short period of time, and when you attacked me, you must have discovered many things in the surrounding void space. This news naturally spread within the Red Cloud World, and it naturally reached Ruler Hong’s ears.”","“Ruler Hong, although he doesn’t have a very deep friendship with me, he once owed me a favor by chance. I still have his transmission token in my hand. Even though I can’t send a message because you’ve completely sealed off Temporal, Ruler Hong knows that my life is in danger, so he will still come to save me.”","..."]},{"number":3758,"title":"Chapter 3758 - The Strongest Trump Card","paragraphs":["“We’re in big trouble!”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master’s faces turned extremely ugly.","Ruler Hong was an extremely ancient and powerful Ruler.","In terms of combat strength, although he had not reached the level of a Superior Ruler, he was definitely the strongest among the Advanced Rulers.","The most important thing was that Ruler Hong was extremely difficult to deal with.","Like Jian Wushuang, Ruler Hong’s body protection ability was extremely strong. However, Jian Wushuang’s body protection ability was famous because of his body protection swordsmanship.","Once the earth protection was activated, even a Superior Ruler would not be able to break it.","And Ruler Hong’s body protection ability relied on his divine body.","Ruler Hong was a member of the golden stone race, which was extremely rare among the special races.","The golden stone race was not good at attacking, but their godly bodies were innately powerful. After reaching the level of a Senior Ruler, Ruler Hong’s divine body was definitely much stronger than that of many other top-tier Rulers. Moreover, he had once obtained an extremely powerful divine body secret technique from the three great battlefields, by chance, he had obtained an extremely powerful divine body secret technique, which had made his divine body even more terrifying.","...","Although he did not have a Supreme True Treasure Armor to protect his body, it was only a Pinnacle True Treasure Armor, but it was still enough to give many top Rulers a headache.","He had once fought with two top Rulers, but the two top Rulers could not do anything to him.","Such a powerful and powerful Ruler who could protect his body was about to defend the battlefield, and he was the Pupil Master’s helper?","This was not good news for Jian Wushuang and the others.","“With the speed of Ruler Hong, we should be able to cover an area of 10,000 kilometers in a short time. With the help of Ruler Hong, we won’t have a chance to kill Pupil Master,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened.","Jian Wushuang had not expected that Ruler Hong would come.","Emperor Hong’s reputation in this Star Field was not good. He had offended many experts and forces, and he had never heard of any close friends.","However, he did not expect Emperor Hong to owe him a favor. Moreover, Emperor Hong happened to be adventuring in the Third Continent, so he was able to come in such a short time.","“What should we do?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master frowned.","“My young friend, why don’t we leave now? We’ll think of another way next time,” Temporal Temple Master said.","If they left now, both Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master would be very unwilling.","However, they could not do anything about it. They did not know where Ruler Hong had obtained such a powerful trump card, which was enough to last him for a long time. Judging from the current situation...before Jian Wushuang killed Pupil Master, Ruler Hong must have arrived long ago.","“Haha, Blood Sword Master, aren’t you going to give up?” Pupil Master’s body was burning with flames, but his eyes were filled with unprecedented madness.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He stared at Pupil Master and felt his aura.","“It was not easy to force Pupil Master to this point. If I give up now, he will be extremely vigilant next time. It will be difficult to find such a good opportunity to kill him in the future,” Jian Wushuang muttered, the next moment, he made a decision. “It seems that I can only use that move.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a fierce light as he followed his thoughts.","Buzz!","The void shook slightly.","A large amount of black air flow suddenly swept up and covered the surrounding void in the blink of an eye.","The sky was dark.","Without the blood clouds above and without the light, the entire world fell into absolute darkness.","Silence!","The entire world was silent.","“This, this is?”","Pupil Master was still standing in front of the void, but at this moment, he was looking around in shock.","Not only him, but also the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master in the void were stunned.","They did not know what had happened, but as Rulers, they could clearly sense that the world was very different from before.","They even felt that they were no longer in the world or even the universe.","“That’s the aura of the universal principles!”","“This is a technique that contains the universal principles? Oh my God.”","Both Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were stunned.","Although they were on the same side as Jian Wushuang, their relationship with Jian Wushuang was needless to say.","However, they did not know much about some of Jian Wushuang’s trump cards.","For example, they did not know about Jian Wushuang’s current move.","Now that they saw Jian Wushuang’s move, they were shocked by the extremely rich universal principles that filled the surrounding area.","“Innate divine power, primal universe!”","Jian Wushuang stood in the center of the darkness and completely merged with the surrounding darkness. There was a hint of excitement on his face.","Primal universe...it was an innate divine power that was given to him by the arrival of the universe principles.","This move was Jian Wushuang’s strongest trump card.","Ever since he obtained this innate divine power, he had never really used it. He did not even have the chance to experience the power of the primal universe, let alone use it on others.","Until now, Jian Wushuang had only used this move to kill Pupil Master.","Once the original universe appeared, the vast void covered by the black airflow was completely under Jian Wushuang’s control.","Jian Wushuang already had a sense of absolute control. This feeling of control was like a thought from him. If there were any Principles Masters in the original universe, he could annihilate them instantly, leaving nothing behind.","At the same time, he had merged with the original universe, and his overall strength had reached a new level.","“This feeling is so powerful. It’s as if I can do anything.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, feeling extremely excited.","However, he did not forget what he should do now.","“Ten breaths!”","“The original universe only lasts for ten breaths!”","“I must kill him within ten breaths!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with killing intent.","As soon as he performed the Mystic Light Phantom movement technique, he appeared beside Pupil Master like a ghost.","Previously, Pupil Master was helpless against Jian Wushuang’s movement technique when he was not in the original universe. Now, there was no room for him to resist.","“Fall to the Underworld!”","Jian Wushuang struck out with his sword.","It was cold and merciless, as if it could tear everything in front of it apart.","Jian Wushuang’s most powerful strike, the sword light, contained a trace of the aura of universe principles.","With the support of the primitive universe, the cold and merciless sword light struck Pupil Master directly."]},{"number":3759,"title":"Chapter 3759 - Final Kill","paragraphs":["Hualala!","The terrifying sword light, which could tear everything apart, struck Pupil Master’s Supreme True Treasure Armor. Even the Supreme True Treasure Armor left a deep white mark under the sword light, at the same time, a strong power passed through the Supreme True Treasure Armor and struck Pupil Master’s divine body.","“What?”","Pupil Master stared at Jian Wushuang.","He was shocked to find that Jian Wushuang’s sword had directly destroyed three percent of his divine power.","After he summoned the Devil Flame, his protective ability had greatly increased. Previously, Jian Wushuang had used so many sword skills, but each sword skill had consumed less than one-thousandth of his divine power. Because of this...he had only consumed 40% of his divine power in the past hour.","But now, Jian Wushuang had destroyed 3% of his divine power with one sword move?","In other words, the power of Jian Wushuang’s sword light was dozens of times stronger than before?","“The battle strength of a Superior Ruler!”","“Only a Superior Ruler is qualified to use an attack, and it’s a Superior Ruler who is good at killing!”","...","Pupil Master was completely panicking.","He had the Supreme True Treasure Armor and the Devil Flame Body.","Even if he encountered an ordinary Superior Ruler, he would not be too afraid.","Although Jian Wushuang did not have the battle strength of a Superior Ruler, his movement skills were too excessive. He could not defend against the sword skills that he used to constantly move close to him, so he could only become a live target, therefore, the threat that Jian Wushuang posed to him before was slightly stronger than that of an ordinary Superior Ruler.","However, he could still face such a threat.","But now...Jian Wushuang’s attack power instantly increased by dozens of times, reaching the level of a Superior Ruler.","This was definitely a demon for him.","“Pupil Master, die!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his teeth and used his Mystic Light Phantom movement to attack at lightning speed.","Strange and powerful sword lights slashed toward Pupil Master one after another. With the support of the primitive universe, the power of his swordsmanship, even if it was just an ordinary swordsmanship, had reached the level of a Superior Ruler. However, such a swordsmanship...Pupil Master could not even block them. He could only rely on his divine body to resist them.","As a result, the sword lights bombarded him, and Pupil Master’s godly power was consumed dozens of times faster than before.","After all, he only had about 50 percent of his godly power left.","“No, no!”","“Stop! Blood Sword Master, stop!”","Pupil Master was finally anxious and terrified.","He could clearly feel that his divine power was flowing at a crazy speed, but he could neither stop nor change it.","However, Jian Wushuang had no intention of stopping.","After three breaths, Pupil Master only had 30% of his divine power left.","After six breaths, Pupil Master only had 10% of his divine power left.","It was the eighth breath.","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with killing intent. He slashed out with the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand with unprecedented violence.","The sword light struck the Pupil Master’s divine body brutally.","“No! !”","The Pupil Master let out a hysterical roar. His eyes were wide open, full of fear and despair.","This sword attack destroyed the last part of his divine power, and his voice was immediately cut off.","“Whew!”","“Is he finally dead?”","Seeing Pupil Master’s voice cut off, Jian Wushuang let out a sigh of relief. He had to admit that Pupil Master was indeed very difficult to deal with. He had used all his means to kill him.","After such a long battle, especially when he had just activated the original universe, he had expended a lot of divine power.","Of course, although he had consumed a lot of divine power, his combat strength was still at its peak.","“Let’s go.”","With a thought, Jian Wushuang restrained the surrounding original universe.","The dark and boundless original universe quickly disappeared and returned to its original appearance.","Then, Jian Wushuang came to the void where the Pupil Master had died. There was a red long rod, armor, and an interspatial ring floating there.","These were all left by the Pupil Master. As for his divine body, it naturally collapsed with his death.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and put all the things left by the Pupil Master into his interspatial ring. He was deep in thought.","“Pupil Master is not very strong and is only a Primary Ruler, but his life-saving ability is amazing. He also has a lot of trump cards, especially the Devil Flame Body, which he activated at the end. It seems that he has had a lot of opportunities in the three battlefields. I’ll check his interspatial ring later.”","Jian Wushuang had killed a Primary Ruler before.","The three Primary Rulers of Devil Cloud Star had died at his hands. Jian Wushuang had checked their interspatial rings, but he did not find anything.","The three Rulers of Devil Cloud Star were not weak, but their trump cards seemed to be ordinary.","However, Pupil Master’s life-saving ability and trump cards were extraordinary.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","“My young friend, Heavenly Marquis.”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were already walking toward Jian Wushuang.","“Amazing.”","As soon as Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master came to Jian Wushuang, he could not help but exclaim in admiration, “What kind of skill did you just use to increase your strength so much? Pupil Master still has about 50% of his divine power left, but you killed him in such a short time?”","“My young friend, if I’m not mistaken, what you just used should be a unique secret skill, right?” Temporal Temple Master looked over.","Jian Wushuang could not help smiling when he saw their questions, “To tell you the truth, after I refined the small astral world formed by the seven-star divine realm, the universe principles personally descended on me. At that time, the universe principles not only gave me a powerful willpower, but also gave me an innate divine power.”","“What I just displayed was the innate divine power given by the universe principles.”","“Innate divine power?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master looked at each other with a trace of panic and amazement in their eyes.","“No wonder it’s so amazing. So it was given by the universe principles personally.” Temporal Temple Master sighed softly, but there was a trace of unconcealable envy between his brows.","Seeing this...Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “You don’t have to be envious. Although my innate divine power is amazing, it also has some limitations. For example, it can only be used once every 12 hours, and it can only last for 10 breaths at most.”","“10 breaths? That’s not bad.” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master smiled and said.","He and the Temporal Temple Master could understand that such a powerful innate ability would be too abnormal if it didn’t have any restrictions.","..."]},{"number":3760,"title":"Chapter 3760 - Ruler Hong","paragraphs":["In the void, Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master were chatting casually.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master were both praising Jian Wushuang’s amazing innate skill.","Jian Wushuang knew that the innate skill given by the universe principles was indeed terrifying. After using the primitive universe, his strength could increase to the level of a Superior Ruler in a short period of time. In addition, he could also use the Mystic Light Phantom movement technique, under normal circumstances, he could easily kill a Superior Ruler.","It was because of this trump card that he dared to say that he had a 60% chance of killing Pupil Master.","“Eh? Ruler Hong is here.” Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master also looked toward the void not far away. There, a figure rushed over and appeared in front of them in the blink of an eye.","Ruler Hong had rushed over in a hurry.","He was a man of his word. In this Star Field, his character was well known.","Even though Ruler Hong didn’t like many things that the Pupil Master had done in this Star Field, he didn’t have much of a relationship with Ruler Hong before.","However, it was a fact that he owed the Pupil Master a favor.","That favor was in a dangerous place in the Quicksand Demon Realm, one of the three battlefields. They met halfway and were both involved in a great crisis. In that crisis, Ruler Hong almost died, it was Pupil Master’s help that allowed him to escape.","Ruler Hong had always remembered this favor.","Therefore, when he was adventuring in the Third Continent and learned that Pupil Master was besieged by Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master, he rushed here as fast as he could.","......","His purpose was to save Pupil Master and return the favor.","However, when he arrived in the void, there were only Jian Wushuang and the other two in front of him.","“Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, the Principles Master with the sword on his back should be Blood Sword Master. They are all here, but what about Pupil Master?” Ruler Hong narrowed his eyes and stared at the three in front of him, he had a bad premonition.","“Ruler Hong, you are here for Pupil Master, right?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Hong and said with a smile, “Unfortunately, you are too late. Just now, Pupil Master was killed by the three of us.”","“Killed?” Ruler Hong was shocked and said, “Pupil Master was killed by you?”","“Why? Don’t you believe me?” Jian Wushuang smiled and took out something. “This thing in my hand was left by Pupil Master. Ruler Hong, you must know it.”","Jian Wushuang took out Pupil Master’s most powerful Attack Type True Treasure, the red long stick.","Seeing the red long stick, Ruler Hong’s Pupils constricted. He no longer had any doubts.","Since Jian Wushuang had taken the Supreme Treasure magic weapon he had used, Pupil Master was naturally dead.","“As soon as I got the news that Pupil Master was killed by the three of you, I rushed here as fast as I could. I thought that with Pupil Master’s strength and skills, he would be able to hold out for a long time before I arrived. I didn’t expect that I would be late in the end.” Ruler Hong sighed softly.","He was also quite surprised.","He knew more or less about Pupil Master’s strength and methods. He had even seen him use his most powerful trump card once.","He knew that even a superior master might not be able to kill Pupil Master.","However, he was surprised that the three of them had killed Pupil Master together.","“Ruler Hong, I heard that you owe Pupil Master a favor. You came here to save him. But now that Pupil Master has died in our hands, do you want to avenge him?” Jian Wushuang suddenly asked.","“Revenge?” Ruler Hong shook his head, but his expression was extremely cold, “It’s true that I owe Pupil Master a favor, but it doesn’t mean that I have a deep friendship with him. This time, when I knew that he was in danger, I rushed here immediately. Although I didn’t save him in time, I did my best to repay him.”","“As for who killed him, it has nothing to do with me. Naturally, I can’t avenge him.”","Ruler Hong said this with a clear conscience.","He did try his best to come to the rescue as quickly as possible, but he couldn’t be blamed for not being able to catch up.","As for avenging Pupil Master, it was certainly impossible.","“Since the dust has settled, I’ll stay a little longer. Farewell, the three of you.” Ruler Hong cupped his hands to Jian Wushuang and the other two, then turned and left.","“Ruler Hong is very direct.” Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh.","“Haha, although Ruler Hong owes Pupil Master a favor, he is a good person. Many Rulers in this Star Field look down on Pupil Master. They think that Pupil Master doesn’t care about his status at all, which is a disgrace to the Rulers. I’m afraid Ruler Hong is no exception.” Temporal Temple Master laughed.","“He came to save Pupil Master because of that favor, but in his heart, he probably doesn’t think much of Pupil Master.”","“I guess so.”","Jian Wushuang and Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master looked at each other and smiled.","“Well, Pupil Master is dead. We’ve achieved our goal. Let’s leave this place first,” Jian Wushuang said.","The three of them immediately withdrew the suppression and Temporal seal on the surrounding void and left.","...","In the Red Cloud World, when Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master ganged up to kill Pupil Master, they caused quite a stir. Many Principles Masters had already noticed it.","Because of the nine-dragon heaven-slaying formation, these Principles Masters were far away from the battlefield and could not record the scene of the battle through a mirror image. However, the battle was about to end, they could all sense it.","Pupil Master died in this battle.","The news spread throughout Red Cloud World and even the entire Star Field.","Red Cloud World and countless great beings in this Star Field were shocked when they heard the news.","“What? Pupil Master is dead?”","“How is that possible? Not only is Pupil Master a powerful low-level Ruler, but he also has a Supreme True Treasure Armor protecting him. Even a top-tier Ruler might not be able to kill him, right?”","“I know, right? But Pupil Master didn’t die at the hands of a top-tier Ruler. Instead, he died at the hands of Blood Sword Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Temporal Temple Master.”","“It is said that Blood Sword Master and the other two had set up a trap in advance to suppress the void space. At the same time, they had completely sealed the space and time, so Pupil Master didn’t have any chance to escape. Then the three of them worked together and fought for more than an hour before they killed Pupil Master.”"]},{"number":3761,"title":"Chapter 3761 - The Strangest Part","paragraphs":["As the news of Pupil Master’s death spread, it caused quite a stir in the entire Star Field.","However, due to the suppression of heaven and earth and the complete confinement of time and space, the surrounding Principles Masters could only watch from afar. The distance was too far. Forget recording the mirror images, even the specific scenes of the fierce battle...no one knew. Therefore, they could only guess how Pupil Master was killed by Jian Wushuang and the other two.","However, they were sure that after this battle, the understanding of Jian Wushuang among the experts in the Star Field had increased by another level.","It was normal that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were not very strong, so they could not kill Pupil Master. However, Jian Wushuang had previously suppressed the Ruler Tyrant Axe and Pupil Master, in terms of strength, he was one of the strongest among the Advanced Rulers.","It could be imagined that Jian Wushuang was the absolute main force among the three people who had killed Pupil Master.","It was a mystery as to how he had killed Pupil Master.","...","In the void millions of miles away from the battlefield where they had killed Pupil Master, Jian Wushuang and the other two had stopped.","Jian Wushuang landed on the ground.","“Pupil Master has been roaming the three battlefields for many years. He has ignored his status and dignity many times to deal with the Principles Master and seize Supreme Treasures and opportunities. After so many years of accumulation, he must have an extraordinary wealth and a lot of treasures. Heaven Marquis, please check it out,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and immediately took out the things left by Pupil Master.","The red long stick and the Supreme Treasure Armor on Pupil Master’s body were both Supreme Treasures.","Jian Wushuang did not need the long stick at all. He just took a glance at it and put it into his interspatial ring.","......","The Supreme Treasure Armor was the real purpose of the three of them to kill Pupil Master. Now that Pupil Master was dead, the Supreme Treasure Armor fell into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","After all, his body-protection ability was extremely powerful. If he had another Supreme Treasure Armor, it would be even more amazing.","“It’s not easy to refine the Supreme Treasure. It will take me some time to refine this Supreme Treasure Armor.” Jian Wushuang integrated his consciousness into the Supreme Treasure Armor, he had a general understanding of the requirements to refine the Supreme True Treasure Armor.","These requirements were not difficult for him, but it would take some time.","“There’s no rush. Let’s see what good things are in Pupil Master’s interspatial ring first.”","Jian Wushuang began to search Pupil Master’s interspatial ring with a hint of expectation in his heart.","Pupil Master was indeed a Ruler who had roamed this Star Field for so long and did not care about his reputation. There were hundreds of Supreme True Treasures in his interspatial ring.","“My God, there are hundreds of universe True Treasures. Pupil Master is really rich,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master could not help exclaiming.","“Although these hundreds of True Treasures are universe True Treasures, they are not too high-end. There are only three top-tier True Treasures and only a dozen top-tier True Treasures. The rest are only elementary and high-level True Treasures. He doesn’t need most of them himself, and he doesn’t have any sect forces or disciples. Why would he need so many True Treasures?” Jian Wushuang had a strange look on his face.","When one’s power reached the level of a Ruler, especially a Ruler who was extremely powerful, it would be easier to deal with him if he was a leader of a sect and had many disciples under his command, what was the use of having so many True Treasures?","Besides, most of the time, Pupil Master would lower his status to deal with some Principles Masters to get them.","He didn’t need some True Treasures at all, so why would he do that?","“Maybe Pupil Master wants to collect more True Treasures and exchange them for higher-level ones in the Nine Emperor Pavilion?” Temporal Temple Master said.","“That’s possible.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“Heavenly Marquis, what else do you see in Pupil Master’s interspatial ring besides these True Treasures?” Temporal Temple Master asked.","“There are a lot of things. There are all kinds of treasures, elixirs, and some secret skills. There seem to be several in this interspatial ring,” Jian Wushuang said as he took out the treasures and secret skills that could attract his attention, he took them out one by one.","Although some of the treasures were rare and precious, they did not attract the attention of Jian Wushuang and the other two.","On the contrary, one or two of the secret skills were not bad. For example, the secret skills that Pupil Master had used previously, which could increase one’s strength in an instant, were in this interspatial ring, they were recorded on a token.","“These secret skills are not bad. It’s a good choice to leave them for Star Palace or the Divine Beginning Realm.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then he suddenly frowned and said, “It’s strange. I killed the three Rulers of the Devil Cloud Star, so they should have more secret skills. However, they don’t have any secret skills that I like in their interspatial rings.”","“Haha, it’s easy to understand. Although the three Rulers of the Devil Cloud Star have a greater background than the Pupil Master, most of the secret skills they cultivate are already available in the Devil Cloud Star. As expected, the way they get the secret skills is through self-comprehension. They leave them directly in people’s minds. The secret skills stored in the token of the Pupil Master must have been obtained in the dangerous places in the three battlefields.”","“Many of the dangerous places in the three battlefields have great origins. However, they have lost their inheritances, so there are no restrictions on these secret skills,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood, then he continued, “There is another strange thing. Pupil Master’s interspatial ring contains all kinds of strange treasures, elixirs, and secret skills, but why is there no special crystal stone among them?”","“Special crystal stone?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were surprised.","“There’s not a single special crystal stone in the interspatial ring?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked in puzzlement.","“No.” Jian Wushuang shook his head. “Normally, even an ordinary Principles Master would have some special crystal stones in his interspatial ring, but the quality is different. Pupil Master, on the other hand, has roamed the Red Cloud World for 5,000 years, not to mention how long he has roamed the three battlefields.”","“In the past 5,000 years, he has killed quite a number of Principles Masters. He has even obtained their interspatial rings. Don’t tell me that there isn’t even a special crystal in their interspatial rings?”"]},{"number":3762,"title":"Chapter 3762","paragraphs":["Pupil Master had roamed the Red Cloud World for 5,000 years. He had killed at least a dozen Principles Masters, right?","How could these ten Principles Masters not have a single special crystal in their possession? Forget about those extremely high-level and extremely rare special crystals, but there should at least be some of those relatively ordinary special crystals, right?","“My dear Heaven Marquis, quickly check if there are any other special treasures in the Pupil Master’s interspatial ring,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and immediately began to check the treasures one by one.","In the blink of an eye, half a day passed.","During this half a day, Jian Wushuang carefully checked all the treasures in the Pupil Master’s interspatial ring. After checking, there was only one treasure that Jian Wushuang was completely unable to figure out.","This treasure was the crystal-clear Blood-Red Gourd.","It was also the treasure gourd that Pupil Master mentioned.","“This gourd...is that the treasure that Pupil Master took out earlier?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master looked over.","“I’ve carefully counted all the treasures left by Pupil Master. I know almost all the uses of those treasures, but I can’t see through the Blood-Red Gourd,” Jian Wushuang said.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master also stared at the Blood-Red Gourd in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","On the surface, the Blood-Red Gourd did not seem to be anything special. Except for a little crystal, it looked very ordinary.","Even when their consciousness covered the Blood-Red Gourd, they did not receive any information.","......","However, the more they looked at it, the more they felt that the Blood-Red Gourd was extraordinary.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, try to recognize this gourd as your master,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“This Blood-Red Gourd is so extraordinary. I’m afraid it won’t be easy to recognize it as your master,” Jian Wushuang said, but he still tried to recognize the gourd as his master.","In the end, he actually succeeded in recognizing the Blood-Red Gourd as his master.","“So easy?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Under normal circumstances, the more powerful the treasure, the more difficult it would be to refine and recognize its master.","For the most powerful Supreme Treasures, the threshold to refine and recognize their master was very high.","The value of the Blood-Red Gourd might not be comparable to that of the most powerful Supreme Treasure, but judging from the Devil Flame Body that Pupil Master had summoned from the gourd, the Blood-Red Gourd should be very powerful, Jian Wushuang did not expect that the refinement of the Blood-Red Gourd would be so simple.","In just an instant, it was successfully refined.","However, what made Jian Wushuang feel strange was that although he had recognized the Blood-Red Gourd as his master, he still did not receive any specific information about it, he only felt an unprecedented heat and madness from the Blood-Red Gourd.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","The Blood-Red Gourd began to tremble crazily.","“What’s going on?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master frowned.","“My young friend, what’s wrong with the gourd?” Temporal Temple Master also looked over.","“I don’t know what’s going on either, but I can feel that the gourd is very excited and eager, and this desire comes from me. It’s as if I have something that can make it go crazy,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You have something that can make the gourd go crazy?” Temporal Temple Master raised his eyebrows. “What is it?”","“I don’t know.” Jian Wushuang shook his head. Then, he flipped his hand and took out items from his interspatial ring.","He took out some genius treasures, elixirs, and Supreme Treasures, but the Blood-Red Gourd remained unmoved.","When Jian Wushuang took out a purple crystal, the Blood-Red Gourd immediately approached him with great intelligence.","“Crystal? It wants a crystal?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, after pondering for a moment, he opened the stopper of the Blood-Red Gourd and put the purple crystal into the mouth of the gourd. In an instant, a powerful devouring power erupted from the gourd and directly swallowed the purple crystal.","After swallowing the purple crystal, the gourd began to tremble again. Obviously, he still wanted it.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang and the other two looked strange.","“Now I finally understand why there isn’t even a special crystal in the interspatial ring left by Pupil Master. It turns out that all the crystals are ‘filial’ to this precious gourd,” Jian Wushuang said with a strange expression.","“A gourd actually likes to eat crystals?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was also very surprised.","“My young friend, do you have any more crystals in your hand? Try feeding it,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and took out a large number of crystals with a flip of his hand.","In terms of killing, he had killed more Principles Masters in the Red Cloud World Than Pupil Master. In addition, he had killed a large number of experts before, so those experts had all kinds of special crystals in their hands, Jian Wushuang had kept these special gems in his interspatial ring, so they had been piled up like a mountain.","There were many high-level gems and low-level gems. He just took out some of them.","In his opinion, he had taken out enough gems to feed the gourd, but in fact, the Blood-Red Gourd had a big appetite.","The special crystals piled up like a small mountain were swallowed by the Blood-Red Gourd in a moment. It was obvious that the gourd was still not satisfied.","It trembled more and more crazily, and Jian Wushuang could feel the unprecedented desire from the Blood-Red Gourd.","The desire did not come from the crystals he took out, but from his interspatial ring.","“What is in my interspatial ring that makes the Blood-Red Gourd so eager and crazy?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He looked through his interspatial ring carefully. Although there were many crystals in it, they were not the source of the Blood-Red Gourd’s madness.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes inadvertently caught a glimpse of a corner of the interspatial ring. There, an ancient and strange-looking knife disc was lying quietly.","Upon seeing the knife disc, Jian Wushuang’s Pupils suddenly shrank.","He remembered this knife disc very clearly.","It was his first time exploring the depths of Devil Smoke Valley. When he passed by the blaze sea, he encountered the blaze tide, and this knife disc was born from the blaze tide and fell into his hands.","However, it must be known that when he first obtained the knife disk, the temperature of the knife disk was frighteningly high. He had only grabbed the knife disk for a short while, and then put it into his interspatial ring. His divine power had been directly evaporated by one-fifth!","Moreover, after the knife disk was put into his interspatial ring, all the treasures in his interspatial ring, except for some of the extremely high-level ones, were all evaporated by the temperature of the knife disk."]},{"number":3763,"title":"Chapter 3763 - Awakening","paragraphs":["One-fifth of his divine power was directly evaporated with a single grab. After all, he was a perfect chaos creature.","After he put it into his interspatial ring, more than 90% of the treasures in the ring were also evaporated.","Just these two points alone showed how incredible the knife disk was.","Jian Wushuang had always known that this saber disk must be extraordinary. He had been unable to recognize it as his master all these years, so he could only throw it into his interspatial ring. As the temperature of the saber disk gradually decreased, it did not have much effect on the other treasures in the interspatial ring.","It could be said that the saber disk had completely calmed down, but Jian Wushuang had never forgotten it.","Now that he saw the Blood-Red Gourd swallowing those special crystals and the unprecedented madness and desire it gave him, Jian Wushuang thought of the saber disc.","“Although the special crystals I just gave to the Blood-Red Gourd can be considered precious in this Star Field, they are not too rare. It’s the same for a Star Field. In the entire vast universe, the crystals I gave him could only be considered ordinary, but the saber disc is different.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","Jian Wushuang did not even know what the material used to refine the knife disk was.","But he was sure that the material used to refine the knife disk was much higher than the crystals in this Star Field.","It was very likely that the knife disk was the thing that the blood-colored calabash desperately desired.","“Let’s see its reaction first.”","With a thought, the knife disk appeared in the void in front of him.","As soon as the saber disk appeared, the surrounding void immediately became hot.","......","Sizzle sizzle sizzle! The sound of the void being burned had begun to ring out.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to hold the saber disk in his hand. He was afraid that the saber disk would melt his palm directly.","The moment the saber disk appeared, the Blood-Red Gourd indeed became restless.","Even the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master could sense the fervor of the Blood-Red Gourd, let alone Jian Wushuang, who recognized it as his master.","“What kind of treasure is this saber disk? How could it make the Blood-Red Gourd so crazy?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master could not help asking.","“Even I have never seen the material of this saber disk. How did you get it, Heavenly Marquis?” Temporal Temple Master also asked.","Although they were both Rulers and knowledgeable, they could not tell the material of the knife disk.","“I got this knife disk by luck in the blaze sea. I’ve been keeping it in my interspatial ring. I didn’t expect the gourd to be so eager for it,” Jian Wushuang said, “I’m hesitating whether I should give it to the gourd to eat.”","“This...” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master looked at each other in dismay, but they did not say anything.","Jian Wushuang was also in a dilemma.","He could see that the scarlet gourd was very eager to eat the saber disk.","As for what would happen after it was eaten, Jian Wushuang did not know.","However, the saber disk was not an ordinary object. At least from the process of Jian Wushuang obtaining it, the value of the saber disk was extraordinary. It was just that Jian Wushuang was unable to display its value now.","That was why he hesitated whether he should give the knife disk to the Blood-Red Gourd to eat.","After hesitating for a moment, Jian Wushuang finally made up his mind.","“Eat it. Although the knife disk is of extraordinary value, I don’t know its use. If I’m not mistaken, I won’t be able to figure out its use in a short period of time, even before I become a Ruler and travel to the depths of the universe. However, the crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm is imminent. I must cherish all the resources that I can use now. I can’t wait until then.”","“Since I can’t use it now, I might as well use it to complete the Blood-Red Gourd.”","Jian Wushuang had thought about it carefully.","Perhaps he would feel pity when he found out the value of the cutting tool, but he would never regret it.","For him, no matter how valuable the treasure was, as long as he did not use it, it would be useless.","With Jian Wushuang’s permission, the Blood-Red Gourd immediately became excited. It flew to the edge of the knife disk and aimed its mouth at it.","Boom! A devouring power that was dozens of times stronger than the special crystals it had swallowed exploded from the Blood-Red Gourd.","Although the knife disk was extraordinary, it was ownerless. After being swallowed by the Blood-Red Gourd, it could not resist and was directly swallowed by the gourd.","Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master stood around the Blood-Red Gourd, waiting for its reaction.","Suddenly...","Boom!","A terrifying soul aura suddenly rose from the Blood-Red Gourd.","“Haha! I’m awake, I’m finally awake.”","“Blood Blaze Iron, it’s all because of this Blood Blaze Iron!”","“Haha!”","An earth-shaking laughter suddenly echoed in the sky.","The laughter even swept up the blood cloud above, causing the world to tremble.","The expressions of Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master all changed.","At this moment, the soul aura that suddenly rose from the Blood-Red Gourd was absolutely something that the three of them had never thought of before.","Moreover, judging from the wild laughter of the soul aura...it was obvious that the other party had been sleeping in the Blood-Red Gourd. It was because he had just swallowed Jian Wushuang’s saber that he woke up.","But the key point was, was this soul awakening good or bad for them? It was not something that they could control.","“One Principles Master and two Chaos Masters?”","“Did the Principles Master refine the gourd, and is the scarlet blaze iron yours?”","“Haha, I really have to thank you. Without your scarlet blaze iron, I don’t know when I would have woken up. In order to repay you, I will enjoy your divine body. In addition, I promise to use your divine body to make a name for myself in the universe!”","Wild laughter echoed. The soul that originally existed in the Blood-Red Gourd surged out from the Blood-Red Gourd and covered Jian Wushuang’s body.","“What?”","“Not good!”","Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master’s expressions changed drastically.","Judging from the words of the soul, it was obvious that it had bad intentions.","The problem was that the soul was too strong. It came toward Jian Wushuang, and neither the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master nor the Temporal Temple Master could stop it. They could only watch as the soul entered Jian Wushuang’s body.","Jian Wushuang suddenly woke up.","“Is this...possession?”"]},{"number":3764,"title":"Chapter 3764 - Begging for Mercy","paragraphs":["Possession...when a soul enters another person’s divine body, it forcibly destroys the soul and takes possession of the other person’s divine body. This is called possession.","Whether in this Star Field or in the entire universe, possession was an extremely vicious and ruthless method.","Jian Wushuang also did not expect that the soul in the Blood-Red Gourd would directly possess him as soon as it woke up.","Although he immediately reacted and tried to stop it, it was too late. The soul had already entered his divine body, and a terrifying soul power had already engulfed his soul.","“Destroy it.”","A deep and evil voice suddenly sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The soul power was too powerful, much stronger than Jian Wushuang’s own soul. Although Jian Wushuang had a soul treasure to protect his body and he did not have many souls, under the attack of this soul power, his soul began to collapse almost instantly.","There was no room for struggle.","In just a moment, Jian Wushuang’s soul was destroyed.","“Haha, it’s too easy for me to possess a mere Principles Master.”","After the Soul Body destroyed Jian Wushuang’s soul, it smiled disdainfully and prepared to completely control Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","But at this moment...","Buzz!","......","A large amount of soul power crazily gathered, and in the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang’s intact soul appeared in front of the Soul Body again.","“What?” The Soul Body was shocked. “How is it possible? I have completely destroyed your soul?”","Just now, he had completely destroyed Jian Wushuang’s soul, so he could not sense any trace of Jian Wushuang’s soul aura.","But in the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang’s soul was completely intact?","What was going on?","“Could it be...”","This Soul Body had quite a background, so it was naturally very knowledgeable. After seeing the situation, he immediately thought of a possibility.","“Perfect life?”","“It’s the legendary perfect life!”","“Only cultivators at the perfect life level can merge their soul power into every trace of divine power. Even if their soul is completely destroyed, as long as there is sufficient divine power, it can be instantly repaired. This Principles Master is actually a cultivator at the perfect life level?”","The Soul Body was extremely shocked and no longer looked as arrogant as before.","Jian Wushuang’s soul, which was condensed in front of him again, looked at the Soul Body coldly.","“Who are you not good at possessing? How dare you possess me?”","“You’re courting death!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and instantly, a large amount of soul power crazily counterattacked the Soul Body.","“Not good.” The Soul Body suddenly became frightened.","In terms of soul power, he was much stronger than Jian Wushuang. They were two completely different levels.","In a head-on collision of souls, he could easily crush Jian Wushuang’s soul and even destroy it. However, Jian Wushuang was a perfect life. Even if his soul was destroyed, he could immediately recover, this soul could do nothing to Jian Wushuang, but Jian Wushuang could do nothing to him.","After all, this place was in Jian Wushuang’s divine body, and it was completely under Jian Wushuang’s control. Previously, Jian Wushuang did not guard against it, which allowed this soul to enter his divine body so easily, but now, Jian Wushuang was on guard. If he wanted to leave Jian Wushuang’s divine body and return to the Blood-Red Gourd, it would not be so easy.","A large amount of soul power crazily attacked the Soul Body.","Although each attack was directly destroyed by the Soul Body and Jian Wushuang’s soul was destroyed one after another by the Soul Body, if there were countless moths flying toward the fire...they would come over again and again. No matter how strong the fire was, it would be extinguished.","This was the case for this soul.","Jian Wushuang’s soul had attacked countless times, and each time it attacked, it consumed a lot of soul power. After dozens of times, the soul power of this Soul Body was obviously weakened.","However, Jian Wushuang’s soul was still reassembling and attacking him again and again.","“A mere Soul Body wants to possess me? You want to control my divine body? You must be dreaming.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold. “Now, I want to see how you die!”","Jian Wushuang was furious.","He had thought that the Blood-Red Gourd was a very powerful treasure, so he did not hesitate to give it to the Blood-Red Gourd to devour. He did not expect that after the Blood-Red Gourd devoured the saber, the soul that had awakened...it was the first one to take his body.","It was like a farmer saving a snake, only to be bitten by a snake.","If he was not a perfect life, he would have been dead by now, and his divine body would be under the control of the soul. How could he not be shocked and angry?","That was why Jian Wushuang was so desperate to kill the soul here.","“This is in my divine body. You can’t return to the Blood-Red Gourd because of my obstruction. What you will face next is my crazy attacks, which will weaken your soul power until it is completely exhausted.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold.","“I don’t care who you are, but since you have the guts to enter my divine body, you should stay here.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice sounded in his divine body.","He continued to crazily attack the Soul Body time and time again.","“No, no!”","The Soul Body was terrified at this moment.","“There are only a few perfect level cultivators in the entire vast universe. How could I be so unlucky to meet a perfect life level cultivator here? Moreover, I want to take his body?”","This Soul Body was truly unlucky.","He had been sleeping within the Blood-Red Gourd for countless years. It wasn’t easy for him to wake up, but before he could feel happy, he immediately seized a perfect-level life-level cultivator.","Seize the possession of a perfect-level life-level cultivator?","That was simply a joke.","A perfect-level life-level cultivator was invincible in the aspect of the soul.","“My brother, my friend, no, my lord, I have been asleep for too long and finally woke up. I was so excited that I offended you. Please forgive me, my lord,” the Soul Body said anxiously.","He had already begged for mercy.","He had no choice but to beg for mercy.","Under Jian Wushuang’s hindrance, his Soul Body could not return to the Blood-Red Gourd, nor could it leave Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","If he continued to stay here, the only outcome would be to be tortured to death by Jian Wushuang.","It was not easy for him to wake up, but he did not want to be killed the moment he woke up."]},{"number":3765,"title":"Chapter 3765 - The Devil Flame of Domination","paragraphs":["“Now you know how to beg for mercy?” Jian Wushuang sneered, “What do you mean by saying that you will only be offended in a moment of excitement? Is this just an offense?","“If I wasn’t a cultivator with a perfect life, I would have died long ago. Humph, if you want me to spare your life, you have to hand over your soul origin. Otherwise, you will die.”","“Soul origin?” The soul turned pale with fright.","The soul origin was the core material of the soul, which could control its life and death.","Except for a perfect life like Jian Wushuang, anyone would attach great importance to the soul origin.","To hand over the soul origin voluntarily?","That was equivalent to leaving their life and death in the other party’s control. Therefore, many people would rather die than hand over their soul origin.","But now...","“Okay, I’ll hand it over. I’ll hand over the soul origin.”","The Soul Body only hesitated for a moment before agreeing.","“You agreed so quickly?” Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised.","He was sure that this Soul Body must have been an extremely powerful expert, or even a supreme expert.","Would such a super expert really hand over the soul origin to him?","......","Jian Wushuang immediately had some doubts.","However, the Soul Body was very decisive. It directly forced his soul origin out of the Soul Body and sent it to Jian Wushuang.","“This aura is indeed the soul origin, and it was forced out of the Soul Body. It should be his soul origin. That’s right.” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, but he still controlled this soul origin at once.","After controlling it, Jian Wushuang immediately obtained the connection between this soul origin and this Soul Body.","Jian Wushuang had a feeling that he had already controlled the life and death of this Soul Body.","“He really gave his soul origin to me?” Jian Wushuang was very strange.","“Master, can I return to the gourd now?” The Soul Body begged.","The soul origin was under Jian Wushuang’s control. It could be said that his life and death depended on Jian Wushuang’s thoughts. The Soul Body was straightforward enough to address Jian Wushuang as master.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang did not stop it.","Without Jian Wushuang’s hindrance, the Soul Body quickly returned to the Blood-Red Gourd.","However, even if he returned to the Blood-Red Gourd, Jian Wushuang still had absolute control over it through the soul origin.","Neither the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master nor the Temporal Temple Master knew what had happened in Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","They only sensed that an extremely powerful soul had entered Jian Wushuang’s body from the Blood-Red Gourd, and then Jian Wushuang’s soul power dissipated temporarily.","This shocked both Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","Fortunately, it did not take long for Jian Wushuang’s soul power to recover.","Finally, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes, and a faint smile appeared on his face.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what happened?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","“Heavenly Marquis, did something happen?” Temporal Temple Master looked over.","“Don’t be nervous.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said with a smile, “Something happened just now.”","Then, Jian Wushuang told them about the process of the Soul Body possession.","“Good lord, the Soul Body in the Blood-Red Gourd wants to take your house? How dare you!” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said with a hint of anger in his eyes.","Temporal Temple Master chuckled, “This soul is really unlucky. He could have taken anyone’s body, but he chose to take your body. You are at the perfect life level, and your soul origin and divine power are completely fused together. You are absolutely invincible in terms of soul. I’m afraid that even a Supreme Being at his peak would not be able to take your body.”","“He’s really unlucky. Now his soul origin is in my hands,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Soul origin?” The eyes of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master lit up.","“My young friend, do you mean that the Soul Body has given its soul origin to you?” The Temporal Temple Master asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “If he doesn’t give it to me, I will kill his Soul Body in my divine body. He has no choice but to give it to me.”","“Haha, that’s great.” Temporal Temple Master smiled and said, “This Soul Body is so powerful, so it must have a powerful origin. My young friend, please ask quickly.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang understood and immediately covered the Blood-Red Gourd with his consciousness.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang asked in a deep voice.","“Master, my name is Devil Flame. I come from the nether world and am a Chaos Ruler who has reached the ultimate level.” The Soul Body in the gourd said respectfully.","“Devil Flame?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He remembered that Pupil had summoned the Devil Flame Body with the Blood-Red Gourd. The Devil Flame Body must have been the work of Devil Flame.","He had never heard of the nether world, so it must not be an astral world in this Star Field.","“An ultimate level Chaos Ruler?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","He had thought that the soul was an autarch, but he did not expect it to be just a Chaos Ruler.","However, the Chaos Ruler he knew was only at the elementary, advanced, and top levels. As for the so-called ultimate level, he did not know about it.","“What is the ultimate level?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Master, you don’t know about the ultimate level?” The Devil Flame Soul Body was obviously a little surprised.","“The Star Field we are in now should be at the edge of the universe. The strongest one here is only at the Superior Ruler level. There is no Ultimate Ruler,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Is that so?” The Devil Flame Soul Body understood, but then said seriously, “Master, how many principles have the Superior Rulers in your Star Field fused?”","“This...” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He did not know the answer to this question, so he could only ask the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","“In our Star Field, as long as you fuse four rules, you can become a Ruler. As far as I know, most Rulers only fuse four rules. The Superior Rulers usually understand five rules, but they can’t fuse all five rules together. As for the Superior Rulers, I don’t know if anyone has fused five rules,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“My young friend, you’ve fought with a Superior Ruler before, can’t you feel it?” Temporal Temple Master asked.","“When I fought with Master Qing, I didn’t see that she had fused five rules into her attack. I think she hasn’t reached this level. As for Master Heaven Roc, although he fought with me, he didn’t use his full strength at that time. I don’t know whether he has reached it or not.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","“Devil Flame, is it true that only a Ruler who combines five rules is the Ultimate Ruler?” Jian Wushuang asked."]},{"number":3766,"title":"Chapter 3766 - Ruler Level","paragraphs":["“No, no, master, you’ve misunderstood. A Ruler who has fused five principles is only a second-level Chaos Ruler. He is far from the ultimate level,” Devil Flame said.","“Far from it?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “Devil Flame, explain clearly.”","“Master, it’s like this. In the vast universe, the level of Chaos Ruler is mostly determined by the number of rules fused. The most ordinary Ruler is a Ruler who has fused four rules. In the universe, such Rulers are called the first-level Rulers!”","“Rulers at this level are the most mediocre and ordinary Rulers in the vast universe. Any third-grade astral world can produce many Rulers like them, but from the second-grade onwards, it is not that simple.”","The Devil Flame Soul Body began to explain.","“Master, you should also be clear that although the laws of heaven and earth are far from the principles of the universe, under the premise that the laws of the universe and the Chaos Rulers are unable to touch upon the principles of the universe, the degree of comprehension and mastery of the principles of heaven and earth is still very important. Furthermore, although it is relatively easy to comprehend the principles of Heaven and earth, it is not difficult to completely comprehend a single principle.”","“Especially after breaking through to the Ruler level, one’s sense of the principles of the world will become even stronger, and the speed of comprehension will be much easier than when one is at the Ruler level. However, the fusion between the principles is still extremely difficult.”","“After all, the principleshave their own characteristics. Just fusing two laws together is very difficult, but fusing three, four, or even more laws together is ten times and ten times more difficult. Many people struggle to fuse four laws together and break through to become Rulers, but this is already their limit. They will never be able to fuse a fifth principle in their entire lives. Thus, they will always be Rulers of the first level.”","“In the vast universe, there are the most first-level Rulers. 99 of the 100 Rulers are only first-level Rulers.”","“The second-level Rulers have fused five principles, so there are fewer of them.”","“Of course, even the second-level Rulers are still far inferior to the final-level Rulers because many of the Rulers who can be called final-level Rulers have fused nine principles.” The Devil Flame Soul Body paused.","...","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was a little confused.","“Devil Flame, did you just say that an Ultimate Ruler has fused nine rules?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","It was indeed very difficult to fuse principles. He knew this very well.","After all, he had only fused four principles. He was still far from fusing the fourth principle and reaching the threshold of becoming a Ruler.","But fusing nine principles was too far away for him.","What shocked Jian Wushuang was that the principles could fuse nine principles?","“Nine is in the heaven and earth realm. No matter who it is, the limit is to fuse nine principles. That’s why it’s called the ultimate. As for those who fuse more than six principles...for example, Rulers who fuse six principles are called third-level Rulers in the universe.”","“Those who fuse seven principles are the Rulers of the fourth level.”","“Those who fuse eight principles are the Rulers of the fifth level.”","“In the vast universe, the Rulers of the fifth level are already considered top-tier experts. They can easily occupy a second-level astral world or even a smaller Star Field. As for the Ultimate Rulers, as long as they don’t go to the deepest part of the universe, the most prosperous place with the most experts, they can easily become an overlord.”","“For example, I used to be an overlord in a certain region of the universe for a period of time. I ruled five Star Fields under my command. Later on, because I was too bored, I went to the deepest part of the universe, which was the most prosperous place, to explore. I accidentally provoked a strong enemy, and his divine body was destroyed by the enemy. Only my soul was lucky enough to escape. In the end, by chance, I entered the gourd and fell into a deep sleep.”","Jian Wushuang could not help smacking his lips.","He had heard that Devil Flame said he was an Ultimate Ruler, but he did not think much of it. After all, he had come into contact with an autarch before.","However, he did not expect that an Ultimate Ruler would be so powerful. He could easily rule several Star Fields and become an overlord.","“Devil Flame, you said that you have provoked a strong enemy. That strong enemy should be an autarch, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No, not a Supreme Being.” Devil Flame shook his head. “What kind of person is a Supreme Being? Even in the deepest part of the universe, he is still a top-tier existence. I don’t have the courage to provoke a super-expert of that level. Moreover, if I really provoked a Supreme Being, how could my soul have a chance to escape?”","“Not a Supreme Being? Could it be that the one who destroyed your divine body was also a Ruler of the ultimate realm?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded. “But he was also an Ultimate Ruler, but he was much stronger than me. In fact, he was on a completely different level.”","“Why?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","They were both Ultimate Rulers, so why did Devil Flame say that they were on a different level?","“Not only did he integrate the nine principles, but more importantly, he also comprehended a trace of the universe principles!”","Devil Flame’s voice was a little cold, “The universe principles is something that only supreme experts are qualified to be involved in. However, that guy has actually comprehended a trace of it. Even though it’s just a trace, his strength has reached a whole new level. He can be said to be a half-step supreme expert.”","“When I fought with him, I was completely crushed by him. I didn’t even have a chance to fight back. If I didn’t react fast enough, my soul might not have been able to escape from his hands.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","He knew how terrifying the universe principles were.","And just as he had expected, even a Ruler had the opportunity to comprehend the universe principles. It was just a matter of whether he had the talent and comprehension ability.","“Devil Flame, let me ask you again. What is this Blood-Red Gourd?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“This gourd is actually not a treasure, but its material is very special. It can shield the soul of an ordinary Ruler from detection. At that time, my divine body was destroyed, and even my soul was severely damaged. I was at a loss when I saw this gourd, so I immediately ran into it and used it to hide my soul aura. Not long after that, I fell into a deep sleep.”","“As for what happened after that, I don’t know. I also don’t know how I came to this Star Field,” said Devil Flame."]},{"number":3767,"title":"Chapter 3767 - Gold-Devouring Clan","paragraphs":["“Where are the special crystals? And what happened to your Soul Awakening?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“It has something to do with my origin.” Devil Flame did not hide anything. “Have you heard of the Gold-Devouring Clan?”","“Gold-Devouring Clan?” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","“Master has not left this Star Field and has not really explored the universe. It’s normal that you don’t know,” Devil Flame said in a deep voice.","“The Gold-Devouring Clan is one of the rarer races in the vast universe. Most of them were born from birth, just like special life forms. However, special life forms are unique, while the Gold-Devouring Clan is a race. In the vast universe, the number of Gold-Devouring Clan is very few. I’ve explored for so long, but I’ve only met two of them.”","“The Gold-Devouring Clan has an innate talent, which is to have a strong sense of special crystals. We like to eat these special crystals, and we can even improve our strength by eating them. Of course, we can also eat these special crystals to recover our divine power and injuries.","“As a member of the Gold-Devouring Clan, I naturally have a strong sense of these special crystals. My soul was severely injured, and I slept in the gourd for God knows how many years. Not long ago, someone recognized the gourd as its owner and temporarily woke me up.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Not long ago? How long ago was that?”","“It must have been tens of millions of years,” Devil Flame said.","Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes.","Tens of millions of years, but Devil Flame said it was only a short time ago?","...","However, it was normal. Devil Flame had slept in the gourd for an unknown period of time. These tens of millions of years might be very short for an ultimate level Ruler like him.","“Tens of millions of years ago, the gourd should have been in the hands of Pupil Master,” Jian Wushuang thought.","“And then?” Jian Wushuang continued to ask.","“Although that person recognized the gourd as his master, he could not sense my existence from it. Instead, I found an opportunity at this time,” Devil Flame continued, “you know, my soul was severely injured. If I were to recover by sleeping, I don’t know how long it would take to recover. But if I had external help, it would be much faster.”","“Therefore, I caused some movement in the gourd and showed my desire for the special crystals. I made the man think that the gourd was a great treasure and immediately sent a lot of special crystals into the gourd. The speed of my soul recovery was much faster than before.","“In the end, I simply used my innate ability to sense the special crystals and asked the man to find all kinds of special crystals for me to swallow. Of course, in order to make him believe that the gourd was really a treasure, I also brought him some benefits.”","“Is it the Devil Flame Body?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded. “The Devil Flame Body is just a name I lied to him about. In fact, it’s a Gold-Devouring divine body that I rebuilt. Of course, a Gold-Devouring divine body that is exactly the same as when I was at my peak can not be created overnight. I can only wait and my soul will continue to sleep. The Devil Flame Body can also sense the special crystals and let that person continue to search for all kinds of crystals for me.”","“When he is in danger, of course, he can summon the Devil Flame Body, which can greatly increase his strength in a short time.","“Originally, my goal was to use the special crystals he found to completely restore my soul. As soon as I restore it, I can immediately possess him and control his divine body. Then, I can personally plunder all kinds of crystals, so that I can reduce the time to create the Gold-Devouring divine body. Everything has been in my plan until now, and the next thing...”","Devil Flame paused.","Jian Wushuang naturally knew what happened next.","He killed Pupil Master, and the gourd fell into his hands. Like Pupil Master, he thought the gourd was a Supreme Treasure, so he gave all kinds of special crystals to the gourd to eat, in the end, he even sent the saber disc into the gourd.","He did not expect that the knife disc would directly wake up the Devil Flame’s soul and restore it. The Devil Flame, whose soul had been completely restored, naturally wanted to possess Jian Wushuang at once, however, he did not expect that Jian Wushuang was a cultivator at the perfect life level. He failed to steal the chicken, but instead, he lost himself.","“Devil Flame, you said that the knife disc I devoured for you was Blood Blaze Iron. What is this Blood Blaze Iron?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","He really wanted to know the value of the blade plate.","After all, the blade plate was extraordinary. Devil Flame’s soul was severely injured and it would take a long time to recover. However, after swallowing the blade plate, it immediately recovered.","“Blood Blaze Iron is one of the rarest and most precious special crystals in the vast universe. Crystals of this level are very valuable. Master, although the blade plate you gave me contains only a part of Blood Blaze Iron, which is estimated to be about 10 kilograms, the value of 10 kilograms of Blood Blaze Iron is enough to tempt even Supreme Beings!”","“Even when I was at my peak, it was almost impossible for me to get such a big piece of Blood Blaze Iron. I didn’t expect you to have it in such a Star Field, master.” Devil Flame was in disbelief.","Hearing Devil Flame’s words, Jian Wushuang was furious, “It’s a pity that such a precious piece of Blood Blaze Iron was swallowed by you. I lost a piece of Blood Blaze Iron, and not only did I not get anything, but I was almost possessed by you!”","“This...” Devil Flame was nervous, but then he said, “Master, although you lost a piece of blood flame iron, you got me as your slave. I am from the Gold-Devouring Clan, and I have a strong sense of all kinds of special crystals in the universe. The higher the level of the crystals, the more sensitive my sense is. In the future, with me by your side, what special crystals can you not get?”","“Also, no matter what, when I was alive, I was still a Ruler at the ultimate level. I’ve even roamed the deepest part of the universe. At least, I have some knowledge. Master, you’re a perfect life-form. In the future, you won’t be limited to this star area. You’ll definitely go to the vast universe to explore. At that time, master will definitely need my knowledge and experience.”","“In addition, there’s also the Gold-Devouring divine body inside the gourd. Although that divine body is still in the reconstruction stage, it should be of some use to you, master.”"]},{"number":3768,"title":"Chapter 3768 - Devil Flame’s Plan","paragraphs":["There were three benefits.","The first was the Gold-Devouring Clan’s innate ability to sense special crystals.","The second was the knowledge and experience of Devil Flame, the Ultimate Ruler.","The third was the Gold-Devouring divine body.","The first two benefits were of no use to Jian Wushuang at the moment. After all, he was still in this Star Field and did not need much knowledge and experience, as for the innate sensing ability of the pair of special gems...he did not need any special gems at the moment.","For example, the saber that he had previously obtained contained the Scarlet Blaze iron, but it was useless in his hands. That was why he had devoured it by the Devil Flame.","On the contrary, the third benefit mentioned by the Devil Flame caught Jian Wushuang’s attention.","“Gold-Devouring divine body?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","He had witnessed the scene when Pupil Master summoned the Gold-Devouring divine body from the Blood-Red Gourd.","Pupil Master’s battle strength was only that of a Primary Ruler. However, after summoning the Gold-Devouring divine body, his battle strength could rival that of a Senior Ruler. He was even considered very strong among Senior Rulers.","Especially his divine body, which could be many times stronger.","...","Of course, Jian Wushuang was interested in such an ability.","Of course, Pupil Master’s strength was much weaker than his, which was why his strength had increased so much after summoning the Gold-Devouring divine body. Jian Wushuang himself was the strongest among the Senior Rulers, so even with the help of the Gold-Devouring divine body, his strength would not increase too much, but it would increase a lot more or less.","It might even give him the ability to fight with a Superior Ruler.","“Devil Flame, what are the conditions for summoning the Gold-Devouring divine body?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“This...” Devil Flame hesitated for a moment, then he said, “Master, the Gold-Devouring divine body is still in the stage of remodeling and has just begun to be molded. It is not perfect enough. Although Master can summon it to enhance his own strength, the power consumed after each summoning is enormous. It requires a large number of special crystals to restore the Gold-Devouring divine body to the unsummoned stage.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","“Of course, master, unless it’s a critical moment, you shouldn’t summon the Gold-Devouring divine body. If you have the chance, you can get as many special crystals as you can for me to eat. In this way, my reconstructed Gold-Devouring divine body will become more and more powerful. After I summon it, it will enhance your strength,” Devil Flame added.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He understood the use of the Gold-Devouring divine body. It was a divine body reconstructed by the Devil Flame. However, due to the special relationship of the Gold-Devouring clan, the Gold-Devouring divine body could enhance his strength like a Supreme Treasure. However, every time he used it, he would need to spend a large number of special crystals to replenish it.","If he did not use the Gold-Devouring divine body and often gave a large number of special gems to the Devil Flame to devour, the Gold-Devouring divine body would become stronger and more useful to him.","Of course, this was only what the Devil Flame said. As for the truth, Jian Wushuang did not fully believe it.","“This Gold-Devouring divine body is a full-faith divine body prepared by the Devil Flame for himself. It can withstand his cultivation and strength at his peak. If I really give him all kinds of special gems at all costs and let him completely reconstruct the Gold-Devouring divine body, he will be able to recover 80 percent of his strength at his peak after he completely controls the Gold-Devouring divine body,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","How strong was a master at the peak of the Devil Flame?","He was an Ultimate Ruler, second only to a Supreme Being and a heaven-defying master who had comprehended a trace of the universe’s principles.","If such a super expert recovered his peak strength, Jian Wushuang was not confident that he could completely control him.","Even though the soul origin of the Devil Flame was in his hands, and it was respectful to him, as if it had completely submitted to him, Jian Wushuang was still very vigilant about the Devil Flame.","After all, a Ruler at the ultimate level who had traveled in the deepest part of the universe, who knew if he had any special means to escape from his control.","If he did not have it, it would be fine, but if he really did have it, then he would be digging a hole for himself by painstakingly collecting all kinds of special crystals for him to recover his peak strength.","Once the Devil Flame recovered its peak strength and got out of his control, the Devil Flame would immediately kill him.","Jian Wushuang had to be vigilant.","As he expected, the Devil Flame was respectful on the surface and called Jian Wushuang ‘master’ affectionately. It did not dare to go against Jian Wushuang’s question, but it was forced by the situation, he had no choice.","In order to survive, he had to bow down to Jian Wushuang.","However, it did not mean that he was willing to submit to Jian Wushuang. After all, how could a Ruler of the ultimate level sincerely submit to an ant at the level of a Principles Master?","Even if this Principles Master was the legendary perfect life.","“I have no choice but to support you now, but you must not let me find an opportunity, or else...” Devil Flame was already making all kinds of plans in his heart.","He was already thinking about how to find an opportunity to kill Jian Wushuang and then get rid of Jian Wushuang’s control.","After all, his soul origin was in Jian Wushuang’s hands. If Jian Wushuang was slightly unhappy, he could kill him. He was not willing to let Jian Wushuang completely control his life and death, but he had no way at the moment.","His current plan was very clear. He would wait for Jian Wushuang to die.","He knew very well that with Jian Wushuang’s strength, it might be difficult for him to die in this Star Field, but sooner or later, he would have to go to other Star Fields or the depths of the universe, once he went to a wider Star Field, there would be many experts there, so there would be many dangers.","Even though Jian Wushuang was a perfect life, he would still die if he was not careful.","As long as Jian Wushuang died, he would be able to escape from Jian Wushuang’s control.","Of course, before he died, Jian Wushuang might still choose to kill his soul and let him die with him, but he was not worried at all.","“Humph, he is just a Principles Master. His understanding of the soul is rough. Even if I give him control of my soul origin, it won’t be easy for him to kill me with this trace of soul origin.”","“Moreover, there are so many dangers in the universe. Many dangers are fleeting. He might die in an instant. He won’t even have a chance to react. How can he deal with me?”","Devil Flame thought clearly in his heart.","However, he was still powerless in the face of Jian Wushuang. He could only be obedient to Jian Wushuang.","..."]},{"number":3769,"title":"Chapter 3769 - Supreme Treasure Armor","paragraphs":["Devil Flame hated Jian Wushuang, but now he didn’t dare to disobey him, so he could only bow and scrape.","Jian Wushuang was also very vigilant about Devil Flame. The reason why he did not kill it directly was because he really needed it now.","Both of them had their own thoughts.","“Devil Flame, you stay in the gourd from now on. If I need you, you must respond immediately. If you dare to slight me, I will kill you directly,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Yes, yes.” Devil Flame was very terrified.","“Of course, if possible, I will get you some more special crystals in the future,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Thank you, master.” Devil Flame was delighted again.","Jian Wushuang nodded, then waved his hand and put the Blood-Red Gourd into his interspatial ring.","After dealing with the matter of the Blood-Red Gourd, Jian Wushuang flipped his hand and took out the Pupil Master’s Supreme Treasure Armor.","The armor was pitch-black and gave off a faint light. The surface of the armor was smooth, but there was a bit of malevolence. A faint murderous aura slowly spread out from the armor.","It was obvious that the armor was a malevolence.","...","“With my strength, it shouldn’t be difficult for me to refine this Supreme Treasure Armor.”","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and began to try to refine the Supreme Treasure Armor.","As he had expected, although the threshold for refining the Supreme Treasure Armor was very high, ordinary Rulers might not be able to achieve it.","However, Jian Wushuang’s strength was still there, so it was easy for him to get the recognition of the most powerful Supreme Treasure Armor.","In just three days, Jian Wushuang had refined the most powerful Supreme Treasure Armor. At the same time, he immediately got the specific information of the Supreme Treasure Armor.","“Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor was the name of the most powerful Supreme Treasure Armor.","The name looked ordinary, but its origin was extraordinary.","The Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor was made by a master craftsman after he killed a magic dragon at the Ruler level with dragon bones in its leather belt, the master craftsman even completely sealed the Magic Dragon Soul on the armor.","Over the years, the Magic Dragon Soul had suffered a lot, and its resentment was growing. As a result, the armor became more and more ferocious, and its power was naturally stronger.","With a thought, Jian Wushuang immediately replaced the Blood Demon Cave Armor with the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor. It turned into an ordinary black robe and covered his body. Then, Jian Wushuang began to feel the power of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor.","“The Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, as the most powerful Supreme Treasure Armor, is indeed much stronger than the Blood Demon Cave Armor.” Jian Wushuang sighed secretly.","The difference between Supreme True Treasure Armor and Pinnacle True Treasure Armor seemed to be only one level, but this level was like a huge gap between heaven and earth.","A Pinnacle True Treasure Armor could withstand most of the power of an ordinary attack from a Primary Ruler, but if the opponent’s strength reached the Advanced Ruler level or even the Peak Ruler level...the top-tier True Treasure Armor would not be able to withstand it, and its power would be limited in the end.","However, the Supreme True Treasure Armor was different.","Even a top-tier True Treasure Armor could withstand more than 90% of the power of an attack by a top-tier Ruler, while a top-tier True Treasure Armor could even withstand 99% of the power, only 1% of the power could hit its master.","Therefore, even though Pupil Master’s strength was average, it still took a long time for Jian Wushuang to kill him. He had also revealed so many tricks and trump cards.","Pupil Master was the same. Now that the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor had fallen into Jian Wushuang’s hands, his body-protection ability was much stronger than Pupil Master’s. His divine body was far beyond Pupil Master’s, not to mention the protective swordsmanship of Earth Guard.","Now that he had the protection of the Supreme Treasure Armor, Jian Wushuang could definitely do whatever he wanted in this Star Field.","No one in this Star Field could threaten him anymore.","Even if his opponent was a Superior Ruler, even if two or three Superior Rulers joined hands, they could not do anything to him.","Of course, if he were to leave this Star Field, Jian Wushuang would not be able to deal with experts like the Devil Cloud Star Master.","After all, the Superior Ruler of this Star Field was probably only a first-level Ruler according to Devil Flame. At most, he could barely reach the second-level, while the Devil Cloud Star Master could occupy a second-level star world, his strength was certainly not weak.","According to Jian Wushuang’s guess, Devil Cloud Star Master was probably a third-level or even fourth-level Ruler.","A Ruler of that level was nothing in the vast universe, but it was an existence that Jian Wushuang and even this Star Field could not afford to provoke.","In addition to its own protective ability, the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor also had its own power.","Almost all of the power of the armor came from the Magic Dragon sealed in the armor. As long as it met the requirements, it could activate the Magic Dragon Power in the armor. With the power of the Magic Dragon, its strength could be enhanced to a higher level.","After Jian Wushuang recognized the armor as his master, he knew that there were four levels of power in the armor.","The first level of power could trigger 10% of the Magic Dragon Soul. The conditions were simple, and most Rulers could achieve it.","The second level of power could trigger 30% of the Magic Dragon Soul. It could only be triggered by grasping a trace of the aura of the universe principles.","The third level of power, 60% of the Magic Dragon Soul, needed to comprehend a trace of the universe principles.","The fourth level of power, 100% of the Magic Dragon Soul, naturally required a higher requirement.","“Pupil Master’s own strength is not very strong. Although he has the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, he can only activate the first level of power at most. Activating 10% Magic Dragon Soul will probably be very limited to his own strength.”","“As for me, although I am only a Principles Master, I have long grasped a trace of the aura of the universe principles. I can barely activate the second level of power of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes immediately lit up.","“Let’s try it.”","With a thought, the second level of the power of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor was immediately activated.","Suddenly, a dragon’s cry sounded in the sky. The dragon’s cry was accompanied by a monstrous resentment. Immediately, a majestic murderous aura surged out from the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor and directly covered Jian Wushuang’s entire body, the moment this murderous aura covered his entire body, Jian Wushuang clearly sensed the change in his own strength.","“My power seems to have increased a lot?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and suddenly exerted strength with his hands.","Crack! He almost crushed the space.","..."]},{"number":3770,"title":"Chapter 3770 - Challenge","paragraphs":["“This power is a little too strong.”","Jian Wushuang was a little excited, and his eyes were full of surprise and joy.","He had thought that activating the second level of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor would not increase his strength too much. After all, it was only 30% of the Magic Dragon Power.","But in fact, the 30% Magic Dragon Power was too strong for him. He did not use any secret skills or techniques, but the power burst out in an instant, Jian Wushuang felt that he was still slightly stronger than an ordinary Senior Ruler and was almost close to his peak power.","After all, he did not use his life divine power, Heaven-cleaving skill, or the power of his will given by the universe principles.","The power was so strong without using these things. If he used all his strength...the power would not be weaker than an ordinary Superior Ruler.","“With 30% of the Magic Dragon Power from the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, my power should not be much weaker than that of a Superior Ruler. In terms of swordsmanship and comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle, I am definitely no weaker than a Superior Ruler. In addition, I have the support of the most powerful Flight Type True Treasure, such as the Celestial Light Wings. With the help of the Mystic Light Phantom movement technique and the suppression of the domain...”","“Now, I really want to find a genuine Superior Ruler to spar with.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","He had fought with a Superior Ruler before.","But this so-called fight was just to save his life.","A Superior Ruler could not kill him, but he could easily crush him. Jian Wushuang was very clear about this.","...","However, now that he had the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, which gave him power comparable to a Superior Ruler, he looked forward to a real fight with a Superior Ruler.","He was absolutely confident that if he encountered a Superior Ruler again, he would definitely be qualified to fight him head-on.","If he used his innate divine power, the original universe, he could even suppress an ordinary Superior Ruler within ten breaths.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how powerful is the armor?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master looked at him.","“Very good.” Jian Wushuang stood up with a smile on his face. “With this Supreme True Treasure Armor, not only will my protective ability reach a new level, but my strength will also increase by a level.”","“Oh?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master looked at each other.","In their eyes, Jian Wushuang’s strength was already strong before, but now, it had increased by another level?","Could it be that he could fight against a Superior Ruler?","“With this Supreme True Treasure Armor, we have achieved our purpose in coming to the Red Cloud World, and you have also obtained a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure. This can be said to be a great surprise. As for the following...although the Red Cloud World will still be closed for thousands of years, it doesn’t matter if we can get another treasure in the remaining thousands of years,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He now had not only a supreme attack type True Treasure, but also a Supreme True Treasure Armor, a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure, and a Supreme Suppression Type True Treasure.","He basically had a Supreme True Treasure in all aspects. The only thing he lacked was a supreme Domain Type True Treasure.","However, he had a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure, and with the combination of the two, his domain power was close to that of a supreme Domain Type True Treasure.","Just as Temporal Temple Master had said, his gains in Red Cloud World over the years had been huge, and they had long exceeded his expectations. As for whether he could obtain other True Treasures, there was no need to force it.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what are your plans next?” asked the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“My strength has improved a lot since I got the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor. Now, I really want to fight with top-tier Rulers. Almost all the top-tier Rulers in this Star Field are in the Red Cloud World, so I plan to continue adventuring here. I don’t want to obtain True Treasures, but only to hone my swordsmanship and fight with those top-tier Rulers,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay. With your current strength, you can survive a Supreme Ruler even if you can’t defeat him. Heaven-cleaving and I won’t stop you. You can continue to roam around here,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“By the way, Don’t forget the legend of the Red Cloud World, which is Heaven-Treading Mountain.” Temporal Temple Master reminded him again, “If possible, go to Heaven-Treading Mountain earlier. With your talent and strength, you might have a chance to pass it.”","“I remember,” Jian Wushuang replied.","Of course, Jian Wushuang would not forget the Heaven-Treading Mountain.","He still wanted to explore the Red Cloud World for a while. It would be best if he could fight with one or two Superior Rulers. After that, he would go to the Heaven-Treading Mountain.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master left.","Jian Wushuang continued to explore the Red Cloud World.","However, he no longer had any thoughts about the Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World. His goal was to fight with the top Rulers, so there was no need for him to stay on the Third Continent, instead, he went to the continents where there were top Rulers and began to explore.","More than 5,000 years after the Red Cloud World opened, Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Temporal Temple Master jointly killed Pupil Master. The battle shocked the entire Red Cloud World.","400 years later, on the Second Continent, Jian Wushuang encountered an extremely powerful Advanced Ruler, Master Icefox, in a fight for a Supreme Treasure.","Master Icefox was a very famous Advanced Ruler. His battle strength was definitely among the best among the Advanced Rulers, and he was slightly stronger than the Tyrant Axe Ruler.","After the encounter, Jian Wushuang directly challenged Master Icefox. The two fought, but the battle only lasted for a short while before Master Icefox admitted defeat and admitted that he was no match for Jian Wushuang.","In the 6600th year since the Red Cloud World opened, Jian Wushuang met Doom Ruler again.","Doom Ruler was an overlord of this Star Field. Although his battle strength was not as strong as a Superior Ruler, he was one of the few people in this Star Field who dared to challenge a Superior Ruler.","His attack power was extremely powerful and far exceeded that of an ordinary Superior Ruler. He was also very good at speed and body protection. He also had many secret skills and no weaknesses.","Because of this, many people in the Star Field thought that the Doom Ruler was the number one person under a Superior Ruler.","However, after fighting Jian Wushuang, the title of the number one person under a Superior Ruler was immediately changed.","The battle was extremely fierce. At first, Jian Wushuang only used his life divine power, Heaven-cleaving skill, and the power of the will given by the universal principles. With the advantage of his domain, he fought fiercely with the Doom Ruler, it was only a tie, but with Jian Wushuang’s Mystic Light Phantom movement..."]},{"number":3771,"title":"Chapter 3771 - Battle Strength of a Superior Ruler","paragraphs":["The Mystic Light Phantom movement technique was too terrifying. Once it was used, even the Doom Ruler could not keep up with Jian Wushuang’s speed. He was easily suppressed by Jian Wushuang.","What followed was a complete one-sided suppression. The Doom Ruler could not even find a chance to fight back.","Therefore, the Ruler admitted defeat after a short while.","From then on, the number one person under the Superior Ruler became Jian Wushuang.","In the 7500th year since the Red Cloud World opened, Jian Wushuang finally met a Superior Ruler on the First Continent.","This Superior Ruler was Master Kong.","He was a Superior Ruler with monstrous fame and terrifying strength.","Sky Master also had a great force under his command. This force was no weaker than the Northern Sea Palace led by Sky Roc Ruler. It was even slightly stronger than the Northern Sea Palace to a certain extent.","Moreover, Sky Master was decisive in his killing. He rose up in the midst of a bloody storm and stepped on countless corpses. He might not be stronger than Sky Roc Ruler in terms of strength, but there was no doubt that he was more awe-inspiring or feared than Sky Roc Ruler.","Jian Wushuang had heard that Sky Master was adventuring on the First Continent, so he had rushed there. When he encountered Sky Master, he was overjoyed and immediately went up to challenge him.","As a Superior Ruler, Sky Master was proud of his status and would not trouble the weak. However, if anyone dared to provoke him, he would kill them without mercy.","...","Therefore, when he saw that Jian Wushuang had taken the initiative to challenge him, he did not hesitate to attack.","The battle was extremely dark, and many people were watching.","The final result of the battle shocked everyone.","Before the battle between Jian Wushuang and space master, almost everyone thought that the battle was one-sided. After all, Space Master was a Superior Ruler and had been famous for a long time.","As for Jian Wushuang, although he had extraordinary combat strength and was known as the number one person under a Superior Ruler, he was only a Principles Master?","In many people’s eyes, no matter how powerful a Principles Master was, there must be a limit, right?","It was already incredible that he could defeat a Superior Ruler. As for fighting against a Superior Ruler, almost no one thought so.","In fact, in this battle, Jian Wushuang used all of his strength and secret skills at the same time. He also activated 30% of the Magic Dragon Power in the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, which instantly increased his power to the level of a Superior Ruler, his swordsmanship was also extremely powerful. With the help of the Mystic Light Phantom movement technique, he was not at a disadvantage in a short time.","Of course, Sky Master was still strong. After fighting Jian Wushuang for a while, he finally used his full strength and secret skill to suppress Jian Wushuang.","But he was only barely able to suppress Jian Wushuang.","Sky Master also realized that he could not defeat Jian Wushuang directly.","In the end, after fighting for nearly an hour, they finally stopped.","After the battle ended, Sky Master announced to the public that Jian Wushuang already had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler.","Once the news was spread, the entire Red Cloud World was in an uproar.","After all, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master?","This was confirmed by several Superior Rulers. Even the Superior Rulers agreed that Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master, so he naturally could not hide his cultivation with secret skills.","It was indeed shocking that a Principles Master had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler.","In the vast void above the First Continent, Jian Wushuang was slowly moving forward. At the same time, he was chatting with the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Daoist Xuan God.","“My young friend, you don’t know that the entire Red Cloud World and even the entire Star Field have been completely shocked. Although I’m in the Star Palace, many Rulers have sent me messages to build a good relationship with me. In particular, the leaders and Rulers of some forces in this Star Field have congratulated me and also come to build a good relationship with my Star Palace.”","“To be honest, my Star Palace has existed in this Star Field for quite some time now. It has a certain status within this Star Field, but amongst the many powers of this Star Field, it can only be considered average. But now, it’s completely different.” Daoist Xuan God laughed loudly.","“Haha, this is very normal. Although there are a few Rulers in this Star Field, there are only four or five Supreme Rulers. At most, there are six or seven. Any Supreme Ruler can do whatever they want within this Star Field, and no one dares to offend them. Previously, my Star Palace relied on us to hold down the fort. At that time, I, Heaven-cleaving, and the Heaven Ancestor had yet to publicly declare our stance. It can be said that you, Xuan God, are the only Ruler in the Star Field. Naturally, not many people or powers would take you seriously.”","“However, now that we’ve made our stance clear, the Star Palace has suddenly gained a few more Rulers. More importantly, our Heavenly Marquis friend is now publicly acknowledged as having the battle prowess of a Peak Ruler. With a Peak Ruler in the Star Palace, who would dare to underestimate it?” The Temporal palace master laughed loudly.","“That’s right. A Peak Ruler is different from ordinary elementary Rulers and Advanced Rulers. This is the strongest battle prowess in this Star Field. With such a battle prowess, no one in this Star Field would dare to provoke the Star Palace. If we have a bit of ambition, we can easily become a Peak Ruler in this Star Field, just like the Northern Sea Palace.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master added.","The North Sea Palace was one of the overlords of this Star Field. It was led by the Superior Ruler, the Sky Roc Ruler, and had two Rulers under its command. Moreover, the North Sea Palace had a very deep foundation.","However, the current Star Palace had more Rulers than the North Sea Palace. Jian Wushuang was also in charge of the battle strength of the Superior Rulers. They were not weaker than the North Sea Palace at all. What they lacked was the foundation and the battle strength of the Principles Master level.","However, the foundation could be plundered. For example, they could destroy some other forces and plunder resources.","The Principles Master was even easier to deal with. After Jian Wushuang’s fame spread, many experts would be eager to join the Star Palace. As long as the Star Palace was willing, they could easily gather a large group of Principles Master experts.","Hearing their conversation, Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly.","Although the entire Star Field was saying that he was the most terrifying monster in the history of this Star Field and that he had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler at the level of a Principles Master, in fact, Jian Wushuang knew very well that his master, Xuan Yi, had...at the level of a Principles Master, he also had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler. However, not long after Xuan Yi had that battle strength, he died and did not have the time to show his strength in this Star Field, therefore, not many people knew about this matter.","In other words, he was not the number one genius in the history of this Star Field. At the very least, his master was ahead of him."]},{"number":3772,"title":"Chapter 3772 - Heaven-Treading Mountain","paragraphs":["Of course, the reason why his master, Xuan Yi, was able to fight against a Superior Ruler at the level of a Principles Master was mainly because of the Heaven Suppression Tablet, in addition to his perfect life.","Xuan Yi had reached the level of a Superior Ruler in the first place because he had mastered the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","Although Jian Wushuang had also borrowed the power of a Supreme Treasure, his own strength was still a big factor. Therefore, although he could not be said to be better than his master, he was at least on par with his master.","“I’ve had a good fight with a Superior Ruler. There’s no need for me to continue exploring the Red Cloud World. It’s time for me to go to the Seventh Continent and visit Heaven-Treading Mountain,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, are you going to Heaven-Treading Mountain?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Okay, then I wish you good luck,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“Haha, I hope you can be the first person to pass the Heaven-Treading Mountain in this Star Field,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","They were all very relaxed.","The Heaven-Treading Mountain was a legend in the Red Cloud World.","So far, no one had been able to pass the trial on the Heaven-Treading Mountain. However, although the trial on the Heaven-Treading Mountain was extremely difficult, there was no danger to their lives.","...","Even if they could not pass it, they would be able to escape unscathed. Naturally, they would not be worried.","Jian Wushuang smiled and quickly flew toward the Seventh Continent where Heaven-Treading Mountain was located.","The seven continents of the Red Cloud World, from the First Continent to the Sixth Continent, were scattered in all directions. Only the Seventh Continent was located in the center of the other continents.","Heaven-Treading Mountain was located in the center of the Seventh Continent.","Jian Wushuang arrived at the Seventh Continent in no time.","There were still many cultivators fighting for the Supreme Treasures on the Seventh Continent.","However, Jian Wushuang was no longer interested in the Supreme Treasures.","He did not move fast along the way and headed straight for Heaven-Treading Mountain in the center of the Seventh Continent.","On the way, he naturally encountered quite a few cultivators.","“That outfit and that look...it’s Blood Sword Master!”","“It’s him. Wasn’t he on the First Continent before? And he just fought with that space master not long ago. Why is he on the Seventh Continent now?”","“The Seventh Continent is at the center of the other continents. There were already many great beings adventuring here, and now there’s Blood Sword Master, who has the combat power of a top-tier Ruler. It’ll be even harder for us to get a True Treasure.”","“No, Blood Sword Master has been fighting for True Treasures on the Third Continent for the first 5,000 years. He has been wandering around the other continents to challenge Rulers, but he has not participated in the True Treasures. Obviously, he is no longer interested in the True Treasures from the Red Cloud World. Now that he has come to the Seventh Continent, he is either here to challenge Great Beings, or he is here for Heaven-Treading Mountain.”","“Heaven-Treading Mountain?”","Many cultivators on the Seventh Continent were shocked.","Although they were all on the Seventh Continent and knew about the existence of Heaven-Treading Mountain, the test was too difficult. They had no chance at all, therefore, they had always regarded Heaven-Treading Mountain as an insurmountable mountain in their hearts.","Now that Jian Wushuang had deliberately rushed to the Seventh Continent, it was obvious that he was heading toward Heaven-Treading Mountain.","“It seems that Blood Sword Master is really going to Heaven-Treading Mountain.”","“Tut, tut, Heaven-Treading Mountain is a legend. Although the Red Cloud World has existed for so many years, it has been born many times, and countless experts have gone there to challenge it, no one has been able to reach the peak. Although Blood Sword Master is very heaven-defying, I’m afraid he still can’t pass it.”","“It’s hard to say. Blood Sword Master has the battle strength of a Superior Ruler at the level of a Principles Master. He has a good chance of passing it. Maybe he really did pass it?”","Many cultivators on the Seventh Continent began to discuss.","Heaven-Treading Mountain was an insurmountable mountain for many people. They did not see any hope of passing it.","However, Jian Wushuang was the number one genius in the history of this Star Field. He had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler at the level of a Principles Master. Such a heaven-defying feat gave them a glimmer of hope.","Perhaps Jian Wushuang could really pass through it?","Jian Wushuang did not care about the thoughts of these cultivators. He continued forward and soon arrived at the center of the Seventh Continent, in front of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","In front of him was a towering blood-red mountain, which directly pierced into the Red Cloud at the top. Standing in front of the blood-red mountain, one could only feel two words, “Insignificant.”","Even Jian Wushuang could not help being shocked when he came to the foot of the blood-red mountain.","This mountain was too towering and its aura was too majestic.","Standing at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain, even Jian Wushuang could not help but feel a sense of awe.","“It’s said that the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain is connected to the Second Heaven and Earth of the Red Cloud World. It’s a pity that since the birth of the Red Cloud World, no one in this Star Field has been able to step on the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain,” Jian Wushuang thought.","From the words of the Xuan God and the others, Jian Wushuang had some understanding of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","Heaven-Treading Mountain was the only way to the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World. Anyone who came to Heaven-Treading Mountain, no matter who they were, could not fly up directly. They had to start from the bottom of the peak and go up step by step, finally, they reached the peak.","However, there were two trials on the way to the peak. To be exact, there were two gatekeepers.","Only after passing the trials of these two gatekeepers could they go to the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","As for whether there was a third test after reaching the top of Heaven-Treading Mountain, the existence of the third gatekeeper, it was unknown.","After all, no one had ever reached the top of the peak. Even the strongest experts in this Star Field could only pass the test at the foot of the mountain. However, when they reached the mountainside, they would be easily defeated by the gatekeeper.","“Even a Superior Ruler can only pass the test at the foot of the mountain. However, I’m not a Ruler, just a Principles Master. The test of Heaven-Treading Mountain seems to be related to the cultivation realm of the cultivator,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","If a Principles Master was like a Ruler, then even a Superior Ruler could not pass the test at the mountainside, so naturally, Jian Wushuang could not pass it.","However, he was only a Principles Master, so he had a great advantage in this regard.","“Let’s give it a try.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and appeared at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain in a flash. There was a path that was completely paved with steps leading to the peak."]},{"number":3773,"title":"Chapter 3773 - Foot of the Mountain","paragraphs":["Starting from the first step, Jian Wushuang walked up step by step.","His pace was not fast, and he did not encounter any resistance on the steps. He easily walked over 100 steps.","However, Heaven-Treading Mountain was too tall. There were at least 10,000 steps leading to the peak. After Jian Wushuang walked over 100 steps, he was still at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain. At this time...Jian Wushuang saw a pavilion beside the steps.","In the pavilion, a black-clothed man was sitting with his back facing Jian Wushuang.","This black-clothed man looked very ordinary, and he did not emit any aura. Even when Jian Wushuang looked up at him, he did not sense any divine power fluctuation from this black-clothed man.","However, it was because he could not sense it that Jian Wushuang became vigilant.","At this moment, the black-clothed man seemed to have sensed Jian Wushuang’s arrival. He turned his body sideways and looked at Jian Wushuang with a pair of pitch-black eyes.","It was just a simple glance.","However, the moment the black-clothed man looked at Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang felt a sudden fear in his heart, as if he had been completely seen through by the other party.","His ordinary eyes seemed to have a special magic power, which immediately calmed Jian Wushuang down.","“Little guy, you must be tired after walking for so long. I have a bowl of coarse tea here, how about coming over for a cup?” A calm voice came out of the black-clothed man’s mouth.","...","Jian Wushuang saw that there were indeed two bowls of tea on the stone table where the black-clothed man was sitting. He nodded slightly and walked over.","“I brewed this tea with my own hands. Try it.” The black-clothed man made an inviting gesture.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He picked up the bowl of tea in front of him and drank it in one gulp.","When the tea entered his throat, it immediately gave him an extremely bitter taste. Jian Wushuang could not help but click his tongue at this bitter taste.","However, after the tea entered his stomach, it felt warm and comfortable.","“How do you feel?” The black-clothed man asked with a smile.","“Very good, but it’s a little bitter,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Haha, only through suffering can one rise to the top. Little guy, since you’ve already eaten my tea, it means that you and I are fated. For the sake of our fated fate, I advise you to go back to where you came from. It’s not easy to enter the Heaven-Treading Mountain,” the black-clothed man said.","“I haven’t really started. How would you know that I can’t pass it?” Jian Wushuang asked with interest.","“Haha, the Red Cloud World has existed in your Star Field for so many years. Over the years, how many people have come to Heaven-Treading Mountain to pass it? Not to mention a Principles Master like you, even a Ruler...there are probably more than a hundred people who have come and gone. However, only a few of these Rulers were able to pass my level. Even if these Rulers were lucky enough to pass my guarding level, they will still be easily defeated when they reach the mountainside.”","“Even the masters who have reached the top of the first level, or at least the second level, will be easily defeated by the one on the mountainside. You are just a Principles Master, so why bother?” The black-clothed man said.","Hearing the black-clothed man’s words, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","He did not doubt the truth of the black-clothed man’s words.","The Red Cloud World had been in this Star Field for a very long time. During this period, this Star Field had produced many Rulers. At the same time, many Rulers had already left this Star Field to explore more vast Star Fields, it was normal that more than a hundred Rulers had come to Heaven-Treading Mountain to pass this test.","There must be some Superior Rulers among the hundreds of Rulers. However, according to the black-clothed man, ordinary Superior Rulers would not be able to pass this test, even if they were lucky enough to pass, when they reached the mountainside, they would be easily defeated by the gatekeeper guarding the mountainside, which surprised Jian Wushuang.","After all, the black-clothed man had just talked about a second-level Ruler. How could a second-level Ruler be defeated by the gatekeeper?","“After all, a Ruler is a Ruler. Compared to a Principles Master, the requirements are naturally higher. I’m just a Principles Master. I don’t need a Superior Ruler’s battle strength to pass you, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course not, but it’s not easy to pass me. Do you want to give it a try?” The black-clothed man looked at Jian Wushuang with a faint smile.","“Of course, I didn’t come to Heaven-Treading Mountain just for a walk,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Okay.” The black-clothed man stood up and said, “Then let’s begin.”","“Here?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","They were still at the foot of the Heaven-Treading Mountain, and there was no spacious place for them to fight.","“Don’t worry, it’s not here.” The black-clothed man smiled. “The tea you just ate is special. It can bring your consciousness into a special space. I also drank a cup, so our consciousness will fight in that special space. In that special space, you can display your strength without any restrictions, even the power of the Supreme Treasure.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","He did not expect that the cup of tea he had just eaten would have such an effect.","“Wait a moment, the tea is about to take effect,” the black-clothed man said.","Sure enough, Jian Wushuang felt that his body was light and his consciousness was being pulled by a special power. Soon, he came to a special space.","This was the sky above a vast sea, which spanned hundreds of millions of miles. Not to mention Jian Wushuang, even several masters of the second or third level could fight wantonly here.","Not long after Jian Wushuang’s figure condensed in the sky above the sea, the black-clothed man appeared.","“Little guy, let’s fight.” The black-clothed man smiled faintly. He casually flipped his hand and took out a pitch-black long spear.","Although the pitch-black spear exuded an ancient aura, its power was very ordinary. Obviously, it was not a great Supreme Treasure.","Jian Wushuang did not waste any time and immediately unsheathed the Netherworld Divine Sword.","Clang!","A surge of astonishing sword essence instantly swept out.","With the Netherworld Divine Sword in hand, Jian Wushuang immediately sensed the power of the Netherworld Divine Sword.","“Sure enough, even in the space of consciousness, the power of the Netherworld Sword is the same as in reality.” Jian Wushuang revealed a smile. Then, he moved and attacked.","Whoosh!","A cold sword light slashed out from a distance.","The sword light slashed through the void, but it created a huge crack in the sea below.","“Oh? Overlord-level battle prowess?” The black-robed man revealed a surprised expression.","..."]},{"number":3774,"title":"Chapter 3774 - Waves of Power","paragraphs":["“You do have some power. No wonder you are so confident.” The black-robed man smiled calmly.","He had been guarding this Heaven-Treading Mountain for countless years. He had spent countless chaos cycles within this Star Field, and countless Principles Masters had come to challenge him during this period of time, however, among these Principles Masters, very few were able to unleash the battle strength of a Ruler.","Jian Wushuang was undoubtedly one of them.","“However, even if you have the battle strength of a Ruler, it won’t be so easy for you to pass me.”","The black-clothed man looked relaxed and casual. When he saw the cold sword light coming at him, he raised his hand and thrust three spears forward.","Swish! Swish! Swish!","It was as if three streams of light flashed at the same time.","One of the streams of light collided with the sword light and directly destroyed it, while the other two streams of light rushed toward Jian Wushuang from the left and the right respectively.","At the same time, a special realm rose up.","In a moment, Jian Wushuang felt that he had fallen into the endless waves, and the two streams of light that rushed toward him were the two waves.","“Interesting.”","...","Jian Wushuang smiled and easily moved away from the two streams of light. However, before he could continue to attack, the black-clothed man casually waved his wrist.","Suddenly, a large number of waves swept toward him.","They came from all directions and rushed toward his divine body.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and sword shadows burst out and destroyed the waves. However, there were so many waves that it seemed endless.","“Humph!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold, and the divine power in his hand suddenly burst out.","Whoosh!","A cold sword light suddenly swept out.","This sword light, with a hatred that would not rest until death, swept across the void with a crushing force and directly tore apart the waves in front of him.","“No matter how strong your spear technique essence realm is, just tear it apart,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","However, just as the wave was torn apart...boom!","A large amount of air waves rolled up crazily, like endless waves rolling up in the sea.","These waves surged up and swept toward Jian Wushuang with astonishing power.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang seemed to have become a lone boat among the waves.","“This spear technique...”","Jian Wushuang could not help feeling a little shocked.","The power displayed by the black-clothed man was not very strong. At most, he was at the level of a Primary Ruler.","But his spear technique, especially the concept contained in his spear technique, was terrifyingly rich.","The concept was like an endless rolling wave that kept rolling, causing Jian Wushuang to be completely trapped and unable to break free.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The endless waves rolled, and in the middle of the waves, waves of ‘waves’ emitting an astonishing cold air continuously swept toward Jian Wushuang.","The waves were endless.","Jian Wushuang was completely submerged by these waves.","In the face of these crazy waves, Jian Wushuang also fully displayed his swordsmanship. Countless sword lights were displayed in his hands.","These sword lights were extremely fast and mysterious. Each sword light contained the sword principle universe origin and collided with the crazily surging waves.","In a short while, Jian Wushuang had collided with the crazily surging waves more than 10,000 times.","However, the waves were endless and still crazily swept over.","“Amazing. This spear technique is...endless. It’s really amazing.” Jian Wushuang could not help but exclaim in his heart, “This is the real spear technique. The essence contained in it is simply unfathomable. It’s completely different from the spear techniques used by the spear experts I’ve met before.”","He had met many experts who were good at spear techniques before.","He had also met a Superior Ruler like Master Qing.","However, whether it was the Principles Masters and Rulers who were good at spear techniques, or a Superior Ruler like Master Qing, their spear techniques were very impressive, but most of them were simple. They were either extremely powerful, or they were terrifyingly fast. Although they also contained profound mysteries, the essence of their spear techniques was not that high.","At least, he would not be caught in the endless waves like he was now.","Although the black-clothed man’s spear technique was not very powerful, it was much more brilliant than any of the spear techniques he had encountered before.","If he was an ordinary Principles Master or an ordinary Primary Ruler, as long as he was caught in the endless waves, he would have no chance to struggle out. He would only be trapped in the waves, he would be trampled on.","Compared to Jian Wushuang’s shock, the black-clothed man was also quite surprised.","“This little guy is trapped in my wave form. How could he last so long?” The black-clothed man could not help but look at Jian Wushuang again.","Because he was the gatekeeper, he could not display much of his strength when facing Jian Wushuang, the Principles Master. Even the wave form, which he was using now, contained only one-thousandth of the essence and mystery of the spear technique, even so, it was still not something that a master of rules or even an ordinary Primary Ruler could withstand.","However, Jian Wushuang had been stuck in the endless waves for so long, and he was still persisting. Naturally, the black-clothed man was impressed.","At this moment...Jian Wushuang, who had been stuck in the endless waves and looked like he could only passively resist the waves, finally began to erupt.","“I’m not playing with you anymore.”","“Break!”","Jian Wushuang shouted.","He did not increase his power. Instead, he held his sword with both hands and slashed out furiously.","The strongest sword skill that Jian Wushuang had created, the falling yellow springs!","A huge sword light instantly swept out.","Cold and merciless!","It seemed to be able to tear apart all obstacles in front of it.","Most importantly, the moment the sword light was unleashed, the black-clothed man clearly sensed a trace of the aura of the universe’s principles from the sword light.","“This sword...” The black clothed man’s Pupils constricted.","The cold and merciless sword light tore apart all obstacles in front of it, tearing apart the endless waves. Even the spear technique concept surrounding the world was torn apart.","The endless waves dissipated.","However, the cold and merciless sword light continued to slash toward the black clothed man behind it.","The black-clothed man raised the long spear in his hand to block in front of him.","Clang!","With a loud sound, the black-clothed man’s body was incomparably heavy. He took a few steps back before he managed to regain his footing.","In the space of consciousness, the victor and loser had been determined!"]},{"number":3775,"title":"Chapter 3775 - The White-Bearded Elder","paragraphs":["In a pavilion at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","Jian Wushuang and the black-clothed man opened their eyes almost at the same time.","“Senior, thank you.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the black-clothed man in front of him and bowed slightly.","Before this, Jian Wushuang had only addressed the black-clothed man as ‘Your Excellency’. But after the battle in the consciousness space, Jian Wushuang understood that the other party’s realm was much higher than his, the reason why he was able to defeat the black-robed man in the space of consciousness was mainly because he was the gatekeeper. Against a Principles Master like him, he could only display a certain level of strength.","As for the black-robed man’s true strength, it was undoubtedly much stronger than Jian Wushuang’s.","The profound mysteries contained in the spear he used in the space of consciousness alone were enough to prove his monstrous strength.","“I didn’t expect you, a mere Principles Master, to have grasped a trace of the aura of the universe principles. It’s really rare.”","The black-clothed man looked at Jian Wushuang with admiration, then he shook his head and said, “Although you have some strength and passed the test of my guarding, what you will face next is the test on the mountainside. Although the guard on the mountainside is not much stronger than me, his combat strength on the mountainside is far above mine.”","“If your strength is only at the level of the consciousness space, I advise you to give up, because there is no chance for you to pass the test on the mountainside.”","“Senior, you just lost too quickly. How would you know that that is my strongest strength?” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","...","“Oh? It seems that you still have some strength left?” The black-clothed man smiled slightly. “Well, I won’t persuade you anymore. Go. I hope you can pass the test on the mountainside.”","Jian Wushuang bowed to the black-clothed man again, then left the pavilion and continued to walk up the stairs.","Seeing Jian Wushuang leave, the black-clothed man slowly sat down and poured himself another bowl of tea.","“It seems that the little guy didn’t use his full strength in the consciousness space just now. It’s possible that he hid a lot of his strength. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be so confident,” the black-clothed man said in a low voice.","Continue -reading on","In his opinion, he had already shown his strong skills in the space of consciousness, which meant that the test on the mountainside was much more difficult than his.","However, Jian Wushuang still looked so confident. This showed that Jian Wushuang’s strength was far more powerful than what was shown in the space of consciousness.","And it was true.","In the space of consciousness, what Jian Wushuang showed was only his swordsmanship. As for the power, the power he used was only at the level of an elementary Ruler, the same as the black-clothed man. As for secret skills, methods, and Supreme Treasures...he did not use them.","It could be said that most of his battle strength was hidden. What was shown in the space of consciousness just now was just the tip of the iceberg.","Because of this, when the black-clothed man talked about how difficult the test on the mountainside was, Jian Wushuang did not worry at all. On the contrary, he was absolutely confident.","“Haha, if that’s the case, then it’ll be interesting.” The black-clothed man suddenly let out a strange laugh. With a thought, he sent a voice transmission, “Old Man, a little guy will come to you soon. You have to be careful. That little guy is not weak. Don’t fail miserably.”","After saying this, the black-clothed man ignored his response and closed his eyes.","...","After defeating the black-clothed man in the space of consciousness and passing the test at the foot of the mountain, Jian Wushuang continued to move forward.","After going through thousands of steps, Jian Wushuang finally arrived at the mountainside of the Heaven-Treading Mountain.","Beside the steps on the mountainside, there was a simple cottage.","Jian Wushuang stepped into the cottage with the door open. He immediately saw a crude table and a white-bearded, white-robed elder sitting cross-legged on a futon.","The white-bearded, white-robed elder had a weathered face and a thin body. Like the black-robed man at the foot of the mountain, he did not exude any aura.","He sat there like an old monk meditating, making the entire hut seem quiet.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, greetings, senior.”","Jian Wushuang bowed slightly and bowed to the white-bearded, white-robed elder.","The white-bearded, white-robed elder opened his eyes, revealing a pair of strange eyes that faintly glowed with white light. The pair of eyes seemed to contain no emotion at all and were extremely cold.","“Principles Master?”","The white-bearded, white-robed elder raised his head to look at Jian Wushuang and nodded slightly. “To be able to reach the level of Principles Master, you’re the fourth one to reach my level in the past few chaos cycles. Little guy, you’re very good.”","The white-bearded, white-robed elder’s words clearly contained a trace of admiration.","Upon hearing the white-bearded, white-robed elder’s words, Jian Wushuang’s heart was moved.","The white-bearded white-robed elder had mentioned the recent chaos cycles. Jian Wushuang estimated that the Red Cloud World had been born in this Star Field for a few chaos cycles.","During these few chaos cycles, he was the fourth Principles Master to walk in front of him. In other words, there had been three other Principles Masters in this Star Field who had reached this step before him.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised by this.","After all, it had been a few chaos cycles. Over such a long period of time, countless Principles Masters had been born in this Star Field, and some of them were top-notch geniuses.","It was normal for a few top-notch geniuses to have battle strength comparable to a Ruler at the level of a Principles Master, or even very strong at the level of a Primary Ruler.","Although the test at the foot of the mountain was not easy to pass, Jian Wushuang estimated that a Principles Master with the battle strength at the peak of a Primary Ruler might be able to pass it.","It was normal for three Principles Masters to pass the test at the foot of the mountain after a few chaos cycles.","“Senior, you are the gatekeeper at the mountainside. Do I have to defeat you to reach the peak?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, you have to pass me if you want to keep going up. However, I’m different from the one at the foot of the mountain. As a Principles Master, you can easily pass as long as you have an advanced level master of the first level. Even a master at the top of the first level, the beginner level, has a high chance of passing his level. However, ordinary advanced level masters can’t pass me,” the white-bearded white-robed elder said with a smile.","“I will try my best,” Jian Wushuang said.","“OK, eat this bowl of tea first.” The white-bearded elder waved his hand and two bowls of tea appeared on the rough table in front of him.","The white-bearded elder handed one of the bowls to Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3776,"title":"Chapter 3776 - Nine Levels of the Volcano","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang was no longer surprised to see the white-bearded white-robed elder take out tea.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang picked up a bowl of tea from the table and ate it.","Jian Wushuang frowned when he ate the tea.","Unlike the tea taken out by the black-robed man at the foot of the mountain, the black-robed man’s tea, although extremely bitter, had a great taste. It was warm and comfortable to drink, but the tea taken out by the white-bearded white-robed elder.., extremely unpleasant to drink.","“What? It’s very unpleasant to drink, isn’t it?” The white-bearded white-robed elder looked over. “I can’t help it. I’m not good at making tea, but the effect of this tea is the same. It will also bring you into a space of consciousness. You and I will fight in the space of consciousness.”","After saying that, the white-bearded white-robed elder also ate the bowl of tea in front of him.","Soon, the effect of the tea came into play. Jian Wushuang and the white-bearded white-robed Elder’s consciousness had entered a special space of consciousness.","This place was no longer the vast sea, but the center of a barren mountain range. There were bare mountains around and under their feet. The scorching sun baked the air, making it a little hot.","The white-bearded, white-robed elder stood in the void. Unlike the outside world, this white-bearded, white-robed elder seemed to have transformed into a different person after coming to this space of consciousness. His body was filled with a monstrous aura.","This aura was wild and violent. The heat was like a raging flame.","“Little fellow, take this.”","...","The white-bearded, white-robed elder did not say a single word. In this space of consciousness, he directly attacked.","He did not use any weapons. He was purely relying on his own palm. His palm was completely red, as if it had just been burned by a raging fire.","“Volcano, collapse!”","With a fierce shout, the white-bearded, white-robed elder fiercely slapped out with his palm.","Continue -reading on","In an instant, a large amount of red air waves rolled out. These red air waves gathered crazily, and in an instant, they actually gathered into a towering mountain that was 30,000 feet tall.","This mountain was surrounded by raging flames that burned everything in the world.","Boom!","The terrifying flaming mountain fell from the sky and pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh. A series of ear-piercing and shrill gusts of wind came. The wind was so strong that Jian Wushuang could hardly open his eyes. He could only raise his head and look at the endless mountain above him. The power of the mountain...it was earth-shaking.","“The power of an Advanced Ruler, and this move...is very powerful!”","Jian Wushuang had a rough idea of the strength of the white-bearded white-robed elder.","The black-robed man at the foot of the mountain was only an elementary Ruler, but his spear skills were superb and extremely powerful.","The power of the white-bearded white-robed elder was definitely at the Advanced Ruler level. The way he used the move, the towering mountains, and the terrifying air waves were enough to make one’s heart skip a beat, this technique was no less powerful than the black-robed man’s spear technique.","Sensing the power of the towering mountain, Jian Wushuang naturally did not hold back his strength.","The life divine power, Heaven-cleaving skill, and the power of the will given by the universe principles were unleashed at this moment.","“Break!”","With a low roar, Jian Wushuang slashed out with the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand.","Starfire Burning Sun!","Whoosh!","A fierce and direct sword light rushed out with an unprecedented violent and unstoppable momentum.","Using violence to counter violence!","The same extreme violence and the same majestic power.","In the blink of an eye, the fierce sword light collided with the towering mountain that fell from the sky.","Bang!","With a loud sound, the world rumbled.","The towering mountain that was hundreds of thousands of feet tall was actually directly cleaved apart by that ferocious sword light.","The sword cleaved apart the mountain, and it was even cleaving at the gigantic mountain of flames that was completely condensed by the white-bearded white-robed old man’s divine power!","Hualala! A large amount of power crazily charged out in all directions, and the entire world was in the midst of a large area of flames.","“Oh?”","When the white-bearded white-robed elder saw the majestic volcano being directly split open, his eyes lit up.","“To be able to directly split open the first layer of my volcano, you little fellow really have some ability. However, my volcano has a total of nine layers!”","“The nine layers of volcano secret art that I created. Although my strength is currently limited, and the power and profoundness that I can unleash is only one-thousandth, it isn’t something that an ordinary person can withstand.”","“Boy, let’s see how many layers of volcanoes you can block!”","As soon as he finished his words, the white-bearded white-robed Elder’s divine power surged crazily.","Red air billowed in the sky, and towering volcanoes that were even taller than before appeared one after another.","These volcanoes took shape, and each of them contained much more power and pressure than the previous one.","“Volcano, destroy!”","The white-bearded and white-robed elder roared.","The volcanoes that had already taken shape immediately rushed toward Jian Wushuang one after another.","The terrifying power suppressed everything in the world. At this moment, the Earth under Jian Wushuang’s feet, which was separated by the void, could no longer withstand the terrifying power of these volcanoes and exploded, the entire world was filled with an aura of destruction.","In the blink of an eye, the second volcano had arrived.","After the second volcano, there were the third and fourth volcanoes!","As for the fifth volcano, it was in the process of condensing.","“Nine volcanoes?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a trace of shock, but there was more excitement.","“Come on.”","Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all. He released his divine power to the extreme. He knew that the volcanoes contained earth-shaking power, but he did not intend to retreat. Instead, he soared into the sky, he faced the volcanoes bravely.","Then, boom!","A terrifying sword light suddenly lit up.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","A series of earth-shaking noises could be heard. The second volcano was directly smashed into pieces by the sword light.","Then the third and fourth volcanoes were formed.","Even the fifth and sixth volcanoes, which were more powerful, could not withstand the earth-shaking power of Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship and were destroyed one by one.","Bang!","Another loud sound was heard.","The seventh volcano was also split open by Jian Wushuang.","“What?”","The scene in front of him made the white-bearded, white-robed elder look surprised, but then he burst into laughter, “Haha, good boy. I have been guarding this Star Field for several chaos cycles. Three Principles Masters came to me. They were also hit by my nine-stage volcano secret skill, but the weakest one could not even survive the second volcano. Even the strongest one could only survive the fifth volcano and could not withstand the sixth volcano.”","“And you have survived the seventh volcano?”","..."]},{"number":3777,"title":"Chapter 3777 - There Was Still a Test?","paragraphs":["“To be able to withstand my seventh volcano, you are already stronger than any of the Principles Masters who have come here before. However, although my nine-layered volcano secret technique is stronger than the previous one, it is a qualitative transformation from the eighth layer onwards. Brat, let’s see if you can still withstand my eighth volcano.”","The white-bearded and white-robed elder laughed loudly. In the Void, the eighth towering volcano had already formed.","This volcano was much larger than the previous seven-layered volcano in terms of size. The power of the volcano was even more earth-shattering.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","As the volcano slowly descended, the terrifying wind crushed down. Jian Wushuang felt that his ears were ringing.","“This power is indeed much stronger than the previous seven-layered volcano.”","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly, but he was not afraid at all.","The moment the towering volcano descended, he suddenly struck out with his sword.","Whoosh!","A sword light suddenly lit up.","It was cold and merciless, as if it could tear apart all obstacles in front of it.","...","There was also a trace of the aura of the universe principles in the sword light. In an instant, it collided with the volcano that was slowly descending.","Bang!","An earth-shaking and terrifying roar sounded, and a large amount of majestic power spread wildly in all directions.","The eighth volcano formed by the white-bearded and white-robed elder had completely collapsed.","Continue -reading on","However, the cold and ruthless sword light also slowly dissipated.","The eighth volcano was still resisted by Jian Wushuang.","“The aura of the universe’s principles?”","The white-bearded white-robed elder was surprised. He could naturally see the aura of the universe principles contained in Jian Wushuang’s sword.","He was naturally surprised that a mere Principles Master could grasp a trace of the aura of the universe principles.","However, the white-bearded white-robed elder laughed loudly and said, “Boy, you’re very good. Look at my ninth level of the volcano.”","Majestic air currents gathered crazily, and a terrifying power condensed in the void above.","In the blink of an eye, the ninth volcano was formed.","This volcano was not much bigger than the eighth one, but the power and aura of destruction gathered in the volcano was much bigger than that of the eighth volcano, when the volcano was completely formed, the vast world fell silent for a short while.","“This power...is very close to that of a Superior Ruler.” Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","The ninth volcano formed by the white-bearded and white-robed elder brought him great pressure.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang did not hold back anymore. His body suddenly shook, and a dragon’s cry suddenly sounded in the world. The dragon’s cry was accompanied by a monstrous hatred, immediately, a majestic murderous aura surged out from the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor and directly covered Jian Wushuang’s entire body.","The second stage of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor’s power, 30% of the Magic Dragon’s power, instantly increased Jian Wushuang’s strength to a new level.","“I’m tired of watching your volcanoes. You’d better leave.”","Jian Wushuang said softly, and the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand directly slashed down.","It was the same move of the netherworld.","It was the same cold and ruthless sword light that seemed to be able to tear everything in front of it apart.","The difference was that the power that Jian Wushuang had just unleashed was only the limit of an Advanced Ruler. Now, with 30% Magic Dragon Soul, his power had barely reached the threshold of a Superior Ruler.","The power of a Superior Ruler using the Netherworld was naturally far more powerful than what he had just displayed.","Whoosh!","The cold and merciless sword light directly passed through the towering volcano.","Before the ninth layer of the volcano, which the white-bearded white-robed elder had just formed, was completely cut open by Jian Wushuang’s sword light. The power of the sword light did not decrease as it continued to cut toward the white-bearded white-robed elder.","The white-bearded white-robed Elder’s face changed. He staggered and immediately retreated after being hit by the sword light. He looked quite miserable.","“Senior, thank you for letting me win,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Top-tier first-level battle strength?” The white-bearded, white-robed elder frowned and looked at Jian Wushuang solemnly.","While the two of them were talking, their consciousness had slowly left this space.","In a cottage on the mountainside of Heaven-Treading Mountain, Jian Wushuang and the white-bearded, white-robed elder, who was sitting on a futon, opened their eyes at the same time.","“Boy, you actually have top-tier first-level battle strength?” The white-bearded, white-robed elder raised his head to look at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly.","“Not bad.” The white-bearded, white-robed elder nodded in praise. “The Red Cloud World has been in this Star Field for several chaos cycles. In such a long time, I don’t know how many Principles Masters and Rulers have come here to explore. But before you, no Principles Master or Ruler has been able to walk past me. You are the first.”","“I was just lucky,” Jian Wushuang said humbly.","“A Principles Master with top-tier first-level battle strength is also lucky?” The white-bearded elder rolled his eyes at Jian Wushuang, then he said, “But don’t be too proud. Although you’ve passed my test, it’s still not easy for you to reach the top of Heaven-Treading Mountain.”","“Senior, do you mean that there are other gatekeepers on Heaven-Treading Mountain?” Jian Wushuang frowned and asked.","“Right.” The old man with white beard and white robe nodded.","“Is it on the peak?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It seems that you have guessed.” The white-bearded white-robed old man just smiled.","Jian Wushuang was silent.","When Daoist Xuan God and the others told him about the Heaven-Treading Mountain and that it had two trials at the foot and halfway of the mountain, and that there were two gatekeepers, he had already been thinking that on the peak of the Heaven-Treading Mountain, is there a third test.","However, no one could answer this question for him. After all, no one in this Star Field had ever been able to pass this pass on the mountainside. Naturally, no one was qualified to go to the summit. As for whether there was a third test on the summit, no one knew.","And now, he is finally the first to pass the mountainside test, the white beard white robe elder will be on the peak of the third Test told him.","“Senior, is the test on the peak the same as the one at the foot of the mountain and on the mountainside?” Jian Wushuang could not help asking.","“Well...I can’t tell you.” The white-bearded white-robed elder shook his head. “But I can tell you that the test on the mountaintop is the final test in the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World. As long as you pass the test on the mountaintop, you can go to the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World. At the same time, you can get some unexpected benefits.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and he nodded. “Thank you for telling me.”"]},{"number":3778,"title":"Chapter 3778 - Three People","paragraphs":["After learning from the white-bearded and white-robed elder that there was a third trial at the peak, Jian Wushuang did not stay any longer. Instead, he continued to walk up the steps toward the peak.","On the way, Jian Wushuang’s heart was quite heavy.","Previously, when he had not really come to the Heaven-Treading Mountain, he was still very confident in his strength.","Even after passing the test at the foot of the mountain, he was still full of confidence. He believed that with his strength, the test at the Heaven-Treading Mountain should not be difficult for him.","However, after passing the test at the mountainside, which was the battle with the white-bearded, white-robed old man, he did not have that much confidence.","One had to know that in the battle with the white-bearded, white-robed old man, he had truly gone all out. He had used all of his methods to defeat his opponent.","The strength that the white-bearded white-robed old man had displayed in that space of consciousness was definitely at the highest level among the Advanced Rulers.","For example, when he had been adventuring in the Red Cloud World, he had met the so-called number one Advanced Ruler in this star area, the Doom Ruler. the Doom Ruler’s strength was definitely not comparable to the white-bearded white-robed old man.","And the white-bearded white-robed old man’s strength also proved a problem.","The strength of the black-robed man at the foot of the mountain was the ultimate strength of a Primary Ruler.","At the waist of the mountain, the white-bearded white-robed elder was the ultimate strength of a Superior Ruler.","If this continued, would the test at the peak be the ultimate strength of a Superior Ruler?","A Superior Ruler...even if he used all his trump cards, his battle strength could barely reach the threshold of a Superior Ruler. If the gatekeeper at the peak really had the ultimate strength of a Superior Ruler...it would be impossible for him to defeat his opponent.","......","“I can only take it one step at a time. I hope the test on the peak is not so ridiculous.” Jian Wushuang could only sigh inwardly.","After crossing over 10,000 steps, Jian Wushuang finally reached the top of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","However, when he was dozens of steps away from the top of Heaven-Treading Mountain, he saw a snow-white figure half-lying there.","The snow-white figure was covered in snow-white fur. It was tall and had the face of an ape-man.","Obviously, this snow-white figure was not a human cultivator, but a special race in the universe.","“Is it the gatekeeper of the peak?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","In his perception, the Snow-White Ape-Man also did not emit any aura. He lay motionless on the ground, as if he had fallen asleep.","Even though he was close, the Snow-White Ape-Man did not respond.","Jian Wushuang walked to the Snow-White Ape-Man and saw that the Ape Man still had his eyes closed. He could not help saying awkwardly, “Senior...”","“What?”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s voice, the Snow-White Ape-Man finally reacted.","He turned slightly and slowly opened his eyes. A pair of strange cyan eyes instantly locked on Jian Wushuang.","“A human cultivator?”","The Snow-White Ape-Man stared at Jian Wushuang. At first, he was shocked, but then he was overjoyed. He immediately jumped up.","“Haha, a human cultivator. After so many years, there is finally a human cultivator here.”","“Hey, hey, Three-Eyed Demon Woman, Stone, hurry down. A human cultivator is here.”","The Snow-White Ape-Man’s laughter echoed.","Suddenly, two streams of light rushed over from the top step and appeared beside the Snow-White Ape-Man.","The streams of light disappeared, and two figures appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","One of the two people was a graceful, beautiful, and extremely charming woman. Most of the parts of this charming woman were the same as that of a human woman. The only difference was that between her eyebrows...she had a strange Pupil that emitted a dim light.","She had a third eye, a vertical eye!","As for the other person, he was a Stone Man over five meters tall, made of special rocks. He had no nose, no ears, only a mouth and a pair of sunken eyes.","Jian Wushuang was shocked to see these two people.","Snow-White Ape-Man, Three-Eyed Demon Woman, five-meter-tall Stone Man...these three people obviously came from a special race in the universe, and they were all extraordinary.","Jian Wushuang thought there was only one gatekeeper at the peak, just like at the foot of the mountain and at the waist of the mountain. He did not expect there to be three people.","As for how strong these three people would be, Jian Wushuang could not guess.","“Haha, they are indeed human cultivators.”","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman stared at Jian Wushuang with a strange glint in her eyes. “It’s been a long time since I’ve seen a human cultivator. It’s been hundreds of chaos cycles since the Red Cloud World was lost.”","“Tsk, tsk. When I was adventuring in the universe, my favorite thing was to eat the meat of these human cultivators. The stronger I was, the better the meat would be. It’s a pity that I was caught and sent to the Red Cloud World. Since then, I’ve never tasted a human cultivator.” The Snow-White Ape-Man stared at Jian Wushuang, his mouth was slightly agape, and there was a trace of greed in his eyes.","“It’s not that you don’t know the rules of the Red Cloud World. This human cultivator came here to pass the test. You two better not have any other thoughts.” The five-meter-tall Stone Man was more honest, his voice was incomparably heavy.","“Hmph, don’t worry. We know the rules of the Red Cloud World. We don’t dare to violate them.” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman smiled.","“It’s a pity. If we were in the outside world, I would have eaten him, but this is the Red Cloud World.” The Snow-White Ape-Man also revealed a regretful look.","Hearing the conversation between the three people, Jian Wushuang’s heart could not help tightening.","Especially when he heard the Snow-White Ape-Man say that he liked to eat human cultivators’meat, his expression changed. Fortunately, the three people were afraid of the rules of the Red Cloud World and did not dare to act recklessly, which made Jian Wushuang feel relieved.","“Are all of you the gatekeepers at the peak?” Jian Wushuang looked at the three people in front of him.","“Yes,” the Three-Eyed Demon Woman said, “As a Principles Master, it’s already good enough for you to get here. However, the peak is guarded by the three of us. If you want to go to the Second Heaven, you have to pass through the three of us. However, the level guarded by the three of us can not be easily passed by anyone.”","“Little guy, you’re just a Principles Master, so the three of us will naturally restrain our power. Even so, it’s not easy for those first-level masters to pass through us. Do you want to give it a try?” The Snow-White Ape-Man curled his finger at Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3779,"title":"Chapter 3779 - Snow-White Ape-Man","paragraphs":["“Let me challenge the three of you.” Jian Wushuang looked calmly at the three people in front of him.","“Haha, not bad, not bad. I was worried that you would be so scared that you wouldn’t dare to attack us.” The Snow-White Ape-Man smiled strangely.","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman waved her hand and said, “Eat this cup of tea.”","Seeing the tea taken out by the Three-Eyed Demon Woman, a refreshing fragrance immediately assailed Jian Wushuang’s nostrils.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, and he picked up the tea and ate it.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang felt his mind rumbling, his body and mind relaxed, and the throbbing of his heart completely calmed down.","“This tea...” Jian Wushuang revealed a surprised look.","“This is a heart-cleansing tea personally planted by the Three-Eyed Demon Woman. It has the effect of concentrating and calming the mind. If it were placed in the universe, it would have a certain value. It’s not something that ordinary people can eat.” The Snow-White Ape-Man smiled. “The Three-Eyed Demon Woman actually took out this tea to serve you. You are really lucky.”","Jian Wushuang smiled, but his consciousness had already been attracted.","Buzz, buzz, the world changed.","Jian Wushuang had already appeared in a space of consciousness.","Here, he was in the middle of a vast mountain range. This mountain range was very desolate. There were boulders and bald peaks everywhere.","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman, the Snow-White Ape-Man, and the five-meter-tall Stone Man also appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","......","“Little guy, we are going to make a move. Be careful,” the Three-Eyed Demon Woman reminded him.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was solemn. The Netherworld Divine Sword had already appeared in his hand.","Although he could not see the real strength of the three people in front of him, he could tell from the test at the foot of the mountain and the mountainside that they must be very powerful.","“You three, come at me,” Jian Wushuang said in a clear voice.","“Not bad, you are quite calm.” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman smiled slightly.","However, the Snow-White Ape-Man beside her had already made a move.","The two-meter-tall body of the Snow-White Ape-Man suddenly jumped, and Jian Wushuang saw a snow-white figure suddenly sway between heaven and earth.","Boom!","A terrible air explosion suddenly sounded.","An inexplicable chill suddenly swept over. Jian Wushuang opened his eyes wide, but he saw that a large amount of snowflakes had been floating in the void around him.","The snowflakes flew, and a huge snow-white fist had already arrived in front of him.","“So fast!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised. “And this power...the battle strength of a Superior Ruler!”","When the Snow-White Ape-Man attacked, the power contained in his fist was enough to make Jian Wushuang’s state of mind.","The power contained in his fist was undoubtedly that of a Superior Ruler.","“Humph!”","With a cold snort, Jian Wushuang’s power reached its peak. His life divine power, Heaven-cleaving skill, and even the second stage of the dark-gold Magic Dragon Armor burst out at this moment.","As soon as he made his move, Jian Wushuang went all out.","He had no choice but to go all out to deal with an expert at the Superior Ruler level.","Whoosh!","A dazzling sword light, with an endless hatred, instantly collided with the huge snow-white fist.","Clang!","The sound of metal colliding rang out. Jian Wushuang’s body slightly shook, but he immediately took a few steps back.","The Snow-White Ape-Man also stopped in the void and took half a step back.","“Oh? You can block my punch head-on. Not bad.” The Snow-White Ape-Man smiled.","Jian Wushuang’s heart was extremely heavy.","He had used all of his power, but he was still at an absolute disadvantage in a head-on collision.","There was nothing he could do. His battle strength had barely reached the threshold of a Superior Ruler, but the strength that the Snow-White Ape-Man had burst out in an instant was definitely at the level of a Superior Ruler.","It was normal for Jian Wushuang to be at a disadvantage when the two fought.","“Boy, let’s try again.”","The ape-man grinned, revealing his white teeth, and moved again.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The ape-man was extremely fast. When he moved, only white afterimages could be seen flashing in the void.","The fist of the Snow-White Ape-Man was already smashing toward Jian Wushuang.","“This speed...”","Jian Wushuang clenched his teeth and spread out the huge black wings on his back.","He immediately displayed the Celestial Light Wings and the Mystic Light Phantom movement skill.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","Numerous ghostly figures burst out at the same time. They moved closer and closer, making Jian Wushuang’s figure become ethereal.","Under the crazy changes of his figure, Jian Wushuang and the Snow-White Ape-Man began to fight.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The low sound of collision sounded one after another.","Jian Wushuang and the Snow-White Ape-Man were already fighting crazily.","Not long after, Jian Wushuang even used a Domain Type technique. But even so, he still could not gain any advantage in the fierce battle.","As the battle went on, Jian Wushuang’s heart became heavier and heavier.","“The Snow-White Ape-Man’s speed is too fast, and his movement is also very strange. Although I have the Celestial Light Wings of the Mystic Light, the movement skills of the Mystic Light Phantom, and the suppression of the domain, I still only have a slight advantage in speed and movement skills, but his power is stronger than mine. The difference in power can completely destroy my advantage in movement skills.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had basically used all of his techniques.","Even so, he was only evenly matched with the Snow-White Ape-Man. In fact, the Snow-White Ape-Man might still have some techniques that he had not used yet.","In other words, even if it was a one-on-one, he wouldn’t be able to defeat the Snow-White Ape-Man.","But one had to know that the test at the summit was a one-on-three.","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman and the five-meter-tall Stone Man had been standing by the side from the beginning to the end. They had yet to make a move.","Just one person was already giving him so much pressure. If the three of them made a move at the same time..","“Hehe, White Ape, you are a genius of the Emperor Ape Clan, yet you can’t even deal with a little fellow who is the Principles Master. Isn’t that too embarrassing?” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman teased.","When the Snow-White Ape-Man who was in the midst of an intense battle heard these words, his eyes immediately surged with raging flames of anger. “You two, don’t just stand there and talk like it’s nothing. It’s not that you don’t know how great the restrictions I face in the Red Cloud World are. Not to mention my strength and cultivation, even my absolute arts and secret arts can’t display much power. Otherwise, how could I not be able to deal with this brat?”","The Snow-White Ape-Man was also very aggrieved.","Just like the two gatekeepers at the foot of the mountain and at the mountainside, the three people on the peak were also greatly restricted. They could not even use one-tenth of their strength.","Otherwise, a Principles Master like Jian Wushuang was no different from an ant in their eyes."]},{"number":3780,"title":"Chapter 3780 - Three-Eye Demon Race","paragraphs":["“If we can’t do anything to him, then we can’t do anything to him. Why are you still trying to quibble?” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman sneered.","“The two of you, stop talking nonsense. Hurry up and attack together. Don’t forget that we don’t have much time. If we really let this brat pass through our hands, then we’ll really be laughing our asses off,” the Snow-White Ape-Man shouted sternly.","Hearing the Snow-White Ape-Man’s words, the Three-Eyed Demon Woman and the five-meter-tall Stone Man’s expressions turned solemn.","“Stone, attack,” the Three-Eyed Demon Woman said.","“Mm, cooperate with me.” The five-meter-tall Stone Man nodded.","Hong!","The void suddenly trembled, and the entire land began to shake wildly at this moment. On those desolate mountains, large amounts of large boulders suddenly floated up.","These boulders were densely packed, and with the five-meter-tall Stone Man as the core, they formed a huge sea of boulders in an instant.","The Stone Man, which was originally only five meters tall, suddenly expanded in size at this moment, directly reaching nearly a thousand feet tall.","The Stone Man, which was nearly a thousand feet tall, emitted a monstrous aura. Two streams of air spewed out from the sunken eye sockets.","The 300-meter-tall Stone Man stretched out his thick arms, directly picked up a huge rock in the void, and then raised it high.","The huge rock was comparable to an ordinary mountain, and it must have weighed tens of billions of pounds. However, when the Stone Man raised his hands, it was as if he was holding a ball of cotton.","Suddenly, the five-meter-tall Stone Man let out a sharp cry. The huge rock, which weighed tens of billions of pounds and was the size of a mountain, turned into a meteor and shot toward Jian Wushuang like lightning.","......","“What?” Jian Wushuang was dumbfounded.","He had thought that the Stone Man would launch an incredible attack, but he did not expect that his attack would be so simple.","He just picked up a giant rock and threw it directly at himself.","Although the giant rock shot toward him at a speed that was as fast as a meteor.","With Jian Wushuang’s strength, it was very easy for him to dodge such a huge rock.","Such an attack did not pose any danger to him.","At least, that was what Jian Wushuang thought.","However, just as Jian Wushuang was about to move and Dodge the Boulder’s attack, the Three-Eyed Demon Woman standing beside the 300-meter-tall Stone Man gave a strange smile.","A dazzling purple light suddenly flashed in the third vertical eye between her eyebrows.","The purple light was extremely demonic, like a huge purple sun. Jian Wushuang was immediately attracted by it.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang was surprised, but he was immediately shocked to find that under the purple light, he felt a sharp pain in his consciousness. The pain made him unable to control his divine body.","He just stood there, motionless.","The huge rock that rushed toward him like a shooting star directly hit his divine body.","The huge rock weighed tens of billions of pounds and hit him at the speed of a shooting star. The impact of the Star was incredible.","The impact was at least not weaker than that of an ordinary Superior Ruler. It was even stronger than the full-strength attack of an ordinary Superior Ruler.","Jian Wushuang was struck by such a powerful attack without any defense.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had the protection of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, so the impact was weakened by more than 90 percent at the first moment. The remaining power was applied to his divine body.","His supreme eternal celestial body was comparable to an ordinary elementary Universe Supreme Treasure, but the remaining part of the impact was enough to completely shatter an ordinary elementary Universe Supreme Treasure.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s body shook, and he spat out a mouthful of blood.","His divine body had been damaged by more than 40 percent of the impact.","“How terrifying. I have the protection of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor and cultivated the supreme eternal celestial body. My divine body is comparable to an ordinary elementary Universe Supreme Treasure, but this level of attack still severely injured his divine body and damaged it by more than 40 percent.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with a trace of shock.","Although he had only consumed his divine body, he could immediately use his divine power to repair it.","However, it must be remembered that the stronger the divine body, the more divine power was needed to repair it. Jian Wushuang’s divine body was comparable to an elementary universe True Treasure. If it were an ordinary Principles Master, even if they used up all their divine power, they would not be able to completely repair more than 40 percent of their divine body.","However, Jian Wushuang was a perfect life after all. His divine power was as vast as the sea, much more than that of a Ruler. To repair more than 40% of his divine body, Jian Wushuang had only used 3% of his divine body.","“One attack has consumed 3% of my divine body. If this attack were to be repeated dozens of times, I would not be able to withstand it.” Jian Wushuang’s expression was a little unsightly.","The attack of the 300-meter-tall Stone Man was very strong, much stronger than the attack of the Snow-White Ape-Man. There was no doubt about that.","However, Jian Wushuang did not care about the Stone Man. What he cared about was the Three-Eyed Demon Woman next to the Stone Man.","He knew very well that he could have easily dodged the Stone Man’s attack just now. However, it was because of the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s technique that he lost control of his divine body in a very short period of time, that was why he was hit.","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s attack was a real threat to him.","“What happened just now?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He did not even know how he was hit.","He only saw the Three-Eyed Demon Woman open her third eye and let out a purple light. Then he felt an unprecedented pain in his consciousness.","“Master, master.”","A voice suddenly sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Hmm, Devil Flame?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes focused.","Although the soul of the Devil Flame was in the Blood-Red Gourd, he knew what was happening in the outside world and could communicate with Jian Wushuang’s consciousness at any time.","“Master, that woman should be a clansman of a special race in the universe, the Three-Eye Demon Race. The Three-Eye Demon Race is a very famous special race in the universe. This race has an innate advantage, which is the third eye between their eyebrows. The third eye can release different colored beams of light, which can affect the cultivator’s consciousness. Master’s consciousness was affected by her just now, so she couldn’t avoid the Stone Man’s attack,” Devil Flame said.","“A special method to directly affect consciousness?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","Consciousness controlled the body, but it also controlled the soul.","One could even say that a person’s soul was derived from consciousness.","In the universe, many attacks aimed at the soul, such as some special illusions and illusions, were actually also aimed at the consciousness.","However, those attacks would first be blocked by the opponent’s soul power.","However, the Three-Eye Demon Race’s special attack methods were obviously different."]},{"number":3781,"title":"Chapter 3781 - One Possibility?","paragraphs":["“The Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s attack completely ignored my soul power and directly affected my consciousness. My consciousness was in pain and I couldn’t control my divine body temporarily, but my soul was fine.” Jian Wushuang clenched his teeth.","He did not care about ordinary attacks on his consciousness.","After all, he had to go through his soul first. As a perfect life-form, he was invincible in the soul aspect.","However, his soul could not block the attack of the Three-Eyed Demon Woman. He could only rely on his own consciousness to endure it.","If his consciousness could not block it, he could not do anything against the Stone Man and the Snow-White Ape-Man.","“Haha, he actually used his divine body to block the stone’s attacks. It seems that his divine power is not consumed too much. A little Principles Master really has some ability.” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman laughed strangely, then she glanced at the 300-meter-tall Stone Man and said, “Stone, go on. Don’t show mercy. He won’t die in the consciousness space anyway.”","“Okay.”","The 300-meter-tall Stone Man nodded silently. Then he raised another giant stone and smashed it at Jian Wushuang.","Boom!","The stone pierced through the void like a meteor, and the terrifying wind tore the void apart.","The moment the Stone Man attacked, the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s third eye shone with a dazzling purple light again.","“Again?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened and he immediately closed his eyes.","He thought that the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s technique was transmitted by the purple light in her eyes. As long as he closed his eyes and did not see the purple light, he would not be affected by the purple light.","......","In fact, after the purple light lit up, whether Jian Wushuang saw it or not, it would shine on his body at once.","Then, the same thing happened. Jian Wushuang felt a sharp pain in his consciousness and temporarily lost control of his divine body. He squatted there again.","Then, the meteor-like giant rock came crashing down fiercely.","Behind the giant rock, Snowflakes fluttered in the sky, and the Snow-White Ape-Man’s fist also came smashing toward Jian Wushuang.","Bang! Bang!","Jian Wushuang could not withstand the terrifying attacks of two Superior Rulers at the same time. His divine body was seriously injured again, and blood gushed out of his mouth, dyeing his armor red.","“Master, the three-eyed Demon’s special attack is very strange. Whether you see it with your eyes or not, you will be hit. There is only one way to defend against such a method, and that is to rely on your absolute strong consciousness. Your consciousness obviously can’t defend against the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s attack,” Devil Flame’s voice sounded again.","“No, I can’t.” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","His consciousness was actually very strong.","After all, he had lived two lives and had experienced countless life-and-death situations. He could completely ignore ordinary consciousness attacks.","However, the Three-Eyed Demon Woman was extremely powerful. Even if she was not a Supreme Being, she was probably a terrifying Ruler in the fourth or fifth level.","Even though she was the gatekeeper of Heaven-Treading Mountain in the Red Cloud World, she could still affect ordinary Superior Rulers with her consciousness attack, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness was strong, but it was still slightly inferior to that of a Superior Ruler.","Therefore, he could not block it.","“If I can’t block the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack, then I’ll be a living target. I won’t be able to move even if I want to, let alone use any techniques. If this continues, it won’t be long before I run out of divine power after a dozen attacks. Then I’ll be defeated.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and he asked, “Devil Flame, does your Gold-Devouring divine body have some effect on your consciousness?”","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded.","“Although my Gold-Devouring divine body is only in the molding stage, it can greatly improve your strength and consciousness. However, it won’t last long. Master, even if you summon your Gold-Devouring divine body and use it to resist the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack, you can’t defeat these three people. You won’t be able to pass this test.”","Although Devil Flame was in the Blood-Red Gourd, he could see that the three people in front of him were all Superior Rulers. Jian Wushuang had no advantage against any of them. One against three...even if he could block the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack, he would still be completely suppressed by these three people.","As for defeating these three people, it was impossible. At least, Jian Wushuang could not do it now.","Hearing Devil Flame’s words, Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “No, as long as I can block the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack, even if I still can’t defeat the three of them, I might be able to pass this test.”","“Huh?” Devil Flame was stunned.","“If I remember correctly, the Snow-White Ape-Man told the Three-Eyed Demon Woman and the Stone Man that they don’t have much time.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Previously, when he fought with the ape-man one-on-one, the Three-Eyed Demon Woman and the Stone Man were watching the show. The Three-Eyed Demon Woman even mocked the ape-man.","This made the ape-man furious. Later, he told them to attack immediately, saying that they did not have much time.","The ape-man might have said something unintentionally. Ordinary people would not care about it, but Jian Wushuang heard it and paid attention to it.","Not only that, but Jian Wushuang had also made a lot of guesses.","“Yes, the tests at the foot of the mountain and the mountainside all require me to defeat the gatekeepers face to face, but the tests at the peak are obviously different.","“There are three gatekeepers at the peak, and the three gatekeepers...one is extremely fast, the other is extremely powerful, and the last one is a three-eyed demon clansman with unique consciousness attacks. All three of them have the battle strength of a Superior Ruler. If they work together, even a Ruler at the top of the first level would not be able to defeat them face to face.","“As for me, I’m just a Principles Master. It would be incredible if I had to defeat all three of them.”","“And the Snow-White Ape-Man, he said that they didn’t have enough time. In other words, the test on the peak might not be for me to defeat all three gatekeepers, but for me to hold on for a certain amount of time and not be killed by them...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a strange light.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt that the possibility was greater."]},{"number":3782,"title":"Chapter 3782 - Had Withstood It","paragraphs":["First of all, he was only a Principles Master. Heaven-Treading Mountain was also a test of his level as a Principles Master.","As for a Principles Master, no matter how heaven-defying he was, it was still inconceivable for him to defeat three top-tier Rulers who specialized in speed, power, and special consciousness attacks.","Even in the vast universe, not many Principles Masters could do it, let alone in this Star Field.","Although the Red Cloud World had an extraordinary origin, it was only the first test, so the requirements should not be so ridiculous.","Moreover, the Snow-White Ape-Man’s words also revealed some information, which made Jian Wushuang think that the test at the peak was different from the tests at the foot of the mountain and at the mountainside.","“Every time I summon the Gold-Devouring divine body of the Devil Flame, I need to consume a large number of special crystals to recover. If I have no chance of passing this test, I don’t need to summon it. But now that I have a chance, I have to try.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","He had already made up his mind.","He immediately flipped his palm and a Blood-Red Gourd appeared in his hand. He opened the stopper of the Blood-Red Gourd.","Suddenly...a suffocating and terrifying power burst out from the Blood-Red Gourd.","It was a pitch-black and boundless flame. The flame was so cold that even the Ruler was shocked.","It burst out from the Blood-Red Gourd. In an instant, the void of the Red Cloud World seemed to be unable to withstand the power of the Black Flame and collapsed. Then, a large area of black flame jumped crazily, they surged toward Jian Wushuang’s body.","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang’s entire body was enveloped by the monstrous black flames, and his body expanded by a full circle.","At the same time, the aura he emitted instantly rose to a whole new level.","......","The Gold-Devouring divine body of the Devil Flame could also be said to be the body of the Devil Flame. Previously, Jian Wushuang had seen Pupil Master summon it once, but now he had summoned it.","With the help of the Gold-Devouring divine body, Jian Wushuang immediately felt that his strength had improved by leaps and bounds. This improvement was not only in his strength, but also in his soul and consciousness.","“Eh?”","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman, the 300-meter-tall Stone Man, and the Snow-White Ape-Man all noticed the change in Jian Wushuang.","“It seems that you have used a powerful secret skill, but it’s useless. As long as your consciousness is not strong enough to withstand my attack, you will only be a target for the stone and ape-man. There is no chance for you to struggle.” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman smiled slightly, the dazzling purple light in her third eye lit up again.","The 300-meter-tall Stone Man shook its body and its terrifying power soared. It raised the giant rock again and smashed it at Jian Wushuang.","The Snow-White Ape-Man also burst out with its terrifying speed. It would attack when Jian Wushuang’s consciousness could not control his divine body.","Buzz! The purple light shone on Jian Wushuang’s body.","In an instant, the intense pain caused by his consciousness appeared again. Jian Wushuang was still gnashing his teeth in pain, but this time, although it was painful, his consciousness did not escape the control of his divine body.","“I’ve withstood it.” Jian Wushuang was overjoyed in his heart. His eyes were fixed on the huge rock that was shooting toward him like a meteor.","The next moment...","“Earth Guard!”","Jian Wushuang brandished his sword.","The Netherworld Divine Sword seemed to be casually slashed out, but it contained a special mystery.","Buzz, buzz, buzz. A large amount of sword essence, accompanied by a large amount of earthy yellow energy, instantly rose up. With a thick and nostalgic sense of the principles of the Earth, coupled with Jian Wushuang’s attainments in sword principle, in an instant, layers of earthy yellow Earth Sword Domain formed!","After the first Earth Sword Domain appeared, the second and Third Earth Sword Domains were formed immediately. In the blink of an eye, a total of 13 Earth Sword Domains were formed in front of Jian Wushuang!","Yes, it was 13!","When he was meditating under the Sword Stone, he had perfected the Earth Guard to the 12 sword domains.","The Earth Guard of the 12 sword domains had previously blocked Master Qing’s strongest attack head-on.","However, more than two thousand years had passed since Master Qing had exchanged blows with him. During these two thousand years, he had wandered around the Red Cloud World and exchanged blows with experts. His comprehension of sword techniques and the principles of the earth had improved to a certain extent, as a result, the twelve sword domains had an additional layer. Now, he could use the Earth Guard of the thirteen sword domains at the same time.","Naturally, the defensive ability of the Earth Guard was better than before.","Bang!","The meteor-like giant rock, containing extremely terrifying power, crashed into the 13 sword domains.","In almost an instant, nine of the 13 sword domains were crushed. At the 10th level, the speed became slower, but the 10th sword domain was still crushed.","Then the 11th level, the 12th level...","The terrifying impact of the boulder was obviously stronger than the full-strength attack of Master Qing. Master Qing could not defeat all of Jian Wushuang’s 12 levels of the sword realm, but the boulder did, however, the boulder only defeated the 12 levels of the sword realm, but it still could not defeat the 13th level of the sword realm.","In other words, Jian Wushuang’s Earth Guard had perfectly blocked the terrifying power of the boulder that the 300-meter-tall Stone Man had smashed at him.","Although the Snow-White Ape-Man’s fist had arrived shortly after, its power was obviously not as powerful as the impact of the boulder. Therefore, Jian Wushuang had a much easier time dealing with it.","Boom! Boom!","Two consecutive loud bangs rang out. Although Jian Wushuang had been knocked back by the impact, he did not suffer a serious injury to his divine body as before, and the consumption of his divine power was not much.","“He actually withstood my consciousness attack?” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s expression finally changed.","“My attack did not break through his protective sword skill?” The Stone Man, who was 300 meters tall, was also shocked.","“Sure enough!”","Jian Wushuang, who had regained his balance, had a cold smile on his face.","“As long as I can withstand the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack and control my divine body to use the Earth Guard, the Stone Man’s attack will not be able to do anything to me. Although summoning the Gold-Devouring divine body for a long time has consumed a lot of divine power, and the amount of divine power I used to use the Earth Guard is also enormous, it is much slower than before.","“If they don’t have any other trump cards or tricks, they won’t be able to use up all my divine power even if I give them two hours.”","He did not think that the three people in front of him would have enough time to kill him in two hours.","As expected, the three people became anxious after seeing how easily Jian Wushuang blocked their attacks."]},{"number":3783,"title":"Chapter 3783 - Passed","paragraphs":["“This kid is not weak. We can’t waste time with him. Let’s kill him with our full strength.”","The Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s voice was solemn. As soon as she finished speaking, the purple light from her third eye became more dazzling than ever. At the same time, purple light balls appeared out of thin air beside her, each of these purple light balls contained extremely strong destructive power, and then they smashed toward Jian Wushuang one after another.","The aura of the 300-meter-tall Stone Man skyrocketed. At this moment, his two towering palms each lifted a boulder, and at the same time, two boulders smashed toward Jian Wushuang in anger.","The Snow-White Ape-Man’s vicious aura surged, and snowflakes danced in the sky. One snow-white fist after another completely enveloped Jian Wushuang.","The three of them did not hold back at all. They had already reached the limit of their strength in Heaven-Treading Mountain.","However, although the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack was slightly stronger than before, Jian Wushuang could still withstand the attack with the help of the Gold-Devouring divine body.","Although it was difficult for him to move because of the intense pain in his soul, he did not need to move at all. He just needed to stand there and then use the earth-protection sword skill to block the attacks in front of him.","The terrifying attacks were blocked by the thirteen layers of his sword domain. Even if he could not block all of them, he could still use the Earth Guard sword technique, many attacks hit his divine body. However, because of the Gold-Devouring divine body, his divine body was strengthened again. Although the damage to his divine body was reduced, he could still resist them for a long time.","As time went by, the three gatekeepers became more and more anxious.","“There’s no time, give it your all!” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman shouted.","But no matter how anxious they were, it was useless.","Although the three of them had great strength and had more secret skills than they had shown, as gatekeepers on the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain, they were only facing a Principles Master, they could not use their many skills at all.","Now that they had pushed their strength to the limit, they still could not do anything to Jian Wushuang.","......","Finally...buzz!","The void trembled slightly, and the three gatekeepers stopped at the same time.","Time was up.","Jian Wushuang’s consciousness began to leave this space.","Near the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again.","When he opened them, he found the Three-Eyed Demon Woman, the Snow-White Ape-Man, and the five-meter-tall Stone Man staring at him.","Their eyes were strange. There was shock, frustration, and helplessness.","They were indeed frustrated and helpless.","If they could display their strength a little better, they would not give Jian Wushuang a chance.","If they could exert their strength at the peak, they could kill Jian Wushuang countless times with just a blow of their breath.","However, because they were in Heaven-Treading Mountain, they had no choice but to watch Jian Wushuang pass the test.","“You three, I should have passed the test, right?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","“Yes, you have.” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman nodded. “The requirement of this test is that you can last for 15 minutes in our hands. You’ve already met the requirement.”","Jian Wushuang was delighted.","“Boy, you’re really capable.”","The Snow-White Ape-Man also looked over. “You’re just a Principles Master, and the three of us have displayed battle strength at the peak of the first-level master level in Heaven-Treading Mountain. The three of us joined hands to kill you, but you can last for more than 15 minutes in our hands. Even this 15 minutes is far from your limit. This alone is enough to prove that you have a bright future.”","“That’s right. Even in the vast universe, there aren’t many Principles Masters who can do this in the hands of the three of us.” The Three-Eyed Demon Woman also nodded.","The three of them had been captured and brought to the Red Cloud World a long time ago. After that, they had been the gatekeepers at the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","Although the Red Cloud World declined and they came to this remote Star Field and did not encounter any outstanding geniuses, they had at least existed in the depths of the universe for quite some time, during this period, there were also countless geniuses who came to their level. However, only a handful of them could pass this test.","It was a test that even many geniuses in the depths of the universe could not pass. If Jian Wushuang, the Master of rules from the peripheral Star Field, could pass it, he naturally had a bright future.","“Well, let’s cut the crap. You passed the test of the three of us. According to the rules of the Red Cloud World, you can go to the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain to see Lord Wu,” the Snow-White Ape-Man said.","“Lord Wu?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Who is this Lord Wu?”","“Lord Wu is the steward of the Red Cloud World. He is responsible for managing everything in the Red Cloud World, including the life and death of all living beings in the Red Cloud World. As for the life and death of the three of us, it depends on Lord Wu’s will. So when you see Lord Wu later, you must be respectful and not show any disrespect. Otherwise, if you upset Lord Wu, he might kill you directly,” the Ape Man said.","“Kill me directly?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “I have passed the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain. Will Lord Wu kill me too?”","“Of course. What’s the point of passing the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain?”","“It’s just the first trial of the Red Cloud World. Although he is considered a top genius in the universe, it’s not enough to attract Lord Wu’s attention. Now that the Red Cloud World has declined and the Master of the Red Cloud World has disappeared, it’s entirely up to Lord Wu to decide what he wants to do. If he wants to kill you, who can stop him?” The Snow-White Ape-Man glanced at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang suddenly became nervous.","“Of course, you don’t have to worry too much. Although Lord Wu is in charge of life and death in the Red Cloud World, he has always been mild-mannered. As long as you don’t foolishly provoke him, he won’t attack you. Moreover, according to the rules of the Red Cloud World, he will give you rewards and benefits.” The Snow-White Ape-Man laughed again.","“Is he gentle?” Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief.","He was worried that the so-called Lord Wu was a lunatic who had become temperamental because he had been trapped in the five-gold period.","It was not as if he had never seen such a lunatic. Killing depended on one’s preferences. He might even kill someone who disliked him.","Such a person was too dangerous.","He was only the Principles Master Now, and he was also in the Red Cloud World. If that Lord Wu wanted to kill him, he probably would not even have the slightest chance to struggle.","“Let’s go, I’ll bring you to see Lord Wu,” the Snow-White Ape-Man said."]},{"number":3784,"title":"Chapter 3784 - Second Heaven","paragraphs":["Under the guidance of the Snow-White Ape-Man, Jian Wushuang soon crossed the last dozens of steps and appeared on the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","The peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain was already the highest point of the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World. If one stood at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain and looked up, it would be unattainable.","However, when he really stood on the peak, Jian Wushuang immediately looked down and found that his vision was completely blocked. He could not see anything at the foot of the peak.","When he arrived at the peak, Jian Wushuang immediately saw a bald elder in a luxurious silver robe.","The bald elder had his hands behind his back and a gentle smile on his face, which made people feel very friendly at first sight.","Jian Wushuang could not help feeling warm in his heart when he saw the bald elder. He immediately had a good impression of him.","“Lord Wu.” The Snow-White Ape-Man bowed respectfully.","“Blood Sword, greetings, Lord Wu.” Jian Wushuang was naturally very respectful.","“You can go first.” The Bald Elder, Lord Wu, glanced at the Snow-White Ape-Man.","“Yes.” The Snow-White Ape-Man did not dare to disobey and immediately turned to leave.","Only Jian Wushuang and the Bald Elder, Lord Wu, were left on the peak.","“Blood Sword, is that your name?” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile on his face, “It’s rare for someone at the level of a Principles Master to be able to reach this level. Although you are a perfect life and have passed the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain, which is partly related to your life level, your strength, your understanding of sword principle, and your various skills are not weak.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but he was not surprised.","......","Ordinary people would not be able to tell that he had a perfect life level, but as long as he used his full strength and used his life divine power and Heaven-cleaving skill...these two secret skills were used to maximize his life level advantage. As long as he used these two secret skills, with Lord Wu’s vision, he would be able to tell his life level at a glance.","“Aside from your life-level, your talent should be top-notch in the vast universe. If you add your life-level, you can be said to be one of the top geniuses in the entire universe. Such a genius, even in the depths of the universe, is enough to be valued by many forces,” Lord Wu said.","“You flatter me, sir.”","Jian Wushuang was very modest, but he was very puzzled.","His talent, including the perfect life level, was only valued by the forces in the depths of the universe?","This made Jian Wushuang even more curious about the depths of the universe, and how many incredible geniuses there were.","“Under normal circumstances, a genius like you, who has passed the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain, can become master’s disciple. Although you are only an outer disciple, you can also receive benefits that you couldn’t imagine before, as well as various resources. Unfortunately...master’s bloodline has long been destroyed.”","“Even master has died in battle. Countless experts under his command have died, fled, roamed about, and even master’s Divine Kingdom has completely collapsed. The Red Cloud World has also come to this border through the turbulence of the universe. Now, there is only a small portion of the resources left by master as a reward. So, naturally, you won’t be able to get as much now,” Lord Wu said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm, but he sighed in his heart.","In fact, he had guessed that the founder of the Red Cloud World had died. Otherwise, the Red Cloud World would not have existed here.","The test in the Red Cloud World was probably used by the Master of the Red Cloud World to select disciples.","However, after the Master of the Red Cloud World died in battle, the Red Cloud World drifted here. Although there was no support from the Red Cloud World, Lord Wu, who was in charge of everything in the Red Cloud World, still followed his master’s orders, he continued to select disciples for the Red Cloud World.","“Although you can’t get the treatment that the outer disciples of the master’s line deserve, since you passed the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain, you can still get some benefits.” After saying that, Lord Wu waved his hand, the void beside him suddenly tore open, and a space passage appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Sword, come with me.”","Lord Wu stepped into the space passage that suddenly appeared.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and followed Lord Wu into the space passage.","With a flash of light, Jian Wushuang appeared on a vast land.","The land was still blood-red, and red clouds were still rolling above it, just like most environments in the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World.","However, when Jian Wushuang looked around with his soul power, he immediately figured out where he was.","“An island?”","“Am I on an island now?”","Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“This is Red Cloud Island, or the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World,” Lord Wu said.","“Second Heaven?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","Sure enough, there was a Second Heaven in the Red Cloud Foundation, but it seemed to be very different from the First Heaven.","“There are three heavens in the Red Cloud World, and the First Heaven has seven continents. The Seventh Continent, where Heaven-Treading Mountain is located, is the core of the Red Cloud World. It is vast and boundless. It is not much inferior to an astral world.","“The Second Heaven is not as vast as the First Heaven. There is only one island in the Second Heaven. The island you are on now is only hundreds of thousands of miles in size.”","Lord Wu said in a low voice.","“As for the Third Heaven in the Red Cloud World, it is even smaller. Although it is called the third heaven, there is only a simple high platform in the third heaven. The high platform is very ordinary, but it is very difficult to step onto it.”","“Do you also need to pass the test?” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at Lord Wu.","“Yes.” Lord Wu nodded. “There are two tests in the Red Cloud World. These two tests correspond to the tests of the outer and inner disciples. If you pass the Heaven-Treading Mountain test of the First Heaven, you can enter the Second Heaven and qualify as an outer disciple. In the Second Heaven, there’s also a test for inner disciples. You can only enter the third heaven if you pass the test here.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","At the same time, he also understood that the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain in the First Heaven was so difficult. He had to exert all his strength and use all his trump cards to barely pass it. As for the trial in the Second Heaven, it was definitely more difficult, with his current strength, the possibility of passing it was very slim."]},{"number":3785,"title":"Chapter 3785 - Patriarch Red Cloud","paragraphs":["“Little guy, I’ve told you so much, but you probably don’t even know who the master is.” Lord Wu stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Listen, master, his real name is host. Of course, almost no one in the universe knows this name. Most people only know the title of master, Patriarch Red Cloud.” Lord Wu’s face was filled with respect and admiration. “Master is a supreme expert, and a very powerful one at that. He personally founded the Red Cloud Branch and even opened a Divine Kingdom.”","“Is he really a supreme expert?” Jian Wushuang was not surprised.","As for opening a Divine Kingdom?","Jian Wushuang had never been to the depths of the universe. He did not know what a Divine Kingdom was, but judging from what Lord Wu said, opening a Divine Kingdom should be a great thing.","“How strong is an extremely strong Supreme Being?” Jian Wushuang could not help but ask.","“Very strong. Among the Supreme Beings, master is considered to be at the top level, enough to dominate the universe. However, there were too many top experts who participated in that battle. There were many who were stronger than master, such as Supreme Being Ling Yun, Jade Throat King, and the Hundred-Battle Demon Ancestor, who were all super experts who were above master. Master died at the hands of the Hundred-Battle Demon Ancestor, and even the Divine Kingdom was completely destroyed. Sigh!” Lord Wu could not help sighing.","Upon hearing Lord Wu’s words, Jian Wushuang immediately had many thoughts.","Supreme Ling Yun, Jade Throat King, and the Hundred-Battle Demon Ancestor?","He might not know about Jade Throat King and the Hundred-Battle Demon Ancestor, but he knew about Supreme Ling Yun.","After all, he was now a disciple of the Ling Yun Star lineage.","“According to Lord Wu, many years ago, an extremely fierce battle broke out in the depths of the universe. Even supreme experts died in that battle. Supreme Ling Yun and Patriarch Red Cloud participated in that battle, and Patriarch Red Cloud died in that battle. As for Supreme Ling Yun, perhaps he was severely injured in that battle, which led to the disaster of the Ling Yun Star lineage,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","......","At the same time, he finally understood why there were three battlefields in this Star Field.","According to his estimation, it was very likely that the battle back then was too earth-shattering, causing many Divine Kingdoms to collapse. One of the Divine Kingdoms was swallowed by the broken cosmic turbulence and drifted into this Star Field. As for the Red Cloud World...the Secret Realm where Ling Yun Star was located was probably also a floating one.","“When master was alive, his strength was monstrous. He founded the Red Cloud lineage and had a complete disciple training system. This Red Cloud World was specially selected for master to choose suitable disciples. Back then, in the vast universe, who knows how many genius disciples came to the Red Cloud World, hoping to pass the test of the Red Cloud World and become a disciple of the Red Cloud lineage.”","“Even if it’s just an outer sect disciple, it’s enough for countless geniuses to go crazy fighting over it. At that time, our Red Cloud World would occasionally select outer sect disciples or even inner sect disciples for master. However, ever since that battle, the Red Cloud World has drifted here. Although I have always followed my duty and been selecting disciples for the Red Cloud World, up until now, the only person who has successfully passed the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain is you!","“Little guy, you’re the first person to pass the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain after master died. Although you won’t be treated as an outer disciple of the Red Cloud Branch, I won’t give you any less benefits in the Red Cloud World.”","As Lord Wu spoke, he waved his hand, and immediately, token after token appeared and floated in front of Jian Wushuang. There were 36 tokens.","“According to the rules set by master, whoever passes the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain and comes to the Second Heaven can not only enjoy the great opportunities in the Second Heaven, but also choose one of the 36 secret skills to cultivate. Little Guy, you can choose one of these 36 tokens,” Lord Wu said.","Looking at the 36 tokens floating in front of him, it was obvious that each of them contained a secret skill.","This secret skill came from the Red Cloud Branch. Since Patriarch Red Cloud was so powerful, any one of the 36 secret skills must be extraordinary.","However, Jian Wushuang was not happy.","“Lord Wu, is this the reward for passing the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","“Why? Are you still not satisfied?” Lord Wu immediately glared at him. “Boy, I’m afraid you don’t know that each of the 36 secret skills is an extremely precious treasure of the Red Cloud Branch. Some were created by the master himself, while others were plundered by other supreme experts. Each of these secret skills is enough to cause countless Rulers to fight for it. Even some weaker supreme experts would covet them. How could you not be satisfied?”","“No, no.” Jian Wushuang shook his head repeatedly. “That’s not what I meant, nor do I dislike the 36 secret skills. However, I came to Heaven-Treading Mountain because I Need a special treasure, which may be found in the Red Cloud World.”","“Oh, what treasure?” Lord Wu looked over.","“The iceheart glazed jade, a special treasure that can help people shape their glazed bodies,” Jian Wushuang said solemnly.","He really desired the iceheart glazed jade, which was a precious treasure for his wife to rebuild her divine body.","He had been so eager for the Red Cloud World not only because of the opportunities in the Red Cloud World, but also because there were countless treasures in the Red Cloud World, most likely including the iceheart glazed jade, that was why he had desperately wanted to pass the Heaven-Treading Mountain’s test.","He had thought that he would have a chance to get the iceheart glazed jades after passing the Heaven-Treading Mountain’s test, but he had not expected that the reward after passing the Heaven-Treading Mountain was only one of the thirty-six secret techniques.","Indeed, these thirty-six secret techniques were very powerful, and any one of them was far more valuable than the iceheart glazed jades. However, he had longed for the iceheart glazed jades even more.","“Iceheart glazed jade?” Lord Wu frowned slightly and said, “There is no such thing in the Red Cloud World.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang’s face changed immediately.","“No? The Red Cloud World has endless Supreme Treasures and countless opportunities and treasures. How can there be no iceheart glazed jade?” Jian Wushuang could not believe it.","“I am in charge of everything in the Red Cloud World. I can tell you with certainty that although there are many treasures left by master in the Red Cloud World, including all kinds of genius and earthly treasures, the iceheart glazed jade you mentioned is not among them.” Lord Wu was very sure.","..."]},{"number":3786,"title":"Chapter 3786 - The Heart of the Astral World","paragraphs":["“No?”","Jian Wushuang was confused and unwilling to accept this.","He had gone through a lot of trouble to pass through Heaven-Treading Mountain to get the iceheart glazed jade, but now Lord Wu told him that he did not have it. How could he accept this.","“I can see that you need the iceheart glazed jade very much.” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang deeply, but then he smiled. “You don’t have to be nervous. There is no ice-heart glazed jade in the Red Cloud World, but there is something in the Red Cloud World that can replace it. It’s even better than the ice-heart glazed jade.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang looked at him immediately.","“Little guy, you want the ice-heart glazed jade so that you can reshape someone’s divine body, right?” Lord Wu asked.","“Yes, for my wife,” Jian Wushuang answered immediately.","“No wonder.” Lord Wu understood. “The ice heart glazed jade can reshape a glazed body. The glazed body can be molded at will. However, the glazed body itself is not a very good physique. After it is molded, it will be the same as an ordinary cultivator. At most, it will have a slight advantage.”","“But in the Red Cloud World, there is a special treasure that is also used to create divine bodies. It is called the heart of the Astral World.”","“The heart of the Astral World?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","It was the first time he had heard of this treasure.","“As the name suggests, the heart of the Astral World is the core of an astral world. It contains the essence of an astral world for billions of years and has incredible effects. It is easy to create a divine body with the heart of the astral world. In terms of potential, the divine body created by the heart of the astral world is much stronger than the so-called glazed body.”","“Under normal circumstances, if a cultivator absorbed the stellar heart, he would easily become a Ruler and even become a Supreme Being. The stellar heart contains the endless essence of an astral world, including the vast life force of the astral world. Therefore, if a divine body is formed with the stellar heart, the life force of the divine body formed will be extremely strong. The recovery of the divine body will be many times faster than that of an ordinary cultivator,” Lord Wu said.","......","Hearing Lord Wu’s words, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","The heart of the astral world contained endless life force.","Moreover, after a cultivator absorbed the heart of the astral world, he would have great potential and become a Ruler easily?","The heart of the Astral World was amazing.","It was many times stronger than the glazed ice jade.","“Shuang ‘er’s strength is too weak. I was worried that even if she had the glazed ice jade, she would need to cultivate step by step to become a Principles Master, let alone a Ruler. But if she could get the heart of the astral world, it would be much easier.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, he was extremely excited.","“Lord Wu, can I exchange the reward for passing the Heaven-Treading Mountain for the heart of the Astral World?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Exchange for the heart of the Astral World? You wish.” Lord Wu sneered, “Little guy, I have just told you the use of the heart of the astral world. You should be able to hear that the heart of the astral world is a very rare treasure. It is extremely precious even in the vast universe.”","“After all, the Astral World Heart is the core of an astral world. During the process of Astral World Evolution, it is protected by the laws of the universe. No one can take it out. Only when an astral world evolves to the end and self-destructs will the astral world heart be left behind. Moreover, not every astral world that evolves to the end will leave behind an astral world heart. Instead, only when tens of thousands of astral worlds evolve to the end will there be an astral world heart left behind.","“Most importantly, the heart of the astral world will return to the universe after less than a month in the universe void. If no one finds it within a month or can’t take it with special treasures, then the heart of the astral world will be gone.”","“Because of this, the heart of the astral world is extremely rare in the universe, and its value is extremely expensive. Under normal circumstances, the entire wealth of a fourth-level or even fifth-level Ruler is not comparable to the heart of the astral world, and this is only the price of the heart of the astral world. But the heart of the astral world is too rare in the universe. Even if you can afford it, someone must sell it.”","Lord Wu’s words stunned Jian Wushuang.","Although he had guessed that the heart of the astral world might be valuable, he did not expect it to be so valuable.","Even the entire wealth of the fourth and fifth-level Rulers might not be as valuable as the heart of the astral world.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang frowned. “Lord Wu, although the heart of the Astral World is very precious, each of the 36 secret skills of the Red Cloud bloodline is enough to drive countless Rulers crazy. The value of these secret skills should be above the heart of the Astral World, right?","“At the very least, they should be more or less the same.”","“Mm. You are right. These thirty-six secret arts have been accumulated by the redcloud lineage over the course of countless years. Their value is immeasurable. Even a single secret art would be worth as much as the astral heart.” Lord Wu nodded slightly, but then, the conversation changed, “However, the trials and rewards of the redcloud lineage were all set by master when he was alive. Although master is now dead, no one can change the rules he set. Naturally, I can’t change them either.”","“If you pass the Heaven-Treading Mountain, then you can only get one of the thirty-six secret techniques, as well as the opportunities contained in the Second Heaven. You can also get it, but other things like the heart of the astral world can not be obtained through the Heaven-Treading Mountain. Of course, you can continue to work hard and think of a way to pass the Second Heaven’s test.”","“As long as you can pass the test of the Second Heaven, you can go to the third heaven and become an inner disciple of the Red Cloud Branch. According to the rules set by the master, an inner disciple can choose three treasures from all the treasures in the Red Cloud World. Then you can choose the heart of the Astral World as your reward,” Lord Wu said.","“Can I get the heart of the astral world only after I pass the Second Heaven?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly.","Jian Wushuang had already used all his skills to pass the First Heaven.","Although he had yet to pass the Second Heaven, he could imagine that it would be much more difficult than the First Heaven.","It would be impossible for him to pass it now.","“Little fellow, you don’t have to be too anxious. What you need to do now is to choose one of the thirty-six secret techniques and cultivate it. Then, you can use some of the opportunities in the Second Heaven to think of ways to increase your strength. Although the Second Heaven’s trial is a hundred times more difficult than the First Heaven’s trial, with your talent, you might be able to pass it in the future,” Lord Wu said."]},{"number":3787,"title":"Chapter 3787 - The Principles Supreme Treasure","paragraphs":["“The future?”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. “Lord Wu, you know that I’m a cultivator in this Star Field, and the Red Cloud World usually only appears once every hundreds of millions of years. Every time it appears, it’s only 10,000 years. It’s been almost 8,000 years since the Red Cloud World appeared. In other words, I have less than 2,000 years left. How can I talk about the future?","“Do we have to wait until the next birth of the Red Cloud World?”","“You don’t have to worry about that.” Lord Wu smiled. “The Red Cloud World only appears once every hundreds of millions of years in this Star Field, and each birth is irregular. Of course, it depends on my mood. When I want to be born, I will be born. Similarly, whoever I want to let into the Red Cloud World can enter.”","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked at Lord Wu.","“If you didn’t pass the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain before, then you will have to wait hundreds of millions of years before you can enter the Red Cloud World again. But now that you have passed the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain and are an outer disciple of the Red Cloud Branch, you can naturally enter and exit the Red Cloud World at will. Before you leave the Red Cloud World, I will give you a token. Through the token, you can easily find the entrance to the Red Cloud World and enter the Red Cloud World,” Lord Wu said with a smile.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","“Lord Wu, you mean I can enter and leave the Red Cloud World at any time in the future?” Jian Wushuang asked excitedly.","“Yes.” Lord Wu nodded and said, “Of course, if you enter the Red Cloud World through the entrance, there won’t be any Supreme Treasures appearing in the Red Cloud World.”","“Supreme Treasures appearing? Lord Wu, those Supreme Treasures appearing in the Red Cloud World were deliberately guided by you, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, I did,” Lord Wu admitted, “the purpose of the Red Cloud World is to select suitable disciples for the master’s lineage. If you want to choose disciples, you have to attract an endless stream of genius experts. How to attract them depends on these Supreme Treasures.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood. “But the number of Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World over the past few epochs is too much, isn’t it?”","Jian Wushuang was amazed in his heart.","......","The Red Cloud World had existed in this Star Field for several epochs. Although it only opened once every hundreds of millions of years, it had probably opened hundreds of times over the past few epochs.","And every time the Red Cloud World opened, countless Supreme Treasures would appear in the first sky. For a full 10,000 years, even if one Supreme Treasure appeared in the Red Cloud World every year, it would still be more than 10,000 Supreme Treasures, if the Red Cloud World opened more than 100 times, it would be more than a million Supreme Treasures.","In addition, among these Supreme Treasures, there was no lack of pinnacle or even Supreme Treasures!","Although the red cloud lineage was once extremely glorious, it had declined no matter what. Even Patriarch Red Cloud had died, but there were still so many Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World?","Lord Wu seemed to have read Jian Wushuang’s mind and smiled, he said, “Little guy, don’t think that the number of these Supreme Treasures is frightening. In fact, the value of these Supreme Treasures is pitifully low. The Red Cloud World has opened hundreds of times and produced millions of Supreme Treasures. However, the value of these millions of Supreme Treasures added together is only equivalent to one or two good Principles Supreme Treasures.”","“A Principles Supreme Treasure?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “What is a Principles Supreme Treasure?”","“You don’t know?” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise. Seeing him shake his head, he smiled and said, “It seems that your Star Field is too remote. You don’t even know what a Principles Supreme Treasure is.”","“A Principles Supreme Treasure is a Supreme Treasure that has been blessed by the principles of the universe. Its power is extremely powerful, far beyond that of ordinary Supreme Treasures. The conditions for using a Principles Supreme Treasure are also very high. Under normal circumstances, one must grasp a trace of the aura of the principles of the universe in order to barely grasp it. However, it is only barely grasped. As for the power of a Principles Supreme Treasure...one must have a certain level of comprehension of the principles of the universe.”","“In the vast universe, Principles Supreme Treasure are extremely valuable. Any low-level Principles True Treasure can be exchanged for thousands of Supreme True Treasures. Principles Supreme Treasure are treasures that true great beings in the universe can use. Most Rulers in the universe, even those at the second or third level, don’t have Principles Supreme Treasure. However, those at the fourth level and above might be able to get one or two if they’re lucky.”","“However, as long as a fourth-level Ruler hasn’t comprehended any universe principles, he can’t exert the power of a Principles Supreme Treasure. Of course, even if he can’t exert the power, the power of the Principles Supreme Treasure can still be enhanced by the universe principles.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","A Principles Supreme Treasure?","A weapon and treasure used by top experts in the vast universe?","Even the lowest level of a Principles True Treasure contained the laws of the universe. One had to comprehend the laws of the universe to be able to exert its power?","Any Principles True Treasure was worth hundreds or thousands of Supreme True Treasures?","“Oh my God.” Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming.","He had been delighted when he had obtained a Supreme Flight Type True Treasure and a Supreme True Treasure Armor in the Red Cloud World, but now, in the blink of an eye, he knew about the existence of a Principles True Treasure.","He immediately understood that he had always been a frog in a well.","A Supreme True Treasure was indeed a good treasure in this Star Field, enough to make a Ruler expert fight for it.","But in the vast universe, it was nothing. Only a Principles True Treasure was used by a true expert.","“Do you understand now?”","Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. “It’s just a few million ordinary Supreme Treasures. Even a Supreme Being wouldn’t care about them, let alone a Supreme Being like master. In that battle, when Master died and his Divine Kingdom collapsed, countless cultivators in the Divine Kingdom died and their Supreme Treasures were left behind. Many of them were absorbed by the Red Cloud World, so there are hundreds of millions of such Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World.”","“I only control the number of True Treasures that come into being in order to make the Red Cloud World last longer.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh in his heart.","In this Star Field, countless Principles Masters, including many Rulers, were crazily fighting for the True Treasures, especially the Supreme True Treasures.","After several opportunities, countless experts had died fighting for these True Treasures. However, who would have thought that the treasures that the experts were crazily fighting for in this Star Field were so garbage in Lord Wu’s eyes.","That was right, trash."]},{"number":3788,"title":"Chapter 3788 - Ordinary and Supreme","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang could not help being stunned when he imagined the hundreds of millions of Supreme Treasures piled up together.","Hundreds of millions of Supreme Treasures.","No wonder Lord Wu dared to be so extravagant. Every time the Red Cloud World opened, tens of thousands of Supreme Treasures would appear.","It turned out that these Supreme Treasures were so worthless in Lord Wu’s eyes.","“Little guy, when you were adventuring in the First Heaven, you also got a lot of Supreme Treasures, including a wing Supreme Treasure, right?” Lord Wu looked at him.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Thinking of his celestial wings, he could not help but smile bitterly in his heart.","Celestial Light Wings was the most powerful flying Supreme Treasure.","When he got the Celestial Light Wings, he was pleasantly surprised, especially when he sensed the power of the wings. He was extremely happy.","Because of the wings, his strength had greatly increased.","However, now that he knew about the existence of the Principles Supreme Treasure, Jian Wushuang felt that the wings were only so-so in the eyes of top experts.","“Well, the Wing Supreme Treasure you obtained in the First Heaven is actually not bad,” Lord Wu said.","“Not bad?” Jian Wushuang looked at Lord Wu.","“The Red Cloud Branch has been destroyed for many years. The Red Cloud World alone has been opened in this Star Field for several eras. During this long period of time, I divided the hundreds of millions of True Treasures in the Red Cloud World into different levels because I was bored. Most of these hundreds of millions of True Treasures are classified as the lowest level, which is garbage.”","......","“The Universe True Treasures that your Star Field calls elementary Universe True Treasures, advanced universe True Treasures, top-tier Universe True Treasures, and Pinnacle Universe True Treasures are all trash,” said Lord Wu.","“As for the universe True Treasures that your Star Field calls the strongest universe True Treasures, I can barely classify them as ‘ordinary’. Although these ordinary True Treasures are useless to me, they are barely enough for ordinary first-level and second-level Rulers to use.”","“As for the ‘ordinary’ True Treasures, I can also classify them as ‘supreme-grade’ True Treasures. As the name implies, they are among the so-called universe Supreme True Treasures. Some of them are more powerful, and some of them might be more special. As for the treasures that I can classify as ‘supreme-grade’ True Treasures, they are barely worthy of my attention. In terms of value, they are naturally much more valuable than ordinary Supreme True Treasures.","“There are more than 1,000 ordinary True Treasures, which can barely be compared to one of the lowest Principles Supreme Treasure. There are dozens of supreme-grade True Treasures, which can be compared to one of the lowest Principles Supreme Treasure.","“There are many low-grade or ordinary True Treasures in the Red Cloud World, but only a hundred of them can be classified as supreme-grade. I don’t usually throw them out for you to fight over. It’s only after the Red Cloud World opens a few times that I throw one out.","“This time, I threw out a supreme-grade treasure, the wings, which you got in the end.”","Hearing Lord Wu’s words, Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly lit up.","He had been shocked and thought that the Celestial Light Wings he got were just like that.","But now, it seemed that the Celestial Light Wings were not bad.","Although it was far from being comparable to a Principles True Treasure, it was at least a supreme-grade True Treasure, much stronger than the so-called Supreme True Treasure. Besides, Lord Wu had said that a supreme-grade True Treasure like this could be exchanged for dozens of them, it could barely be exchanged for a lowest-grade array True Treasure.","In other words, the mystic light sky-escaping wing was at least one-tenth of a Principles True Treasure, which was already very good.","“Your Star Field is too remote. I’m afraid that you’re not qualified to meet experts, so you’re not qualified to meet powerful Supreme Treasures. Therefore, you treat these low-level and ordinary Supreme Treasures as treasures and fight crazily for them. But in the future, when you enter the depths of the universe, you don’t have to go too deep. As long as you enter the slightly larger Star Field, you’ll understand how narrow your horizons are.” Lord Wu smiled faintly.","Jian Wushuang curled his lips. He was displeased, but he could not refute.","“By the way, there are many low-level and ordinary Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World. Do you want me to give you a few?” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. “Supreme Treasures of this level were absorbed from the Divine Kingdom. They were not left by master. If you want them, I can give them to you directly.”","“Of course I want them.” Jian Wushuang immediately looked excited.","Although he now knew the existence of Principles Supreme Treasure and knew that these so-called Supreme True Treasures were only so-so, Supreme True Treasures were extremely rare in this Star Field, it was definitely enough to make many Rulers fight for them.","Perhaps he did not lack Supreme True Treasures, but he did not have any good friends.","For example, Daoist Xuan God, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor did not have any Supreme True Treasures.","There were also many high-level great beings in the Divine Beginning Realm. If he could bring back a large number of Supreme True Treasures from the Red Cloud World this time, then the combat power of the highest level in the entire Divine Beginning Realm would be able to rise by a large level, in the future, when he fought against Devil Cloud Star, his confidence would be even greater.","“Haha, looking at your eagerness, fine. When you plan to go to the Red Cloud World, I’ll take you to pick them out. Although I won’t give you too many Supreme True Treasures, you can get hundreds of ordinary and low-level ones,” Lord Wu said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","However, Lord Wu said, “Little guy, you’re now an outer disciple of the Red Cloud Branch. You should be more open-minded. Ordinary True Treasures are not worth your happiness. What you should really care about now is the Principles True Treasures!”","“Principles-based treasures...” Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. “Lord Wu, I have a chance to get Principles-based treasures in the Red Cloud World, right?”","“Of course.” Lord Wu nodded. “Didn’t I tell you before that as long as you pass the test of the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World and become an inner disciple of the Red Cloud Branch, you can choose three of the treasures in the Red Cloud World.”","“And the treasures in the Red Cloud World were all left behind by master. Although master only left a few at will, and there aren’t many of them, only a few hundred, any one of them is enough to make the Rulers of the fourth or even the fifth level envious and even go crazy. As for the Principles Supreme Treasure, there are dozens of them. When the time comes, you can choose whatever you want to use.”","“Only if you can pass the second test of the Red Cloud, of course.”"]},{"number":3789,"title":"Chapter 3789 - Inner Disciple’s Request","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang was excited when he heard it.","Although there were only hundreds of treasures left by Patriarch Red Cloud in the Red Cloud World, any one of them was priceless. It was enough to drive a fourth-level or even fifth-level master crazy.","As long as he passed the test of the Second Heaven, he could choose three of these treasures.","“I must pass the test of the Second Heaven.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with an unprecedented desire.","Not only for the Principles Supreme Treasure, but most importantly, he had to pass the test of the Second Heaven to get the Star World Heart, which could help his wife, Leng Rushuang, recover her divine body.","For his wife, he had to pass the test of the Second Heaven no matter what.","“Determination is a good thing.”","Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang and poured a bucket of cold water on him. “But the Second Heaven’s test is extraordinary. Although you passed the First Heaven’s test and your talent is very good, and you are among the top in the entire universe, there is not much hope for you to pass the Second Heaven’s test.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked at him.","“Little guy, you know that the test in the Red Cloud World is to select disciples for the Red Cloud Branch. At its peak, the Red Cloud Branch was so powerful that it had a huge Divine Kingdom. My master, Patriarch Red Cloud, was a top expert among the Supreme Beings. Since he was so powerful, he naturally had high expectations. Ordinary geniuses were nothing in his eyes.”","“Even someone like you, a genius who can last for a long time in the hands of three top-tier masters of the first level, can only become an outer disciple of the Red Cloud Branch. As for inner disciples, the requirements are much higher than outer disciples.”","“After all, in the past, the price of resources spent by the Red Cloud Branch to nurture an inner disciple alone would not be lower than the entire wealth of an Ultimate Ruler. Moreover, these inner disciples have a certain chance of being valued by their master and receiving his true teachings. This has led to countless geniuses in the vast universe trying their best to join the Red Cloud Branch to become inner disciples. However, even at the peak of the Red Cloud Branch, the total number of inner disciples added up is only a few dozen.”","“You can imagine how difficult it is to become an inner disciple of the Red Cloud Branch.”","......","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s face became extremely solemn.","Indeed, according to Lord Wu, the cost of cultivating an inner disciple of the Red Cloud Branch was comparable to the entire wealth of an ultimate level Ruler. This price was indeed too high, naturally, the requirements were even higher.","In the peak of the Red Cloud Branch, there were only a few dozen inner disciples. This further proved the difficulty of becoming an inner disciple.","Without a doubt, the dozens of people who could become inner disciples of the Red Cloud Branch must be the most monstrous super genius in the vast universe.","“Little guy, since you’ve come this far, I might as well tell you that as a Principles Master, if you want to become an inner disciple of the Red Cloud Branch, the threshold is to comprehend a trace of the universe principles. As long as you comprehend a trace of the universe principles, you can easily pass the test of the Second Heaven. There’s no other way,” Lord Wu said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes.","“Why? Are you scared?” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He was indeed scared.","He had comprehended a trace of universe principles?","After all, even a Ruler who could comprehend a trace of universe principles was extremely heaven-defying.","Like Devil Flame, he was an Ultimate Ruler. However, he met a Ruler who had comprehended a trace of universe principles and was chased by him. That was why his divine body was destroyed and only his remnant soul escaped, he had been struggling for his life for a very long time.","One could imagine that a Ruler who had comprehended a trace of a universe principles was an extremely abnormal being, and he was destined to become a top-tier great being among Rulers.","Rulers were all like this, yet he was only a Principles Master now?","To ask a Principles Master to comprehend a trace of a universe principles was absolutely a fool’s dream.","“Actually, in the beginning, the requirements for the second sky trial of the Red Cloud World weren’t that outrageous. It’s just that master might have been dissatisfied with the quality of the inner disciples of the red cloud lineage, or perhaps it was because master wanted to take in true disciples, so he intentionally raised the requirements. Unfortunately, not long after he raised the requirements, that great battle broke out. Master died, and the requirements for the Red Cloud World trial couldn’t be changed back.” Lord Wu said seriously.","“Of course, although the requirement for a Principles Master to comprehend a trace of universe principles is indeed very demanding and incredible, the universe is too big and vast, and there are endless geniuses. It’s not impossible for such a Principles Master to comprehend a trace of universe principles in the universe, but it’s relatively rare.","“In the vast universe, there are different levels of geniuses. Among them, Principles Masters who can comprehend a trace of universe principles are among the top ones. Only one in a billion star worlds can appear.”","“Only one out of billions of star worlds appears?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","He did not travel to the depths of the universe, so he did not know how big the universe was. He also did not know how many Star Fields and star worlds there were in the universe.","However, just the number of billions of Star Worlds was enough to be exaggerated.","After all, the Divine Beginning Realm was only a third-class star world. It was only one out of billions of Star Worlds.","Even in his current Star Field, there were only dozens of astral worlds.","There was only a chance for a genius to appear in billions of Astral Worlds. The quality of this genius was too high.","“Little guy, you don’t have to worry too much. According to my estimation, even if you can’t compare to a super genius that only appears in billions of Astral Worlds, the difference is not too great,” Lord Wu said.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked over.","“You know, you’re at the edge of the universe. The strongest here is at most a second-level Ruler. Moreover, you’re not qualified to come into contact with the universe, nor do you have a perfect cultivation system or a complete inheritance. Most of the cultivators in your Star Field rely on themselves to explore and cultivate. The only chance they have is to come here through the chaotic flow of the universe to some battlefield fragments.”","“In such a harsh environment, you can pass the First Heaven’s test. Your talent is naturally extraordinary, and in the Second Heaven, which is now on this island, there are many opportunities. These opportunities will be of great help to you.”"]},{"number":3790,"title":"Chapter 3790 - Secret Skill, Dragon Extermination","paragraphs":["“With your talent, you might be able to pass the test of the Second Heaven if you spend some time with these opportunities,” Lord Wu said.","Although Lord Wu said it casually, Jian Wushuang still felt immense pressure.","“No matter what, I must get the heart of the Astral World and the Principles Treasure,” Jian Wushuang said with a fierce look in his eyes.","“Little guy, let’s not talk about the Second Heaven test for now. You can choose any of the 36 secret skills,” Lord Wu said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and then began to explore the 36 secret skills.","The 36 secret skills were recorded in the 36 tokens, so Jian Wushuang could only explore them one by one.","The 36 secret skills were all powerful secret skills accumulated by the Red Cloud Branch. Any one of them was powerful enough to drive a fourth-level or even fifth-level Ruler crazy.","Jian Wushuang browsed through them and found that they were indeed very impressive.","Some secret skills were not much weaker than his supreme immortal celestial body.","There were a total of 36 secret skills of various kinds, including powerful offensive secret skills, domain or suppression secret skills, protective secret skills, and so on.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","After all, there were many secret skills that he could use.","For example, there was a unique sword principle secret skill among these secret skills. Although Jian Wushuang did not cultivate it, he knew from the information that it was enough to make his swordsmanship more powerful.","Unfortunately, the threshold of this sword principle secret skill was very high, and he had to spend a lot of money to condense a Natal Divine Sword. The Natal Divine Sword was not an ordinary Natal Divine Sword, it had to reach the level of a Principles Supreme Treasure.","Jian Wushuang did not have a Principles Supreme Treasure, so naturally, he could only be envious of this secret skill.","There was also an extremely powerful secret skill in the area of consciousness. This secret skill could not only greatly increase the strength of one’s consciousness, but it could also release a terrifying consciousness attack.","That consciousness attack could ignore the obstruction of the soul. It was the same as the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack on the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","Jian Wushuang had experienced the Three-Eyed Demon Woman’s consciousness attack. Not only was it extremely powerful, but it was also unstoppable.","Of course, Jian Wushuang also yearned for such a secret skill.","If he suddenly used this consciousness attack while fighting with an expert, the other party would not be able to detect it in time and might be hit.","However, although this consciousness secret skill was good, the minimum cultivation threshold was the Ruler level. Moreover, it was not an ordinary Ruler. At the very least, it had to be at least a second-level Ruler.","He was still far from being a first-level Ruler, let alone a second-level one. Of course, he could not cultivate this secret skill of consciousness.","“These secret skills are worthy of the long accumulation of the Red Cloud bloodline. Any one of them is very impressive. However, the requirement to cultivate these secret skills is too high. Although I have 36 secret skills, there are only a few that I can cultivate now. I can’t cultivate any of the secret skills that I like that are of great use to me.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Little guy, you’re worried. You don’t know which secret skill to choose, do you?” Lord Wu looked at him.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Among the 36 secret skills, I can only cultivate about 10 at most. However, I don’t really desire these 10 secret skills. I don’t know which one to choose.”","“Haha, I can’t help it. You’re just a Principles Master and your realm is too low. If you’ve reached the Ruler level, even if you’re a first-level Ruler, you’ll be able to cultivate many more secret skills.” Lord Wu laughed, suddenly, his expression changed. “Little guy, if you can’t make up your mind, how about I recommend one to you?”","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang looked at Lord Wu immediately. “Lord Wu, which secret skill do you think I should cultivate now?”","“Take a look at this one.” Lord Wu waved his hand, and one of the 36 tokens appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang immediately checked the secret skill information in the token.","“Secret skill, dragon extermination, divine power burning secret skill!”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","As the name implied, the divine power burning secret skill was a secret skill that burned one’s own divine power by force, greatly increasing the consumption of one’s own divine power, so that one’s strength could reach a new level in a short period of time.","Jian Wushuang had briefly seen this secret skill before, but he did not pay much attention to it.","After all, each of the 36 secret skills was very impressive, and most of them were used to directly improve one’s strength or various means. As for this divine power burning secret skill...it required a large amount of divine power as a price to be used. Compared to other secret skills that were used directly, this divine power burning secret skill was obviously inferior.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang did not really care about this secret skill. He did not expect that Lord Wu would recommend this secret skill to him.","“Lord Wu, is this dragon-killing secret skill very powerful?” Jian Wushuang looked at Lord Wu.","“Of course it’s powerful.” Lord Wu smiled. “Little guy, you haven’t really explored the vast universe, so you don’t know much. In the vast universe, the divine power burning secret skill is relatively rare. At least it’s much rarer than other offensive or protective secret skills.”","“And godly power burning technique needs a huge amount of godly power as the foundation, and the consumption of godly power is too huge. Usually, a cultivator’s godly power will be completely exhausted not long after he uses the godly power burning technique. Therefore, almost all the cultivators in the universe use the godly power burning technique as their trump card. It’s the kind of technique that can only be used to fight for their lives.”","“However, it is undeniable that the divine power burning secret skill is very powerful. For example, a master of the first level, once he uses the divine power burning secret skill, his strength will increase by a hundredfold. In a short period of time, he will have the battle strength of a Master of the second level. Even a master of the fourth level, after using the divine power burning secret skill, will be able to barely reach the threshold of a master of the fifth level.”","“The burning of divine power can indeed reach this stage.” Jian Wushuang was not surprised.","“If it were anyone else, I would not recommend the dragon-killing secret skill, but you are different.” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang calmly. “Little guy, you are a perfect life-level cultivator. Your divine power is hundreds or even thousands of times more powerful than that of other cultivators of the same level. In other words, if an ordinary Principles Master can only maintain the burning of divine power for one breath, you can maintain it for hundreds or even thousands of breaths.”"]},{"number":3791,"title":"Chapter 3791 - Choice","paragraphs":["“Of course, there are too many changes in a battle, and you can’t only use one method that consumes divine power. Even if your divine power is hundreds or thousands of times more vast than ordinary cultivators, you can’t be so extravagant as to recklessly use this divine power burning secret technique. But no matter what, if you have this divine power burning secret technique, it will be much more convenient than other cultivators.”","“Other cultivators, even if they have the divine power burning secret skill, use it as their ultimate trump card to fight for their lives. But you can use it as long as you feel it’s necessary. After all, you have a lot of divine power, so it’s not a big deal even if you burn 10-20% of it,” Lord Wu said.","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly and began to think about it in his heart.","Indeed, compared to ordinary cultivators, he had a huge advantage in divine power.","The divine power burning secret skill could last for a long time even if he burned it at all costs.","With his strength, an ordinary life-and-death battle would not last long. It might even end in an instant. In his hands, the divine power burning secret skill could become a sharp blade, it was also a big trump card, and it could last much longer than ordinary cultivators.","“It’s decided. I want the dragon-exterminating secret skill.” Jian Wushuang had made up his mind.","After careful consideration, he confirmed that among the 36 secret skills, he could only cultivate more than 10 of them.","Among the 10 secret skills, the dragon-exterminating secret skill should be the most helpful to his strength.","According to Lord Wu, the divine power burning secret skill was extremely rare in the universe. If he missed it this time, he would not know whether he could get another divine power burning secret skill next time.","“Little guy, trust me. You won’t regret choosing the dragon-killing secret skill,” Lord Wu said with certainty.","Jian Wushuang smiled. Then he received the information of the dragon-killing secret skill according to Lord Wu’s instructions.","Although the dragon-killing secret skill was recorded in the token, Jian Wushuang could not take it directly.","Instead, under the guidance of Lord Wu, the information in the token entered his mind and formed a memory.","Soon, the complete information method of the dragon-exterminating secret skill was completely imprinted in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“This dragon-exterminating secret skill is actually so powerful.”","After completely receiving the information of the dragon-exterminating secret skill, Jian Wushuang was shocked and overjoyed.","He had thought that the dragon-exterminating secret skill was just a simple method to burn divine power. He did not expect that the dragon-exterminating secret skill could burn divine power in different levels.","The dragon-exterminating secret skill was divided into three volumes.","The first volume could be cultivated by the Principles Master. After burning divine power, one’s strength would increase by 100 times.","The second volume could be cultivated by the Ruler. The burning speed of divine power would increase by 10 times, and the strength would increase by 1,000 times.","In the third volume, the burning speed of divine power was increased by a hundred times, and the strength was increased by ten thousand times!","“Terrifying, it’s too terrifying!” Jian Wushuang shouted.","At the level of Principles Master, his strength was increased by a hundred times, and at the level of Ruler and Master, it was increased by a thousand times and ten thousand times.","Of course, the burning of divine power could only increase the power. As for his understanding of the Dao and understanding of the universe principles, he had not improved his ultimate moves. Moreover, in the second and third volumes.., the burning of divine power would also increase by 10 times or 100 times, which meant that the consumption of divine power was increasing.","Even so, it was still very abnormal.","“I’m now a Principles Master, so I can cultivate the first volume. Once I succeed...my battle strength will be at the level of a Superior Ruler. Once I use the dragon-killing secret skill to increase my power by 100 times, my battle strength will be able to soar to the level of a second-level Ruler. I’m afraid that among the second-level Rulers, I’m not weak, but I’m at the level of an advanced or even Superior Ruler.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, his eyes were shining brightly.","He felt that as long as he mastered this secret skill, his battle strength would be able to reach a new level.","In the future, even if the Devil Cloud Star Master came to kill him personally, he would be more confident in dealing with him.","“Although this dragon-killing secret skill is powerful, it’s not too complicated. You just need to spend some time to master the first volume. Of course, you don’t need to cultivate now. After all, this is the Red Cloud World. You Won’t encounter any danger here, and you won’t be able to use the dragon-killing secret skill in the Second Heaven. So it’s not too late for you to cultivate when you leave the Red Cloud World or when you’re about to leave,” Lord Wu said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“By the way, Lord Wu, you said that there are many opportunities in the Second Heaven? What opportunities are there?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The opportunities in the Second Heaven are on this island.” Lord Wu smiled. “Although this island is small, it contains countless opportunities. Some of these opportunities are left behind by experts of the Red Cloud lineage. Of course, most of them come from the outside world and are of a very high level. Of course, your strength is still too weak, and you haven’t even comprehended the universe principles. You can only see a little of the opportunities in the Second Heaven, but even if it’s just a little, it should be of great help to you.”","“For example, the Sword Stone that was born in the First Heaven during the opening of the Red Cloud World...”","“Sword Stone?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He had studied the Sword Stone in the First Heaven for 5,000 years.","During these 5,000 years, not only had his comprehension of the sword principle origin improved greatly, but he had also perfected his earth protection sword skill.","It could be said that the Sword Stone was very helpful to him, and it contained a total of four sword skills. He had only comprehended one sword skill before comprehending the body-protecting sword skill.","If he was not worried that the Red Cloud World would only open for 10,000 years, he did not want to waste too much time on the Sword Stone. Otherwise, he would have studied the other three sword skills under the Sword Stone.","“Is the Sword Stone related to the Second Heaven?” Jian Wushuang could not help asking.","“Yes.” Lord Wu nodded. “In the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World, there will occasionally be some special opportunities. In fact, these special opportunities do not belong to the First Heaven, but come from the Second Heaven. For example, the Sword Stone comes from the Second Heaven. There is not only one Sword Stone, but a total of 11 Sword Stones. On each Sword Stone, there are four golden characters. Each golden character has a sword skill that has reached the pinnacle of a Ruler.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately became excited.","Each of the 11 Sword Stones was engraved with four golden characters. Each golden character contained a swordsmanship that had reached the ultimate level of a Ruler?","..."]},{"number":3792,"title":"Chapter 3792 - Opportunities on the Island","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang knew very well how strong the swordsmanship in the Sword Stone was.","It was because he had grasped the universe origin of sword principle that he was barely able to observe some of the mysteries and concepts in the swordsmanship. However, what he could see was only the tip of the iceberg.","Even if it was just the tip of the iceberg, it had greatly improved his sword principle and swordsmanship.","And there were 11 Sword Stones like this?","“Those Sword Stones are the most important ones on this island, but they are only one of the many opportunities on this island. They are not the most precious opportunities. As for the other opportunities, you can explore them yourself,” Lord Wu said.","“Lord Wu, how long can I stay on this island?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s up to you. You can stay as long as you want. And even if you leave now, you can come in anytime,” Lord Wu said.","“Great.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining with joy.","“Go.” Lord Wu waved his hand.","ower and kept looking down at everything below.","There were all kinds of opportunities on the island. Jian Wushuang did see some places where opportunities should exist, but he did not stay. Instead, he kept moving forward.","Soon, he came to the center of the island, where he saw the pile of Sword Stones mentioned by Lord Wu.","Sure enough, there were 10 Sword Stones floating calmly in the air.","There were ancient and ethereal golden characters on each Sword Stone.","Each Sword Stone had four golden characters, and each golden character contained an extremely powerful sword skill.","In addition to the Sword Stone that was born in the First Heaven, there were 11 Sword Stones, which added up to a total of 44 heaven-shaking sword skills.","“The Sword Stone that was born in the First Heaven of the Red Cloud World alone is enough to drive many cultivators who are proficient in sword principle crazy, but there are 10 Sword Stones here.” Jian Wushuang smiled, he immediately rushed toward the 10 Sword Stones.","When he came to the Sword Stones and looked at the ancient and elegant golden characters on them, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and immediately sank his consciousness into them.","In an instant, the golden characters began to evolve into sword skills in his mind.","The world-shaking and terrifying sword skills were continuously practiced in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“So powerful, so terrifying!”","“These sword skills are simply incredible.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the sword skills that evolved from the golden words.","Without a doubt, these sword skills were not inferior to the four sword skills he had seen on the Sword Stone of the First Heaven.","Even with his current comprehension of the sword principle origin, he could only peek at some of these sword skills.","But even the surface of these skills was enough to shock him.","“This sword skill is as fast as the wind, shaped like fire, and can cause the world to collapse!”","“This sword skill has directly formed a boundless sword principle domain.”","“This sword skill can destroy everything with one strike!”","Jian Wushuang was extremely excited.","He knew very well that any one of the sword skills contained in these ten Sword Stones was unfathomable to him. Even if he studied them for a long time, he could not comprehend 10-20% of the sword skills, let alone so many sword skills, not to mention so many sword skills.","“There’s no rush. There are more opportunities on this island than just this Sword Stone. I’ll go and look for other opportunities first.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and released his consciousness from the Sword Stone. He immediately stood up and flew toward the surrounding void.","On this island, he began to look for other opportunities.","There were many opportunities in the Second Heaven, and they were everywhere. Moreover, they were not hidden. Naturally, it was very easy for him to look for them.","Soon, he found all kinds of opportunities on the island.","..."]},{"number":3793,"title":"Chapter 3793 - Wu God","paragraphs":["“What is this? A vortex?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the huge blood-colored vortex in front of him in surprise.","The blood-colored vortex was thousands of miles wide and looked like an open bloody mouth. It was extremely ferocious and terrifying.","On this island that was only hundreds of thousands of miles wide, the blood-colored vortex that covered thousands of miles was extremely eye-catching.","Besides the Sword Stone, the first place Jian Wushuang found was this blood-colored vortex.","“This vortex doesn’t seem to be dangerous,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","First of all, although the blood-colored vortex looked terrifying, it did not give Jian Wushuang any sense of danger.","Moreover, Lord Wu had said that the Second Heaven only contained opportunities, and there was no danger.","Naturally, he did not need to be too vigilant or worried.","After hesitating for a moment, Jian Wushuang slowly walked toward the core of the vortex. He did not encounter any obstacles,","when he appeared at the core of the blood-red vortex, a huge ancient picture appeared in front of him.","In the picture, a blood-red figure held a saber in one hand.","Suddenly, he swung his saber.","Whoosh!","It was a beautiful and extremely experienced saber move.","Reading on Myb o xno vel. com ,Please!","Jian Wushuang’s mind was instantly attracted by this saber move. At this moment, Jian Wushuang even felt that his entire consciousness and soul were about to be forcefully split apart by this saber move, a monstrous fear involuntarily emerged in his heart.","He was completely stunned and could not move.","He was completely intimidated by the shocking saber in the ancient picture.","It was not until the saber light in the ancient picture completely disappeared that Jian Wushuang managed to recover.","“Terrifying, too terrifying!”","“I’ve never seen such a terrifying saber.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the ancient picture in horror.","In the picture, the blood-red figure had already put away the saber, but Jian Wushuang would never forget the feeling of that moment.","At that moment, it felt as if his soul and consciousness were about to be forcefully split apart.","Without a doubt, it was a shocking move.","“Peerless Saber Skill!”","“The person who used this saber skill must be an expert at the supreme-level!”","“Absolutely!”","Jian Wushuang was absolutely sure.","Although the blood-red figure was not a supreme-level expert, the saber skill he used was definitely at the supreme-level.","“Such a saber technique has a complete ancient picture, and you can even feel the essence and mystery contained in it. Even you will be shocked by it. If an expert who is good at Saber principle were to look at this ancient picture and comprehend it, his understanding of saber principle would definitely improve at an incredible speed, and so would his saber technique.”","“Unfortunately, I’m not good at Saber Principle.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Without a doubt, the ancient scene at the core of the blood-red vortex was a great opportunity for any saber principle cultivator.","But for Jian Wushuang, who was good at sword principle, it was not very useful.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang walked out of the blood-red vortex and quickly went to another place.","“Hmm, statues?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the statues standing side by side in front of him.","There were four statues, each of which was extremely huge and towering, with a height of more than 300 meters.","Jian Wushuang could feel the existence of an extremely dense rule power from the four statues.","“Master, this is the statue of Wu God.” The voice of Devil Flame suddenly sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Statue of Wu God?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “What is Wu God?”","“Wu God is an extremely unique and powerful special life form in the universe. This kind of special life form is very unique. They are born to be favored by the principles of heaven and earth. They don’t need to comprehend the principles of heaven and earth. As long as they grow slowly and reach the peak stage, they will naturally comprehend nine rules and merge all nine rules to become a Ruler at the ultimate level,” Devil Flame said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","He did not need to comprehend the principles. As long as he reached the peak, he would naturally understand the nine principles and fuse them perfectly?","How could there be such a heaven-defying special life form in the Universe?","“No, since it’s a special life form, it should be unique. But you just said that there’s more than one Wu God?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Master, you misunderstand. Wu God is just a general name for this kind of special life form. Although they are all Wu Gods, the principles they comprehend and integrate with each other are different. After all, there are many kinds of heaven and earth principles. Even if each Wu God has comprehended and integrated nine principles, it can still create many Wu Gods,” Devil Flame said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","Yes, they were both gods. One had comprehended the nine rules, while the other had comprehended the other nine rules. Of course, they were different.","“It’s because gods are blessed that their divine bodies are so precious. Let alone a complete divine body, even a scale on their body represents the essence of the fusion of the nine rules. Therefore, in the universe, a scale at its peak is extremely valuable.”","“Later, some cultivators used the scales of the Wu God to transform them into statues of the Wu God. Although they were statues, they still contained the essence of the fusion of nine principles. Therefore, master, you can see the four statues of the Wu God in front of you now. Each one of them contains a rich power of principles. If you carefully sense them, you can even sense the fusion of nine different principles on each statue of the Wu God.”","“Master, you are only at the level of a Principles Master. If you want to break through to become a Ruler, you must understand and integrate more principles. The Wu God statue is of great use to you. Master, you can experience the integration of the nine rules on the Wu God statue. The four Wu God statues represent different principles of heaven and earth. Even the director can experience them,” Devil Flame said, he paused.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes had already lit up.","“The statue of Wu God...has fused nine different principles perfectly?” Jian Wushuang was excited.","Yes, he had not become a Ruler yet. Even if he had become a Ruler, he would need to fuse more principles of heaven and earth to increase his strength.","However, the statue of Wu God contained the fusion of nine principles. He could even experience the fusion process of the nine rules. It was a rare opportunity for him.","“The statue is of great use to me,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","Although it was of great use, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to comprehend it. Instead, he continued to look for other opportunities on the island.","..."]},{"number":3794,"title":"Chapter 3794 - Breaking Through Heaven-Treading Mountain","paragraphs":["There were so many opportunities on the island.","Sword Stones, ancient scenes in the blood-red vortex, and the statue of Wu God were just one of them.","Jian Wushuang searched the island and easily found all kinds of opportunities.","In the blink of an eye, three days passed.","Jian Wushuang searched the entire island and found nearly 100 opportunities.","There were all kinds of opportunities.","They were not only for improving one’s strength and cultivation, but also for comprehending the principles of the universe, the principles of heaven and earth, and various daos.","There were even opportunities to temper one’s consciousness and soul strength.","Many of them were very helpful to Jian Wushuang.","As for sword principle, there were three opportunities on the island that were helpful to the improvement of sword principle, and Sword Stone was just one of them.","“Strange, there are all kinds of opportunities on the island. There are even opportunities to deepen the comprehension of the universe principles, but there are none that can help a cultivator to cross the threshold of the universe principles.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had to master a trace of the universe principles to pass the test of the Second Heaven.","Therefore, he was naturally eager to find opportunities on the island that could help him master a trace of the universe principles and cross the threshold of the universe principles as soon as possible.","However, Jian Wushuang did not find such opportunities on the island.","On the contrary, there were several opportunities on the island that could help him deepen his understanding of the universe principles.","Reading on Myb o xno vel. com ,Please!","The key point was that Jian Wushuang had not even grasped a trace of the universe principles and had not really stepped into the threshold of the universe principles, so how could he deepen it?","In other words, if an expert had already comprehended the universe principles, he could continue to improve on the island with the help of opportunities, but for a cultivator like Jian Wushuang who had not grasped a trace of the universe principles...he could not find any opportunities on the island that would allow him to grasp a trace of the universe principles as soon as possible.","“If I think about it carefully, maybe Patriarch Red Cloud deliberately arranged it this way,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","He understood that for a Principles Master, the test of the Second Heaven was to grasp a trace of the universe principles.","Under this standard, if the island of the Second Heaven still had a shortcut that could allow him to quickly comprehend a trace of the universe principles, then the test of the Second Heaven would be a little too easy.","“Although there are no shortcuts, there are too many opportunities on this island. There are even many opportunities to deepen my understanding of the universe principles. Among these opportunities, I can more or less feel the existence of the universe principles. It’s much easier to comprehend it than just relying on myself,” Jian Wushuang thought.","“Let’s begin to comprehend it.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and soon began to cultivate on the island.","Time passed quietly.","Jian Wushuang stayed in the Second Heaven and took advantage of the opportunity on the island to meditate carefully and increase his strength.","However, in the First Heaven, many experts in the Star Field were still crazily fighting for the Supreme Treasures.","As the Supreme Treasures were born one by one, the competition for the Supreme Treasures in the Red Cloud World became more and more intense and crazier.","Especially in the last thousand years, because there were only one thousand years left, there were obviously not many treasures that were born, so the competition became more and more intense.","And in this frenzied competition, the deadline of ten thousand years in Red Cloud World was slowly approaching.","In the blink of an eye, there were only ten years left to the deadline of ten thousand years.","In the last ten years, the first sky of Red Cloud World began to gradually calm down, and the rush for True Treasures had gradually subsided.","Now, most of the cultivators in the first sky had gathered on the Seventh Continent, and they had all come to the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","The Legend of the Red Cloud World had long been known in this Star Field. Everyone knew that Heaven-Treading Mountain was a test. Since it was a test, passing it would naturally bring great benefits. It was precisely because of this...in the last ten years, most of the experts of this Star Field would choose to come to the foot of the Heaven-Treading Mountain to try and pass it.","Although it had been several chaos cycles since the Red Cloud World had appeared in this Star Field, no one had ever set foot on the peak of the Heaven-Treading Mountain. Everyone knew that they had to pass the trial of the Heaven-Treading Mountain, it was virtually impossible, but everyone was still willing to give it a try.","After all, what if their luck was heaven-defying and they passed?","Heaven-Treading Mountain. In a pavilion at the foot of the mountain, a black-robed man was calmly sitting there.","In front of the black-robed man was a densely packed long dragon.","Countless cultivators walked up the stairs to the pavilion and accepted the black-robed man’s trial.","After a short moment, the black-clothed man and the purple-clothed youth in front of him opened their eyes at the same time.","The moment they opened their eyes, the purple-clothed youth’s face turned slightly pale.","“Weak, truly too weak.”","The black-clothed man’s expression was cold as he stared at the purple-clothed youth in front of him. “You don’t even need me to make a move. Just the divine might alone will crush you. With such strength, you dare to challenge the Heaven-Treading Mountain? Scram!”","The black-robed man did not hold back in his berating.","The purple-robed young man’s expression was ugly, but there was nothing he could do.","Just now in the space of consciousness, the black-robed man had indeed not made a move. Just the casual pressure he released was enough to suppress him to the point of kneeling down. Both sides did not even need to make a move before he lost.","There was nothing he could do. The black-robed man was guarding the foot of the mountain. Although this was the simplest stage of Heaven-Treading Mountain, when facing the challenger of a Principles Master, the combat power he unleashed was still at the pinnacle of a Beginner Ruler, his power was also at the elementary Ruler realm, and the divine might of a Ruler was something that an ordinary Principles Master would not be able to withstand.","“Next.”","The black-robed man spoke.","Immediately, more people came to challenge him.","“Too weak, too weak!”","“It’s been so long, and there are already thousands of people taking the test in front of me. But up until now, I haven’t even taken anyone seriously. This Star Field is really trash.”","Although the black-clothed man said this, he knew in his heart that this Star Field was not that bad.","At least, not long ago, someone had easily passed through his hands. Moreover, he had received news that that person had passed the test of the Heaven-Treading Mountain and entered the Second Heaven.","In the last ten years of the First Heaven, a large number of cultivators had tried the test of the Heaven-Treading Mountain.","In the end, after five years, not a single person passed the trial at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain.","It was not until the sixth year that someone finally passed the trial guarded by the black-clothed man.","This person was a Ruler, Ruler Kun Yu.","A Peak Ruler who had long become famous in this Star Field. It was rumored that he was not the Ruler of this Star Field, but came from another Star Field. It was only because he saw the existence of the three great battlefields in this Star Field...he had always stayed here."]},{"number":3795,"title":"Chapter 3795 - Had He Reached the Peak?","paragraphs":["Ruler Kun Yu was a solitary expert who had never joined any faction before.","Over the years, he had been adventuring in the three battlefields in search of treasures and opportunities, and his strength had been constantly increasing.","There had been rumors that he had fought with the Northern Sea Palace’s Sky Roc Ruler, but no one knew who had won.","And today, Ruler Kun Yu had passed the test at the foot of the mountain. It was obvious that he had won that battle back then.","After all, two years ago, Ruler Sky Roc had come to challenge the test at the foot of the mountain. Although he had fought with the black-clothed man for a very long time in the space of consciousness, he had still been unable to defeat the black-clothed man in the end, so he had not been able to pass the test at the foot of the mountain, and since Ruler Kun Yu had passed, it naturally meant that he was stronger than Ruler Sky Roc.","“You’re still alright.”","The black-robed man looked at Ruler Kun Yu with a faint smile. “You’ve clearly only fused four principles and are only a first level Ruler. However, your combat power is extremely strong and isn’t the slightest bit inferior to a second level Ruler. In fact, even amongst the second level Primary Rulers, you are extremely strong. It seems that amongst the Rulers of this Star Field, your strength should be the strongest.”","“Let’s go up.”","Ruler Kun Yu’s face was as cold as an ice mountain.","Upon hearing the black-robed man’s words, he nodded slightly, then began to walk up the stairs.","However, the black-robed man once more spoke to everyone present, “Although the standard of your Star Field’s cultivators is indeed very low, for two of you to be able to pass through my hands during the opening of the Red Cloud World is already quite impressive.”","Ruler Kun Yu’s footsteps immediately came to a halt.","The experts present all turned to look at the black-robed man.","“Two people?”","“Aside from Ruler Kun Yu, there’s someone else who passed the test at the foot of the mountain?”","Reading on Myb o xno vel. com ,Please!","“Who is that person?”","The sounds of discussion immediately rang out.","Ruler Kun Yu turned to look at the black-robed man as well. “The Principles Master?”","“Yes.” The black-clothed man nodded.","He had just said that Ruler Kun Yu should be the strongest expert in the Star Field. If the same Ruler had passed the test at the foot of the mountain, the black-clothed man would not be so sure.","Naturally, it was the master of rules.","After all, the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain varied from person to person. Different levels of cultivation would challenge Heaven-Treading Mountain, and the gatekeepers would show different strengths.","For example, when Jian Wushuang came here to pass the test, the black-clothed man was only at the peak of the Primary Ruler realm.","However, if the Ruler came to pass his test, the battle strength he displayed would be at the peak of the Superior Ruler realm, or even the second level. Fortunately, the battle strength of the Kun Yu Ruler was extremely strong among the second level Primary Rulers, that was how he could pass the test.","Ruler Kun Yu did not stay any longer and continued to walk toward the mountainside.","However, the foot of the mountain was completely in an uproar.","Many cultivators were wildly discussing and guessing.","“Then who is the Principles Master who passed the test at the foot of the mountain before Ruler Kun Yu did?”","“If I’m not mistaken, it should be Blood Sword Master, right?”","“Blood Sword Master?”","“Yes, it’s very likely. Among the Principles Masters in this Star Field, the most powerful ones are Blood Sword Master and Blood Saber Emperor. If that Blood Saber Emperor goes all out, he can barely unleash the battle power of a Primary Ruler. Although he’s very impressive, he’s still far from Blood Sword Master. Blood Sword Master has the battle power of a top Ruler at the level of a Principles Master. With such battle power, it should be very easy for him to pass the test at the foot of the mountain.”","“Yes, I think it’s the Blood Sword Master. I don’t think any other Principles Master could pass the test at the foot of the mountain. The Blood Saber Emperor came here a year ago and failed.”","Most of the cultivators in the Star Field believed that the Principles Master who passed the test at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain before the Ruler of the Devil realm was Jian Wushuang.","This was normal. After all, Jian Wushuang had shown his true strength.","The Ruler of the Devil Realm also believed that he had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler.","It was unbelievable that a Principles Master had the battle strength of a Superior Ruler. It was so heaven-defying that the test at the foot of Heaven-Treading Mountain could not stop him.","Now, many cultivators in this Star Field were guessing whether Jian Wushuang had just passed the test at the foot of the mountain, or whether he had also passed the test at the mountainside and even reached the peak, he had gone to the Second Heaven?","Everyone was guessing. Some of them even tried to ask Jian Wushuang’s friends.","For example, some masters asked Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the others to find out the answer from them.","After all, this was not a trivial matter.","If Jian Wushuang had only passed the test at the foot of the mountain, it would not be a big deal.","Even if he passed the test at the mountainside, although it was amazing, it would not cause too much of a stir. However, if he really stepped on the peak of Heaven-Treading Mountain and went to the Second Heaven...that was something that no one in this Star Field had ever reached in the long years.","The First Heaven of the Red Cloud World contained endless Supreme Treasures, which was enough to drive many cultivators crazy. What was in the Second Heaven?","Almost all the cultivators in this Star Field were full of longing and desire for the Second Heaven, but they just could not go there.","It could be imagined that if the news of Jian Wushuang going to the Second Heaven was confirmed, it would set off a huge wave in this Star Field.","...","“Everyone, another Ruler came to see me. He also asked if the Heavenly Marquis had entered the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World. According to our agreement, he passed the two tests at the foot of the Heaven-Treading Mountain and the mountainside, but he failed to pass the tests at the peak. Naturally, he could not enter the Second Heaven. Now, he has left the Red Cloud World and is on his way back to our Star Palace.”","Daoist Xuan God exchanged messages with Jian Wushuang, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Heaven Ancestor.","“Haha, another one. This must be the eighth Ruler who came to ask you, right?” Temporal Temple Master laughed loudly.","“Not only you, but also quite a few people came to ask you for information,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang had passed the three tests of Heaven-Treading Mountain and entered the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World. Naturally, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Heaven Ancestor knew about this, after all, they were on the same side as Jian Wushuang, so he had nothing to hide from them.","After hearing the news, even the four Rulers were excited for half a day.","At the same time, they also learned from Jian Wushuang that he had gained a lot of benefits in the Second Heaven. Even now, he was in the midst of an opportunity, but Jian Wushuang did not tell them what he had gained, they did not ask.","Because they had considered that some people would doubt whether Jian Wushuang had entered the Second Heaven, they had already agreed on the story.","They all said that Jian Wushuang had only passed the test at the foot of the mountain and the mountainside, but he had lost in the test at the peak."]},{"number":3796,"title":"Chapter 3796 - 10,000 Years","paragraphs":["It could not be helped. If Jian Wushuang was told that he had passed the three trials of Heaven-Treading Mountain and entered the Second Heaven, it would definitely cause a huge wave in this Star Field, moreover, Jian Wushuang would definitely be targeted by many people with ulterior motives. Although Jian Wushuang did not need to fear anything in this Star Field with his current strength, it was still better to be cautious.","Now they said that Jian Wushuang had passed the first two trials of Heaven-Treading Mountain, but it was appropriate for him to be defeated in the third trial, which was the trial at the peak.","After all, until now, no one in this Star Field except Jian Wushuang could pass the trial at the mountainside. Many cultivators in this Star Field, as strong as Ruler Kun Yu, could only struggle a little in the trial at the mountainside, and they could not pass it at all. No one in this Star Field was sure whether there was a third test on the peak.","With Jian Wushuang’s heaven-defying strength, it was acceptable for him to pass the test at the foot of the mountain and the mountainside, but he could not pass the test on the peak.","Even if some people still did not believe it, there was no need to explain too much.","“My young friend, the Red Cloud World is about to close again, but you said that you would still stay in the Red Cloud World?” Daoist Xuan God suddenly asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “The Red Cloud World is not as simple as we thought. After passing the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain, I am qualified to enter the Red Cloud World at any time. From now on, I can stay in the Second Heaven for a long time to cultivate. Therefore, you two can return to the Star Palace without waiting outside. When you return to the Star Palace, just announce to the public that I am in closed-door cultivation,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Temporal Temple Master nodded.","“In that case, Temporal and I won’t wait for you. We’ll go back first.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master laughed heartily.","The two of them already knew that Jian Wushuang had gone to the Second Heaven, and they did not have the strength to go to the Second Heaven. Therefore, they did not even bother to go to Heaven-Treading Mountain and were ready to leave the Red Cloud World.","“My young friend, how long will you stay in the Red Cloud World?” The Heaven Ancestor suddenly asked.","“I don’t know, but I don’t think it will take too long.” Jian Wushuang said calmly, “By the way, when I return from the Red Cloud World, I will bring a surprise to everyone.”","“Surprise?”","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Heaven Ancestor were all surprised.","“Haha, what? Did you not only get an opportunity in the Second Heaven, but also something we can use?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said with a smile.","“Can you bring us some Supreme Treasures from the Second Heaven?” Daoist Xuan God teased.","Jian Wushuang did not say much. After chatting for a while, he ended the communication.","In the Second Heaven, Jian Wushuang put away the transmission token and shook his head with a smile.","“I’m afraid Xuan God and the others don’t know. The surprise I’m going to give them is the strongest Supreme Treasure.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","Lord Wu had promised him that he could pick some Supreme Treasures to bring back before he left.","The Supreme Treasures mentioned by Lord Wu, such as the supreme-grade Supreme Treasures like the Celestial Light Wings, might not be worth his time, but it was obvious that Lord Wu did not care about ordinary Supreme Treasures, he could bring a lot of them back.","After all, Xuan God and the others did not have many Supreme Treasures.","He only needed to bring some Supreme Treasures back and let them use them. Their strength could reach a new level.","The Divine Beginning Realm and Star Palace camp would naturally be stronger.","“Continue to meditate.”","Jian Wushuang soon calmed down and continued to cultivate and meditate with the opportunity on the island of the Second Heaven.","The last ten years in the Red Cloud World soon passed.","During these ten years, there were countless experts who went to Heaven-Treading Mountain. However, except for Jian Wushuang who passed at the beginning and the Ruler Kun Yu who passed later, there was no third person who passed the test at the foot of the mountain in this Star Field, master Kun Yu had only passed the trial at the foot of the mountain, but he was easily defeated by the gatekeeper at the halfway point.","When the last ten years were up, many cultivators of the Red Cloud World left the Red Cloud World. Even if they did not want to leave, they would be sent out by the experts of the Red Cloud World.","The entire Red Cloud World immediately fell silent. It would only reappear in front of the world after hundreds of millions of years when the next Red Cloud fog tide appeared.","At least, most of the cultivators in this Star Field thought so. However, only a few people knew that Jian Wushuang had appeared in the opening of the Red Cloud World. He had directly passed the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain and entered the Second Heaven, and he had been quietly meditating in the Second Heaven all these years.","Time passed quietly like flowing water.","In a flash, the Red Cloud World had been closed for 8,000 years.","Jian Wushuang had come to the Second Heaven about 2,000 years before the Red Cloud World closed.","In other words, he had stayed in the Second Heaven for more than 10,000 years.","Over the past 10,000 years, he had been improving his strength with the help of various opportunities on the island in the Second Heaven.","With the help of these opportunities, he had made great progress.","...","In the Second Heaven, there was an open space on the island that spanned hundreds of thousands of miles. However, there were layers of pale purple restrictions on the open space.","There were nearly 20 layers of restrictions, each of which emitted a sharp aura and was stronger than the last.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in front of the first restriction and closed his eyes slightly.","“Break!”","A soft moan suddenly sounded. A terrifying sword essence suddenly burst out from Jian Wushuang’s body and rushed into the restriction in front of him, rampaging inside the restriction.","Although this was only the first restriction, which was the weakest of all restrictions, it was difficult for even a second-level master to break this restriction.","But now, under the impact of Jian Wushuang’s sword essence, the restriction quickly began to collapse.","After a moment, the first restriction completely disappeared.","“It took me 4,000 years to finally break the first restriction of Sword Principle!” Jian Wushuang opened his eyes, full of surprise and joy.","4,000 years.","That was right, Jian Wushuang had spent 4,000 thoughts on this restriction.","The restriction of sword principle was a great opportunity for sword principle on the island. Each of these restrictions required a certain level of comprehension of sword principle to be able to crack. When Jian Wushuang first arrived at the restriction of sword principle, he could only crack one-tenth of the restriction of sword principle.","Over the past 4,000 years, he had gradually studied and understood it step by step. Finally, he had completely broken the first complete restriction of sword principle. Naturally, his comprehension of sword principle had also been greatly improved."]},{"number":3797,"title":"Chapter 3797 - Treasure Selection","paragraphs":["“I’ve already broken the first restriction of sword principle. As for the second restriction...”","Jian Wushuang also tried to break the second restriction, but after trying, he shook his head helplessly.","“The second restriction of sword principle is probably ten times more complicated and difficult than the first restriction of sword principle. It’s extremely difficult for me to break the first restriction of sword principle. I don’t know how long it will take to break the second restriction.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","It took him 4,000 years to break the first restriction of sword principle alone.","This was because he had a certain level of comprehension of sword principle origin, so he was able to study it step by step.","The second restriction contained more profound sword principle universe origin, so it was more than ten times more difficult to break. Jian Wushuang was not confident that he could break the second restriction in a short time.","“Forget it. I have benefited a lot from breaking the first restriction of sword principle. As for the second restriction of sword principle, I’ll try it again when I have the chance,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","He had been comprehending and improving his strength through various opportunities on the island for nearly 10,000 years.","After 10,000 years, he had made the greatest progress in sword principle, which was enough to break the first restriction of sword principle.","It must be known that even the restriction of the first layer of Sword Dao was difficult for a second-level Ruler who was proficient in sword dao to break through.","In other words, his current attainments in Sword Dao were no less than that of a third-level Ruler.","This was only in Sword Dao.","As for the principle, he had already completely comprehended the fourth principle, the principles of the Earth. However, he had yet to perfectly fuse it with the other three principles.","Although he was familiar with the integration process of Temporal, reincarnation, destruction and the earth principles under the statue of Wu God, it was obviously not that easy for him to integrate them.","As for the universe principles, he still had not really mastered it. However, the aura of the universe rule he had mastered was getting stronger and stronger.","Jian Wushuang understood that only supreme experts were qualified to comprehend the universe principles. Even a Ruler would find it difficult to comprehend it, let alone a Principles Master.","He could not be anxious. He could only slowly improve and comprehend them.","“After 10,000 years of comprehension, I feel that my strength has reached a bottleneck, especially in sword principle and other principles.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had realized that even with the help of many opportunities on the island, his progress was getting slower and slower.","As he said, he had reached a bottleneck.","This kind of bottleneck was not something that could be broken through simply by continuing to meditate here.","It required extremely special conditions, such as Epiphany.","Especially the kind of Epiphany in life and death, which was enough to make a person undergo a qualitative transformation. What Jian Wushuang lacked now was this kind of transformation.","“It’s been a long, long time since I’ve experienced the feeling of life and death.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","There was nothing he could do. As his strength continued to increase, especially his life-saving ability, there was no one in this Star Field who could threaten him.","Even if he was as strong as a Ruler, he could easily crush an ordinary Ruler. Even if he was a Superior Ruler, he would still have to deal with it seriously ten thousand years ago. But now, ten thousand years later, an ordinary Superior Ruler was also a threat to him.","It could be said that he was completely invincible in this Star Field.","Except for some of the most dangerous places in the three battlefields, no one could threaten him. Naturally, no one could force him to the brink of death.","Jian Wushuang carefully recalled that the last time he was on the brink of death was a long time ago, when he had set up an inescapable net to kill him in the three Saint Realms on the Saha Island.","That time, he was indeed on the verge of death.","After that battle, he had never been forced into a desperate situation again.","“Now I understand why the experts in the universe chose to venture into the depths of the universe after being invincible in a Star Field. Indeed, being invincible in a Star Field means that one can no longer experience life-and-death experiences, and their strength will stagnate. Only by constantly taking risks and constantly challenging stronger existences can one’s strength continuously increase.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","“It’s a pity that I have to worry about the Divine Beginning Realm and can’t leave freely with the danger of the Devil Cloud Star. However, I should be invincible in this Star Field. In that case, I can only go to the deepest part of the three battlefields where even the Rulers are afraid.”","“As for the Red Cloud World...it’s time for me to leave.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and made up his mind.","“Lord Wu,” Jian Wushuang said in a clear voice.","Buzz! A figure quickly condensed in the void around Jian Wushuang. It was Lord Wu, who was in charge of everything in the Red Cloud World.","“Little guy, are you ready to leave?” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “My progress on this island is getting slower and slower. Obviously, I have reached a bottleneck, and I can’t comprehend the universe principles in a short time. In that case, it’s useless to stay here. I might as well go to the outside world and look for other opportunities. As for the Second Heaven test, I’ll come back when I have comprehended a trace of the universe principles.”","“Okay, this is the token of the Red Cloud World. Take this token. You can come to the Red Cloud World Anytime in the future.” Lord Wu handed a token to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was secretly happy to have obtained the token.","After all, with this token, he could enter the Red Cloud World Anytime in the future. The numerous opportunities in the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World were very useful to him.","“Besides that, I’ve promised you before that you can choose some useful True Treasures. I’ll let you choose now.” After saying that, Lord Wu waved his hand, and an ancient black tower appeared in his hand, this black tower was divided into three levels, and its structure was very unique.","“The hundreds of millions of True Treasures that the Red Cloud World absorbed before are inside this tower. The tower is divided into three levels. The first level is the most garbage and the lowest level treasures. I can give you hundreds of thousands of such treasures, or even millions of such treasures.","“The second level is for ordinary level treasures, which are the strongest Supreme Treasures in your Star Field. I’ll let you choose one hundred of them.”","“As for the third level, it’s the strongest Supreme Treasure in the same level as your wings. There are only dozens of them left. I can only let you choose one.”","“Are you satisfied?” Lord Wu looked at Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3798,"title":"Chapter 3798 - Shadow Demon Armor","paragraphs":["“Yes, of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded without hesitation, but he was ecstatic.","Although the treasures on the first level were trash in Lord Wu’s eyes, many of them were top-tier or even top-tier universe True Treasures. Such True Treasures were enough to drive Principles Masters crazy, some powerful top-tier True Treasures were highly valued by even the Rulers in this Star Field.","As for the second and third floors, there was no need to mention them.","On the second floor, there were Supreme True Treasures. Any one of them was enough to make the Rulers in this Star Field envious and even crazy. However, Lord Wu had promised Jian Wushuang a total of 100 Supreme True Treasures.","On the third floor, there were dozens of Supreme True Treasures that could be compared to one Principles True Treasure. Although Lord Wu had only promised to give him one more, Jian Wushuang was already very satisfied.","“Little guy, you can enter this tower now and choose for yourself.” Lord Wu waved his hand, and the three-story black tower began to enlarge in front of Jian Wushuang, soon it became a towering tower that was a thousand feet tall.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and directly entered the tower.","The first floor of the black tower was actually a dark space. Jian Wushuang did not see any Supreme Treasures in this dark space, but there was an extremely detailed list of Supreme Treasures in front of him. This list...the information was too huge.","After all, there were hundreds of millions of Supreme Treasures here. Ordinary people would not record the information of these Supreme Treasures on the list, it was because Lord Wu was too bored in the Red Cloud World that he divided the levels of these Supreme Treasures and recorded the information of these Supreme Treasures.","Of course, the information of these Supreme Treasures was only the simplest kind, which was the name of the Supreme Treasure and the category it belonged to.","Jian Wushuang did not bother to read so much information. He chose a total of 100,000 Supreme Treasures at the level of a pinnacle Supreme Treasure. There were all kinds of Supreme Treasures.","“100,000 Pinnacle True Treasures should be enough,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","Of course, he did not need Pinnacle True Treasures.","But the Divine Beginning Realm could use them.","After all, the Divine Beginning Realm had the potential threat of Devil Cloud Star, and it would not be long before the top experts of Devil Cloud Star felt that the entire Divine Beginning Realm must unite and fight with Devil Cloud Star, at that time, the numerous Principles Masters of the Divine Beginning Realm would also contribute.","And these Pinnacle True Treasures would definitely be of great help to the numerous Principles Masters of the Divine Beginning Realm. At the very least, they would be enough to raise the combat power of these Principles Masters by a large margin.","As for the number of 100,000 True Treasures...although Lord Wu said that he would be able to get hundreds of thousands or even millions of True Treasures, the total number of Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm was estimated to be only a few thousand, there was no need for so many Supreme True Treasures. It was not necessarily a good thing to take too many.","After choosing the first floor, Jian Wushuang quickly went to the second floor.","The Supreme True Treasures on the second floor were all Supreme True Treasures. There were protective armor, Domain Type, Flight Type, Soul Type, and Suppression Type.","Jian Wushuang also began to choose.","The selection of these Supreme True Treasures was mainly for Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Heaven Ancestor, as well as some Principles Masters who were at the top level of strength in the absolute beginning miracle, for a Ruler, having a few Supreme True Treasures could definitely raise his strength to a whole new level.","Soon, Jian Wushuang had selected the 100 Supreme Treasures. Among them, the most were the offensive magic weapons and body-protection armors, followed by the flying and domain Supreme Treasures. In total, he had selected about 40 Supreme Treasures.","Then, Jian Wushuang entered the third floor of the tower.","He was still in a dark space, and there was still a list of Supreme Treasures in front of him.","However, the number of Supreme Treasures on this list was much less than the first two levels.","There were less than 100 Supreme Treasures on this list, but there was no doubt that each Supreme Treasure on the third level was more valuable than the ordinary Supreme Treasures on the second level.","The only Supreme Treasure on the third level that Jian Wushuang could choose was for himself.","After all, although he had enough True Treasures, there was still room for improvement.","A good True Treasure could also greatly improve his strength. For example, the Celestial Light Wings had greatly increased his strength.","“Although there are not many True Treasures on the third floor, there are all kinds of True Treasures.” Jian Wushuang looked at the information on the list with his eyes shining.","Indeed, some of the Supreme Treasures on the list were very useful to him.","For example, the magic shadow armor that Jian Wushuang saw now.","According to the information on the list, although it was only a protective armor, its value was more valuable than Domain Type and Flight Type Supreme Treasures.","The reason was that the Magic Shadow Armor was a Principles Supreme Treasure. Although it was the lowest level Principles Supreme Treasure, its value was still very important. After several battles, the Magic Shadow Armor became more and more valuable, the Magic Shadow Armor was damaged time and time again, and its power was greatly weakened. Later, it was disintegrated by the bombardment. Later, someone got a piece of the magic shadow armor and refined it again, but the refining level was not good enough, the Magic Shadow Armor had just been reduced from a Principles Supreme Treasure to the strongest Universe Supreme Treasure.","Of course, even though it was no longer a Principles Supreme Treasure, the power of the Magic Shadow Armor was still far above that of ordinary Supreme Treasure Armor. At least, it was much more powerful than Jian Wushuang’s Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor.","“The Shadow Demon Armor used to be a Principles Supreme Treasure. Even though it’s not as powerful as it used to be after being broken up and refined, it still has the foundation of a Principles Supreme Treasure. No wonder its restrictions are much more precious than the Domain Type and the Flight Type at the same level.” Jian Wushuang sighed secretly.","He considered the Shadow Demon Armor for a while, but he still gave up.","After all, he had the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor Now. Although it could not protect him as well as the Shadow Demon Armor, it was not too bad. With his divine body, he could do whatever he wanted in this star area, he didn’t need to pursue a more powerful True Treasure Armor. As for the power of the Shadow Demon Armor, it had to be under certain conditions.","For example, he could barely activate the second level of power of the Dark Gold Magic Dragon Armor, which was 30 percent of the power of the Magic Dragon.","Shadow Demon Armor had the foundation of a Principles True Treasure, so it would be even more difficult to activate its power. It was still unknown whether he could meet the requirements to activate its power."]},{"number":3799,"title":"Chapter 3799 - Left","paragraphs":["“It would be best if I could choose a divine sword or a Domain Type Supreme Treasure that is more powerful,” Jian Wushuang said lightly.","Needless to say, a divine sword.","His Netherworld Divine Sword was the strongest Supreme Treasure. With it in hand, his swordsmanship could be greatly enhanced. If it was a more powerful divine sword, then his swordsmanship would be more powerful, his power could also be enhanced to a certain extent.","As for Domain Type True Treasures, they were also of great use to him.","After all, his Celestial Light Wings had the move of Mystic Light Realm on his wings of Heaven escape, which could be used with Domain Type True Treasures. Previously, he only had a Pinnacle Domain Type True Treasure, Magic Sand Realm, which could be used with Mystic Light Realm, so the power was not ridiculously strong, however, if he had a Domain Type Supreme True Treasure to complement each other, its power would naturally be stronger.","“I’ve already obtained an ordinary supreme Domain Type True Treasure on the second floor, but it’s only an ordinary Domain Type Supreme True Treasure. Perhaps it won’t be able to exert its advantage in the domain to the maximum. If it’s a supreme-grade supreme Domain Type True Treasure...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened.","A supreme-grade Supreme Domain Type Supreme Treasure combined with the Mystic Light Realm could suppress even a Ruler at the top of the first level. Even a Ruler at the second level would be greatly suppressed by his domain, even a Ruler at the top of the first level would be greatly suppressed by him.","Moreover, a Supreme Domain Type Supreme Treasure had the advantage of being able to suppress many people at the same time, not just one person.","Jian Wushuang was bound to have a great battle with Devil Cloud Star in the Divine Beginning Realm. If the army of Devil Cloud Star came and suppressed the entire battlefield with a powerful domain technique...it would be enough to increase the chances of the Divine Beginning Realm’s camp winning.","“The supreme-grade Supreme True Treasure divine sword might improve my strength, but it won’t be as useful as a Domain Type True Treasure in that great battle. If I’m lucky enough to pass the second test of the Red Cloud World, I can choose a Principles Type True Treasure divine sword. A Principles Type True Treasure divine sword is much more powerful than a supreme-grade Supreme True Treasure,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","Soon, he made up his mind.","He would choose the supreme-grade Domain Type Supreme Treasure.","There were three supreme-grade Supreme Treasures in the third level. Jian Wushuang quickly picked one of them.","The supreme-grade supreme-grade Supreme Treasure, Triple Magic Light Mirror.","The reason why Jian Wushuang chose this near-Domain Type Supreme Treasure was that the triple magic light mirror was not only useful for one level, but also three levels.","The first level, suppression!","The second level, Impact!","The third level, strangle!","The first level, suppression, was like an ordinary Domain Type True Treasure. It could restrict and suppress the opponent to the greatest extent within the domain, causing the opponent’s strength to be greatly reduced. Of course, the strongest Domain Type True Treasure at the supreme level...the suppression effect was definitely much stronger than the ordinary strongest Domain Type True Treasures on the second floor of the tower.","The Second Impact was a large-scale domain impact. Of course, it was different from the normal domain impact. The domain impact of the triple magic light mirror was extremely wide and could cover an area of nearly a million miles.","It should be known that an ordinary Domain Type Supreme Treasure could cover an area of 10,000 miles. For example, some of the most powerful Domain Type Supreme Treasures on the second floor of the tower could only cover an area of about 100,000 miles with their full power, only the triple magic light mirror could cover an area of 1,000,000 miles. During the process, Jian Wushuang’s soul power could also cover the beams of magic light.","This was not to be underestimated. One must know that in some special places, the ability of soul perception was greatly limited. For example, in the Red Cloud World, Jian Wushuang’s soul perception could only cover an area of 100,000 miles at most, if he were to be trapped in the depths of the three battlefields, in some extremely dangerous places, it was possible for his soul perception to be limited to a range of tens of thousands of miles or even thousands of miles.","Under such circumstances, Jian Wushuang used the realm impact of the Triple Magic Light Mirror with all his strength and covered the magic light with his soul power. With the impact of the Magic Light, he could detect the situation within a range of 1,000,000 miles, this was a very rare use.","As for the third power strangle, it relied on the power of the realm to annihilate the experts who were trapped in the realm.","With Jian Wushuang’s current strength, if he used the triple magic light mirror with all his strength, he could easily kill the Principles Masters. Even the weaker Rulers would not be able to last long under his realm, if he used the triple magic light mirror at full strength and only targeted one person, the Superior Rulers would not dare to ignore the strangling power of the domain.","The triple power had three different functions and was extremely powerful.","That was why Jian Wushuang chose the Triple Magic Light Mirror.","After choosing, Jian Wushuang walked out of the tower.","“Lord Wu, this is the Supreme Treasure I picked. Please take a look.” Jian Wushuang handed the list of Supreme Treasures he picked to Lord Wu.","Lord Wu took it and nodded slightly. “You have good taste. The treasures you picked are all of the same level, especially the triple magic light mirror. It has three different functions and is more valuable than other Supreme Treasures. Ten of these treasures together should be comparable to one of the lowest level Principles Supreme Treasures.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled with joy.","“Wait a moment.”","Lord Wu had already chosen the treasures for Jian Wushuang according to the list.","Soon, the selection was finished.","“Oh, this is what you want. It’s all in this interspatial ring.” Lord Wu handed an interspatial ring to Jian Wushuang.","After taking it, Jian Wushuang looked at it and became excited.","The interspatial ring contained 100,000 Supreme Treasures, 100 Supreme Treasures, and the three magic light mirrors, the Supreme Realm Supreme Treasure he had chosen from the black tower.","“Little guy, I’ve given you everything. You can leave now.” Lord Wu waved his hand and a complete space passage appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. “I hope you can return here soon and pass the test of the Second Heaven.”","“I will.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and stepped into the space passage. Soon, he disappeared.","Lord Wu looked at the space passage that was slowly closing. He narrowed his eyes and fell into deep thought.","The vast Red Cloud World had finally calmed down."]},{"number":3800,"title":"Chapter 3800 - Back to the Star Palace","paragraphs":["Red Rock Mountain, one of the three great battlefields.","Since the Red Cloud World had closed, Red Rock Mountain had returned to its original appearance. Many cultivators from this star area were still wandering around Red Rock Mountain, hoping to find some opportunities and treasures.","At a certain place in Red Rock Mountain, a vortex suddenly appeared in the center of the blood-red Earth.","The whirlpool grew bigger and bigger, and it became more and more complete, like a space tunnel.","This sudden change immediately attracted the attention of the two Principles Masters nearby.","“What is this?”","“A whirlpool? Could it be that a True Treasure is about to be born?”","The two Principles Masters, one at the pinnacle of the fourth level and the other who had just entered the fifth level, were not very powerful. At that moment, the two of them were standing on a piece of blood stone, looking at the whirlpool that appeared on the ground below with great anticipation.","Crimson Rock Mountain had endless opportunities, and there were many types of True Treasures.","The sudden change in front of their eyes made them subconsciously think that a True Treasure had appeared.","However, as the blood-colored whirlpool gradually completed, there were no True Treasures that extended out from within. Instead, a human figure rose up.","“It’s out.”","A hearty laughter reverberated in the world. This laughter carried a trace of joy.","The two Principles Masters on the blood stone immediately widened their eyes.","“It’s a human? It’s actually a human?”","“This appearance and this terrifying aura...it’s the Blood Sword Master!”","“Blood Sword Master? Didn’t he return to the Star Palace long ago and has been in closed-door cultivation all these years?”","The two Principles Masters looked at each other in dismay. They could see the shock in each other’s eyes.","Back in the Red Cloud World, a large number of cultivators in this Star Field had attempted to challenge the Heaven-Treading Mountain. And as the publicly acknowledged number one genius of this Star Field, the Blood Sword Master, who possessed the battle prowess of a Peak Ruler at the level of a Principles Master...his achievements naturally attracted the attention of many people.","Everyone was speculating whether the Blood Sword Master would be able to pass the test of the Heaven-Treading Mountain.","However, there was no concrete answer. Later, news spread from the Star Palace that the Blood Sword Master had passed the trial at the foot of the mountain and the mountainside, but was defeated in the trial at the peak, after that, he left the Red Cloud World and returned to the Star Palace. He had been in seclusion in the Star Palace for the past few years.","Most people chose to believe the news spread from the Star Palace. There were also a few people who still had doubts.","But whether they believed it or doubted it, the Red Cloud World had been closed, so no one had any thoughts about it.","But now...the two Principles Masters saw Jian Wushuang emerge from the underground of Red Rock Mountain.","Everyone knew that the Red Cloud World was under Red Rock Mountain, but they could not enter it normally.","In other words, Jian Wushuang did not leave the Red Cloud World and return to the Star Palace. He had stayed in the Red Cloud World all these years, and he did not come out of it until today.","There was only one possibility for this, and that was that he passed the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain and went to the legendary Second Heaven.","“He, he really passed the test of Heaven-Treading Mountain?”","“The Red Cloud World has been closed for a long time, but he could stay there. If he didn’t pass the trial of Heaven-Treading Mountain, he would have some special privileges. How could he do that?”","The two Principles Masters secretly sighed. They were ready to immediately tell the news to their forces so that it would be announced to the world.","However, before they could send a message, a ghostly figure suddenly passed between them. Jian Wushuang, who had always been in their eyes, had disappeared.","“I don’t have any enmity with you, but in order to avoid unnecessary trouble, I can only apologize.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice rang in the ears of the two Principles Masters. The two Principles Masters widened their eyes and looked terrified, but their voices had been completely cut off.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and directly destroyed the divine bodies of the two Principles Masters. After collecting the treasures they left behind, he shook his head gently. “I didn’t expect to meet someone when I came out of the Red Cloud World, just like the last time when I came out of the Life and Death Realm.”","“However...I was too careless in the Life and Death Realm, and I wasn’t that strong back then. That’s why I attracted so much trouble. But this time, there won’t be any trouble.”","Jian Wushuang smiled.","After learning from the Life and Death Realm last time, he immediately killed the two Principles Masters when he came out of the Red Cloud World to make sure that they didn’t have time to spread the news.","“It’s time to go back to Star Palace.”","Jian Wushuang sent a message to Daoist Xuan God, saying that he had come out of the Red Cloud World, and then he directly rushed out of Red Rock Mountain.","...","The place where Jian Wushuang came out of the Red Cloud World was not the deepest part of the Red Cloud World. It was just the periphery. With his current strength, Jian Wushuang could run amok in the periphery of the Red Cloud World, he did not encounter any obstacles along the way. Soon, he left the Red Cloud World and spent some time to return to Star Palace.","When he returned to Star Palace, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Heaven Ancestor, who had already received the news, were already waiting for him.","Jian Wushuang sat side by side with Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Heaven Ancestor in a separate pocket of space time.","“My young friend, you must have gained a lot from the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World, right?” Daoist Xuan God asked with a smile.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“How’s your strength?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","“It’s much better than before. Now I can do whatever I want in this Star Field. Even ordinary Superior Rulers can’t do anything to me,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He was being modest. In fact, during the 10,000 years in the Second Heaven of the Red Cloud World, he had been improving his strength, especially in sword principle, with the help of many opportunities in the Second Heaven, now, his attainments in sword principle and swordsmanship were much better than those of the other Rulers in this Star Field.","In addition to the advantages of the Supreme Treasure secret skill and other aspects, he could easily defeat ordinary Superior Rulers.","Even if Jian Wushuang was not absolutely sure that he could defeat the second-level Ruler Kun Yu, who was widely recognized as the first Ruler in this Star Field, as long as he was given some time...if he could master the first volume of the dragon-killing secret skill, it would be easy for him to defeat the Ruler Kun Yu.","Of course, Jian Wushuang still hid some of his absolute strength from the Daoist Xuan God and the others.","“By the way, four of you, I have brought a surprise for you after coming back from the Red Cloud World,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said."]}]);
